(457395, 42817, 11073, '<td valign="top">wow, look at the eyes on that one! very cool....looks like the bird from "V"...sorry obscure reference, don''t ask where that came from...well besides that his eyes are scary.... good colors, and use of negative space.  You led the main subject well too.  nice work.</td>', 'wow, look at the eyes on that one! very cool....looks like the bird from "V"...sorry obscure reference, don''t ask where that came from...well besides that his eyes are scary.... good colors, and use of negative space.  You led the main subject well too.  nice work.', '2003-10-22 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(457396, 42761, 12327, '<td valign="top">haha :) I almost did the same thing.  nice lighting at sunset?    Composition would look better if he wasn''t right in the center.</td>', 'haha :) I almost did the same thing.  nice lighting at sunset?    Composition would look better if he wasn''t right in the center.', '2003-10-22 01:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(457397, 43403, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is so sad.  I bet you miss him.  NIce shot though!</td>', 'This is so sad.  I bet you miss him.  NIce shot though!', '2003-10-22 01:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(457398, 42533, 6668, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have been more effective if the other kids had been further off in the background, I don''t really get the sense of aloness in this photo as much as the feeling that she was just passing but, she doesn''t really appear to being left out...if that makes any sense. :-)</td>', 'I think this photo would have been more effective if the other kids had been further off in the background, I don''t really get the sense of aloness in this photo as much as the feeling that she was just passing but, she doesn''t really appear to being left out...if that makes any sense. :-)', '2003-10-22 01:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(457401, 42497, 10170, '<td valign="top">Wonderfil shot.  Reminds me of The Cars video (though she was clothed) ... "Who''s going to take you home tonight" (well, that''s the main line anyway).</td>', 'Wonderfil shot.  Reminds me of The Cars video (though she was clothed) ... "Who''s going to take you home tonight" (well, that''s the main line anyway).', '2003-10-22 01:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(457402, 43365, 656, '<td valign="top">just great - very cute but lonely at the same time.</td>', 'just great - very cute but lonely at the same time.', '2003-10-22 01:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(457403, 42543, 12327, '<td valign="top">I like how the colors go together.</td>', 'I like how the colors go together.', '2003-10-22 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(457405, 42626, 7226, '<td valign="top">nice colors and lines, maybe changing the camera angle so the ceiling is not in the picture would make this stronger as that doesn''t go with the other colors and solid colors.</td>', 'nice colors and lines, maybe changing the camera angle so the ceiling is not in the picture would make this stronger as that doesn''t go with the other colors and solid colors.', '2003-10-22 01:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(457406, 42533, 11073, '<td valign="top">good take on the category - i wouldn''t have thought there was a way to convey "alone" with more than one person...but you proved me wrong - great idea.  My only suggestion would be to use a higher shutter speed to freeze the action of the moving kids.  Nice idea to use b/w, that always conveys more of an emotion. nice work.</td>', 'good take on the category - i wouldn''t have thought there was a way to convey "alone" with more than one person...but you proved me wrong - great idea.  My only suggestion would be to use a higher shutter speed to freeze the action of the moving kids.  Nice idea to use b/w, that always conveys more of an emotion. nice work.', '2003-10-22 01:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(457407, 42543, 6668, '<td valign="top">I understand the idea you were going for, but yet not a very appealing photo to look at, I do like the contrast between the yellow background and the blue bowl.</td>', 'I understand the idea you were going for, but yet not a very appealing photo to look at, I do like the contrast between the yellow background and the blue bowl.', '2003-10-22 01:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
