(457420, 42821, 11073, '<td valign="top">good idea and execution.  I know that its easy to play monday morning quarterback...but my only suggestion would be to do another angle to get the branch out of frame.  But having said that, I won''t factor that into my scoring, because this was obviously a spur of the moment thing and complete creativity wins out over staged "studio" shots every time in my books.  The vertical framing job is excellent as well.  Nice work.</td>', 'good idea and execution.  I know that its easy to play monday morning quarterback...but my only suggestion would be to do another angle to get the branch out of frame.  But having said that, I won''t factor that into my scoring, because this was obviously a spur of the moment thing and complete creativity wins out over staged "studio" shots every time in my books.  The vertical framing job is excellent as well.  Nice work.', '2003-10-22 01:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(457422, 43136, 12327, '<td valign="top">I wish that pole was not there, maybe if you took it from a slightly different angle (more to the right and lower)</td>', 'I wish that pole was not there, maybe if you took it from a slightly different angle (more to the right and lower)', '2003-10-22 01:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
