(457683, 43295, 13403, '<td valign="top">i''m surprised this is the first sailboat i''ve seen submitted.    still, based on the quality of the image, i can''t give you very high marks..     also, it might be a good idea to avoid centering your subject.      where you place your subject might have a strong effect on getting the intended mood across..      whether it be a certain vast expanse (covering the majority of the picture) beyond the sailboat.. kind of a lonely traveler effect...   or the sailboat on the top edge of the photo..   a vast expanse between the eyes of the viewer and the boat itself..  which would certainly capitalize on the solitude feeling.     the choice of subject is a bit obvious, but clearly fitting.    I''m not very against cliche''s because there''s a reason they are so popular.     still, i would suggest recropping..    i suppose the grainy quality isn''t something you can handle.      keep on trucking ;)   i''m sorry i had to give you a 2</td>', 'i''m surprised this is the first sailboat i''ve seen submitted.    still, based on the quality of the image, i can''t give you very high marks..     also, it might be a good idea to avoid centering your subject.      where you place your subject might have a strong effect on getting the intended mood across..      whether it be a certain vast expanse (covering the majority of the picture) beyond the sailboat.. kind of a lonely traveler effect...   or the sailboat on the top edge of the photo..   a vast expanse between the eyes of the viewer and the boat itself..  which would certainly capitalize on the solitude feeling.     the choice of subject is a bit obvious, but clearly fitting.    I''m not very against cliche''s because there''s a reason they are so popular.     still, i would suggest recropping..    i suppose the grainy quality isn''t something you can handle.      keep on trucking ;)   i''m sorry i had to give you a 2', '2003-10-22 05:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(457684, 42664, 12425, '<td valign="top">The white pieces being a little and then a lot out of focus is distracting... a narrower DOF would have been nice here (I know, depends on the camera...).  The relections are also distracting... they should either be highlighted as a part of the pic, or reduced in some way.</td>', 'The white pieces being a little and then a lot out of focus is distracting... a narrower DOF would have been nice here (I know, depends on the camera...).  The relections are also distracting... they should either be highlighted as a part of the pic, or reduced in some way.', '2003-10-22 05:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(457685, 42936, 12425, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and lighting, good composition, well done.</td>', 'Nice focus and lighting, good composition, well done.', '2003-10-22 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
