(457702, 42376, 12425, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, I had to look three times to make out the subject.  Good interpretation tho.</td>', 'A bit dark, I had to look three times to make out the subject.  Good interpretation tho.', '2003-10-22 05:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(457703, 42812, 12425, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and light.  I can see the man is alone in the pic, but I dont think the pic portrays solitude and loneliness, if that makes sense.  Good shot</td>', 'Nice colors and light.  I can see the man is alone in the pic, but I dont think the pic portrays solitude and loneliness, if that makes sense.  Good shot', '2003-10-22 05:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(457704, 43298, 13403, '<td valign="top">i''m glad you picked the unknown tombstone..    smart choice..    i wish the branches were a better contrast against the grass and leaves... this photograph would be infinitely more powerful if there were snow on the ground instead of the dark grass.        very happy that you chose a non-personal subject..  i don''t like people trying to pull my heartstrings submitting photos of their deceased loved one''s stones-   almost disrespectful if you ask me.    thank you for making the smart choice.  cheers. ;) 8</td>', 'i''m glad you picked the unknown tombstone..    smart choice..    i wish the branches were a better contrast against the grass and leaves... this photograph would be infinitely more powerful if there were snow on the ground instead of the dark grass.        very happy that you chose a non-personal subject..  i don''t like people trying to pull my heartstrings submitting photos of their deceased loved one''s stones-   almost disrespectful if you ask me.    thank you for making the smart choice.  cheers. ;) 8', '2003-10-22 05:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(457705, 43205, 12425, '<td valign="top">Nice, colors look good, I''d have composed the goat more off to one side</td>', 'Nice, colors look good, I''d have composed the goat more off to one side', '2003-10-22 05:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(457706, 42867, 13403, '<td valign="top">hehehe.. i don''t know why this is funny.. perhaps because i''m picturing these guys as overgrown children.   he almost looks like a self-pitying youngster would if he were removed from the game..   NAP TIME, BILLY..      sissy :P pff..  great photo.  candid photos rock.  :)</td>', 'hehehe.. i don''t know why this is funny.. perhaps because i''m picturing these guys as overgrown children.   he almost looks like a self-pitying youngster would if he were removed from the game..   NAP TIME, BILLY..      sissy :P pff..  great photo.  candid photos rock.  :)', '2003-10-22 05:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(457707, 43103, 12425, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the reflections and glare spoil it a little</td>', 'Nice idea, but the reflections and glare spoil it a little', '2003-10-22 05:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(457708, 42885, 10170, '<td valign="top">The Cars - Who''s going to drive you home tonight.  Reminds me of that excellent video.  Wonderful photo, both technically and subject.  The photo frame, without even knowing what it shows, adds so much extra meaning to this.  Excellent work, very excellent work :)  Hope this makes a ribbon, if it doesn''t then it should come very close :)</td>', 'The Cars - Who''s going to drive you home tonight.  Reminds me of that excellent video.  Wonderful photo, both technically and subject.  The photo frame, without even knowing what it shows, adds so much extra meaning to this.  Excellent work, very excellent work :)  Hope this makes a ribbon, if it doesn''t then it should come very close :)', '2003-10-22 05:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(457709, 43110, 13403, '<td valign="top">ooh, i like ;)    i do.   i haven''t seen a 10 yet, and this is probably more deserving than any of the others..   so 10 it is ;)   you took a cliche'' and made it pretty.   photos like these are the reasons those cliche''s are so popular ;)  congratulations</td>', 'ooh, i like ;)    i do.   i haven''t seen a 10 yet, and this is probably more deserving than any of the others..   so 10 it is ;)   you took a cliche'' and made it pretty.   photos like these are the reasons those cliche''s are so popular ;)  congratulations', '2003-10-22 05:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(457710, 42897, 12425, '<td valign="top">I like this, droopy ears and all, good composition and interpretation, well done</td>', 'I like this, droopy ears and all, good composition and interpretation, well done', '2003-10-22 05:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(457712, 43418, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very clever :)</td>', 'Very clever :)', '2003-10-22 05:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(457713, 43378, 13403, '<td valign="top">yes.     we are.            :-/  this photo would look nicer if the rock were colorful..  maybe less contrast and more saturation?   umm.. darn.. it would be a really cool picture too.</td>', 'yes.     we are.            :-/  this photo would look nicer if the rock were colorful..  maybe less contrast and more saturation?   umm.. darn.. it would be a really cool picture too.', '2003-10-22 05:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(457715, 43282, 10170, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  I didn''t end up entering this challenge, but I was going to do this idea had I done so.  I am really glad I didn''t in the end as I could not have come close to this one.  Great work.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  I didn''t end up entering this challenge, but I was going to do this idea had I done so.  I am really glad I didn''t in the end as I could not have come close to this one.  Great work.', '2003-10-22 05:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
