(457717, 43119, 13403, '<td valign="top">love the texture and the color.. somehow this photo isn''t compelling enough to me.  maybe my simple mind is below critiquing this photo accurately..  a 6 from me.</td>', 'love the texture and the color.. somehow this photo isn''t compelling enough to me.  maybe my simple mind is below critiquing this photo accurately..  a 6 from me.', '2003-10-22 05:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
