(457719, 43109, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done indeed.</td>', 'Very nicely done indeed.', '2003-10-22 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(457720, 42936, 13368, '<td valign="top">Yes, I think this photo gives a very good feeling of solitude. technically seems the model''s face is a little blurred and focus is more on the table then on his eyes. But well, I thik the important is the feeling it does. Probably a darker look would fit.</td>', 'Yes, I think this photo gives a very good feeling of solitude. technically seems the model''s face is a little blurred and focus is more on the table then on his eyes. But well, I thik the important is the feeling it does. Probably a darker look would fit.', '2003-10-22 05:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(457722, 43391, 13403, '<td valign="top">yep.. its a bee... yep.. its a loner...   yep.. this is high quality.   still..........  and i can''t put my finger on it..  this just doesn''t do it for me.. 6 though.</td>', 'yep.. its a bee... yep.. its a loner...   yep.. this is high quality.   still..........  and i can''t put my finger on it..  this just doesn''t do it for me.. 6 though.', '2003-10-22 05:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(457723, 42686, 12802, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I just vote on something like this in the lighting challenge?  The chair leg and cable are a little distracting, good idea.</td>', 'Didn''t I just vote on something like this in the lighting challenge?  The chair leg and cable are a little distracting, good idea.', '2003-10-22 05:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(457724, 42592, 13403, '<td valign="top">wow, great photo.. and i almost didn''t think it had anything to do with aloneness..  but each spider although 3 feet from the next lives its own separate life.. void of contact with any of the others..     very interesting scene..  i think it was a good idea to focus on the webs in the back..   very interesting photo indeed.    difficult to make this work... you pulled it off satisfactorally-  7 ..  because this needs to be more simple than it is.. somehow..    crazy..</td>', 'wow, great photo.. and i almost didn''t think it had anything to do with aloneness..  but each spider although 3 feet from the next lives its own separate life.. void of contact with any of the others..     very interesting scene..  i think it was a good idea to focus on the webs in the back..   very interesting photo indeed.    difficult to make this work... you pulled it off satisfactorally-  7 ..  because this needs to be more simple than it is.. somehow..    crazy..', '2003-10-22 05:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(457725, 43377, 13368, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s a very good idea and the photo looks to be very much in topic; unfortunately by his expression it is quite evident that he is looking at someone who is outside the picture: players? But I thinbk this image had good chances to be obe of the best in this challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Yes, it''s a very good idea and the photo looks to be very much in topic; unfortunately by his expression it is quite evident that he is looking at someone who is outside the picture: players? But I thinbk this image had good chances to be obe of the best in this challenge. Good luck.', '2003-10-22 05:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(457726, 42608, 3540, '<td valign="top">Just a little bit too dark.  Hard to balance this so that the light is also not overwhelming the photo.</td>', 'Just a little bit too dark.  Hard to balance this so that the light is also not overwhelming the photo.', '2003-10-22 06:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(457727, 42735, 13403, '<td valign="top">ggrrreat photo ;)    10..     this because as a child.. my time alone with my imagination was the most important time i could spend.   i envy this girl :)</td>', 'ggrrreat photo ;)    10..     this because as a child.. my time alone with my imagination was the most important time i could spend.   i envy this girl :)', '2003-10-22 06:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
