(457733, 42516, 12428, '<td valign="top">i think this is not too sightly a photograph and the theme isnt conveyed at all perhaps u do have some hidden intentions, but it didnt shine thr,,,, plus the flash made things too far too artificial.</td>', 'i think this is not too sightly a photograph and the theme isnt conveyed at all perhaps u do have some hidden intentions, but it didnt shine thr,,,, plus the flash made things too far too artificial.', '2003-10-22 06:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
