(457741, 42909, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a very cute concept for a picture.  It doesn''t have a lot of pop either, but it gave me a chuckle.  Good idea.</td>', 'This is a very cute concept for a picture.  It doesn''t have a lot of pop either, but it gave me a chuckle.  Good idea.', '2003-10-22 06:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
