(457770, 43360, 10848, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous capture of the sky, the darkness of the tree really makes its solitude more apparent. I like it</td>', 'Gorgeous capture of the sky, the darkness of the tree really makes its solitude more apparent. I like it', '2003-10-22 06:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(457771, 43402, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, wonderful lighting, the color selection of your subject works great with the blue background.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, wonderful lighting, the color selection of your subject works great with the blue background.', '2003-10-22 06:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(457772, 43076, 11785, '<td valign="top">... and sometimes you use more as one mouse? <br/>Too hazy and why it is b&amp;W? I like the red light under the mouse (I have Logitech, but it is probably similar) (2)</td>', '... and sometimes you use more as one mouse? Too hazy and why it is b&W? I like the red light under the mouse (I have Logitech, but it is probably similar) (2)', '2003-10-22 06:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(457776, 42549, 5728, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but could have benefitted more if it were not so dark</td>', 'A good idea, but could have benefitted more if it were not so dark', '2003-10-22 07:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(457779, 43232, 9886, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture, form and function. I especially like the boyish posture. 8.</td>', 'Lovely picture, form and function. I especially like the boyish posture. 8.', '2003-10-22 07:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(457780, 43402, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice color combination pink and blue. A little too tightly cropped somehow and the border doesn''t do this justice. I would have gone for a simple white border without the drop shadow.</td>', 'Nice color combination pink and blue. A little too tightly cropped somehow and the border doesn''t do this justice. I would have gone for a simple white border without the drop shadow.', '2003-10-22 07:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(457781, 43418, 5728, '<td valign="top">Clever! Good composition and color combination. Maybe I would have cropped it so that the black line at the bottom, on the right and the gap at the very top isn''t seen. The gap at the top of the blue book is okay, although the background is a little distracting. I would have gone for a uniform background there - 7.</td>', 'Clever! Good composition and color combination. Maybe I would have cropped it so that the black line at the bottom, on the right and the gap at the very top isn''t seen. The gap at the top of the blue book is okay, although the background is a little distracting. I would have gone for a uniform background there - 7.', '2003-10-22 07:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(457785, 43393, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good depiction to the challenge, the B&amp;W is okay too. But why, why did you cut the knee off?</td>', 'Good depiction to the challenge, the B&W is okay too. But why, why did you cut the knee off?', '2003-10-22 07:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(457787, 43295, 5728, '<td valign="top">Too centered and the horizon is slanted. You met the challenge tho :-)</td>', 'Too centered and the horizon is slanted. You met the challenge tho :-)', '2003-10-22 07:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(457789, 42587, 5728, '<td valign="top">The photo is way too small. Wasn''t it possible to get the long side at 640? The post in the middle is distracting. Good use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'The photo is way too small. Wasn''t it possible to get the long side at 640? The post in the middle is distracting. Good use of the rule of thirds.', '2003-10-22 07:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(457790, 42752, 5728, '<td valign="top">Even though you have blurred the background out well with the shallow DOF, it still seems to distract in a way. Especially the whiteness at the bottom and the top left hand corner. Good use of the rules of thirds, although I would have cropped just a tad mor off at the left. (7)</td>', 'Even though you have blurred the background out well with the shallow DOF, it still seems to distract in a way. Especially the whiteness at the bottom and the top left hand corner. Good use of the rules of thirds, although I would have cropped just a tad mor off at the left. (7)', '2003-10-22 07:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(457791, 43275, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice shot... the focus seems to have gotten behind the cat tho... still excellent :)</td>', 'very nice shot... the focus seems to have gotten behind the cat tho... still excellent :)', '2003-10-22 07:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(457792, 42589, 5728, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, however it is a little dark. Is that the way you wanted it? It seems quite grainy too, probably from the higher ISO.</td>', 'The idea is good, however it is a little dark. Is that the way you wanted it? It seems quite grainy too, probably from the higher ISO.', '2003-10-22 07:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
