(457900, 43081, 13368, '<td valign="top">If i didn''t read your titile to this photo, I would have considered it as a symbol of individualism from the black ball, and not of racism. This shows that the feeling we generate with our pictures is sometimes different from the feeling we would have wished to share. I generally avoid emotive title to my pics. Nice photo, anyway, though it looks too much compressed.</td>', 'If i didn''t read your titile to this photo, I would have considered it as a symbol of individualism from the black ball, and not of racism. This shows that the feeling we generate with our pictures is sometimes different from the feeling we would have wished to share. I generally avoid emotive title to my pics. Nice photo, anyway, though it looks too much compressed.', '2003-10-22 09:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(457902, 43372, 5728, '<td valign="top">A couple of small points could have changed this a lot. The crop is a little too tight at the top of the boys head. A tad more breathing space would have helped. The white line on the far left is distracting. Actually the whole border is uneven, there is no white at all on the bottom. I won''t even go into the spelling mistake :-) (6)</td>', 'A couple of small points could have changed this a lot. The crop is a little too tight at the top of the boys head. A tad more breathing space would have helped. The white line on the far left is distracting. Actually the whole border is uneven, there is no white at all on the bottom. I won''t even go into the spelling mistake :-) (6)', '2003-10-22 09:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
