(457921, 43331, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now that is overkill! Pills, alcohol and slashed wrists! The capture of that blood drip is what gives this photo it''s kick. Morbid but fantastic at the same time (10)</td>', 'Now that is overkill! Pills, alcohol and slashed wrists! The capture of that blood drip is what gives this photo it''s kick. Morbid but fantastic at the same time (10)', '2003-10-22 10:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
