(457929, 42978, 5728, '<td valign="top">For some reason this photo looks a little squashed in from the sides, maybe it is just me after looking at too many photos. I like the pose here, especially with the effect of the wind blowing through her hair.</td>', 'For some reason this photo looks a little squashed in from the sides, maybe it is just me after looking at too many photos. I like the pose here, especially with the effect of the wind blowing through her hair.', '2003-10-22 10:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(457930, 43187, 12855, '<td valign="top">I always thought that job looked lonely...deffinetely when he is the only one on the ice and everyone else is on the outside looking in...or not really paying attention to you at all. It''s like being anywhere by yourself in a crowd of strangers...like a lost child. Nice idea if people read it right. Great Idea.</td>', 'I always thought that job looked lonely...deffinetely when he is the only one on the ice and everyone else is on the outside looking in...or not really paying attention to you at all. It''s like being anywhere by yourself in a crowd of strangers...like a lost child. Nice idea if people read it right. Great Idea.', '2003-10-22 10:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(457931, 43271, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like your use of negative space and black &amp; white. I think the crack in the cement is a nice touch and the fact that your subject is so small really emphasizes the idea of being alone. The only think that detracts from the shot to me is I can''t really tell what the subject is.  I think it''s a bird (a pigeon?), andl this is going to sound like I''m a real goofball, but for the longest time while typing this, I thought it was a girl facing away from the camera and that dark shadowed area was her long black hair. LOL!  Can I blame that on my monitor? Anyway, it''s a great shot overall. I like it.</td>', 'I like your use of negative space and black & white. I think the crack in the cement is a nice touch and the fact that your subject is so small really emphasizes the idea of being alone. The only think that detracts from the shot to me is I can''t really tell what the subject is.  I think it''s a bird (a pigeon?), andl this is going to sound like I''m a real goofball, but for the longest time while typing this, I thought it was a girl facing away from the camera and that dark shadowed area was her long black hair. LOL!  Can I blame that on my monitor? Anyway, it''s a great shot overall. I like it.', '2003-10-22 10:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(457934, 42768, 13223, '<td valign="top">I liked your picture, but I wish her face was clearer, it''s a little out of focus.</td>', 'I liked your picture, but I wish her face was clearer, it''s a little out of focus.', '2003-10-22 10:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(457935, 42521, 9295, '<td valign="top">Lovely autumn colors and detail of the leaf captured.  I would have liked the drop just a little closer to falling so that it looks more separated from the leaf, but that''s really not that big of a deal.</td>', 'Lovely autumn colors and detail of the leaf captured.  I would have liked the drop just a little closer to falling so that it looks more separated from the leaf, but that''s really not that big of a deal.', '2003-10-22 10:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(457936, 43296, 12855, '<td valign="top">I remember hearing something about this...is this in Great Britain? Wonderful picture...a man all alone while this "visitor" is completely oblivious to or is ignoring the obvious plea for attention. I love it.</td>', 'I remember hearing something about this...is this in Great Britain? Wonderful picture...a man all alone while this "visitor" is completely oblivious to or is ignoring the obvious plea for attention. I love it.', '2003-10-22 10:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(457937, 42533, 5728, '<td valign="top">I didn''t enter for this challenge, but this was also the idea I first thought of. The B &amp; W is a good choice. Maybe having it in landscape format might have placed more impact on "alone" factor. Some more empty space around her, you know? Maybe shooting from a different position might have also benifited this photo, as it is difficult to comprehend the distance between the girl and the group. Other than that a good pic.</td>', 'I didn''t enter for this challenge, but this was also the idea I first thought of. The B & W is a good choice. Maybe having it in landscape format might have placed more impact on "alone" factor. Some more empty space around her, you know? Maybe shooting from a different position might have also benifited this photo, as it is difficult to comprehend the distance between the girl and the group. Other than that a good pic.', '2003-10-22 10:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(457938, 43275, 13223, '<td valign="top">Cute Kitty. I would have sharpened her face and blurred the back ground.</td>', 'Cute Kitty. I would have sharpened her face and blurred the back ground.', '2003-10-22 10:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(457940, 43132, 13223, '<td valign="top">Cool effect!</td>', 'Cool effect!', '2003-10-22 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(457941, 42532, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic capture.  The lighting is great and you have some really nice colors here.  I loved scrolling down so I could see the whole picture and suddenly seeing that little donkey down at the bottom.  Good choice in having him facing away from the camera and looking towards the mountians off in the distance. Doesn''t get much more alone than this.  10</td>', 'This is a fantastic capture.  The lighting is great and you have some really nice colors here.  I loved scrolling down so I could see the whole picture and suddenly seeing that little donkey down at the bottom.  Good choice in having him facing away from the camera and looking towards the mountians off in the distance. Doesn''t get much more alone than this.  10', '2003-10-22 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(457943, 42883, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic is all I can say! You really made use of dusk lighting, and very well too (10)</td>', 'Fantastic is all I can say! You really made use of dusk lighting, and very well too (10)', '2003-10-22 10:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(457945, 43423, 5728, '<td valign="top">For some reason this reminds me of Matrix Reloaded, where Keanu Reeves is surrounded by about 200 Smith''s :-)</td>', 'For some reason this reminds me of Matrix Reloaded, where Keanu Reeves is surrounded by about 200 Smith''s :-)', '2003-10-22 10:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(457946, 42735, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cute! Good capture, all the leaves on the ground give this image a mellow feeling. I like it.</td>', 'Cute! Good capture, all the leaves on the ground give this image a mellow feeling. I like it.', '2003-10-22 10:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(457947, 42872, 9295, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the grainy feel and the lighting making your subject almost a silhouette against the background.  Would''ve liked him to lose the bag he''s holding, but I guess there is a certain interest in it being there too.  You can imagine the story here...this person coming home from the store...Shopping for one...a single bag of groceries...no one to cook for...no one to dine with...::sniffle::</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the grainy feel and the lighting making your subject almost a silhouette against the background.  Would''ve liked him to lose the bag he''s holding, but I guess there is a certain interest in it being there too.  You can imagine the story here...this person coming home from the store...Shopping for one...a single bag of groceries...no one to cook for...no one to dine with...::sniffle::', '2003-10-22 10:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(457949, 43232, 10274, '<td valign="top">brilliant composition.... in my opinion it is the only photo in this challenge that gives the feeling of ''all alone''...very charming title to compliment this entry..congratulations</td>', 'brilliant composition.... in my opinion it is the only photo in this challenge that gives the feeling of ''all alone''...very charming title to compliment this entry..congratulations', '2003-10-22 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(457950, 43232, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic pic, good use of leading lines here (10)</td>', 'Fantastic pic, good use of leading lines here (10)', '2003-10-22 10:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(457952, 42883, 9295, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and crispness.  I like how the tip of the cactus melts into the blackness of the sky.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and crispness.  I like how the tip of the cactus melts into the blackness of the sky.  Nice capture.', '2003-10-22 10:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(457954, 42659, 5728, '<td valign="top">Is lacking on the contrast side, but otherwise good. Cute even!</td>', 'Is lacking on the contrast side, but otherwise good. Cute even!', '2003-10-22 10:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(457956, 42389, 12855, '<td valign="top">Color:dark and cold=loneliness<br/>Dancing alone=solitude<br/>The reflection: Could symbolize a person reflecting on a joy or a person long gone to the past, which in turn can make someone feel very alone...sad.<br/>Picture quality is great and to my analytical mind, it fits the challenge from every angle. I like the picture as it is and also cut in half, without the statue itself. However, the statue does look cold and the way the legs come together like they are about to go into the featle(sp?) position gives the emotion of someone being closed off from others...or alone. Beautiful.</td>', 'Color:dark and cold=lonelinessDancing alone=solitudeThe reflection: Could symbolize a person reflecting on a joy or a person long gone to the past, which in turn can make someone feel very alone...sad.Picture quality is great and to my analytical mind, it fits the challenge from every angle. I like the picture as it is and also cut in half, without the statue itself. However, the statue does look cold and the way the legs come together like they are about to go into the featle(sp?) position gives the emotion of someone being closed off from others...or alone. Beautiful.', '2003-10-22 10:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(457957, 43063, 5728, '<td valign="top">He he, looks like two of you had the same idea in this challenge. I think it''s a good idea, original, and I am surprised two of you had the same thought :-)</td>', 'He he, looks like two of you had the same idea in this challenge. I think it''s a good idea, original, and I am surprised two of you had the same thought :-)', '2003-10-22 10:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(457958, 42910, 6624, '<td valign="top">somewhere in a galaxy far away?</td>', 'somewhere in a galaxy far away?', '2003-10-22 10:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(457961, 42692, 12855, '<td valign="top">Very cute and fitting. It''s a nice simple idea and it worked very well. You can just read the expression on his/her face like..well...the title says. I love it...should be the cover on a card.</td>', 'Very cute and fitting. It''s a nice simple idea and it worked very well. You can just read the expression on his/her face like..well...the title says. I love it...should be the cover on a card.', '2003-10-22 10:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(457962, 43134, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if your subjects head weren''t hidden in behind the tree limbs. Although you may have done that intentionally, I don''t think it works as effectively as it might have if he were better seen.  I think the stark white lighting on some of the rocks draws the eyes there and away from your focal point.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if your subjects head weren''t hidden in behind the tree limbs. Although you may have done that intentionally, I don''t think it works as effectively as it might have if he were better seen.  I think the stark white lighting on some of the rocks draws the eyes there and away from your focal point.', '2003-10-22 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(457963, 43278, 6668, '<td valign="top">too closely cropped</td>', 'too closely cropped', '2003-10-22 10:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(457964, 42414, 12661, '<td valign="top">Beautiful range of colors and spectacular use of reflections. In the foreground, the top branch adds depth nicely, however, the little bush on the bottom is a bit awkward.</td>', 'Beautiful range of colors and spectacular use of reflections. In the foreground, the top branch adds depth nicely, however, the little bush on the bottom is a bit awkward.', '2003-10-22 10:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(457965, 43089, 9295, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge ok and is well composed, but not a very interesting or thought provoking shot to me.</td>', 'Fits the challenge ok and is well composed, but not a very interesting or thought provoking shot to me.', '2003-10-22 10:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(457967, 42588, 12855, '<td valign="top">Snakes are often alone, people are often scared when they are alone, the snake looks scared. Good picture and unless that is a pet snake, I admire you for taking it.</td>', 'Snakes are often alone, people are often scared when they are alone, the snake looks scared. Good picture and unless that is a pet snake, I admire you for taking it.', '2003-10-22 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(457968, 42956, 6668, '<td valign="top">The yellow leaves seem a bit overexposed it is almost hard to look at, they are too bright, maybe this would have worked better in black and white...just a thought.</td>', 'The yellow leaves seem a bit overexposed it is almost hard to look at, they are too bright, maybe this would have worked better in black and white...just a thought.', '2003-10-22 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(457970, 42935, 12661, '<td valign="top">A very nice use of colors. My only critique is in the placement of the subjects. I think placing them lower in the frame and a bit left or right would have improved the shot.</td>', 'A very nice use of colors. My only critique is in the placement of the subjects. I think placing them lower in the frame and a bit left or right would have improved the shot.', '2003-10-22 10:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(457972, 43164, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a nice animal portrait, very nicely done. He is, in fact, alone, but the composition of the photo doesn''t really evoke that feeling. Your title also indicates that this is a Cold October Day but there is nothing in there that, without the title, would make the viewer feel cold or even realize that it''s October.  I like the shot though and the comments I gave do not affect the score I''m giving you. Just an opinion....</td>', 'This is a nice animal portrait, very nicely done. He is, in fact, alone, but the composition of the photo doesn''t really evoke that feeling. Your title also indicates that this is a Cold October Day but there is nothing in there that, without the title, would make the viewer feel cold or even realize that it''s October.  I like the shot though and the comments I gave do not affect the score I''m giving you. Just an opinion....', '2003-10-22 10:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(457973, 43297, 13374, '<td valign="top">Pastels express loneliness very well everytime<br/>10</td>', 'Pastels express loneliness very well everytime10', '2003-10-22 10:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(457976, 43287, 12661, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the challenge and a nice use of depth of field.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the challenge and a nice use of depth of field.', '2003-10-22 10:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(457977, 42696, 9295, '<td valign="top">I understand what you were trying to go  for here, the contrast of the dark, reddish wood to the brightness of the flower, but it''s not a very appealing affect.  Maybe if you made the wood black and white or sepia tones and left the flower blue it would help but as it is, the textures just overpower the flower for me.</td>', 'I understand what you were trying to go  for here, the contrast of the dark, reddish wood to the brightness of the flower, but it''s not a very appealing affect.  Maybe if you made the wood black and white or sepia tones and left the flower blue it would help but as it is, the textures just overpower the flower for me.', '2003-10-22 10:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(457978, 43090, 2344, '<td valign="top">This is great! There was a guy in my photography program that used to do pics with these action figures. They were really cool and so is this. (Adam is that you? Just checking...)</td>', 'This is great! There was a guy in my photography program that used to do pics with these action figures. They were really cool and so is this. (Adam is that you? Just checking...)', '2003-10-22 10:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(457979, 43090, 12061, '<td valign="top">super cute!! A+ on this shot - its great! Excellent composition, love the white background, and the little green shadow by the foot makes for a great capture. There is something missing though .. I can''t quite pinpoint it - maybe another subject in the distant background? I dunno .. anyway, excellent work! 9</td>', 'super cute!! A+ on this shot - its great! Excellent composition, love the white background, and the little green shadow by the foot makes for a great capture. There is something missing though .. I can''t quite pinpoint it - maybe another subject in the distant background? I dunno .. anyway, excellent work! 9', '2003-10-22 10:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(457981, 42750, 12855, '<td valign="top">Fall can deffinetley be a lonely season and this leaf is by itself. Nice shadows...they are actually calming and soften the blacktop.</td>', 'Fall can deffinetley be a lonely season and this leaf is by itself. Nice shadows...they are actually calming and soften the blacktop.', '2003-10-22 10:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(457982, 42692, 9295, '<td valign="top">You''re title alone makes this a fun and charming shot.</td>', 'You''re title alone makes this a fun and charming shot.', '2003-10-22 10:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(457986, 43418, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pros .. sharp, colorful and fits the challenge well. <br/> <br/>Cons .. Almost *too* much contrast .. I can see a dull tone working best here. Also it would be great if all the books were aligned perfectly at the top. I am not sure on the blue bottom ... I think all white in the background and black as the bottom would look great :) JMO<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Pros .. sharp, colorful and fits the challenge well.  Cons .. Almost *too* much contrast .. I can see a dull tone working best here. Also it would be great if all the books were aligned perfectly at the top. I am not sure on the blue bottom ... I think all white in the background and black as the bottom would look great :) JMO 7', '2003-10-22 10:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(457987, 43226, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very good human interest study. I like the use of B&amp;W. One small thing is it''s not level. That throws off the compostion a little,,  7</td>', 'Very good human interest study. I like the use of B&W. One small thing is it''s not level. That throws off the compostion a little,,  7', '2003-10-22 10:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(457988, 43312, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice, what a great use of desaturation.</td>', 'Very nice, what a great use of desaturation.', '2003-10-22 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(457990, 42542, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot. Try cropping it so the bird is off-center and see if that doesn''t work even better...to add a little more interest.  Also, I don''t care for the border much but I never adjust my scores based on that.</td>', 'This is a neat shot. Try cropping it so the bird is off-center and see if that doesn''t work even better...to add a little more interest.  Also, I don''t care for the border much but I never adjust my scores based on that.', '2003-10-22 10:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(457991, 43269, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. I like the composition here, and this fits the challenge well. B&amp;W works great, nice choice. Nice and sharp - i like that.<br/> <br/>Neg .. I would like to see less of that shadow behind his back - its a bit distracting. The subject is a little dark, a step lighter would be great. <br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Pos .. I like the composition here, and this fits the challenge well. B&W works great, nice choice. Nice and sharp - i like that. Neg .. I would like to see less of that shadow behind his back - its a bit distracting. The subject is a little dark, a step lighter would be great.  7', '2003-10-22 10:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(457994, 43302, 11855, '<td valign="top">I really like this angle. If it was somewhat brighter it could have brought a better feeling to the picture</td>', 'I really like this angle. If it was somewhat brighter it could have brought a better feeling to the picture', '2003-10-22 10:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(457995, 42703, 6668, '<td valign="top">This one would have been great for the shadow chalenge.</td>', 'This one would have been great for the shadow chalenge.', '2003-10-22 10:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(457997, 43289, 11855, '<td valign="top">very nice, the yellow grass contrasts nice to the background.</td>', 'very nice, the yellow grass contrasts nice to the background.', '2003-10-22 10:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
