(458000, 42520, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally care for this border with this shot, maybe just a black border would have worked better.</td>', 'I don''t personally care for this border with this shot, maybe just a black border would have worked better.', '2003-10-22 10:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(458001, 42838, 12061, '<td valign="top">I love it! The layering of the trees, the colors are wonderful. Image is crisp and totally fits the challenge. Excellent photo!<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'I love it! The layering of the trees, the colors are wonderful. Image is crisp and totally fits the challenge. Excellent photo! 9', '2003-10-22 10:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458004, 42509, 11855, '<td valign="top">very nice tone. When I look at this pic I see the clouds which inturn lead me to the kid.. The clouds are a little over powering in the pic.</td>', 'very nice tone. When I look at this pic I see the clouds which inturn lead me to the kid.. The clouds are a little over powering in the pic.', '2003-10-22 11:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(458005, 43274, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. Very moody, its great for this challenge. The composition is good. B&amp;W is good .. but I think just a *hint* of neutral tones would work beautifully here.<br/> <br/>Neg .. a little grainy, although I''m not too sure if thats a good or bad thing... not "completely" in focus but then again the soft touch is also nice. I''m partial on the negatives!! Great job :)<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Pos .. Very moody, its great for this challenge. The composition is good. B&W is good .. but I think just a *hint* of neutral tones would work beautifully here. Neg .. a little grainy, although I''m not too sure if thats a good or bad thing... not "completely" in focus but then again the soft touch is also nice. I''m partial on the negatives!! Great job :) 8', '2003-10-22 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458006, 42593, 11855, '<td valign="top">The loneliness of love. Well done</td>', 'The loneliness of love. Well done', '2003-10-22 11:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(458012, 43385, 11855, '<td valign="top">The rain adds a lot to this pic</td>', 'The rain adds a lot to this pic', '2003-10-22 11:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(458014, 42845, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. Great contrast and tones, great composition, and its sharp. <br/> <br/>Neg .. I kinda wish the land wasn''t slanted so much, it kinda takes my eye away from the car. this is minor, but for some reason that rock in the lower left corner keeps bugging me ;) Nice stuff.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Pos .. Great contrast and tones, great composition, and its sharp.  Neg .. I kinda wish the land wasn''t slanted so much, it kinda takes my eye away from the car. this is minor, but for some reason that rock in the lower left corner keeps bugging me ;) Nice stuff. 7', '2003-10-22 11:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(458017, 42735, 9295, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a Time Out! LOL  I like this a lot.  You''ve got her in a great pose for this challenge and the fact that she''s facing towards the tree instead of with her back to it gives her a more isolated feeling.  Nice lighting and fall colors.</td>', 'Looks more like a Time Out! LOL  I like this a lot.  You''ve got her in a great pose for this challenge and the fact that she''s facing towards the tree instead of with her back to it gives her a more isolated feeling.  Nice lighting and fall colors.', '2003-10-22 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(458019, 43419, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. Challenge-appropriate, great quality, beautiful city colors.<br/> <br/>Neg .. I know this is the main part of your photo, but I just don''t like the way the hands are ... Maybe its the position they are in, or even because the fingers aren''t tightly closed and is showing some of the sky. <br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Pos .. Challenge-appropriate, great quality, beautiful city colors. Neg .. I know this is the main part of your photo, but I just don''t like the way the hands are ... Maybe its the position they are in, or even because the fingers aren''t tightly closed and is showing some of the sky.  7', '2003-10-22 11:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458021, 42675, 11855, '<td valign="top">Nice work. The contrast between inside and out really brings a lonely feeling to the girl looking out. Wishing she could be a part of the outside world. A little rotation could have straightened the pic out and made the crookedness a little less distracting. 7</td>', 'Nice work. The contrast between inside and out really brings a lonely feeling to the girl looking out. Wishing she could be a part of the outside world. A little rotation could have straightened the pic out and made the crookedness a little less distracting. 7', '2003-10-22 11:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(458022, 42735, 11855, '<td valign="top">well done. the use of the tree works well.</td>', 'well done. the use of the tree works well.', '2003-10-22 11:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(458024, 43194, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. Its a great photo, nice and sharp, visually appealing!<br/> <br/>Neg .. I don''t really get the feeling of being all alone from this shot. The brown foam is a little distracting..<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Pos .. Its a great photo, nice and sharp, visually appealing! Neg .. I don''t really get the feeling of being all alone from this shot. The brown foam is a little distracting.. 7', '2003-10-22 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(458027, 43207, 11855, '<td valign="top">Finally alone and happy... So many of the pics in this challenge relate to being alone and sad. The arms swinging and the bright pink top make this a really fun "alone" photo. 8</td>', 'Finally alone and happy... So many of the pics in this challenge relate to being alone and sad. The arms swinging and the bright pink top make this a really fun "alone" photo. 8', '2003-10-22 11:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
