(458051, 42939, 13368, '<td valign="top">yes, very effective. Pity that she is not walking and her feet do not have a dynamic pose. It seems she is posing. But the sense of solitude is very well goven. Bravo.</td>', 'yes, very effective. Pity that she is not walking and her feet do not have a dynamic pose. It seems she is posing. But the sense of solitude is very well goven. Bravo.', '2003-10-22 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(458054, 43386, 13025, '<td valign="top">Watch for the Horizon!  8-)</td>', 'Watch for the Horizon!  8-)', '2003-10-22 11:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458055, 42580, 13025, '<td valign="top">Cute! :)</td>', 'Cute! :)', '2003-10-22 11:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(458057, 43038, 13025, '<td valign="top">Cute pussy-cat! Well exposed! :)</td>', 'Cute pussy-cat! Well exposed! :)', '2003-10-22 11:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(458064, 43030, 13025, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, Exposure and Composition! Well done! :)</td>', 'Excellent colors, Exposure and Composition! Well done! :)', '2003-10-22 11:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(458066, 42886, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points: A great shot on it''s own right, nice lighting and great level horizon<br/>Bad Points:bit to saturated. And although it won''t effect my score, I think some DPC''ers will say it doesn''t meet the challenge enough. (bah hunbugs) does to me though great shot. (would be more fitting in light challenge mind you)<br/>Overall Score:7</td>', 'Good Points: A great shot on it''s own right, nice lighting and great level horizonBad Points:bit to saturated. And although it won''t effect my score, I think some DPC''ers will say it doesn''t meet the challenge enough. (bah hunbugs) does to me though great shot. (would be more fitting in light challenge mind you)Overall Score:7', '2003-10-22 11:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(458070, 43216, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points: I see your idea, good one.<br/>Bad points: too much negative space, and the subject is out of focus. I tried something the same in the life challenge and got ranked badly ;(<br/>Overall Score:2</td>', 'Good Points: I see your idea, good one.Bad points: too much negative space, and the subject is out of focus. I tried something the same in the life challenge and got ranked badly ;(Overall Score:2', '2003-10-22 11:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(458072, 43108, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:Nice big image, crisp and good dof<br/>Bad points:boring subject, a CD rack...<br/>Overall Score:4</td>', 'Good Points:Nice big image, crisp and good dofBad points:boring subject, a CD rack...Overall Score:4', '2003-10-22 11:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(458076, 43206, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:nice cpature of rare bird ;) Good expression<br/>Bad points:not enough enphassis on the bird, could be composed tighter.<br/>Overall Score:4</td>', 'Good Points:nice cpature of rare bird ;) Good expressionBad points:not enough enphassis on the bird, could be composed tighter.Overall Score:4', '2003-10-22 11:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(458080, 42897, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:Nice technical picture, well developed and nice shadow.<br/>Bad points:Bit boring to be fair, a dog on a golf course. If you had a wider scope would be more fitting. Also, if ever I saw a damn dog on my golf course there would be trouble! Hope you clean his poo up. lol<br/>Overall Score:4</td>', 'Good Points:Nice technical picture, well developed and nice shadow.Bad points:Bit boring to be fair, a dog on a golf course. If you had a wider scope would be more fitting. Also, if ever I saw a damn dog on my golf course there would be trouble! Hope you clean his poo up. lolOverall Score:4', '2003-10-22 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(458082, 43384, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:<br/>Bad points:<br/>Overall Score:</td>', 'Good Points:Bad points:Overall Score:', '2003-10-22 11:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(458083, 42792, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space. The highlights in the leaf are a little distracting for me, but other than that nice image.</td>', 'Good use of negative space. The highlights in the leaf are a little distracting for me, but other than that nice image.', '2003-10-22 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(458088, 43000, 6845, '<td valign="top">I wonder where his twin brother is. I like the offset of the boot, maybe the boot could have been placed even more towards the right corner when framing the shot. The horizon is a little to centered for my taste, but over all a nice idea.</td>', 'I wonder where his twin brother is. I like the offset of the boot, maybe the boot could have been placed even more towards the right corner when framing the shot. The horizon is a little to centered for my taste, but over all a nice idea.', '2003-10-22 11:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(458092, 43096, 6845, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft on the focus, but I like the framing and it makes for a nice subject.</td>', 'Seems a little soft on the focus, but I like the framing and it makes for a nice subject.', '2003-10-22 11:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(458094, 42664, 12661, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition and good use of reflections. Critiques: The background is grainy and the black king is facing the wrong way. I see why you did it, but it just looks strange that the chess piece has his back to the opponent.</td>', 'An interesting composition and good use of reflections. Critiques: The background is grainy and the black king is facing the wrong way. I see why you did it, but it just looks strange that the chess piece has his back to the opponent.', '2003-10-22 11:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(458096, 42692, 6845, '<td valign="top">I love penguins. Poor thing looks lonely though. I like the shot. For me, however, I would have liked to have seen the penguin even more into the left bottom corner. But thats just my personal taste.</td>', 'I love penguins. Poor thing looks lonely though. I like the shot. For me, however, I would have liked to have seen the penguin even more into the left bottom corner. But thats just my personal taste.', '2003-10-22 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(458097, 43209, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colors and fitting facial expression that emphasize the sense of lonlieness. Now put down the camera and go make that kid a sibling. ;)</td>', 'Nice warm colors and fitting facial expression that emphasize the sense of lonlieness. Now put down the camera and go make that kid a sibling. ;)', '2003-10-22 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(458099, 43333, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very nice placement of the subject both within the frame and behind the grass. The sky looks a bit grainy though.</td>', 'Very nice placement of the subject both within the frame and behind the grass. The sky looks a bit grainy though.', '2003-10-22 11:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(458100, 43380, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the image and the idea. But seeing two hands doesn''t make me see this image as "alone". I don''t know why but it just does. Don''t worry though, I won''t take away points for "not meeting the challenge" because I feel you did meet the challenge in a non literal way.</td>', 'I like the image and the idea. But seeing two hands doesn''t make me see this image as "alone". I don''t know why but it just does. Don''t worry though, I won''t take away points for "not meeting the challenge" because I feel you did meet the challenge in a non literal way.', '2003-10-22 11:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(458101, 43261, 12661, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is off with the blurring in the foreground. I don''t think it adds to the photo, then again, I have been wrong before. On the brighter side, good use of the rule of thirds and good sharp focus on the bird.</td>', 'The depth of field is off with the blurring in the foreground. I don''t think it adds to the photo, then again, I have been wrong before. On the brighter side, good use of the rule of thirds and good sharp focus on the bird.', '2003-10-22 11:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(458102, 43117, 6845, '<td valign="top">The slant of the horizon kind of bugs me. But other than that, the image definitely gives the sense that the cow is all alone.</td>', 'The slant of the horizon kind of bugs me. But other than that, the image definitely gives the sense that the cow is all alone.', '2003-10-22 11:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(458103, 42804, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the gannet within the shot. Overall, the image is a put too soft. A sharper head and a sharper horizon would have added to the photo.</td>', 'Nice placement of the gannet within the shot. Overall, the image is a put too soft. A sharper head and a sharper horizon would have added to the photo.', '2003-10-22 12:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(458105, 42935, 6845, '<td valign="top">A different idea. The couple is all alone. I feel, for my taste, there is too many centers in this image. The horizon is almost centered and the couple is centered. Maybe you could have had less ground or less trees and then put the couple down or up in a corner. Just my personal taste. I really enjoy the colors in the image however.</td>', 'A different idea. The couple is all alone. I feel, for my taste, there is too many centers in this image. The horizon is almost centered and the couple is centered. Maybe you could have had less ground or less trees and then put the couple down or up in a corner. Just my personal taste. I really enjoy the colors in the image however.', '2003-10-22 12:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(458107, 42979, 11114, '<td valign="top">She does look kinda scared and alone -( I'',m a sucker for kid photos) - I think a higher angle might have made her look smaller and more alone - as it is we''re almost looking up her nose -</td>', 'She does look kinda scared and alone -( I'',m a sucker for kid photos) - I think a higher angle might have made her look smaller and more alone - as it is we''re almost looking up her nose -', '2003-10-22 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(458108, 43099, 12661, '<td valign="top">You have captured the challenge well. The picture looks a bit faded and grainy however.</td>', 'You have captured the challenge well. The picture looks a bit faded and grainy however.', '2003-10-22 12:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(458110, 42886, 11114, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous shot.  Doesn''t give me a feeling of being alone especially but it is breathtaking. - 8</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous shot.  Doesn''t give me a feeling of being alone especially but it is breathtaking. - 8', '2003-10-22 12:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(458111, 43232, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white shot. Good DOF and composition. 8.</td>', 'Nice black and white shot. Good DOF and composition. 8.', '2003-10-22 12:03:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(458112, 43188, 6845, '<td valign="top">The image looks a little faded. There doesn''t seem to be any rich black tones. Some more contrast or slightly darkening the image might of helped this. I like the composition however.</td>', 'The image looks a little faded. There doesn''t seem to be any rich black tones. Some more contrast or slightly darkening the image might of helped this. I like the composition however.', '2003-10-22 12:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458113, 43134, 11114, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame he''s behind a branch - good solitary feeling to this one thought</td>', 'It''s a shame he''s behind a branch - good solitary feeling to this one thought', '2003-10-22 12:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(458114, 42593, 12661, '<td valign="top">I have a soft spot for shots in Philly. The cropping is a bit awkward with parts of the sculpture cut off. Unfortunelty, the background also leaves much to be desired, but there isn''t much that can be done about that. Nonetheless, a nice interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'I have a soft spot for shots in Philly. The cropping is a bit awkward with parts of the sculpture cut off. Unfortunelty, the background also leaves much to be desired, but there isn''t much that can be done about that. Nonetheless, a nice interpretation of the challenge.', '2003-10-22 12:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(458115, 42976, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot - central america?</td>', 'Nice crisp shot - central america?', '2003-10-22 12:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(458116, 42853, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image. I like the composition and the light.</td>', 'This is a nice image. I like the composition and the light.', '2003-10-22 12:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(458118, 42609, 11114, '<td valign="top">The bare feet, the brokendown steps - it gives me a feeling a dejection and loneliness - well done</td>', 'The bare feet, the brokendown steps - it gives me a feeling a dejection and loneliness - well done', '2003-10-22 12:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(458120, 43423, 6536, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Nice composition. Good lighting effect. 7.</td>', 'Cool idea. Nice composition. Good lighting effect. 7.', '2003-10-22 12:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(458121, 42609, 6845, '<td valign="top">For me, there is almost too much to this image. I know the focal point is the girl, but she gets lost in the jumble of all the trees. I do like the composition as far as her being offset, I think, however that this shot could have benefited from a tighter crop or composition.</td>', 'For me, there is almost too much to this image. I know the focal point is the girl, but she gets lost in the jumble of all the trees. I do like the composition as far as her being offset, I think, however that this shot could have benefited from a tighter crop or composition.', '2003-10-22 12:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(458122, 42813, 6536, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Nice colors and lighting. Good positioning of subject. 6.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Nice colors and lighting. Good positioning of subject. 6.', '2003-10-22 12:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(458124, 43386, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good lighintg and composition. Good theme. 7.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good lighintg and composition. Good theme. 7.', '2003-10-22 12:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(458125, 42708, 6845, '<td valign="top">The light in this image is excellent. I personally would have liked to have seen the bird even more off center, but that is just my personal taste.</td>', 'The light in this image is excellent. I personally would have liked to have seen the bird even more off center, but that is just my personal taste.', '2003-10-22 12:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(458128, 42549, 11114, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit too chipper to evoke a feeling of loneliness - I guess the lighting is moody though</td>', 'Looks a bit too chipper to evoke a feeling of loneliness - I guess the lighting is moody though', '2003-10-22 12:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(458129, 43113, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Good composition. You might want to sharpen in photoshop it loks a little out of focus. 5.</td>', 'Nice idea. Good composition. You might want to sharpen in photoshop it loks a little out of focus. 5.', '2003-10-22 12:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(458130, 43096, 6536, '<td valign="top">Good use of light vs. shadows. Good composition. Nice positioning of subject. 6.</td>', 'Good use of light vs. shadows. Good composition. Nice positioning of subject. 6.', '2003-10-22 12:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(458131, 43350, 6845, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the child''s face. He does look lonely. I feel that this works well with the theme even though it is so tightly cropped, where as most people have a lot of space around their subjects.</td>', 'Great expression on the child''s face. He does look lonely. I feel that this works well with the theme even though it is so tightly cropped, where as most people have a lot of space around their subjects.', '2003-10-22 12:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(458133, 43289, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good light, nice composition.</td>', 'Good light, nice composition.', '2003-10-22 12:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(458134, 43212, 6536, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and shadows going up the stairs. Good positioning of subject. Nice composition and DOF. 7.</td>', 'I like the lighting and shadows going up the stairs. Good positioning of subject. Nice composition and DOF. 7.', '2003-10-22 12:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458135, 42881, 6845, '<td valign="top">Looks a little over sharpened or somthing. But I like how the frogs color just jumps out at you. Nice idea.</td>', 'Looks a little over sharpened or somthing. But I like how the frogs color just jumps out at you. Nice idea.', '2003-10-22 12:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(458136, 42405, 6536, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot. Good composition. 6.</td>', 'Very creative shot. Good composition. 6.', '2003-10-22 12:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(458137, 43110, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. It has a difinate mood to the image. She difinately seems all alone.</td>', 'Nice composition. It has a difinate mood to the image. She difinately seems all alone.', '2003-10-22 12:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(458138, 42560, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. I am still undecided if I like the motion blur of the subject or not, but in any case, nice image.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. I am still undecided if I like the motion blur of the subject or not, but in any case, nice image.', '2003-10-22 12:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(458139, 43282, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Good composition. Nice lighting and shadows. 8.</td>', 'Nice idea. Good composition. Nice lighting and shadows. 8.', '2003-10-22 12:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(458140, 42610, 6845, '<td valign="top">Interesting graphic composition. I like the clouds.</td>', 'Interesting graphic composition. I like the clouds.', '2003-10-22 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(458141, 43158, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Perfect lighting and shadows. Good composition. 9.</td>', 'Great shot. Perfect lighting and shadows. Good composition. 9.', '2003-10-22 12:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(458142, 43271, 6536, '<td valign="top">6.</td>', '6.', '2003-10-22 12:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(458143, 43294, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good composition. You might have wanted  to try to wait until the sun was lower, or get there before the sun was higher to try to get some softer, warmer light on the subject. The light here seems a little too harsh.</td>', 'Good composition. You might have wanted  to try to wait until the sun was lower, or get there before the sun was higher to try to get some softer, warmer light on the subject. The light here seems a little too harsh.', '2003-10-22 12:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(458144, 43327, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this image. It is nice.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this image. It is nice.', '2003-10-22 12:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(458145, 42695, 6536, '<td valign="top">7.</td>', '7.', '2003-10-22 12:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(458146, 43331, 11114, '<td valign="top">ewww - the drop of blood that hasn''t quite fallen.......you made your point for sure</td>', 'ewww - the drop of blood that hasn''t quite fallen.......you made your point for sure', '2003-10-22 12:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458148, 42976, 7703, '<td valign="top">You are not alone whene you are with God</td>', 'You are not alone whene you are with God', '2003-10-22 12:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(458149, 42636, 6845, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this is a great image. The subject looks alone, the composition and the light are excellent. And the tone gives it a cool feeloing. Nice image. One of my favorites.</td>', 'In my opinion, this is a great image. The subject looks alone, the composition and the light are excellent. And the tone gives it a cool feeloing. Nice image. One of my favorites.', '2003-10-22 12:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(458151, 43330, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. Good composition, and the color of his shirt makes him really stand out.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. Good composition, and the color of his shirt makes him really stand out.', '2003-10-22 12:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(458153, 42626, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition. I would have liked to have seen more focus on her however.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition. I would have liked to have seen more focus on her however.', '2003-10-22 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(458154, 43260, 6536, '<td valign="top">8.</td>', '8.', '2003-10-22 12:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(458155, 43177, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. the sky looks great, focus good.<br/> <br/>Neg .. a little small, not the best subject for this challenge, colors a little over saturated. Composition could be better.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'Pos .. the sky looks great, focus good. Neg .. a little small, not the best subject for this challenge, colors a little over saturated. Composition could be better. 5', '2003-10-22 12:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(458157, 42755, 11114, '<td valign="top">Umm - can I ask you a serious question?  Doesn''t this sort of thing violate the 2nd commandment?  <br/> <br/>You shall not make for yourself an idol in the form of anything in heaven above or on the earth beneath or in the waters below.  You shall not bow down to them or worship them; for I, the LORD your God, am a jealous God....Deuteronomy 5:8,9</td>', 'Umm - can I ask you a serious question?  Doesn''t this sort of thing violate the 2nd commandment?   You shall not make for yourself an idol in the form of anything in heaven above or on the earth beneath or in the waters below.  You shall not bow down to them or worship them; for I, the LORD your God, am a jealous God....Deuteronomy 5:8,9', '2003-10-22 12:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(458158, 43097, 12661, '<td valign="top">I am having a really hard time understanding what you are portraying in this photo. However, I have been known to miss the obvious sometimes. Feel free to provide an explanation. For now, my score is pretty low.</td>', 'I am having a really hard time understanding what you are portraying in this photo. However, I have been known to miss the obvious sometimes. Feel free to provide an explanation. For now, my score is pretty low.', '2003-10-22 12:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(458159, 42824, 6845, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on the challenge. I like it. I personally would have liked the glass more off to the side, but that is just me.</td>', 'A very interesting take on the challenge. I like it. I personally would have liked the glass more off to the side, but that is just me.', '2003-10-22 12:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(458160, 43162, 6536, '<td valign="top">8.</td>', '8.', '2003-10-22 12:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(458162, 42735, 6845, '<td valign="top">The shoe is a little hot, but the overall image has a nice feel to it.</td>', 'The shoe is a little hot, but the overall image has a nice feel to it.', '2003-10-22 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(458163, 42704, 12330, '<td valign="top">think it would look better in b/w.</td>', 'think it would look better in b/w.', '2003-10-22 12:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(458164, 43357, 6845, '<td valign="top">The desaturation of the colors really makes the boy stand out. Nice composition and use of negative space.</td>', 'The desaturation of the colors really makes the boy stand out. Nice composition and use of negative space.', '2003-10-22 12:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(458165, 43197, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. I like the composition, perfect straight line across the horizon! Nice job. Great comic value :) Colors blend nicely and its focused well.<br/> <br/>Neg .. the only things that draw me from this image is that the subject is so far away and the ocean ripples are a little sharp, I think they would work best with a soft touch.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Pos .. I like the composition, perfect straight line across the horizon! Nice job. Great comic value :) Colors blend nicely and its focused well. Neg .. the only things that draw me from this image is that the subject is so far away and the ocean ripples are a little sharp, I think they would work best with a soft touch. 8', '2003-10-22 12:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(458166, 42803, 11034, '<td valign="top">Muy bonita imagen. Por tu culpa voy a tener que votar el 20% del reto, pues quiero que el 10 que le di a esta foto cuente.<br/> <br/>Saludos</td>', 'Muy bonita imagen. Por tu culpa voy a tener que votar el 20% del reto, pues quiero que el 10 que le di a esta foto cuente. Saludos', '2003-10-22 12:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458167, 43030, 12330, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2003-10-22 12:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458168, 42763, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Nice and simple, yet creates a strong graphic appeal.</td>', 'Good subject. Nice and simple, yet creates a strong graphic appeal.', '2003-10-22 12:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(458169, 43385, 12661, '<td valign="top">The goods: positioning of the subject, relevance to the challenge, the rain, the choice of B&amp;W, the subjects expression.<br/>The bads: Uhm... I have to come back to it.</td>', 'The goods: positioning of the subject, relevance to the challenge, the rain, the choice of B&W, the subjects expression.The bads: Uhm... I have to come back to it.', '2003-10-22 12:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
