(458171, 42376, 6845, '<td valign="top">The image seems too dark in the shadows. Maybe a little less contrast could have given more detail to the dark areas. I like the composition however.</td>', 'The image seems too dark in the shadows. Maybe a little less contrast could have given more detail to the dark areas. I like the composition however.', '2003-10-22 12:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
