(458231, 42953, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot. I like how the light filters through the shadows and the colors of the leaves behind your subject become the same auburn color as her hair (almost a halo affect) while the green leaves at the top of the page balance the color at the bottom.  With such fair skin and the brightness of her blue jeans, she really her stands out against the backdrop.  What I like most though is the expression on her face and what I''m assuming is a flower in her hand..."He loves me...he loves me not..."  I hope "he" loves her.  :-)</td>', 'This is a lovely shot. I like how the light filters through the shadows and the colors of the leaves behind your subject become the same auburn color as her hair (almost a halo affect) while the green leaves at the top of the page balance the color at the bottom.  With such fair skin and the brightness of her blue jeans, she really her stands out against the backdrop.  What I like most though is the expression on her face and what I''m assuming is a flower in her hand..."He loves me...he loves me not..."  I hope "he" loves her.  :-)', '2003-10-22 12:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
