(458293, 43384, 12327, '<td valign="top">It would help if it had a stem and some leaves so it wouldn''t look like you threw a pumpkin in a bare field.... I mean it would look better if it looked like it grew there.</td>', 'It would help if it had a stem and some leaves so it wouldn''t look like you threw a pumpkin in a bare field.... I mean it would look better if it looked like it grew there.', '2003-10-22 13:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(458295, 43419, 12327, '<td valign="top">very creative... now if you could stop it down  and get the hand in focus to, that would be quite something.</td>', 'very creative... now if you could stop it down  and get the hand in focus to, that would be quite something.', '2003-10-22 13:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(458296, 42944, 12327, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the title, but the photo does express "solitude"</td>', 'I don''t care for the title, but the photo does express "solitude"', '2003-10-22 13:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(458297, 42961, 12661, '<td valign="top">A nice expression of solitude. The only downsides is that more space is needed between the dog and the bottom of the photo and the back view of the dog isn''t the most appealing. Barring that, it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'A nice expression of solitude. The only downsides is that more space is needed between the dog and the bottom of the photo and the back view of the dog isn''t the most appealing. Barring that, it''s a nice shot.', '2003-10-22 13:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(458299, 42507, 12327, '<td valign="top">the lighting bugs me (too greenish)... I''d either adjust the hue or desaturate it.  I like the way the drop acts as a magnifier.</td>', 'the lighting bugs me (too greenish)... I''d either adjust the hue or desaturate it.  I like the way the drop acts as a magnifier.', '2003-10-22 13:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458300, 43277, 12327, '<td valign="top">what the... is that?  weird looking mushroom, almost looks like a face with a frown.</td>', 'what the... is that?  weird looking mushroom, almost looks like a face with a frown.', '2003-10-22 13:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(458301, 42878, 9295, '<td valign="top">Because the bench facing left, I think it would be more effective to have the open space to the left of the photo instead of the right. The shadows are effective however, as are the muted tones. Nice detail in the ground covering.</td>', 'Because the bench facing left, I think it would be more effective to have the open space to the left of the photo instead of the right. The shadows are effective however, as are the muted tones. Nice detail in the ground covering.', '2003-10-22 13:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(458302, 42414, 12327, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition.</td>', 'beautiful composition.', '2003-10-22 13:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(458303, 42509, 9295, '<td valign="top">Make your subject just a little closer and maybe down on the page a little. Cute shot of a cute child, let''s see him just a little better.  Otherwise, beautiful landscape shot, colors, tones and composition.</td>', 'Make your subject just a little closer and maybe down on the page a little. Cute shot of a cute child, let''s see him just a little better.  Otherwise, beautiful landscape shot, colors, tones and composition.', '2003-10-22 13:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(458310, 43286, 6668, '<td valign="top">would be nice if it was a little closer to see more detail on the soldier...cute idea.</td>', 'would be nice if it was a little closer to see more detail on the soldier...cute idea.', '2003-10-22 13:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(458311, 43282, 12327, '<td valign="top">I wish the ones in the background were in focus, but I really like some things about this one:  it''s neat how you can see the other pieces through (or reflected on) the one in front.</td>', 'I wish the ones in the background were in focus, but I really like some things about this one:  it''s neat how you can see the other pieces through (or reflected on) the one in front.', '2003-10-22 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(458313, 42593, 6668, '<td valign="top">too much going on in the background...distracts from the image.</td>', 'too much going on in the background...distracts from the image.', '2003-10-22 13:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(458314, 43242, 9295, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and lighting (it has a wonderful, romantic feel to it) but I think your subject should be off to the left a little.  However, I do like the person''s shadow on the ground so maybe not.  Until you notice that, the picture doesn''t feel right but you don''t want to lose the impact of that shadow. Perhaps soften the bright white light on the pavement and instead of cropping off the right of the picture, leave more to the left.</td>', 'I love the colors and lighting (it has a wonderful, romantic feel to it) but I think your subject should be off to the left a little.  However, I do like the person''s shadow on the ground so maybe not.  Until you notice that, the picture doesn''t feel right but you don''t want to lose the impact of that shadow. Perhaps soften the bright white light on the pavement and instead of cropping off the right of the picture, leave more to the left.', '2003-10-22 13:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(458315, 43208, 12327, '<td valign="top">what is that?</td>', 'what is that?', '2003-10-22 13:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458322, 43392, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space with this shot.</td>', 'I like the negative space with this shot.', '2003-10-22 13:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(458326, 43409, 12661, '<td valign="top">The subject is too centered in the photo. Placing him lower and to the right would have improved the photo. Also, it appears too pixelated. Beautiful sky though.</td>', 'The subject is too centered in the photo. Placing him lower and to the right would have improved the photo. Also, it appears too pixelated. Beautiful sky though.', '2003-10-22 14:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458329, 43053, 11248, '<td valign="top">One of the best to fit to the theme "All alone" and very interresting scene.</td>', 'One of the best to fit to the theme "All alone" and very interresting scene.', '2003-10-22 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(458330, 43199, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice tight macro shot.</td>', 'Good idea, nice tight macro shot.', '2003-10-22 14:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458331, 42375, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellant, excellant image. Good color and star capture. I wonder if you purposely placed the constellation Scorpio just to the left of the lighthouse. This is the best star capture image I have ever seen at DPC. Given the angle I''d guess this was taken near the Equator or in the Southern Hemisphere. Great job.</td>', 'Excellant, excellant image. Good color and star capture. I wonder if you purposely placed the constellation Scorpio just to the left of the lighthouse. This is the best star capture image I have ever seen at DPC. Given the angle I''d guess this was taken near the Equator or in the Southern Hemisphere. Great job.', '2003-10-22 14:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(458332, 42872, 13403, '<td valign="top">i really like the footsteps coming back from the beach..    alas, he has to say good bye ;)   cool picture.</td>', 'i really like the footsteps coming back from the beach..    alas, he has to say good bye ;)   cool picture.', '2003-10-22 14:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(458335, 42970, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the color in the water. It gives the image some warmth.</td>', 'I like the color in the water. It gives the image some warmth.', '2003-10-22 14:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(458338, 43197, 6845, '<td valign="top">Now he looks alone. This is one of the few, for me, that works with the subject that small and the surroundings so vast. It makes a nice simple image.</td>', 'Now he looks alone. This is one of the few, for me, that works with the subject that small and the surroundings so vast. It makes a nice simple image.', '2003-10-22 14:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(458340, 42861, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the light in this image.</td>', 'I like the light in this image.', '2003-10-22 14:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(458341, 43420, 13136, '<td valign="top">I love how the clouds appear lighter below the bird as if it is bringing the light with it as it flies. I half expect all the clouds to turn white and fluffy and the sky to become bright blue as the bird passes. Great shading.</td>', 'I love how the clouds appear lighter below the bird as if it is bringing the light with it as it flies. I half expect all the clouds to turn white and fluffy and the sky to become bright blue as the bird passes. Great shading.', '2003-10-22 14:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(458342, 43090, 6845, '<td valign="top">Great simple image that gets the point across. This is a cool toy and I like how you have posed it. The composition is nicely done as well.</td>', 'Great simple image that gets the point across. This is a cool toy and I like how you have posed it. The composition is nicely done as well.', '2003-10-22 14:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(458343, 42886, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a magnificent image. Great composition and the light is excellent. Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a magnificent image. Great composition and the light is excellent. Nicely done.', '2003-10-22 14:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458346, 42866, 6845, '<td valign="top">I personally, would have liked to have seen his feet included in the composition, but other than that, nice image.</td>', 'I personally, would have liked to have seen his feet included in the composition, but other than that, nice image.', '2003-10-22 14:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458347, 42799, 11793, '<td valign="top">the horzion is tweaked<br/>i think the ocean should be level</td>', 'the horzion is tweakedi think the ocean should be level', '2003-10-22 14:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(458348, 43231, 656, '<td valign="top">the shape contrast works - though I wish it was a different colour to stand out more strongly.  Lots of barrel distortion on the bricks too</td>', 'the shape contrast works - though I wish it was a different colour to stand out more strongly.  Lots of barrel distortion on the bricks too', '2003-10-22 14:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(458349, 43310, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good frozen motion. One of the few that seem to portray being alone is not such a bad thing.</td>', 'Nice composition and good frozen motion. One of the few that seem to portray being alone is not such a bad thing.', '2003-10-22 14:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(458351, 43287, 656, '<td valign="top">not sure the background works well with the orangy yellow flowers - something seems a bit unpleasant about the colours.  A good concept though</td>', 'not sure the background works well with the orangy yellow flowers - something seems a bit unpleasant about the colours.  A good concept though', '2003-10-22 14:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(458352, 42389, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective. Very interesting use of reflection.</td>', 'I like the perspective. Very interesting use of reflection.', '2003-10-22 14:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(458353, 43210, 656, '<td valign="top">I know there wasn''t much you could do about it, but I''d love to have seen the big tree of in the clear sky to the right.  The merger of fore and background weakens what could have been a great image.</td>', 'I know there wasn''t much you could do about it, but I''d love to have seen the big tree of in the clear sky to the right.  The merger of fore and background weakens what could have been a great image.', '2003-10-22 14:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(458354, 42870, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture! Aside from the perfect compositon and excellent color toning, the bed of leaves she is sitting on make this photo come to life. Very nice entry indeed.</td>', 'I really like this picture! Aside from the perfect compositon and excellent color toning, the bed of leaves she is sitting on make this photo come to life. Very nice entry indeed.', '2003-10-22 14:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458355, 43423, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light in this image. Really helps the main subject stand out. I also like the graphic that the marbles create. The top left of the stone is too hot. I feel that if there was some detail in that spot it could of helped.</td>', 'I like the use of light in this image. Really helps the main subject stand out. I also like the graphic that the marbles create. The top left of the stone is too hot. I feel that if there was some detail in that spot it could of helped.', '2003-10-22 14:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(458356, 42873, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro and good use of DOF. Good sharp focus too. The dismay grayness of the image adds to the loneliness called for in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice macro and good use of DOF. Good sharp focus too. The dismay grayness of the image adds to the loneliness called for in the challenge.', '2003-10-22 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(458357, 42710, 13136, '<td valign="top">This was a difficult picture for me to grade. I actually passed it up 10-12 times and graded it last. It almost goes too far evoking "All Alone" into "Total Despair". Pretty powerful and well composed. The posture of the subject was just a little too determined, maybe indicating defiance instead of aloneness.</td>', 'This was a difficult picture for me to grade. I actually passed it up 10-12 times and graded it last. It almost goes too far evoking "All Alone" into "Total Despair". Pretty powerful and well composed. The posture of the subject was just a little too determined, maybe indicating defiance instead of aloneness.', '2003-10-22 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(458358, 43282, 656, '<td valign="top">Good reflecion through the piece and attractive depth of field.  Really dislike the yellowish tinge due to the white balance though.  Something cooler would probably be more effective ?</td>', 'Good reflecion through the piece and attractive depth of field.  Really dislike the yellowish tinge due to the white balance though.  Something cooler would probably be more effective ?', '2003-10-22 14:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(458361, 42407, 656, '<td valign="top">nothing seems horizontal in this - very disconcerting, even if it is really like that</td>', 'nothing seems horizontal in this - very disconcerting, even if it is really like that', '2003-10-22 14:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(458363, 43050, 656, '<td valign="top">might be a strong black and white.  Don''t find the colour version with much appealing in it.</td>', 'might be a strong black and white.  Don''t find the colour version with much appealing in it.', '2003-10-22 14:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(458366, 43103, 6845, '<td valign="top">This looks like a toy version of one of the "urban landscapes" images. The highlights are a little hot, but other than that, nice idea and good composition.</td>', 'This looks like a toy version of one of the "urban landscapes" images. The highlights are a little hot, but other than that, nice idea and good composition.', '2003-10-22 14:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(458368, 43331, 3697, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful image and definately shows solitude, loneliness, and despair. Very nicely lit, great compostion, and a very unique interpretation of this week''s assignment. 9</td>', 'This is a very powerful image and definately shows solitude, loneliness, and despair. Very nicely lit, great compostion, and a very unique interpretation of this week''s assignment. 9', '2003-10-22 14:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(458369, 42867, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a good image in the idea that you did a nice job of conveying the feeling "alone" while having other people in the frame. Good job.</td>', 'This is a good image in the idea that you did a nice job of conveying the feeling "alone" while having other people in the frame. Good job.', '2003-10-22 14:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(458372, 43210, 4008, '<td valign="top">gorgeous picture but does not express the FEELING of lonelyness to me</td>', 'gorgeous picture but does not express the FEELING of lonelyness to me', '2003-10-22 14:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(458373, 43357, 656, '<td valign="top">the shirt works really well - making him stand out from the background, though the rest of the colours seem strangely unnatural.</td>', 'the shirt works really well - making him stand out from the background, though the rest of the colours seem strangely unnatural.', '2003-10-22 14:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(458374, 42706, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and dof. The little accents of color in the leaves behind the main subject help create a more visual appealing photo.</td>', 'Nice composition and dof. The little accents of color in the leaves behind the main subject help create a more visual appealing photo.', '2003-10-22 14:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(458376, 43086, 3697, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the black background seems much to black and artificial to me. Still, the leaf has great color and focus.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the black background seems much to black and artificial to me. Still, the leaf has great color and focus.', '2003-10-22 14:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458377, 42870, 656, '<td valign="top">seems to have been a bit harshly sharpened, but other than that a great portrait shot - plenty of space and texture - very nice appart from the halos.</td>', 'seems to have been a bit harshly sharpened, but other than that a great portrait shot - plenty of space and texture - very nice appart from the halos.', '2003-10-22 14:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(458378, 43053, 6845, '<td valign="top">Great image. Tried a similar idea myself but it didn''t work out so I went with something else. The color in the foreground really hepls seperate the main subject and making it stand all alone.</td>', 'Great image. Tried a similar idea myself but it didn''t work out so I went with something else. The color in the foreground really hepls seperate the main subject and making it stand all alone.', '2003-10-22 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458379, 43379, 656, '<td valign="top">nice side lighiting raises this from the more common internal only lit pumpkins - good shot. <br/> <br/>I like particularly that you have the ''eyes'' looking into the dark</td>', 'nice side lighiting raises this from the more common internal only lit pumpkins - good shot.  I like particularly that you have the ''eyes'' looking into the dark', '2003-10-22 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(458382, 43416, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good composition and dof. The focus really helps dictate the alone feeling.</td>', 'Good composition and dof. The focus really helps dictate the alone feeling.', '2003-10-22 14:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(458385, 42801, 12661, '<td valign="top">The line of light on the right edge of the right pole is a bit distracting. Overall, however, it is a very nice picture and definately gives the impression of alone.</td>', 'The line of light on the right edge of the right pole is a bit distracting. Overall, however, it is a very nice picture and definately gives the impression of alone.', '2003-10-22 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(458386, 43372, 656, '<td valign="top">what''s the white stump coming out of the center of the frame ?  It seems to take away from what would be a good portrait.  same with the thing (leaf?) in the top left.   The colour processing seems odd for the subject matter</td>', 'what''s the white stump coming out of the center of the frame ?  It seems to take away from what would be a good portrait.  same with the thing (leaf?) in the top left.   The colour processing seems odd for the subject matter', '2003-10-22 14:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(458387, 42923, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good composition. The colors int the coat and jeans realy makes the subject stand out.</td>', 'Good composition. The colors int the coat and jeans realy makes the subject stand out.', '2003-10-22 14:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(458391, 42874, 6845, '<td valign="top">Poor puppy. I like the light. There seems to be detail in all of the fur even though it is all white.</td>', 'Poor puppy. I like the light. There seems to be detail in all of the fur even though it is all white.', '2003-10-22 14:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(458392, 42866, 12661, '<td valign="top">A very nice interpretation of the challenge. The only downside is that the subject''s head disapears in the shirt. I lighter colored shirt may have worked better.</td>', 'A very nice interpretation of the challenge. The only downside is that the subject''s head disapears in the shirt. I lighter colored shirt may have worked better.', '2003-10-22 14:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(458397, 43377, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few times that I like the subject being centered. The area above him really adds to the feeling of being alone.</td>', 'This is one of the few times that I like the subject being centered. The area above him really adds to the feeling of being alone.', '2003-10-22 14:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(458398, 43030, 656, '<td valign="top">awesome.  great colours, wonderful silhouette.  Feels very ''upbeat'' for an ''alone'' theme.<br/> <br/>Good composition too with the ''hot'' lower left and cool upper right.  (10)</td>', 'awesome.  great colours, wonderful silhouette.  Feels very ''upbeat'' for an ''alone'' theme. Good composition too with the ''hot'' lower left and cool upper right.  (10)', '2003-10-22 14:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(458399, 43199, 4008, '<td valign="top">technically an excellent picture, but does not convey the FEELING of loneliness to me 5</td>', 'technically an excellent picture, but does not convey the FEELING of loneliness to me 5', '2003-10-22 14:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(458400, 42873, 6845, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot. Great focus and detail. Nice composition and light. The dark background really makes the subject pop out at you.</td>', 'Great macro shot. Great focus and detail. Nice composition and light. The dark background really makes the subject pop out at you.', '2003-10-22 14:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(458401, 43418, 10686, '<td valign="top">That''s one way to make the librarians angry.....</td>', 'That''s one way to make the librarians angry.....', '2003-10-22 14:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(458402, 42636, 656, '<td valign="top">the blue helps a lot - as does the light toned jacket - makes the subject stand out more from the background.  The big rock obviously adds a big weight to the bottom of the shot too.  good entry (9)</td>', 'the blue helps a lot - as does the light toned jacket - makes the subject stand out more from the background.  The big rock obviously adds a big weight to the bottom of the shot too.  good entry (9)', '2003-10-22 14:32:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(458405, 42588, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like you. Snakes are cool. Owned a few myself. Anyway, godd composition and dof. The focus really helps the subject seperate from the background.</td>', 'I like you. Snakes are cool. Owned a few myself. Anyway, godd composition and dof. The focus really helps the subject seperate from the background.', '2003-10-22 14:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(458407, 42883, 656, '<td valign="top">excellent - great colour, strong graphic silhouette and good sun placement - classic of the style.</td>', 'excellent - great colour, strong graphic silhouette and good sun placement - classic of the style.', '2003-10-22 14:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(458408, 42870, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the faded colors with just enough the make her stand out.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the faded colors with just enough the make her stand out.', '2003-10-22 14:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(458411, 43230, 656, '<td valign="top">would have loved to have seen this from a lower viewpoint, to get really close to the foreground leaves.  Good as is though.</td>', 'would have loved to have seen this from a lower viewpoint, to get really close to the foreground leaves.  Good as is though.', '2003-10-22 14:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(458412, 43372, 6845, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of black and white with a hint of color. I feel that if the white bird bath or whatever it is in the back ground is too distracting and it takes away from the main subject. Without it I think the image would have been stronger. I like the composition otherwise.</td>', 'Interesting use of black and white with a hint of color. I feel that if the white bird bath or whatever it is in the back ground is too distracting and it takes away from the main subject. Without it I think the image would have been stronger. I like the composition otherwise.', '2003-10-22 14:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458413, 42588, 656, '<td valign="top">good - though the background is distracting and doesn''t add anything</td>', 'good - though the background is distracting and doesn''t add anything', '2003-10-22 14:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(458414, 43093, 6845, '<td valign="top">Great colors. I like the composition and the tone of the image.</td>', 'Great colors. I like the composition and the tone of the image.', '2003-10-22 14:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(458415, 43378, 12578, '<td valign="top">Real pitty the moon wasnt slightly sharper but never the less a good quality image and composition - 8</td>', 'Real pitty the moon wasnt slightly sharper but never the less a good quality image and composition - 8', '2003-10-22 14:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(458416, 43057, 656, '<td valign="top">nice flat tonal relationships give this a strong feel.  the 3 toned background regions is strong and all leads to the couple walking.  I guess they are ''all alone together''</td>', 'nice flat tonal relationships give this a strong feel.  the 3 toned background regions is strong and all leads to the couple walking.  I guess they are ''all alone together''', '2003-10-22 14:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(458417, 42703, 12578, '<td valign="top">Doh ! would have probably done slightly better in the Shadows II challenge this week ! Still though its a marvellous shot that does say lonely to me - 7</td>', 'Doh ! would have probably done slightly better in the Shadows II challenge this week ! Still though its a marvellous shot that does say lonely to me - 7', '2003-10-22 14:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458418, 42521, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus on the subject. The dof works great to seperate the subject from the background. The drop really adds to the composition. It just gives it that little something extra. The colors and light are also tremendous.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus on the subject. The dof works great to seperate the subject from the background. The drop really adds to the composition. It just gives it that little something extra. The colors and light are also tremendous.', '2003-10-22 14:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458419, 42944, 6845, '<td valign="top">Sad title. Makes you feel more than alone. Like there is nothing at all including yourself.</td>', 'Sad title. Makes you feel more than alone. Like there is nothing at all including yourself.', '2003-10-22 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(458420, 43360, 12578, '<td valign="top">Would be better for me if I could either see the fence a little better or not at all and the tree is too centred, putting it off to the side a little more and working with the so called rule of thirds would have made this tree look slightly more alone ( partly to do with the fact that there is another smaller tree next to it ! )</td>', 'Would be better for me if I could either see the fence a little better or not at all and the tree is too centred, putting it off to the side a little more and working with the so called rule of thirds would have made this tree look slightly more alone ( partly to do with the fact that there is another smaller tree next to it ! )', '2003-10-22 14:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(458421, 43268, 656, '<td valign="top">love it - especially how the textures on the road are almost the same as on the leaf.  Strong colour contrast between the red and blue is great too - might help if the leaf wasn''t ''pointing'' out of the frame to the top right ?</td>', 'love it - especially how the textures on the road are almost the same as on the leaf.  Strong colour contrast between the red and blue is great too - might help if the leaf wasn''t ''pointing'' out of the frame to the top right ?', '2003-10-22 14:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
