(458428, 42729, 12578, '<td valign="top">It really is a great shot and I will score this as if there was only the man sitting there as loneliness / solitude to me states a single thing / object / person, had the lady not have been sat there I would have shot this with the gentleman off to the right some more and shown the rest of a empty bench ! None the less I do like this and give you a 7</td>', 'It really is a great shot and I will score this as if there was only the man sitting there as loneliness / solitude to me states a single thing / object / person, had the lady not have been sat there I would have shot this with the gentleman off to the right some more and shown the rest of a empty bench ! None the less I do like this and give you a 7', '2003-10-22 14:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
