(458672, 43057, 7599, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture, I love the use of megative space and the bold angles. I think you''ll have a fight on your hands to defend this as an all alone picture - but I definitely get the sense of what you''re going for. Obviously two people who are together but still alone as a couple. If that makes sense..</td>', 'Interesting capture, I love the use of megative space and the bold angles. I think you''ll have a fight on your hands to defend this as an all alone picture - but I definitely get the sense of what you''re going for. Obviously two people who are together but still alone as a couple. If that makes sense..', '2003-10-22 16:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
