(458686, 42768, 7599, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space, I like this picture for its simplicity. Only two elements I would have improved, the blow out of the upper right corner and the indented line of the architecture on the left. I think I would have cropped proportionately from the top and left side to avoid the angled indentation  while still maintaining as much negative space and the proportions of the picture as possible.</td>', 'Good use of negative space, I like this picture for its simplicity. Only two elements I would have improved, the blow out of the upper right corner and the indented line of the architecture on the left. I think I would have cropped proportionately from the top and left side to avoid the angled indentation  while still maintaining as much negative space and the proportions of the picture as possible.', '2003-10-22 16:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(458688, 43423, 10339, '<td valign="top">Upper left of the rock seems too bright.</td>', 'Upper left of the rock seems too bright.', '2003-10-22 16:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(458689, 42792, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! I like the idea that everything is greyish, only the leaf is yellow-brown, and the similar shaped water touched me, too. Maybe the stem of the leaf is a bit close to the margin of the picture. But I think this time I give you 10, for all the touching soul and the technics in this photo, congrats!</td>', 'Wonderful shot! I like the idea that everything is greyish, only the leaf is yellow-brown, and the similar shaped water touched me, too. Maybe the stem of the leaf is a bit close to the margin of the picture. But I think this time I give you 10, for all the touching soul and the technics in this photo, congrats!', '2003-10-22 16:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(458690, 42610, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice concept. title definitely adds to the impact. great perspective.</td>', 'nice concept. title definitely adds to the impact. great perspective.', '2003-10-22 16:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
