(458700, 42976, 7599, '<td valign="top">The colours in this image are very nice. I wouldn''t have cut out the top of the tower on the right hand side, I think it would have maintained the angle of the building you selected to use - but prevented the feeling of accidental distortion present in this version.</td>', 'The colours in this image are very nice. I wouldn''t have cut out the top of the tower on the right hand side, I think it would have maintained the angle of the building you selected to use - but prevented the feeling of accidental distortion present in this version.', '2003-10-22 17:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
