(458710, 43239, 7599, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. I tried for five minutes to think of someone that could be marked as helpful as to why I love this picture or how you could improve it but, frankly I''m drawing a blank. I think it''s just super. *grin*</td>', 'I love this picture. I tried for five minutes to think of someone that could be marked as helpful as to why I love this picture or how you could improve it but, frankly I''m drawing a blank. I think it''s just super. *grin*', '2003-10-22 17:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
