(458727, 42853, 12922, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition on this one, the smoke makes your eyes wander to the right, then the light line (I can''t tell what it is!) brings you back to the left, and finally the slope of the hill draws your attention to the horse.  Very well done!</td>', 'I really like the composition on this one, the smoke makes your eyes wander to the right, then the light line (I can''t tell what it is!) brings you back to the left, and finally the slope of the hill draws your attention to the horse.  Very well done!', '2003-10-22 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
