(458730, 43057, 12661, '<td valign="top">I love the way the lines merge in this photograph. Had you given it a bit more space on the right and let the dock meet the horizon, it would have been even better. As far as the challenge, I fear you may get people who don''t agree, but a couple can be alone as easily as a person. Plus, nothing says alone like a rainy day at the beach. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the way the lines merge in this photograph. Had you given it a bit more space on the right and let the dock meet the horizon, it would have been even better. As far as the challenge, I fear you may get people who don''t agree, but a couple can be alone as easily as a person. Plus, nothing says alone like a rainy day at the beach. Nicely done.', '2003-10-22 17:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(458732, 43331, 2223, '<td valign="top">The scary thing is it really looks like blood. Very emotional image.8</td>', 'The scary thing is it really looks like blood. Very emotional image.8', '2003-10-22 17:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
