(458739, 43161, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the hard light used. This is a nice simple, yet effective image</td>', 'I like the hard light used. This is a nice simple, yet effective image', '2003-10-22 17:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458740, 42863, 7599, '<td valign="top">You know it''s funny the bright colours of the hydrant make this almost a happy picture, but then the hydrants downwards "expression" makes me want to think it''s sad. Like a life sentence to look happy, and feel sad.. Interesting picture, I like it.</td>', 'You know it''s funny the bright colours of the hydrant make this almost a happy picture, but then the hydrants downwards "expression" makes me want to think it''s sad. Like a life sentence to look happy, and feel sad.. Interesting picture, I like it.', '2003-10-22 17:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(458742, 43223, 6845, '<td valign="top">This image has a real nice graphic quality to it. I like the tone you went with.</td>', 'This image has a real nice graphic quality to it. I like the tone you went with.', '2003-10-22 17:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(458743, 43240, 12661, '<td valign="top">There is a too much going on in the background that is detracting from this photo. Also, the trees are slightly blurred. However, the composition is nice and the subject is appropriate for the challenge.</td>', 'There is a too much going on in the background that is detracting from this photo. Also, the trees are slightly blurred. However, the composition is nice and the subject is appropriate for the challenge.', '2003-10-22 17:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(458744, 43242, 7703, '<td valign="top">I would have croped a little bit (1 or 2px) of the left side ... you can see some very thin white line but great picture -10</td>', 'I would have croped a little bit (1 or 2px) of the left side ... you can see some very thin white line but great picture -10', '2003-10-22 17:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(458745, 42870, 7599, '<td valign="top">Generally I like when an abundance of negative space is used in an image (especially in a challenge such as this one) However because the space is actually very busy, I think I would have cropped more of it out in this case. I do like the colours used, and the overall feel of the image.</td>', 'Generally I like when an abundance of negative space is used in an image (especially in a challenge such as this one) However because the space is actually very busy, I think I would have cropped more of it out in this case. I do like the colours used, and the overall feel of the image.', '2003-10-22 17:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(458747, 43296, 12661, '<td valign="top">I would have concentrated the shot on Blaine himself. In this composition, he just disapears into the background.</td>', 'I would have concentrated the shot on Blaine himself. In this composition, he just disapears into the background.', '2003-10-22 17:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(458749, 42549, 7703, '<td valign="top">Little dark I think but great idea</td>', 'Little dark I think but great idea', '2003-10-22 17:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458750, 43403, 6668, '<td valign="top">wow..powerful shot..but I almost feel as if it is innapropriate as a challenge entry because it is so emotional and almost too personal if that makes sense....Its almost painful watching the young girl grieve her friend...seems like too private of a moment to be captured and shared with others.</td>', 'wow..powerful shot..but I almost feel as if it is innapropriate as a challenge entry because it is so emotional and almost too personal if that makes sense....Its almost painful watching the young girl grieve her friend...seems like too private of a moment to be captured and shared with others.', '2003-10-22 17:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(458751, 43136, 12922, '<td valign="top">I like how the trees frame the person, and how the background is so uniform.  Too bad the pole is there.</td>', 'I like how the trees frame the person, and how the background is so uniform.  Too bad the pole is there.', '2003-10-22 17:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(458752, 42869, 7599, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and excellent choice of colour.</td>', 'Nice composition and excellent choice of colour.', '2003-10-22 17:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458753, 42870, 7703, '<td valign="top">Great picture, there is nothing that I can say more -10</td>', 'Great picture, there is nothing that I can say more -10', '2003-10-22 17:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(458755, 43277, 12661, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this was your intention, but that shroom almast has a human face to it. Not only that, but a sad, miserable, weather beaten face too.  I LOVE IT!!!  Nice use of depth of field. The only critique is that it is too centered.</td>', 'I don''t know if this was your intention, but that shroom almast has a human face to it. Not only that, but a sad, miserable, weather beaten face too.  I LOVE IT!!!  Nice use of depth of field. The only critique is that it is too centered.', '2003-10-22 17:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(458756, 43030, 7703, '<td valign="top">I can''t say anything, just purfect -10</td>', 'I can''t say anything, just purfect -10', '2003-10-22 17:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(458757, 42761, 7703, '<td valign="top">Little blury I think</td>', 'Little blury I think', '2003-10-22 17:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(458759, 43042, 7599, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is a great shot as I''m sure you had some difficulty getting the lighting just right, and obviously this image meets the challenge. From an interest perspective for me personally, I''m not really feeling it. However 2/3 is not bad.</td>', 'Technically, this is a great shot as I''m sure you had some difficulty getting the lighting just right, and obviously this image meets the challenge. From an interest perspective for me personally, I''m not really feeling it. However 2/3 is not bad.', '2003-10-22 17:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(458760, 43193, 6845, '<td valign="top">Just a thought. I wonder if the image would potray being alone if she was standing looking like she was cheering. The only one there cheering for the home team. Anyway, nice image. Good use of composition and the seats have a nice graphic presence.</td>', 'Just a thought. I wonder if the image would potray being alone if she was standing looking like she was cheering. The only one there cheering for the home team. Anyway, nice image. Good use of composition and the seats have a nice graphic presence.', '2003-10-22 17:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(458761, 43090, 7599, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy. I''m impressed with the lighting and the "positioning" of the subject - he''s definitely alone.</td>', 'Cute little guy. I''m impressed with the lighting and the "positioning" of the subject - he''s definitely alone.', '2003-10-22 17:22:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(458762, 42543, 7703, '<td valign="top">Hehe I hate the last cheerios ring. It''s so hard to catch it :)</td>', 'Hehe I hate the last cheerios ring. It''s so hard to catch it :)', '2003-10-22 17:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(458763, 43380, 12661, '<td valign="top">You did a wonderful job capturing loneliness with a macro. Nice balance and nice composition.</td>', 'You did a wonderful job capturing loneliness with a macro. Nice balance and nice composition.', '2003-10-22 17:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(458764, 43331, 10151, '<td valign="top">Disturbing.  Catching the drop off the finger is brilliant along with the spilled pills and alomst gone bottle of liquor.</td>', 'Disturbing.  Catching the drop off the finger is brilliant along with the spilled pills and alomst gone bottle of liquor.', '2003-10-22 17:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(458765, 42728, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the hard light used to cast the dark shadows. It gives the image a lot of feeling.</td>', 'I like the hard light used to cast the dark shadows. It gives the image a lot of feeling.', '2003-10-22 17:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(458768, 43375, 7703, '<td valign="top">It''s to blury</td>', 'It''s to blury', '2003-10-22 17:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(458770, 43078, 6668, '<td valign="top">The womens stance seems a little unatural, also her blouse seems a little overexposed maybe, to much light glare coming off of it.  Love the fall colors in this shot, but I don''t think the border works well with this one. 5</td>', 'The womens stance seems a little unatural, also her blouse seems a little overexposed maybe, to much light glare coming off of it.  Love the fall colors in this shot, but I don''t think the border works well with this one. 5', '2003-10-22 17:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(458771, 42617, 12922, '<td valign="top">This shot looks a little hazy to me...maybe try adjusting the levels to bring out the color some.  Good idea for the challenge though!</td>', 'This shot looks a little hazy to me...maybe try adjusting the levels to bring out the color some.  Good idea for the challenge though!', '2003-10-22 17:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(458772, 43097, 7599, '<td valign="top">I gotta say I don''t really get whats going on in this image, and the title actually adds to the confusion.. Obviously I''m missing the point. I think I probably would have cropped out some of the distracting angles at the edges of the image and I''m not sure about the colour choice... but again this may have something to do with the story which I''m not understanding.</td>', 'I gotta say I don''t really get whats going on in this image, and the title actually adds to the confusion.. Obviously I''m missing the point. I think I probably would have cropped out some of the distracting angles at the edges of the image and I''m not sure about the colour choice... but again this may have something to do with the story which I''m not understanding.', '2003-10-22 17:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(458775, 43331, 12661, '<td valign="top">That drip of blood on the finger really makes this shot. If that bottle is White Zinfandel, I can understand why the subject wanted to kill themselves. ;) Nice use of DOF and very realistic looking.</td>', 'That drip of blood on the finger really makes this shot. If that bottle is White Zinfandel, I can understand why the subject wanted to kill themselves. ;) Nice use of DOF and very realistic looking.', '2003-10-22 17:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(458776, 43370, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the angle here. I personally would have liked to have seen the boy more to the left and more playground to the right. I like the tones and the mood of the image however.</td>', 'I like the angle here. I personally would have liked to have seen the boy more to the left and more playground to the right. I like the tones and the mood of the image however.', '2003-10-22 17:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458778, 43231, 12922, '<td valign="top">Good shot for the challenge.  I like the textrue in the bricks and how the star breaks that up.</td>', 'Good shot for the challenge.  I like the textrue in the bricks and how the star breaks that up.', '2003-10-22 17:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458779, 43297, 7703, '<td valign="top">One of my top vote -10</td>', 'One of my top vote -10', '2003-10-22 17:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(458780, 43270, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft, pastel color of the flower. Nice composition and light.</td>', 'I really like the soft, pastel color of the flower. Nice composition and light.', '2003-10-22 17:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(458781, 42857, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the balance of the colors in this image. It nicely captures alone. By only critique is that the horizon is slanted. A bit of rotation could have improved the photo.</td>', 'I like the balance of the colors in this image. It nicely captures alone. By only critique is that the horizon is slanted. A bit of rotation could have improved the photo.', '2003-10-22 17:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(458782, 43030, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. The colors are very pleasing. The composition really works well to.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. The colors are very pleasing. The composition really works well to.', '2003-10-22 17:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(458784, 43211, 8891, '<td valign="top">THis is a wonderful abstract...I do not know how well it conveys lone...</td>', 'THis is a wonderful abstract...I do not know how well it conveys lone...', '2003-10-22 17:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(458785, 43197, 12922, '<td valign="top">cool shot, looks like he forgot his canoe!</td>', 'cool shot, looks like he forgot his canoe!', '2003-10-22 17:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(458786, 43108, 7703, '<td valign="top">This picture would be so much better if the CD case where new, not so dirty.</td>', 'This picture would be so much better if the CD case where new, not so dirty.', '2003-10-22 17:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(458789, 42678, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the scenic view. Good composition. The light and the fading mountains make for a realy nice image.</td>', 'I like the scenic view. Good composition. The light and the fading mountains make for a realy nice image.', '2003-10-22 17:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(458790, 42695, 12661, '<td valign="top">This was actually one of my ideas at first. The sole seedling. I like the contrast between the fresh plant (life) and the ashen sand (death). The blur at the top left and bottom right doesn''t add much to the photo though.</td>', 'This was actually one of my ideas at first. The sole seedling. I like the contrast between the fresh plant (life) and the ashen sand (death). The blur at the top left and bottom right doesn''t add much to the photo though.', '2003-10-22 17:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458791, 42883, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Nice colors.</td>', 'This is a great shot. Nice colors.', '2003-10-22 17:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(458793, 42710, 7599, '<td valign="top">Powerful image, I like the use of negative space and the crop. The colour choice is also very effective.</td>', 'Powerful image, I like the use of negative space and the crop. The colour choice is also very effective.', '2003-10-22 17:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458795, 43217, 12922, '<td valign="top">Good alone shot, but the flash is too harsh to me</td>', 'Good alone shot, but the flash is too harsh to me', '2003-10-22 17:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(458796, 42552, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Simple and to the point. Good composition.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Simple and to the point. Good composition.', '2003-10-22 17:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(458798, 42824, 11793, '<td valign="top">you''re never alone if you have beer ;}</td>', 'you''re never alone if you have beer ;}', '2003-10-22 17:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(458800, 43378, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rocks frame the moon. I think a night shot with stars would have been more fitting to the title of the photo though. Non-the-less, still a beautiful shot.</td>', 'I like the way the rocks frame the moon. I think a night shot with stars would have been more fitting to the title of the photo though. Non-the-less, still a beautiful shot.', '2003-10-22 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(458802, 43239, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like this image. The colors are very pleasing and I enjoy the composition.</td>', 'I like this image. The colors are very pleasing and I enjoy the composition.', '2003-10-22 17:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(458804, 43232, 7599, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but I think it works in this particular case. I think I would have actually cropped some off the bottom to remove all traces of the sand and some of the unfocused board.</td>', 'A little grainy, but I think it works in this particular case. I think I would have actually cropped some off the bottom to remove all traces of the sand and some of the unfocused board.', '2003-10-22 17:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(458805, 43053, 12661, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. I think a clear bright blue sky would have improved it, however, the clouds certainly don''t hurt it. Nice job. I look forward to the end of the challenge to find out where this was taken.</td>', 'I really like this picture. I think a clear bright blue sky would have improved it, however, the clouds certainly don''t hurt it. Nice job. I look forward to the end of the challenge to find out where this was taken.', '2003-10-22 17:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(458806, 43423, 10858, '<td valign="top">Mmm... :-) The contrast between the rock and the spheres are really fascinating! I love the lighting, too, maybe the tip of the rock is a bit bright, but never have a bigger problem, especially after this 10 points I give you!</td>', 'Mmm... :-) The contrast between the rock and the spheres are really fascinating! I love the lighting, too, maybe the tip of the rock is a bit bright, but never have a bigger problem, especially after this 10 points I give you!', '2003-10-22 17:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(458807, 42934, 12922, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this shot, and the picture itself is very good.  I think for "all alone" a better picture would be the doll as it was left, forgotten by a child, instead of posed waving at the camera</td>', 'I like the concept of this shot, and the picture itself is very good.  I think for "all alone" a better picture would be the doll as it was left, forgotten by a child, instead of posed waving at the camera', '2003-10-22 17:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458808, 43331, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The composition is well done and the depth of field works very well. The drop of blood really adds alot to the image.  Powerful image. Good take on the callenge.</td>', 'Nice image. The composition is well done and the depth of field works very well. The drop of blood really adds alot to the image.  Powerful image. Good take on the callenge.', '2003-10-22 17:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(458810, 43330, 7599, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones in this image. i would love to know what type of adjustments were made, if any. I think i would have cropped a bit off the top just where it meets the gras line, I don''t think the top bit adds anything to the image.</td>', 'I really like the tones in this image. i would love to know what type of adjustments were made, if any. I think i would have cropped a bit off the top just where it meets the gras line, I don''t think the top bit adds anything to the image.', '2003-10-22 17:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(458813, 42532, 7599, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours. Comical pose &amp; title. I don''t think i would have changed a thing. <br/> <br/>Is that a real donkey?</td>', 'Wonderful colours. Comical pose & title. I don''t think i would have changed a thing.  Is that a real donkey?', '2003-10-22 17:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(458814, 43232, 12922, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I really like the dof, and how the horizon is lost and blurry</td>', 'Great shot!  I really like the dof, and how the horizon is lost and blurry', '2003-10-22 17:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(458815, 43312, 6845, '<td valign="top">The seperation of color really makes the subject leap out at you. The composition is very nice.</td>', 'The seperation of color really makes the subject leap out at you. The composition is very nice.', '2003-10-22 17:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458816, 42737, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very touching title! :-) Maybe the waterin the front is a bit too stirring for me.</td>', 'Very touching title! :-) Maybe the waterin the front is a bit too stirring for me.', '2003-10-22 17:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(458819, 43375, 12922, '<td valign="top">A little blurry, but great shot for "all alone."  I like how the circles of ripples blend into the horizontal ones, and that the picture is vertical.</td>', 'A little blurry, but great shot for "all alone."  I like how the circles of ripples blend into the horizontal ones, and that the picture is vertical.', '2003-10-22 17:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458820, 42910, 7599, '<td valign="top">Overall I really like this image - with the exception of the actual subject. The dark clothing and lack of focus really don''t draw your eye to the subject. Excellent idea, the actual capture just needs to be tweaked a bit.</td>', 'Overall I really like this image - with the exception of the actual subject. The dark clothing and lack of focus really don''t draw your eye to the subject. Excellent idea, the actual capture just needs to be tweaked a bit.', '2003-10-22 17:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(458821, 42592, 10858, '<td valign="top">The spider is a bit blurry to me, as I expected him as the main subject (and not the flower in focus), and I think one spider net (the biggest) would have bin good enough in order to show that this spider is quite alone. But I like the title and the idea very much! :-)</td>', 'The spider is a bit blurry to me, as I expected him as the main subject (and not the flower in focus), and I think one spider net (the biggest) would have bin good enough in order to show that this spider is quite alone. But I like the title and the idea very much! :-)', '2003-10-22 17:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(458822, 43297, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. One of the better leaf shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition. One of the better leaf shots in this challenge.', '2003-10-22 17:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(458823, 43271, 208, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is a good choice here. I like the lines and textures and how they help the bird stick out. 8</td>', 'B&W is a good choice here. I like the lines and textures and how they help the bird stick out. 8', '2003-10-22 17:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(458826, 43158, 12661, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and composition. As I mentioned before, you certainly know how to bring life to a manekin.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and composition. As I mentioned before, you certainly know how to bring life to a manekin.', '2003-10-22 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(458827, 42854, 12922, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the silhouette is lost in the picture on the wall.  A little too much black for my liking as well.  Brighten the "aura" a little and move the picture and it''s a great shot!</td>', 'Nice concept, but the silhouette is lost in the picture on the wall.  A little too much black for my liking as well.  Brighten the "aura" a little and move the picture and it''s a great shot!', '2003-10-22 17:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458829, 42873, 10858, '<td valign="top">Mmm, technically very neat and the subject is touching and wonderful! Congrats, 10 points for that!</td>', 'Mmm, technically very neat and the subject is touching and wonderful! Congrats, 10 points for that!', '2003-10-22 17:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(458830, 42883, 208, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette, beautiful colors. I like how the horizon is at an angle; I think that works better against the cactus than a level one would. 9</td>', 'Great silhouette, beautiful colors. I like how the horizon is at an angle; I think that works better against the cactus than a level one would. 9', '2003-10-22 17:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(458831, 43113, 772, '<td valign="top">The image is too small.  Your subject is hidden in the shadows... it''s actually hard to really tell the dog is even there since the image is this small.  Overall, uninteresting unless I had some tie to the dog.   = 2</td>', 'The image is too small.  Your subject is hidden in the shadows... it''s actually hard to really tell the dog is even there since the image is this small.  Overall, uninteresting unless I had some tie to the dog.   = 2', '2003-10-22 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(458835, 43364, 772, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge in some way, but overall uninteresting.  = 3</td>', 'Meets the challenge in some way, but overall uninteresting.  = 3', '2003-10-22 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(458836, 43423, 12922, '<td valign="top">The light is a little too harsh on the rock, but good idea.</td>', 'The light is a little too harsh on the rock, but good idea.', '2003-10-22 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(458837, 42858, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I like the colours, simple, but therefore very substanted.</td>', 'Nice shot! I like the colours, simple, but therefore very substanted.', '2003-10-22 17:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(458838, 43421, 6130, '<td valign="top">LOL thats funny.</td>', 'LOL thats funny.', '2003-10-22 17:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(458840, 42592, 12922, '<td valign="top">It looks like the spider and web should be in focus in this shot--if the flower is the main subject, I think the spider would be better off to one side of it.</td>', 'It looks like the spider and web should be in focus in this shot--if the flower is the main subject, I think the spider would be better off to one side of it.', '2003-10-22 17:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(458841, 43289, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good use of thirds.</td>', 'Nice composition and good use of thirds.', '2003-10-22 17:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(458842, 42854, 10858, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me, sorry... Maybe a more figurative silouette would fit more.</td>', 'Too dark for me, sorry... Maybe a more figurative silouette would fit more.', '2003-10-22 17:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458843, 43335, 7599, '<td valign="top">You know this image is almost like there are 3 separate stories being told. You have the shopper wearing a suit that appears to be leading a better life, but is all alone. Then you have the homeless man, who appears to be downtrodden and also alone, finally you have the blurred subject  who remains undefined and theres the suggestion made that he isnt as important as the other two, given that he has no definite character. Therefore he is alone in the fact that hes undistinguishable, as well as literally being alone. <br/> <br/>I dont know if this was intentional or if you really meant for the focus just to be on the homeless guy but the end result I think is particularly perfect for this challenge. <br/> <br/>10 from me, although technically there could be some improvements, this shot just fits the challenge and relays the message, without needing to be perfect. <br/></td>', 'You know this image is almost like there are 3 separate stories being told. You have the shopper wearing a suit that appears to be leading a better life, but is all alone. Then you have the homeless man, who appears to be downtrodden and also alone, finally you have the blurred subject  who remains undefined and theres the suggestion made that he isnt as important as the other two, given that he has no definite character. Therefore he is alone in the fact that hes undistinguishable, as well as literally being alone.  I dont know if this was intentional or if you really meant for the focus just to be on the homeless guy but the end result I think is particularly perfect for this challenge.  10 from me, although technically there could be some improvements, this shot just fits the challenge and relays the message, without needing to be perfect. ', '2003-10-22 17:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458846, 42502, 12661, '<td valign="top">The calf is almost unnoticeable. At first I thought the subject was the duck in the lake. It wasn''t until I read the title that I realized there was a calf on the shore.</td>', 'The calf is almost unnoticeable. At first I thought the subject was the duck in the lake. It wasn''t until I read the title that I realized there was a calf on the shore.', '2003-10-22 17:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(458848, 42873, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2003-10-22 17:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(458850, 43370, 12661, '<td valign="top">I love the pulled up pant leg and untied shoe. It adds to the mood.</td>', 'I love the pulled up pant leg and untied shoe. It adds to the mood.', '2003-10-22 17:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(458852, 42742, 12661, '<td valign="top">The title doesn''t really portray the image well. I think "benched" may have been more apropriate. As far as the photo, nice selection for B&amp;W and good composition using the rule of thirds.</td>', 'The title doesn''t really portray the image well. I think "benched" may have been more apropriate. As far as the photo, nice selection for B&W and good composition using the rule of thirds.', '2003-10-22 17:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
