(458958, 42750, 11923, '<td valign="top">Certainly is alone!  I like the play of color against the grey, the use of space helps increase the feeling of alone.  The focus looks pretty good as is the use of natural lighting.  That said, the image doesn''t pop for me, its technically good but is missing a spark in my opinion.  6 due to tech. merit, would''ve been higher if the interest factor was there for me.</td>', 'Certainly is alone!  I like the play of color against the grey, the use of space helps increase the feeling of alone.  The focus looks pretty good as is the use of natural lighting.  That said, the image doesn''t pop for me, its technically good but is missing a spark in my opinion.  6 due to tech. merit, would''ve been higher if the interest factor was there for me.', '2003-10-22 18:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(458963, 42853, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hmm, strangely enough I think the fact that the factory is there in the background helps this photo get that ''lost'' feeling.  The horse does look like its been wandering around.  The colors are a little muted, possibly because of overcast conditions?  I can''t tell if that''s blue sky or just a light cloud layer.  I do like the interplay between the two corner focal points, the factory vs the horse.  Nice image.  6</td>', 'Hmm, strangely enough I think the fact that the factory is there in the background helps this photo get that ''lost'' feeling.  The horse does look like its been wandering around.  The colors are a little muted, possibly because of overcast conditions?  I can''t tell if that''s blue sky or just a light cloud layer.  I do like the interplay between the two corner focal points, the factory vs the horse.  Nice image.  6', '2003-10-22 19:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(458964, 43053, 10625, '<td valign="top">fantastic colours.</td>', 'fantastic colours.', '2003-10-22 19:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(458969, 43162, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I like the choice of black and white, really brings out the starkness of the image and I''ve noticed it helps enhance the feelings of solitude or loneliness.  The perspective is great, I don''t like the border though, seems too much.  I wish the lighting wasn''t quite so glaring on the right side of the person, but that''s a little concern really.  Very nice capture.  8</td>', 'Great idea!  I like the choice of black and white, really brings out the starkness of the image and I''ve noticed it helps enhance the feelings of solitude or loneliness.  The perspective is great, I don''t like the border though, seems too much.  I wish the lighting wasn''t quite so glaring on the right side of the person, but that''s a little concern really.  Very nice capture.  8', '2003-10-22 19:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(458971, 42659, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m not really getting the feeling of loneliness or solitude from this image, actually he looks content and sleepy to me!  The colors seem a bit flat/dull too, but that could be the light hitting the fur.  I like the details of the face, and the subject itself is interesting.  It doesn''t seem to bring across the feelings of the challenge for me is all.  5</td>', 'I''m not really getting the feeling of loneliness or solitude from this image, actually he looks content and sleepy to me!  The colors seem a bit flat/dull too, but that could be the light hitting the fur.  I like the details of the face, and the subject itself is interesting.  It doesn''t seem to bring across the feelings of the challenge for me is all.  5', '2003-10-22 19:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(458975, 43177, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice bright photo, great colors, good lighting.  I''m not sure about the significance of the title though.  This is the last building standing?  The building being somewhat alone (car there) fits the challenge vaguely in my eyes.  I also don''t really get a feeling of loneliness from it or solitude.  Perhaps it would have a greater impact under the challenge for me if I understood what the title was referring to.  All in all a nice image, 5</td>', 'A nice bright photo, great colors, good lighting.  I''m not sure about the significance of the title though.  This is the last building standing?  The building being somewhat alone (car there) fits the challenge vaguely in my eyes.  I also don''t really get a feeling of loneliness from it or solitude.  Perhaps it would have a greater impact under the challenge for me if I understood what the title was referring to.  All in all a nice image, 5', '2003-10-22 19:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(458980, 43025, 11923, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo, I like the use of light and the black&amp;white choice.  The little cherub is adorable, but while shown alone.. I just don''t get a solitude feeling, nor loneliness.   I think there is an inherent feeling of well-being and care to be honest.  Maybe its the closeup aspect of the child, not sure.  I still think its a lovely image though.  7</td>', 'A beautiful photo, I like the use of light and the black&white choice.  The little cherub is adorable, but while shown alone.. I just don''t get a solitude feeling, nor loneliness.   I think there is an inherent feeling of well-being and care to be honest.  Maybe its the closeup aspect of the child, not sure.  I still think its a lovely image though.  7', '2003-10-22 19:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(458986, 42866, 6536, '<td valign="top">Sephia was a nice choice for this one. Good composition and contrast. The graffitti in the background really makes it stand out. Interesting positioning of subject. Nice lighting and shadows. 10.</td>', 'Sephia was a nice choice for this one. Good composition and contrast. The graffitti in the background really makes it stand out. Interesting positioning of subject. Nice lighting and shadows. 10.', '2003-10-22 19:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(458988, 43097, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think the title is throwing me off a bit.  I like the green cast, its different, I also like the angles, but I''m not sure what is going on in the picture (its rather busy) and that''s distracting for me.    The soft focus is a little unappealing.  I''m giving it a 5 for now, may have to come back and re-evaluate.</td>', 'I think the title is throwing me off a bit.  I like the green cast, its different, I also like the angles, but I''m not sure what is going on in the picture (its rather busy) and that''s distracting for me.    The soft focus is a little unappealing.  I''m giving it a 5 for now, may have to come back and re-evaluate.', '2003-10-22 19:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
