(459015, 42376, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that there is something on the rocks tryingt o sleep, but I''m finding it hard to discern exactly what it is.  The image is a gorgeous black and white, but I think the nature of that means its hard to see.. oh wait.. ok I see it now.  My comment still stands though, I had a VERY hard time separating the subject sleeping from the background.  I think its a great image in general, good light, good focus and detail.  7</td>', 'I''m guessing that there is something on the rocks tryingt o sleep, but I''m finding it hard to discern exactly what it is.  The image is a gorgeous black and white, but I think the nature of that means its hard to see.. oh wait.. ok I see it now.  My comment still stands though, I had a VERY hard time separating the subject sleeping from the background.  I think its a great image in general, good light, good focus and detail.  7', '2003-10-22 19:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
