(459028, 43093, 12131, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this.</td>', 'Love the colors in this.', '2003-10-22 19:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(459029, 42728, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the challenge.  The subject''s posture very much evokes the feeling of loneliness.  The black &amp; white aspect highlight the mood perfectly.  Great focus, nice lighting.  I like how the eyes are in shadow, gives an almost, faceless quality to the image.  10</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the challenge.  The subject''s posture very much evokes the feeling of loneliness.  The black & white aspect highlight the mood perfectly.  Great focus, nice lighting.  I like how the eyes are in shadow, gives an almost, faceless quality to the image.  10', '2003-10-22 19:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(459030, 43076, 12131, '<td valign="top">Very amusing.</td>', 'Very amusing.', '2003-10-22 19:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(459031, 42872, 12131, '<td valign="top">Peaceful.  This is a very peaceful picture.</td>', 'Peaceful.  This is a very peaceful picture.', '2003-10-22 19:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(459032, 42970, 12131, '<td valign="top">His reflection on the sand stands out well.  I like that it is the sand on not the water that mirrors him, even if it really is the water on the sand.  Lovely colors.</td>', 'His reflection on the sand stands out well.  I like that it is the sand on not the water that mirrors him, even if it really is the water on the sand.  Lovely colors.', '2003-10-22 19:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(459033, 43026, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and shadows. At sunset or sunrise was a good choice. Nice positioning of subject. 9.</td>', 'Nice lighting and shadows. At sunset or sunrise was a good choice. Nice positioning of subject. 9.', '2003-10-22 19:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(459034, 43327, 6536, '<td valign="top">9.</td>', '9.', '2003-10-22 19:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(459035, 43057, 12363, '<td valign="top">strong lines, strong elements of contrast.<br/>definitely conveys a sense of ''all alone''.</td>', 'strong lines, strong elements of contrast.definitely conveys a sense of ''all alone''.', '2003-10-22 19:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(459036, 42863, 12131, '<td valign="top">DId the flowers take a lesson from the hydrant on the color they should take?  Nice work.</td>', 'DId the flowers take a lesson from the hydrant on the color they should take?  Nice work.', '2003-10-22 19:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(459037, 43362, 11923, '<td valign="top">Ok, this image made me giggle at first because I couldn''t tell if they were fish or chickens..  I do like the way the light is playing on these though.  I don''t think it necessarily evokes loneliness or solitude, I do think it shows separation which I think is a sub-category, and so fits the challenge for me.  I really like how the one alone is much more lit (a little blown out perhaps) and the group is darker.  The use of space is good too and I think the black &amp; white was a good choice.  Would be interested in seeing the color version of this after this is over if there is one though.  Nice image!  8</td>', 'Ok, this image made me giggle at first because I couldn''t tell if they were fish or chickens..  I do like the way the light is playing on these though.  I don''t think it necessarily evokes loneliness or solitude, I do think it shows separation which I think is a sub-category, and so fits the challenge for me.  I really like how the one alone is much more lit (a little blown out perhaps) and the group is darker.  The use of space is good too and I think the black & white was a good choice.  Would be interested in seeing the color version of this after this is over if there is one though.  Nice image!  8', '2003-10-22 19:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(459038, 43360, 12131, '<td valign="top">It''s nice, the clouds and the low lighting, but the fence is a bit of a throw off and the little tree next to the bigger one makes it look like companionship more than loneliness.</td>', 'It''s nice, the clouds and the low lighting, but the fence is a bit of a throw off and the little tree next to the bigger one makes it look like companionship more than loneliness.', '2003-10-22 19:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(459040, 43363, 6536, '<td valign="top">5.</td>', '5.', '2003-10-22 19:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(459041, 43377, 12131, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I like the contrasting colors the consistency of the lines conflicting with his shadow that still manages to be symetrical.</td>', 'Good shot, I like the contrasting colors the consistency of the lines conflicting with his shadow that still manages to be symetrical.', '2003-10-22 19:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(459042, 43057, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of space.  The lack of color really sharpens the angles and contrasts.  Even though the couple are not necessarily a single subject, taking them together being one works.  The extreme feel of distance and the lack of any other focal points really amplifies the solitary feeling.  Very well done.  8</td>', 'Excellent use of space.  The lack of color really sharpens the angles and contrasts.  Even though the couple are not necessarily a single subject, taking them together being one works.  The extreme feel of distance and the lack of any other focal points really amplifies the solitary feeling.  Very well done.  8', '2003-10-22 19:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(459045, 42664, 12131, '<td valign="top">The figure actually looks like he is laughing. Red is brilliant.  I like that contrasting with the black and white.</td>', 'The figure actually looks like he is laughing. Red is brilliant.  I like that contrasting with the black and white.', '2003-10-22 19:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(459046, 42853, 6536, '<td valign="top">6.</td>', '6.', '2003-10-22 19:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(459048, 43331, 12363, '<td valign="top">I definitely feel depression from this photo, but not so much all alone.  However, I''m not gonna rate this based on that.<br/> <br/>On the good side, you have a nice drop coming down and a good angle on the subject.<br/> <br/>Things to improve upon: glare on the wine bottle, the wine bottle stands upright while the meds have spilled, the ''blood'' doesn''t look like it''s flowed naturally, and the shadow from the flash (perhaps use some side lighting or reflectors).<br/> <br/>Overall, good idea and decent execution.</td>', 'I definitely feel depression from this photo, but not so much all alone.  However, I''m not gonna rate this based on that. On the good side, you have a nice drop coming down and a good angle on the subject. Things to improve upon: glare on the wine bottle, the wine bottle stands upright while the meds have spilled, the ''blood'' doesn''t look like it''s flowed naturally, and the shadow from the flash (perhaps use some side lighting or reflectors). Overall, good idea and decent execution.', '2003-10-22 19:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(459049, 42755, 6536, '<td valign="top">5.</td>', '5.', '2003-10-22 19:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(459053, 43188, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I think it need a little more contrast. 6.</td>', 'Nice idea. I think it need a little more contrast. 6.', '2003-10-22 19:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(459054, 43050, 6624, '<td valign="top">not wishing to presume but I wonder how much a chair can feel (lol)  It is certainly alone and conveys a solitary sitting space 5</td>', 'not wishing to presume but I wonder how much a chair can feel (lol)  It is certainly alone and conveys a solitary sitting space 5', '2003-10-22 19:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(459055, 43301, 12131, '<td valign="top">Nice weather at first and then the clouds in the distance as signals of something worse to come.  It looks ominous but not entirely threatening.</td>', 'Nice weather at first and then the clouds in the distance as signals of something worse to come.  It looks ominous but not entirely threatening.', '2003-10-22 19:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(459057, 43132, 6536, '<td valign="top">Very creative. 6.</td>', 'Very creative. 6.', '2003-10-22 19:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(459059, 43275, 6536, '<td valign="top">Good idea. The backwards "s" is a good touch. 7.</td>', 'Good idea. The backwards "s" is a good touch. 7.', '2003-10-22 19:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(459060, 42560, 12131, '<td valign="top">The fact that he is blurred makes me think he''s a phantom that your camera just happened to pick up in an otherwise lovely fall walk.  Overall, it looks good.</td>', 'The fact that he is blurred makes me think he''s a phantom that your camera just happened to pick up in an otherwise lovely fall walk.  Overall, it looks good.', '2003-10-22 19:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(459061, 42520, 6624, '<td valign="top">this has a nice feeling of being alone, doing the fishing but not really caring too much about it - just taking advantage of the quiet 6</td>', 'this has a nice feeling of being alone, doing the fishing but not really caring too much about it - just taking advantage of the quiet 6', '2003-10-22 19:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(459063, 42838, 12131, '<td valign="top">Wow! Where is that green light coming from.  Its cool.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Wow! Where is that green light coming from.  Its cool.  Nice shot.', '2003-10-22 19:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(459065, 43090, 6536, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Nice lighting. Good positioning of subject. Nice use of negative space. 9.</td>', 'Cool shot. Nice lighting. Good positioning of subject. Nice use of negative space. 9.', '2003-10-22 19:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(459071, 43421, 12131, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the negative effect, if that is what it is.  And the completely blank background is somewhat unbalancing.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the negative effect, if that is what it is.  And the completely blank background is somewhat unbalancing.', '2003-10-22 19:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(459072, 43241, 6624, '<td valign="top">quite a powerful image one for the times...the subject''s protection of his face/emotions and the upcurve of the left arm are strong 6</td>', 'quite a powerful image one for the times...the subject''s protection of his face/emotions and the upcurve of the left arm are strong 6', '2003-10-22 19:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(459073, 43223, 12131, '<td valign="top">Or half way up?  That''s pretty frightening, that black hole.  It looks like this is a never ending staircase, will she get off?</td>', 'Or half way up?  That''s pretty frightening, that black hole.  It looks like this is a never ending staircase, will she get off?', '2003-10-22 19:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(459074, 42945, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice texture and detail 5</td>', 'nice texture and detail 5', '2003-10-22 19:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(459077, 43269, 12131, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like the effect of being huddled in a corner. I just think this might have been slight nicer if you could have taken in more of the blank wall around him.</td>', 'Nice image, I like the effect of being huddled in a corner. I just think this might have been slight nicer if you could have taken in more of the blank wall around him.', '2003-10-22 19:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(459080, 43117, 6536, '<td valign="top">6.</td>', '6.', '2003-10-22 19:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(459084, 43063, 12131, '<td valign="top">You know it''s not that bad.   I have nothing to complain about yet anyway.  Nice image.</td>', 'You know it''s not that bad.   I have nothing to complain about yet anyway.  Nice image.', '2003-10-22 19:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(459086, 42728, 12131, '<td valign="top">Your model looks both scared and cold, while defiantly standing by the desire to walk alone.  Good work.</td>', 'Your model looks both scared and cold, while defiantly standing by the desire to walk alone.  Good work.', '2003-10-22 19:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(459087, 42659, 6624, '<td valign="top">very sweet image, nice soft focus, but isn''t there another prairie dog curled up ?</td>', 'very sweet image, nice soft focus, but isn''t there another prairie dog curled up ?', '2003-10-22 19:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(459088, 43042, 12131, '<td valign="top">A sort of guide. The spherical shadow that is illuminated at the innermost point is a nice touch.</td>', 'A sort of guide. The spherical shadow that is illuminated at the innermost point is a nice touch.', '2003-10-22 19:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(459089, 43030, 6624, '<td valign="top">very dramatic image of balloon and of the sunset 6</td>', 'very dramatic image of balloon and of the sunset 6', '2003-10-22 19:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(459093, 42881, 12131, '<td valign="top">Who was the person kind enough to demonstrate by letting this cute critter sit on his/her forehead.  That definitely adds a wowing touch.</td>', 'Who was the person kind enough to demonstrate by letting this cute critter sit on his/her forehead.  That definitely adds a wowing touch.', '2003-10-22 20:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(459094, 42897, 6536, '<td valign="top">6.</td>', '6.', '2003-10-22 20:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(459096, 42878, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice image - welcoming for a moment alone...nice light on bench 6</td>', 'nice image - welcoming for a moment alone...nice light on bench 6', '2003-10-22 20:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(459098, 43388, 6536, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Nice angle. I like the shadow effect. 7.</td>', 'Cool idea. Nice angle. I like the shadow effect. 7.', '2003-10-22 20:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(459101, 42953, 12131, '<td valign="top">She looks like she belongs to this wood.  It''s a good match.  Just for fun, maybe put her in an old peasant type costume, since this is a challenge near holloween.  Good image as it is though.</td>', 'She looks like she belongs to this wood.  It''s a good match.  Just for fun, maybe put her in an old peasant type costume, since this is a challenge near holloween.  Good image as it is though.', '2003-10-22 20:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(459102, 43026, 12131, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, and I like the silloette.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, and I like the silloette.', '2003-10-22 20:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(459103, 43081, 6624, '<td valign="top">very strong image and strong intent --well thought-out and composed 7</td>', 'very strong image and strong intent --well thought-out and composed 7', '2003-10-22 20:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(459105, 43405, 12131, '<td valign="top">That''s a sort of negative view of Autumn or end of summer.  I like the fact that it is alone, but the way the leaf is eaten away gives a deathday feel to it.  Maybe daytime holloween?</td>', 'That''s a sort of negative view of Autumn or end of summer.  I like the fact that it is alone, but the way the leaf is eaten away gives a deathday feel to it.  Maybe daytime holloween?', '2003-10-22 20:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(459106, 43199, 9295, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, contrast and detail. Cute concept.</td>', 'Nice lighting, contrast and detail. Cute concept.', '2003-10-22 20:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(459109, 42939, 12131, '<td valign="top">This works, I just wish I could see this looking down so we can see the road behind the model.</td>', 'This works, I just wish I could see this looking down so we can see the road behind the model.', '2003-10-22 20:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(459111, 43234, 12131, '<td valign="top">Cute, though it''s a little hard to see the other pawns.</td>', 'Cute, though it''s a little hard to see the other pawns.', '2003-10-22 20:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(459114, 42552, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I can''t help feeling it would have looked better with a dark border.</td>', 'Nice picture, but I can''t help feeling it would have looked better with a dark border.', '2003-10-22 20:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(459115, 42873, 12131, '<td valign="top">There''s something almost religious in this.  The last one standing on a dying platform.  Intriguing.</td>', 'There''s something almost religious in this.  The last one standing on a dying platform.  Intriguing.', '2003-10-22 20:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(459118, 42620, 12131, '<td valign="top">The red ax stands out as the lonely being here.  Interesting.</td>', 'The red ax stands out as the lonely being here.  Interesting.', '2003-10-22 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(459121, 42710, 9411, '<td valign="top">THis is an exceptional image. Composition, use of highlighting everything about it.<br/> <br/>This would not have worked as a colour image, IMO.   10</td>', 'THis is an exceptional image. Composition, use of highlighting everything about it. This would not have worked as a colour image, IMO.   10', '2003-10-22 20:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(459123, 43331, 12131, '<td valign="top">That''s just frightening and disturbing.  Good for holloween but it looks incredibly real.</td>', 'That''s just frightening and disturbing.  Good for holloween but it looks incredibly real.', '2003-10-22 20:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(459126, 43097, 12131, '<td valign="top">Remembering someone who used to be there?</td>', 'Remembering someone who used to be there?', '2003-10-22 20:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(459127, 43327, 9411, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. The nose down is a little soft, I think this should have been either sharp or soft, not a combination.  Excellent use of B&amp;W.9</td>', 'Outstanding. The nose down is a little soft, I think this should have been either sharp or soft, not a combination.  Excellent use of B&W.9', '2003-10-22 20:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(459129, 43336, 12131, '<td valign="top">Even the waters shows this as a spot that is somewhat undiscovered and unfettered by man.</td>', 'Even the waters shows this as a spot that is somewhat undiscovered and unfettered by man.', '2003-10-22 20:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(459131, 42891, 12131, '<td valign="top">That ducks eye and the way it''s neck sort of tucks in make it look lonely.  But perhaps you could take in more of the water and grass because it looks like something could be just beyond the fringe of the picture that gives this duck company.</td>', 'That ducks eye and the way it''s neck sort of tucks in make it look lonely.  But perhaps you could take in more of the water and grass because it looks like something could be just beyond the fringe of the picture that gives this duck company.', '2003-10-22 20:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(459132, 42391, 9411, '<td valign="top">Wow.......... excellent use of light to set the mood. I love the way you used so little of the model. Even with that it is very obvious how they feel.  I appreciate seeing minimalist B&amp;W shots. 9</td>', 'Wow.......... excellent use of light to set the mood. I love the way you used so little of the model. Even with that it is very obvious how they feel.  I appreciate seeing minimalist B&W shots. 9', '2003-10-22 20:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(459134, 43298, 12131, '<td valign="top">Hm, multiple meaning to your title isn''t there?  Good choice.</td>', 'Hm, multiple meaning to your title isn''t there?  Good choice.', '2003-10-22 20:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(459136, 43420, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing image. Is it converted from colour? Clouds or smoke/steam?<br/>It took me a while to find the bird, which in a colour image may have been annoying.<br/>With this treatment it works quite well. 9</td>', 'This is an amazing image. Is it converted from colour? Clouds or smoke/steam?It took me a while to find the bird, which in a colour image may have been annoying.With this treatment it works quite well. 9', '2003-10-22 20:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(459138, 42763, 12131, '<td valign="top">Very good, the soldier or explorer or adventurer of anykind traveling in uncharted lands.  This is fun.</td>', 'Very good, the soldier or explorer or adventurer of anykind traveling in uncharted lands.  This is fun.', '2003-10-22 20:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(459142, 42706, 12131, '<td valign="top">The leaf looks sad.  Good picture.</td>', 'The leaf looks sad.  Good picture.', '2003-10-22 20:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(459144, 43211, 6624, '<td valign="top">I am having trouble understanding the intent of this image - a PM to me to explain might be helpful</td>', 'I am having trouble understanding the intent of this image - a PM to me to explain might be helpful', '2003-10-22 20:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(459145, 43286, 7599, '<td valign="top">I like how you''re showing such a wide angle view of the top of the wood - yet I think I would have angled the camera a little differently as the height of the wood does not add to your picture but it does take away from your little man. Perhaps setting your camera at eye level with the wood, at one end and the man at the other to show the empty space?</td>', 'I like how you''re showing such a wide angle view of the top of the wood - yet I think I would have angled the camera a little differently as the height of the wood does not add to your picture but it does take away from your little man. Perhaps setting your camera at eye level with the wood, at one end and the man at the other to show the empty space?', '2003-10-22 20:19:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(459148, 42710, 12131, '<td valign="top">uh, no!  I don''t believe loneliness has to lead to that.   Frightening image.  Good contrast and clear message, I just don''t like the choice.  7</td>', 'uh, no!  I don''t believe loneliness has to lead to that.   Frightening image.  Good contrast and clear message, I just don''t like the choice.  7', '2003-10-22 20:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(459152, 42484, 7599, '<td valign="top">I think I would have focused a bit more on the marker as it seems to have some nice details to it, as well I like the colour choice, I would have just lightened it a bit so the busy grass doesn''t overwhlem the picture. certainly meets the challenge no issues with that.</td>', 'I think I would have focused a bit more on the marker as it seems to have some nice details to it, as well I like the colour choice, I would have just lightened it a bit so the busy grass doesn''t overwhlem the picture. certainly meets the challenge no issues with that.', '2003-10-22 20:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(459153, 42728, 6624, '<td valign="top">well executed - the folds and shadows of the sweatshirt are very nice and the fact that it\''s over-sized echoes the slump or pulling in of the shoulders  nicely ambiguous emotion 8</td>', 'well executed - the folds and shadows of the sweatshirt are very nice and the fact that it\''s over-sized echoes the slump or pulling in of the shoulders  nicely ambiguous emotion 8', '2003-10-22 20:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(459158, 43414, 6624, '<td valign="top">what a remarkable image...I look forward to finding out where and what it is...certainly gives a sense of a place to be alone, textures are good -seems a bit precarious, maybe you created the whole thing...very interesting overall 7</td>', 'what a remarkable image...I look forward to finding out where and what it is...certainly gives a sense of a place to be alone, textures are good -seems a bit precarious, maybe you created the whole thing...very interesting overall 7', '2003-10-22 20:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(459160, 43216, 7599, '<td valign="top">Not a terrible idea, but this isn''t the most interesting picture. You have captured the audience eye right away by the use of negative space, but the small interest detail doesn''t hold it.  I think a harder focus of the candle with some additional soft elements in the image would help it a lot.</td>', 'Not a terrible idea, but this isn''t the most interesting picture. You have captured the audience eye right away by the use of negative space, but the small interest detail doesn''t hold it.  I think a harder focus of the candle with some additional soft elements in the image would help it a lot.', '2003-10-22 20:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(459162, 43217, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is a very pleasing image, pensive subject fitting the challenge, slightly awkward placement of the feet and the red of the sneakers clashing with the red stairs (a crop of the top stair or two might have strengthened the image) 8</td>', 'this is a very pleasing image, pensive subject fitting the challenge, slightly awkward placement of the feet and the red of the sneakers clashing with the red stairs (a crop of the top stair or two might have strengthened the image) 8', '2003-10-22 20:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(459163, 42768, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful image, both in its visual impact and with the title you have given it. Lovely face, and the only suggestion I might have would be to crop a bit off the top...9</td>', 'This is a very powerful image, both in its visual impact and with the title you have given it. Lovely face, and the only suggestion I might have would be to crop a bit off the top...9', '2003-10-22 20:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(459164, 43242, 6624, '<td valign="top">the lighting, pose, and textured background all work together to make this quite lovely 9</td>', 'the lighting, pose, and textured background all work together to make this quite lovely 9', '2003-10-22 20:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(459165, 42803, 6624, '<td valign="top">the lighting and textures are very nice, the fold of the serape and the fold of the arm so interesting 9</td>', 'the lighting and textures are very nice, the fold of the serape and the fold of the arm so interesting 9', '2003-10-22 20:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(459166, 43194, 6624, '<td valign="top">very nice isolation of the wave...nice color, textures, motion 8</td>', 'very nice isolation of the wave...nice color, textures, motion 8', '2003-10-22 20:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(459167, 42979, 6624, '<td valign="top">a very lovely face and an interesting expression, nice soft focus 8</td>', 'a very lovely face and an interesting expression, nice soft focus 8', '2003-10-22 20:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(459169, 42536, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is ridiculous and enchanting - good entry for challenge 8</td>', 'this is ridiculous and enchanting - good entry for challenge 8', '2003-10-22 20:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(459170, 42586, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, I like the reflection and the fog very much! That''s worth 10! :-)</td>', 'Wonderful, I like the reflection and the fog very much! That''s worth 10! :-)', '2003-10-22 20:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(459171, 43287, 7599, '<td valign="top">You know when I first saw this i wans''t completely sold on it, however I left it and came back and I must say it''s grown on me. The colour is great, as is the macro detail and the DOF. The only thing I''d remove is the top petal, for some reason I think it draws your eye up of the focus.</td>', 'You know when I first saw this i wans''t completely sold on it, however I left it and came back and I must say it''s grown on me. The colour is great, as is the macro detail and the DOF. The only thing I''d remove is the top petal, for some reason I think it draws your eye up of the focus.', '2003-10-22 20:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(459172, 42873, 6624, '<td valign="top">lovely image, great clarity, composition, and color 9</td>', 'lovely image, great clarity, composition, and color 9', '2003-10-22 20:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(459174, 42586, 6624, '<td valign="top">very lovely peaceful image, lovely mists in the solitude and nice motion out and away from the subject 8</td>', 'very lovely peaceful image, lovely mists in the solitude and nice motion out and away from the subject 8', '2003-10-22 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
