(459201, 43303, 7599, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see this photo more as a wide angle. Less grass, (I''d cut right at where there looks like there is a path) more negative space (of the sky on the right) and without such a close crop of the tree on the left. I do like the B&amp;W. I do really thing you would have had more of a wow factor if the dark grass was not competing with the tree.</td>', 'I would have loved to see this photo more as a wide angle. Less grass, (I''d cut right at where there looks like there is a path) more negative space (of the sky on the right) and without such a close crop of the tree on the left. I do like the B&W. I do really thing you would have had more of a wow factor if the dark grass was not competing with the tree.', '2003-10-22 20:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
