(459228, 43331, 1368, '<td valign="top">Wow great picture! It looks so real! Love the drops licking from her hands. Beautiful colors. Great work!</td>', 'Wow great picture! It looks so real! Love the drops licking from her hands. Beautiful colors. Great work!', '2003-10-22 20:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
