(459232, 42407, 7599, '<td valign="top">This is a tricky shiot because of the angles of the image. The first thing I thought when I looked at it was I wish they had fixed the tilt of the memorial so it was straight. However, when looking at the bench, the angle isn''t all that crooked. Still I think you need to work with the more powerful of the two which in this case would be the memorial. As for meeting the challenge this obviously does, and the colour/lightng is well done.</td>', 'This is a tricky shiot because of the angles of the image. The first thing I thought when I looked at it was I wish they had fixed the tilt of the memorial so it was straight. However, when looking at the bench, the angle isn''t all that crooked. Still I think you need to work with the more powerful of the two which in this case would be the memorial. As for meeting the challenge this obviously does, and the colour/lightng is well done.', '2003-10-22 20:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(459233, 43057, 8013, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!', '2003-10-22 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(459235, 42939, 10858, '<td valign="top">Neat! Maybe if he / she walked, would be more natural, just standing is a bit artifical for me. And maybe I needed some more of the road behind.</td>', 'Neat! Maybe if he / she walked, would be more natural, just standing is a bit artifical for me. And maybe I needed some more of the road behind.', '2003-10-22 20:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
