(459237, 42821, 7599, '<td valign="top">I like this image. I just wish you could have edited out the background tree it''s distracting (but that''s obviously not in the rules) and I find the border really competes with the pole. i would have skipped it entirely. Other then those 2 aspects, great colour, meets the challenge, and the crop you''ve selected is perfect.</td>', 'I like this image. I just wish you could have edited out the background tree it''s distracting (but that''s obviously not in the rules) and I find the border really competes with the pole. i would have skipped it entirely. Other then those 2 aspects, great colour, meets the challenge, and the crop you''ve selected is perfect.', '2003-10-22 20:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
