(459292, 42507, 13301, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail. Love the color, the drop of water, the closeness.</td>', 'Incredible detail. Love the color, the drop of water, the closeness.', '2003-10-22 21:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(459295, 43269, 13301, '<td valign="top">This photo is excellent-great in black and white. Definitely captures loneliness. I''m new to this website...I find many of the photos ''staged''. Is that the norm and it''s obviously acceptable? What little training I''ve had in photography has been in photojournalism...the art of capturing life as it happens. Staging anything is a huge no-no in photojournalism, so this is very new to me. Any comments?</td>', 'This photo is excellent-great in black and white. Definitely captures loneliness. I''m new to this website...I find many of the photos ''staged''. Is that the norm and it''s obviously acceptable? What little training I''ve had in photography has been in photojournalism...the art of capturing life as it happens. Staging anything is a huge no-no in photojournalism, so this is very new to me. Any comments?', '2003-10-22 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
