(459340, 42594, 10634, '<td valign="top">Hopefully, I''m not too off base on what this photo is portraying... He doesn''t know what the sign says?? If I got that right, I have only 2 suggestions. 1) Add a prop to make the language barrier more obvious (a translation book, a shirt depicting his nationality or with print in his native language) so others can understand it without having to think too hard. 2) The flash reflection is really detracting from the shot. My eye was drawn right to it. Perhaps another source of light or standing off to the side? Otherwise, I like it. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Hopefully, I''m not too off base on what this photo is portraying... He doesn''t know what the sign says?? If I got that right, I have only 2 suggestions. 1) Add a prop to make the language barrier more obvious (a translation book, a shirt depicting his nationality or with print in his native language) so others can understand it without having to think too hard. 2) The flash reflection is really detracting from the shot. My eye was drawn right to it. Perhaps another source of light or standing off to the side? Otherwise, I like it. Keep up the good work!', '2003-10-22 22:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
