(459367, 43187, 12661, '<td valign="top">You have sparked a memory. Not only is the Zamboni man alone, but he has to put up with all the kids screaming at him to hurry up and get off the ice. Nice picture and nice composition. I particularly like the reflection of the skylights on the ice. I wonder if cropping out everything off ice would have improved it.</td>', 'You have sparked a memory. Not only is the Zamboni man alone, but he has to put up with all the kids screaming at him to hurry up and get off the ice. Nice picture and nice composition. I particularly like the reflection of the skylights on the ice. I wonder if cropping out everything off ice would have improved it.', '2003-10-22 22:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
