(459391, 42609, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of an almost great shot.  I love the focus and the colors here!!!  There is some very good composition.  But it''s too busy!  If you cropped it in much closer around the steps, leaving out all of that walled in whatever you would have a much simpler and more appealing image!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a good example of an almost great shot.  I love the focus and the colors here!!!  There is some very good composition.  But it''s too busy!  If you cropped it in much closer around the steps, leaving out all of that walled in whatever you would have a much simpler and more appealing image!TC', '2003-10-22 22:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
