(459406, 42891, 12661, '<td valign="top">Alright, where''s his girlfirend? They ALWAYS travel in pairs. I guess that makes the subject even more fitting for this challenge. Very nice job capturing the colors of the Mallard and nice choice in positioning. The three stalks of grass covering it are a bit distracting but I suppose he would have swam away if you tried to remove them.</td>', 'Alright, where''s his girlfirend? They ALWAYS travel in pairs. I guess that makes the subject even more fitting for this challenge. Very nice job capturing the colors of the Mallard and nice choice in positioning. The three stalks of grass covering it are a bit distracting but I suppose he would have swam away if you tried to remove them.', '2003-10-22 22:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(459409, 42891, 8624, '<td valign="top">would have been a nicer shot without the grasses occluding the duck. wait a little longer next time so that he moves into a better position or you can get a better vantage point.</td>', 'would have been a nicer shot without the grasses occluding the duck. wait a little longer next time so that he moves into a better position or you can get a better vantage point.', '2003-10-22 22:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
