(459476, 43237, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good image depicting solitude or solitary, but the title throws me off a bit.  Says he''s lonely but his expression makes me think of someone taking in rays.. could just be my interpretation though.  The lighting is great, the colors stand out nicely.  Composition is good, nice empty street to contrast with the figure standing alone.  Good clean image.  7</td>', 'I think this is a good image depicting solitude or solitary, but the title throws me off a bit.  Says he''s lonely but his expression makes me think of someone taking in rays.. could just be my interpretation though.  The lighting is great, the colors stand out nicely.  Composition is good, nice empty street to contrast with the figure standing alone.  Good clean image.  7', '2003-10-22 23:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(459481, 42710, 11923, '<td valign="top">Intense image.  Well representing both loneliness and solitude.  Black &amp; white choice was perfect.  Sharp image, good focus and lighting.  Disturbing subject but well executed.  Great use of space.  As an aside, the tattoos look interesting.  8</td>', 'Intense image.  Well representing both loneliness and solitude.  Black & white choice was perfect.  Sharp image, good focus and lighting.  Disturbing subject but well executed.  Great use of space.  As an aside, the tattoos look interesting.  8', '2003-10-23 00:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(459484, 43203, 9168, '<td valign="top">Im not seeing the solitude here.  Not getting any clues from the title either.</td>', 'Im not seeing the solitude here.  Not getting any clues from the title either.', '2003-10-23 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(459485, 43312, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I like the desaturation, the bit of color left really brings out the solitary aspect of the subject.  Great focus on both the leaves and the bulb thing.  The biggest negative impact for me though is the border.  It seems intensely overdone and adds too much white.  Perhaps just the inner thin border would''ve been sufficient.  7</td>', 'Very interesting.  I like the desaturation, the bit of color left really brings out the solitary aspect of the subject.  Great focus on both the leaves and the bulb thing.  The biggest negative impact for me though is the border.  It seems intensely overdone and adds too much white.  Perhaps just the inner thin border would''ve been sufficient.  7', '2003-10-23 00:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(459488, 43414, 11923, '<td valign="top">My goodness.  Where is this?  Very interesting image.  The play between gigantic and small is great, the perspective really captures the size of the boulder.  Lighting is great, I''m not sure it really feels lonely or solitary to me though.  Still a technically sound image.  7</td>', 'My goodness.  Where is this?  Very interesting image.  The play between gigantic and small is great, the perspective really captures the size of the boulder.  Lighting is great, I''m not sure it really feels lonely or solitary to me though.  Still a technically sound image.  7', '2003-10-23 00:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(459490, 42873, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible shot!  Great detail, this is great 10</td>', 'This is an incredible shot!  Great detail, this is great 10', '2003-10-23 00:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(459491, 42520, 9168, '<td valign="top">Theres definitely solitude.  Seems a little contrasty though.  The highlights are a little blown out and the shadows perhaps a little too dark.</td>', 'Theres definitely solitude.  Seems a little contrasty though.  The highlights are a little blown out and the shadows perhaps a little too dark.', '2003-10-23 00:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(459492, 43424, 11923, '<td valign="top">This image does have a slightly depressed feeling to it.  I like that the focus is on the bench, since I would expect to see people sitting there.  The black and white helps build the mood.  A solid image.  7</td>', 'This image does have a slightly depressed feeling to it.  I like that the focus is on the bench, since I would expect to see people sitting there.  The black and white helps build the mood.  A solid image.  7', '2003-10-23 00:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(459495, 43364, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think the image fits the ''all alone'' aspect of the challenge, its well lit and in good focus.  Unfortunately, the image as a whole isn''t very interesting to me.  A suggestion to add some energy to the piece was to pose it in a way and in a place that made it look cast a side.  Something to give it a bit more depth.  4</td>', 'I think the image fits the ''all alone'' aspect of the challenge, its well lit and in good focus.  Unfortunately, the image as a whole isn''t very interesting to me.  A suggestion to add some energy to the piece was to pose it in a way and in a place that made it look cast a side.  Something to give it a bit more depth.  4', '2003-10-23 00:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(459499, 42953, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beautiful image.  Very peaceful which evokes solitude for me.  The lighting is excellent, as are the colors.  A nice contrast of warm and cool tones.  The human element really adds to the feeling of the image.  Well done.  9</td>', 'I think this is a beautiful image.  Very peaceful which evokes solitude for me.  The lighting is excellent, as are the colors.  A nice contrast of warm and cool tones.  The human element really adds to the feeling of the image.  Well done.  9', '2003-10-23 00:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(459503, 43268, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The colors are great, the contrasting nature of them enhances the solitude feel of the piece.  The detail and focus is great.  I love the way the textures of the ground and the leave show.  Nicely done.  8</td>', 'Nice composition.  The colors are great, the contrasting nature of them enhances the solitude feel of the piece.  The detail and focus is great.  I love the way the textures of the ground and the leave show.  Nicely done.  8', '2003-10-23 00:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(459509, 42939, 7966, '<td valign="top">i think i would have like this photo better if she was walking, just to add some movement. i like the feeling though...  the sky, the way she looks, the whole feeling... just looks too staged</td>', 'i think i would have like this photo better if she was walking, just to add some movement. i like the feeling though...  the sky, the way she looks, the whole feeling... just looks too staged', '2003-10-23 00:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(459510, 43297, 12882, '<td valign="top">very nice, gets the point across well</td>', 'very nice, gets the point across well', '2003-10-23 00:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(459518, 43063, 7966, '<td valign="top">pretty good shot, the title and the photo go so well together. love it :o)</td>', 'pretty good shot, the title and the photo go so well together. love it :o)', '2003-10-23 00:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(459524, 43093, 7966, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. fits the challenge well. would like to have seen more of the sky and less of the water though. good job (9)</td>', 'beautiful shot. fits the challenge well. would like to have seen more of the sky and less of the water though. good job (9)', '2003-10-23 00:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(459527, 42414, 7966, '<td valign="top">good composition and all but photo chould have been more crisp (4)</td>', 'good composition and all but photo chould have been more crisp (4)', '2003-10-23 00:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(459529, 42821, 7966, '<td valign="top">nice shot, i like the perspective/cropping. could have upped the contrast just a bit in my opinion, the sky is a little too grey</td>', 'nice shot, i like the perspective/cropping. could have upped the contrast just a bit in my opinion, the sky is a little too grey', '2003-10-23 00:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(459530, 43176, 7966, '<td valign="top">photo is grainy/blurry</td>', 'photo is grainy/blurry', '2003-10-23 00:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(459533, 42837, 7966, '<td valign="top">i like this one. has a depressed/lonely feel (thus fitting the challenge well). beautiful b&amp;w shot</td>', 'i like this one. has a depressed/lonely feel (thus fitting the challenge well). beautiful b&w shot', '2003-10-23 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(459537, 42543, 11427, '<td valign="top">Cute. Original. Different.</td>', 'Cute. Original. Different.', '2003-10-23 00:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(459558, 43237, 9837, '<td valign="top">flowers, nice touch<br/></td>', 'flowers, nice touch', '2003-10-23 01:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(459567, 42979, 9437, '<td valign="top">This photo has a softness that makes it look painted.  8</td>', 'This photo has a softness that makes it look painted.  8', '2003-10-23 01:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(459570, 43330, 9437, '<td valign="top">The yellow shirt against the dark background draws attention; however it overpowers the subject. 7</td>', 'The yellow shirt against the dark background draws attention; however it overpowers the subject. 7', '2003-10-23 01:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(459571, 42881, 9437, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a unique animal portrait. Excellent detail in the frog and the man''s skin and hair.</td>', 'Wow, what a unique animal portrait. Excellent detail in the frog and the man''s skin and hair.', '2003-10-23 01:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(459577, 42945, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in this photo. Good use of zones. 8</td>', 'I like the contrast in this photo. Good use of zones. 8', '2003-10-23 01:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(459585, 43385, 9437, '<td valign="top">ouch! I can feel his desperation. I don''t normally go for flatness in BW photos, but it helped to accentuate the subject. 8</td>', 'ouch! I can feel his desperation. I don''t normally go for flatness in BW photos, but it helped to accentuate the subject. 8', '2003-10-23 01:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(459591, 43030, 9437, '<td valign="top">Love the brilliant yellow against the saturated blue. 9</td>', 'Love the brilliant yellow against the saturated blue. 9', '2003-10-23 01:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(459608, 43391, 9027, '<td valign="top">fab macro shot. love the fact that you were no the other side of the screen. good off center placement. is that a blurry sky in the background? and is that a fake fly?</td>', 'fab macro shot. love the fact that you were no the other side of the screen. good off center placement. is that a blurry sky in the background? and is that a fake fly?', '2003-10-23 02:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(459609, 42592, 9027, '<td valign="top">whoah, there sure are a bunch of webs in your garden. cool. shot would be more effective if they spider was in focus. especially given, from the title, it is the subject matter.</td>', 'whoah, there sure are a bunch of webs in your garden. cool. shot would be more effective if they spider was in focus. especially given, from the title, it is the subject matter.', '2003-10-23 02:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(459610, 42935, 9027, '<td valign="top">this shot is very adorable! not too fond of the border. even from this distance, i can feel their expressions. and great backdrop!</td>', 'this shot is very adorable! not too fond of the border. even from this distance, i can feel their expressions. and great backdrop!', '2003-10-23 02:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(459613, 42794, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the reflection in the wax, but overall, not a very exciting subject. perhaps if you saw a bit of the room it was in. or added a silohuette or some essense of a person to add intrigue.</td>', 'i like the reflection in the wax, but overall, not a very exciting subject. perhaps if you saw a bit of the room it was in. or added a silohuette or some essense of a person to add intrigue.', '2003-10-23 02:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(459614, 43377, 9027, '<td valign="top">love the negative space created in image.</td>', 'love the negative space created in image.', '2003-10-23 02:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(459618, 42589, 11687, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and subject, just a little too dark overall, I think.</td>', 'I like the pose and subject, just a little too dark overall, I think.', '2003-10-23 02:14:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(459621, 42873, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the challenge 10<br/>The clarity is excellent, The background is just a bit unsettling because of the pattern, but the medium tone makes for a great shot here.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the challenge 10The clarity is excellent, The background is just a bit unsettling because of the pattern, but the medium tone makes for a great shot here.', '2003-10-23 02:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(459622, 42414, 11687, '<td valign="top">I searched and searched for the "alone" in this shot.  I just can''t see it.  Sorry!  (Other than that, I like to colors and framing with the branch across the top.)</td>', 'I searched and searched for the "alone" in this shot.  I just can''t see it.  Sorry!  (Other than that, I like to colors and framing with the branch across the top.)', '2003-10-23 02:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(459623, 42606, 11687, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and framing.  Not so sure about the desaturation, though.  It distracts me from paying attention to the child.</td>', 'I like the subject and framing.  Not so sure about the desaturation, though.  It distracts me from paying attention to the child.', '2003-10-23 02:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(459626, 42696, 11687, '<td valign="top">I love the grain and the texture of the wood.  High sun pays off for once!  Was the branch naturally poking through the fence or was it staged?  Either way, nice work.</td>', 'I love the grain and the texture of the wood.  High sun pays off for once!  Was the branch naturally poking through the fence or was it staged?  Either way, nice work.', '2003-10-23 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(459627, 42862, 11687, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and the large shadow of the chair.  Awesome!</td>', 'I really like the lighting and the large shadow of the chair.  Awesome!', '2003-10-23 02:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(459631, 43259, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the DOF. However, I think the photo could be improved by placing the subject off-center.</td>', 'I like the concept and the DOF. However, I think the photo could be improved by placing the subject off-center.', '2003-10-23 02:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(459632, 43420, 6019, '<td valign="top">beautifully captured</td>', 'beautifully captured', '2003-10-23 02:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(459633, 42706, 12661, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF and rule of thirds. The sharpness of the leaf contrasts very well with the background. It would have been ideal if there were no leaves in the background, however, blurring them still allows the point to be made.</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF and rule of thirds. The sharpness of the leaf contrasts very well with the background. It would have been ideal if there were no leaves in the background, however, blurring them still allows the point to be made.', '2003-10-23 02:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(459637, 42970, 9437, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I like the light on the water -- makes it look painted. 8</td>', 'Good shot. I like the light on the water -- makes it look painted. 8', '2003-10-23 02:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(459639, 42970, 9027, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. really like the pink hues.</td>', 'beautiful shot. really like the pink hues.', '2003-10-23 02:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(459640, 43060, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great color, I like how you portrayed alone.  Focus is good as is the lighting.  I think being a little further back, so the expanse of green was larger might enhance the alone feeling.  6</td>', 'Great color, I like how you portrayed alone.  Focus is good as is the lighting.  I think being a little further back, so the expanse of green was larger might enhance the alone feeling.  6', '2003-10-23 02:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(459641, 43331, 9027, '<td valign="top">yikes. very graphic. great blood though. glad it''s not ketchup. would like this at more of an angle. more of the tub, with the bottle,etc a bit further from the hand.</td>', 'yikes. very graphic. great blood though. glad it''s not ketchup. would like this at more of an angle. more of the tub, with the bottle,etc a bit further from the hand.', '2003-10-23 02:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(459642, 42873, 9027, '<td valign="top">very pretty shot. i like the diagonal line you chose.</td>', 'very pretty shot. i like the diagonal line you chose.', '2003-10-23 02:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(459643, 42690, 9027, '<td valign="top">great angled shot. love the composition and soft lights. very serene.</td>', 'great angled shot. love the composition and soft lights. very serene.', '2003-10-23 02:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(459644, 43350, 9437, '<td valign="top">Awww... ya just want to cheer this little guy up. Good even light. Great model. 10</td>', 'Awww... ya just want to cheer this little guy up. Good even light. Great model. 10', '2003-10-23 02:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(459645, 43026, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the silohuette. the branches and things in the back detrack from the subject matter though. the person gets lost almost.</td>', 'i like the silohuette. the branches and things in the back detrack from the subject matter though. the person gets lost almost.', '2003-10-23 02:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(459646, 43282, 9437, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF photo. 10</td>', 'Excellent DOF photo. 10', '2003-10-23 02:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(459648, 43237, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome scenery for shooting around!  Wish I was there!  This could be a really good shot with this title if you could change the angle to get rid of all the stuff in the background that takes away from the ''lonely'' feel.  You could even pull him out of the doorway a little and he could help side some of the distractions like the light pole right in the middle...<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome scenery for shooting around!  Wish I was there!  This could be a really good shot with this title if you could change the angle to get rid of all the stuff in the background that takes away from the ''lonely'' feel.  You could even pull him out of the doorway a little and he could help side some of the distractions like the light pole right in the middle...TC', '2003-10-23 02:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(459652, 42817, 9437, '<td valign="top">This guy''s been to a lot of my picnics. Love the texture and detail you captured. 10</td>', 'This guy''s been to a lot of my picnics. Love the texture and detail you captured. 10', '2003-10-23 03:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(459654, 42552, 9437, '<td valign="top">This looks like a painting. Well done. 10</td>', 'This looks like a painting. Well done. 10', '2003-10-23 03:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(459670, 42934, 8891, '<td valign="top">NICE hair!</td>', 'NICE hair!', '2003-10-23 04:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(459673, 42502, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely picture, I  would not feel lonely there.  I think if the calf is the subject you might have shot in more on it. As it is, the calf looks more lost than alone. Gorgeous Scene.</td>', 'This is a lovely picture, I  would not feel lonely there.  I think if the calf is the subject you might have shot in more on it. As it is, the calf looks more lost than alone. Gorgeous Scene.', '2003-10-23 04:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(459675, 42885, 8891, '<td valign="top">Ahh, teensy prob....her head got down so low that her hair went across her face and she appears to be smiling....I guess when can be happy and alone, but the stakness of the scene would suggest otherwise.  well shot.</td>', 'Ahh, teensy prob....her head got down so low that her hair went across her face and she appears to be smiling....I guess when can be happy and alone, but the stakness of the scene would suggest otherwise.  well shot.', '2003-10-23 04:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(459676, 43109, 8891, '<td valign="top">Timed this ooooh...just almost fine... the on coming car on the left just sort of kills it along with alll the BRIGHT lights. Very nice attempt.</td>', 'Timed this ooooh...just almost fine... the on coming car on the left just sort of kills it along with alll the BRIGHT lights. Very nice attempt.', '2003-10-23 04:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(459677, 42617, 8891, '<td valign="top">colors are too washed out on this.....</td>', 'colors are too washed out on this.....', '2003-10-23 04:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(459678, 42923, 8891, '<td valign="top">if this is a candid then it would appear that the person is looking or waiting for a person or means of conveyance....either way she still will not be alone.  Would have been better with the head down and give her a little distraught feel.  But you do what you can.....</td>', 'if this is a candid then it would appear that the person is looking or waiting for a person or means of conveyance....either way she still will not be alone.  Would have been better with the head down and give her a little distraught feel.  But you do what you can.....', '2003-10-23 04:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(459679, 42872, 8891, '<td valign="top">the bag kills this for me, sorry!  Nice shot but the bag just distracts from the whole point for some reason.</td>', 'the bag kills this for me, sorry!  Nice shot but the bag just distracts from the whole point for some reason.', '2003-10-23 04:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(459680, 43232, 8891, '<td valign="top">like the image very much.  I feel the composition might have been improved.</td>', 'like the image very much.  I feel the composition might have been improved.', '2003-10-23 04:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(459688, 42521, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, good colours all round.</td>', 'Nice picture, good colours all round.', '2003-10-23 05:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(459689, 43365, 12802, '<td valign="top">Awww, I tried some shots like this for the challenge but changed my idea.  Poor wee teddy bear!</td>', 'Awww, I tried some shots like this for the challenge but changed my idea.  Poor wee teddy bear!', '2003-10-23 05:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(459690, 42507, 8056, '<td valign="top">WOW. I would say this is a DAMN GOOD macro shoot for me. NICE !! 6</td>', 'WOW. I would say this is a DAMN GOOD macro shoot for me. NICE !! 6', '2003-10-23 05:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(459691, 42533, 12802, '<td valign="top">Actually looks like the group of three on the right hand side are talking about her.  Good shot.</td>', 'Actually looks like the group of three on the right hand side are talking about her.  Good shot.', '2003-10-23 05:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(459692, 42659, 12802, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem like he''s alone.  Is he (or she) resting on another prairie dog?</td>', 'Doesn''t seem like he''s alone.  Is he (or she) resting on another prairie dog?', '2003-10-23 05:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(459694, 43099, 13368, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I do not like it. The composition looks too busy for my tastes.</td>', 'Sorry, I do not like it. The composition looks too busy for my tastes.', '2003-10-23 05:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(459696, 43115, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. You should have worked with the setup and I think it would have had better impact in color.</td>', 'I like the idea. You should have worked with the setup and I think it would have had better impact in color.', '2003-10-23 06:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(459697, 43242, 6172, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject!  I like the compostition and lighting here a lot.</td>', 'Beautiful subject!  I like the compostition and lighting here a lot.', '2003-10-23 06:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(459699, 42593, 6172, '<td valign="top">Good message here.</td>', 'Good message here.', '2003-10-23 06:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(459701, 43335, 6172, '<td valign="top">The message of this photo is great, one person is "blurring" by, and another is in a store shopping (probably spending money on stuff he doesn''t really need).  This guy is alone in his poverty while everybody goes about their life.</td>', 'The message of this photo is great, one person is "blurring" by, and another is in a store shopping (probably spending money on stuff he doesn''t really need).  This guy is alone in his poverty while everybody goes about their life.', '2003-10-23 06:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(459705, 42910, 6458, '<td valign="top">Subject not distinct enough from the background. Maybe placing the subject on a third would help focus the attention on them?</td>', 'Subject not distinct enough from the background. Maybe placing the subject on a third would help focus the attention on them?', '2003-10-23 06:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(459707, 42586, 6172, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better ones I''ve seen so far!  Great composition and all.</td>', 'This is one of the better ones I''ve seen so far!  Great composition and all.', '2003-10-23 06:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(459709, 42838, 6172, '<td valign="top">Great creativity here!  Nice effect with the colors.</td>', 'Great creativity here!  Nice effect with the colors.', '2003-10-23 06:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(459710, 42939, 6172, '<td valign="top">Looks just a little staged to me only because the pose is so unnatural.  Why would somebody be standing in the middle of the road with their head down in their jacket?</td>', 'Looks just a little staged to me only because the pose is so unnatural.  Why would somebody be standing in the middle of the road with their head down in their jacket?', '2003-10-23 06:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(459712, 42735, 6172, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2003-10-23 06:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(459713, 43188, 6458, '<td valign="top">This is just a bit too bright.. there are no real blacks in the picture and the sky is overexposed. Maybe not centering the subject and showing more of the landscape would enhance the feeling of aloneness?</td>', 'This is just a bit too bright.. there are no real blacks in the picture and the sky is overexposed. Maybe not centering the subject and showing more of the landscape would enhance the feeling of aloneness?', '2003-10-23 06:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(459718, 42606, 6458, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. Desaturation is usally used to draw attention to a subject, but here it draws the attention away. As such the shot almost works. Good job.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. Desaturation is usally used to draw attention to a subject, but here it draws the attention away. As such the shot almost works. Good job.', '2003-10-23 06:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(459721, 42803, 6172, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look lonely, she looks like she is posing - and, she is smiling.</td>', 'She doesn''t look lonely, she looks like she is posing - and, she is smiling.', '2003-10-23 06:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(459724, 43317, 6172, '<td valign="top">all cats are</td>', 'all cats are', '2003-10-23 06:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(459725, 42696, 6172, '<td valign="top">One of my favs so far!</td>', 'One of my favs so far!', '2003-10-23 06:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(459738, 42675, 13368, '<td valign="top">unfortunately you chose the worst kind of light here.... the typical problem with deciding where to measure the exposition; underexposed foreground and overexposed background... But, bedides the technical matter, I think this is a very nice picture, though it is quite a common composition. it gives a good sense of being alone and I hope it will be among the best rated. Good luck.</td>', 'unfortunately you chose the worst kind of light here.... the typical problem with deciding where to measure the exposition; underexposed foreground and overexposed background... But, bedides the technical matter, I think this is a very nice picture, though it is quite a common composition. it gives a good sense of being alone and I hope it will be among the best rated. Good luck.', '2003-10-23 07:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(459741, 42979, 13368, '<td valign="top">Background seems a tad distarcting for my taste, and focus a little soft especially on her eyes which always should be in focus in portraits. Good sense of being alone, though.</td>', 'Background seems a tad distarcting for my taste, and focus a little soft especially on her eyes which always should be in focus in portraits. Good sense of being alone, though.', '2003-10-23 07:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(459743, 42686, 13368, '<td valign="top">I have the feeling this picture does not have the power it might have if you just had put some more attention in some small particulars: an unesuful object is visible on the left on the floor; the photo is much tilted: a sort of flare is visible on the wall; and, just being picky, her hair should have been combed before shooting.-) But still a nice image.</td>', 'I have the feeling this picture does not have the power it might have if you just had put some more attention in some small particulars: an unesuful object is visible on the left on the floor; the photo is much tilted: a sort of flare is visible on the wall; and, just being picky, her hair should have been combed before shooting.-) But still a nice image.', '2003-10-23 07:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(459744, 42910, 13368, '<td valign="top">Quite powerful. But slightly underexposed for my taste. And claustrophobic. But gives a good sense of solitude and appears to be perfectly in topic. Good luck.</td>', 'Quite powerful. But slightly underexposed for my taste. And claustrophobic. But gives a good sense of solitude and appears to be perfectly in topic. Good luck.', '2003-10-23 07:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(459752, 43279, 10370, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say this - and I''d like to give some constructive criticism about the poor framing, messy foreground, underexposure etc - but at the end of the day this is simply a terrible photo. However, I didn''t even manage to submit anything at all so take my judgement with a touch of hypocrasy if you like.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say this - and I''d like to give some constructive criticism about the poor framing, messy foreground, underexposure etc - but at the end of the day this is simply a terrible photo. However, I didn''t even manage to submit anything at all so take my judgement with a touch of hypocrasy if you like.', '2003-10-23 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(459757, 42695, 10370, '<td valign="top">Why would a seedling want a hug?</td>', 'Why would a seedling want a hug?', '2003-10-23 08:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(459758, 42854, 11410, '<td valign="top">that''s very, very dark, isn''t it?</td>', 'that''s very, very dark, isn''t it?', '2003-10-23 08:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
