(460033, 43388, 11687, '<td valign="top">I like the very similar shadows the clock and the person cast.  Wish that the dark object in the bottom right weren''t there!  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the very similar shadows the clock and the person cast.  Wish that the dark object in the bottom right weren''t there!  Nicely done.', '2003-10-23 12:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(460034, 43193, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think th eimage would be stringer if the subject was a bit further from the edge of the picture. Crop the left 1/2 of the picture off perhaps</td>', 'I think th eimage would be stringer if the subject was a bit further from the edge of the picture. Crop the left 1/2 of the picture off perhaps', '2003-10-23 12:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(460036, 42594, 11467, '<td valign="top">Errr what??</td>', 'Errr what??', '2003-10-23 12:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(460048, 42586, 3981, '<td valign="top">This is the only 10 I have given in this challenge.  Your image is so very fitting for the category. Technically skilled, as well, with great clarity and composition. And to me, the thing that makes it feel alone and lonely is the misty fog over the water.  Well done.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This is the only 10 I have given in this challenge.  Your image is so very fitting for the category. Technically skilled, as well, with great clarity and composition. And to me, the thing that makes it feel alone and lonely is the misty fog over the water.  Well done.  Congratulations.', '2003-10-23 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(460054, 43357, 6130, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2003-10-23 13:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(460055, 42560, 6130, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2003-10-23 13:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(460056, 43242, 3981, '<td valign="top">What an outstanding image.  It is magazine quality in my opinion. Your image captures exactly what the challenge is asking for....alone and lonely.  My only constructive criticism would be that the focus seems a little soft, yet in a way, it may be the very thing I love about the picture.  Well done. 9</td>', 'What an outstanding image.  It is magazine quality in my opinion. Your image captures exactly what the challenge is asking for....alone and lonely.  My only constructive criticism would be that the focus seems a little soft, yet in a way, it may be the very thing I love about the picture.  Well done. 9', '2003-10-23 13:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(460057, 42606, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2003-10-23 13:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(460058, 43263, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2003-10-23 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(460061, 42869, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2003-10-23 13:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
