(460150, 42606, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and how the boy is playing clearly on his own, no attention to the world around him. A bit more emptry space around him (if possible?) would have made it stronger.</td>', 'I like the tones and how the boy is playing clearly on his own, no attention to the world around him. A bit more emptry space around him (if possible?) would have made it stronger.', '2003-10-23 14:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(460154, 42867, 4008, '<td valign="top">Being lonely in a group. Good expression, I like the blur of the front figure and the isolation of the sitting figure.</td>', 'Being lonely in a group. Good expression, I like the blur of the front figure and the isolation of the sitting figure.', '2003-10-23 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
