(460179, 43333, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of your photo, however I think the title should have been "Who''s on the other side?" But don''t worry, this hasn''t altered my score for you, I have only judged the photo.</td>', 'I like the feel of your photo, however I think the title should have been "Who''s on the other side?" But don''t worry, this hasn''t altered my score for you, I have only judged the photo.', '2003-10-23 14:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
