(460265, 43297, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image.  I love the expanse and range of blue.  There is a nice tranquility with the solitude.  Simple but the feeling comes across perfectly.  I would rather there was a bit more light directly on the leaf, but its no biggie really.  Well done.  9</td>', 'Very powerful image.  I love the expanse and range of blue.  There is a nice tranquility with the solitude.  Simple but the feeling comes across perfectly.  I would rather there was a bit more light directly on the leaf, but its no biggie really.  Well done.  9', '2003-10-23 16:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
