(460272, 42606, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Light is just right, I like the use of color contrasts.  The child being black &amp; white really separates him from the ''normal'' enhancing that solitary or lonely feeling.  I think him being on a piece of playground equipment also highlights the fact that he is alone, no friends to play with.  Very nice. 8</td>', 'Great capture.  Light is just right, I like the use of color contrasts.  The child being black & white really separates him from the ''normal'' enhancing that solitary or lonely feeling.  I think him being on a piece of playground equipment also highlights the fact that he is alone, no friends to play with.  Very nice. 8', '2003-10-23 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(460276, 43115, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''m not sure the significance (if there is any) of the white eggs all being broken/used.  I think the contrast in color very well separates the brown egg and creates that all alone aspect.  It is of course got the second layer of being the only intact egg too - perhaps that was what you were going for (if a deeper meaning is there I confess I missed it!).  I like the lighting, I''m not sure if I''d prefer it highlighting the different nature of the brown egg, or if its exclusion of the brown egg putting it in the shadows is better, they both work nicely.  I do wish the focus was a bit sharper though.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Interesting.  I''m not sure the significance (if there is any) of the white eggs all being broken/used.  I think the contrast in color very well separates the brown egg and creates that all alone aspect.  It is of course got the second layer of being the only intact egg too - perhaps that was what you were going for (if a deeper meaning is there I confess I missed it!).  I like the lighting, I''m not sure if I''d prefer it highlighting the different nature of the brown egg, or if its exclusion of the brown egg putting it in the shadows is better, they both work nicely.  I do wish the focus was a bit sharper though.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-23 17:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(460277, 43242, 12327, '<td valign="top">excellent, I like the softness the colors.  The <br/>but is there any reason why a young woman as beautiful as this one should ever feel lonely... I can see the shadow of two guys drooling at her on the right side (good thing you cropped them out).</td>', 'excellent, I like the softness the colors.  The but is there any reason why a young woman as beautiful as this one should ever feel lonely... I can see the shadow of two guys drooling at her on the right side (good thing you cropped them out).', '2003-10-23 17:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
