(460317, 42899, 12733, '<td valign="top">There is something very lonely looking about this man - the expression, the cheap-looking grocery, the worn brick, the folded hands. Nice.</td>', 'There is something very lonely looking about this man - the expression, the cheap-looking grocery, the worn brick, the folded hands. Nice.', '2003-10-23 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(460318, 42953, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and good composition, in terms of model and her position within environment. What I don''t like is the brightness of yellows coming through the gaps in the darkened foliage behind her - competes a little with the beautiful highlight in her hair and the dynamic foreground colours of green and blue.<br/>I like her pose though and the slightly blown out lighting on her skin works for me.<br/>She looks contemplative though I''m not sure I''d really conclude that''s she''s alone if I were to see this image outside of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice colours and good composition, in terms of model and her position within environment. What I don''t like is the brightness of yellows coming through the gaps in the darkened foliage behind her - competes a little with the beautiful highlight in her hair and the dynamic foreground colours of green and blue.I like her pose though and the slightly blown out lighting on her skin works for me.She looks contemplative though I''m not sure I''d really conclude that''s she''s alone if I were to see this image outside of the challenge.', '2003-10-23 17:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
