(460333, 43113, 9581, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, its more colorfull than some of these in this challenge, but I know with the 3 challenges i have entered these people are very critical! So I was hoping to give you good critism, its good that there is color and sun is behind you, but in this picture just a little too much shadow. you can hardly see the dog, but otherwise it fits the challenge hes alone in the big backyard! I give you an 8.</td>', 'I like the picture, its more colorfull than some of these in this challenge, but I know with the 3 challenges i have entered these people are very critical! So I was hoping to give you good critism, its good that there is color and sun is behind you, but in this picture just a little too much shadow. you can hardly see the dog, but otherwise it fits the challenge hes alone in the big backyard! I give you an 8.', '2003-10-23 17:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(460334, 42837, 208, '<td valign="top">It looks like there''s some strange editing around the tree branches. Without that (and without the annoying border) this would be a lovely shot. The b&amp;w is a good choice with the different lines and textures.</td>', 'It looks like there''s some strange editing around the tree branches. Without that (and without the annoying border) this would be a lovely shot. The b&w is a good choice with the different lines and textures.', '2003-10-23 17:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
