(460366, 42943, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea!  Good focus and use of DOF.  The background is a touch busy though and even thoug out of focus, the lines on the court and nets pull my eye away from the subject (the ball)!  I would try moving around to get closer to the ball and not have so much background.</td>', 'This is a cool idea!  Good focus and use of DOF.  The background is a touch busy though and even thoug out of focus, the lines on the court and nets pull my eye away from the subject (the ball)!  I would try moving around to get closer to the ball and not have so much background.', '2003-10-23 18:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(460367, 42821, 9906, '<td valign="top">I really like this one except for the out of focus branch in the foreground.  After the challenge I would try to clone it out and maybe clone out the lower antenna and then you would have a simple elegant shot that totally matches the title.<br/>TC</td>', 'I really like this one except for the out of focus branch in the foreground.  After the challenge I would try to clone it out and maybe clone out the lower antenna and then you would have a simple elegant shot that totally matches the title.TC', '2003-10-23 18:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(460369, 42610, 9906, '<td valign="top">Beatiful shot here.  I love the almost B/W that you get with the clouds and the silhouette of the light poles!  I do think the second pole in the background takes away from the strength of the single pole in the foreground though.  Maybe try cropping just to the right of the second pole or (IMHO better) just above it.<br/>TC</td>', 'Beatiful shot here.  I love the almost B/W that you get with the clouds and the silhouette of the light poles!  I do think the second pole in the background takes away from the strength of the single pole in the foreground though.  Maybe try cropping just to the right of the second pole or (IMHO better) just above it.TC', '2003-10-23 18:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(460385, 42737, 10428, '<td valign="top">nice pun</td>', 'nice pun', '2003-10-23 19:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(460388, 43291, 10428, '<td valign="top">i don''t see how this is alone....</td>', 'i don''t see how this is alone....', '2003-10-23 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(460391, 42586, 13390, '<td valign="top">I really really enjoy the colors on this particular picture, very well done. <br/> <br/>I do feel though that the person might be a little to close to the center. Just my own personal feeling, but it really doesn''t detract from the incredible quality of the photo.<br/> <br/>My personal favorite of the competition.</td>', 'I really really enjoy the colors on this particular picture, very well done.  I do feel though that the person might be a little to close to the center. Just my own personal feeling, but it really doesn''t detract from the incredible quality of the photo. My personal favorite of the competition.', '2003-10-23 19:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(460392, 42935, 13390, '<td valign="top">Great Colors!</td>', 'Great Colors!', '2003-10-23 19:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(460394, 43268, 13390, '<td valign="top">Enjoy the contrast of the leave compared to the ground. Well done</td>', 'Enjoy the contrast of the leave compared to the ground. Well done', '2003-10-23 19:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(460395, 43169, 13390, '<td valign="top">I really love the angle, I feel though, that the DOF is a little bit too broad, other than that, I love the colors as well. Good job!</td>', 'I really love the angle, I feel though, that the DOF is a little bit too broad, other than that, I love the colors as well. Good job!', '2003-10-23 19:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(460396, 42706, 9437, '<td valign="top">ooooo pretty! That steel gray around a yellow subject. Even the DOF helps frame the subject. Good work. 10</td>', 'ooooo pretty! That steel gray around a yellow subject. Even the DOF helps frame the subject. Good work. 10', '2003-10-23 19:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(460397, 43060, 13390, '<td valign="top">I personally like this one, very creative use of the theme.</td>', 'I personally like this one, very creative use of the theme.', '2003-10-23 19:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(460399, 42405, 13390, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love the feel of this particular shot. The B&amp;W is very effective. Nicely done</td>', 'Oh, I love the feel of this particular shot. The B&W is very effective. Nicely done', '2003-10-23 19:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
