(460402, 42802, 13390, '<td valign="top">I like the overall balance of the picture, very appealing to the eye (at least mine anyways). I''d be interested in seeing the (color) original.</td>', 'I like the overall balance of the picture, very appealing to the eye (at least mine anyways). I''d be interested in seeing the (color) original.', '2003-10-23 19:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
