(460432, 42857, 12151, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and mood.  IT''s really the color that does it.</td>', 'Beautiful color and mood.  IT''s really the color that does it.', '2003-10-23 19:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(460437, 43261, 13390, '<td valign="top">Nice nice, bery nice. I like your DOF that you used personally.</td>', 'Nice nice, bery nice. I like your DOF that you used personally.', '2003-10-23 19:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(460439, 42885, 13390, '<td valign="top">Loving the sepia tones used here!</td>', 'Loving the sepia tones used here!', '2003-10-23 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(460440, 42586, 9437, '<td valign="top">This is good. It fooled my eyes. On first glance it looked like the man was levitating over the lake. I like the mist. There''s just enough color to add interest. 10</td>', 'This is good. It fooled my eyes. On first glance it looked like the man was levitating over the lake. I like the mist. There''s just enough color to add interest. 10', '2003-10-23 19:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(460442, 42752, 13390, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!! Excellent utilization of DOF. One of my personal favorites!</td>', 'Very Nice!! Excellent utilization of DOF. One of my personal favorites!', '2003-10-23 19:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(460443, 43101, 13390, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot here, I enjoy the quality of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice shot here, I enjoy the quality of the photo.', '2003-10-23 19:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(460444, 43327, 12151, '<td valign="top">Effective photo.  When just looking at the image without knowing the title, you can see sadness, whether the sadness is from loneliness, mourning, or anything else.  I think when you get down to the pure emotions like this, it makes it easier for any person to "feel" the photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Effective photo.  When just looking at the image without knowing the title, you can see sadness, whether the sadness is from loneliness, mourning, or anything else.  I think when you get down to the pure emotions like this, it makes it easier for any person to "feel" the photo.  Well done.', '2003-10-23 19:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(460446, 43223, 13390, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle and perspective used, very effective!</td>', 'I really like the angle and perspective used, very effective!', '2003-10-23 19:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(460448, 43058, 13390, '<td valign="top">Ligthing seems a tad bit too dark. Ver nice shot though.</td>', 'Ligthing seems a tad bit too dark. Ver nice shot though.', '2003-10-23 19:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(460452, 42710, 12151, '<td valign="top">Frightening and provocative photo.  Visually and technically superb, which adds to the effect. I''m worried about the motivation behind the photo, and I hope that the topic of this image isn''t being exploited- images have power to do good and bad... ***as a side note, I rated yours and "You are never alone" the same, though the images are almost totally different, almost opposites.  I''m curious to see how you both place.</td>', 'Frightening and provocative photo.  Visually and technically superb, which adds to the effect. I''m worried about the motivation behind the photo, and I hope that the topic of this image isn''t being exploited- images have power to do good and bad... ***as a side note, I rated yours and "You are never alone" the same, though the images are almost totally different, almost opposites.  I''m curious to see how you both place.', '2003-10-23 19:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(460453, 43109, 13390, '<td valign="top">Wow, a very nice shot. I belive that the B&amp;W here is extremely effective! At first glance, it seems a bit distractive, but for as much that is going on here, it is really isn''t that distracting because you balance everthing out just right. Very nice shot, one of my favorites.</td>', 'Wow, a very nice shot. I belive that the B&W here is extremely effective! At first glance, it seems a bit distractive, but for as much that is going on here, it is really isn''t that distracting because you balance everthing out just right. Very nice shot, one of my favorites.', '2003-10-23 19:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(460454, 42886, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, a mood of awe.  This will probably score really well, and it deserves to do so for at least it''s visual merit.  I''d only challenge you to move further away from cliche.    ***as a side note, I rated yours and "Alone no more..." the same, though the images are almost totally different, almost opposites.  I''m curious to see how you both place.</td>', 'Very nice colors, a mood of awe.  This will probably score really well, and it deserves to do so for at least it''s visual merit.  I''d only challenge you to move further away from cliche.    ***as a side note, I rated yours and "Alone no more..." the same, though the images are almost totally different, almost opposites.  I''m curious to see how you both place.', '2003-10-23 19:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(460455, 43053, 13390, '<td valign="top">Wow, a rare shot! How did you fine something like that?!! An excellent shot! Wow!</td>', 'Wow, a rare shot! How did you fine something like that?!! An excellent shot! Wow!', '2003-10-23 19:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(460456, 43418, 13390, '<td valign="top">Very creative! I like the colors!</td>', 'Very creative! I like the colors!', '2003-10-23 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(460459, 42560, 13390, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I really enjoy this shot a lot, very good use of color and lighting. I love the overall balance of the picture!</td>', 'Ooh, I really enjoy this shot a lot, very good use of color and lighting. I love the overall balance of the picture!', '2003-10-23 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(460460, 42905, 13390, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2003-10-23 20:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(460461, 43391, 13390, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of DOF!</td>', 'Very effective use of DOF!', '2003-10-23 20:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(460464, 42599, 13390, '<td valign="top">I love the color!</td>', 'I love the color!', '2003-10-23 20:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(460465, 42737, 13390, '<td valign="top">Wow, very good photo! I really like the ripples in the water!</td>', 'Wow, very good photo! I really like the ripples in the water!', '2003-10-23 20:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(460467, 42521, 9437, '<td valign="top">I knew this was a 10 before seeing the first full inch of download. The tiny outline of highlight and the vivid texture of the leaf are outstanding. If there was an 11 I''d give it that.</td>', 'I knew this was a 10 before seeing the first full inch of download. The tiny outline of highlight and the vivid texture of the leaf are outstanding. If there was an 11 I''d give it that.', '2003-10-23 20:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(460496, 42610, 11800, '<td valign="top">very good use of the negative space. Good tonal value with no blowouts in the sky/clouds and the tilting is perfect. Would like to see a little more of the futherest pole, but you were maybe trying to avoid all the activity below that point. Anyway, I like it.</td>', 'very good use of the negative space. Good tonal value with no blowouts in the sky/clouds and the tilting is perfect. Would like to see a little more of the futherest pole, but you were maybe trying to avoid all the activity below that point. Anyway, I like it.', '2003-10-23 21:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(460502, 42729, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I would have preferred seeing the subjects more off center.  The lady''s face also seems slightly over exposed.  Underexposing this shot by a few stops could have given more effect.  I find the border a bit much, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I would have preferred seeing the subjects more off center.  The lady''s face also seems slightly over exposed.  Underexposing this shot by a few stops could have given more effect.  I find the border a bit much, but that''s just me.', '2003-10-23 21:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(460506, 42939, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and a solid idea, but I would rather have seen her walking, preferably away from the camera to give this shot an idea of movement.  I just find it strange that she''s standing in the middle of the road.</td>', 'Nice shot and a solid idea, but I would rather have seen her walking, preferably away from the camera to give this shot an idea of movement.  I just find it strange that she''s standing in the middle of the road.', '2003-10-23 21:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(460511, 43053, 13493, '<td valign="top">Effective, expresses the challenge. Would like to know where this was shot. Nice Work</td>', 'Effective, expresses the challenge. Would like to know where this was shot. Nice Work', '2003-10-23 21:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(460514, 43369, 11800, '<td valign="top">Like the title. So many levels of meaning. You did a good job of converting to b/w. Perfect for giving it moodiness. If I could offer my opinion. The wideness of the shot brings in a lot more information than needs to be there. The stairs take away from your center of focus. You might also be able to get a more balanced exposure by getting in closer to the woman.</td>', 'Like the title. So many levels of meaning. You did a good job of converting to b/w. Perfect for giving it moodiness. If I could offer my opinion. The wideness of the shot brings in a lot more information than needs to be there. The stairs take away from your center of focus. You might also be able to get a more balanced exposure by getting in closer to the woman.', '2003-10-23 21:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(460516, 43188, 11800, '<td valign="top">Monitor problem?  I hate when that happens. Good composition.  I''ll go ahead and score it as if there wasn''t a problem. 7</td>', 'Monitor problem?  I hate when that happens. Good composition.  I''ll go ahead and score it as if there wasn''t a problem. 7', '2003-10-23 21:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(460519, 43269, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good job. Really makes me feel enclosed, edgy, with my back to the wall.  Really well done.</td>', 'Good job. Really makes me feel enclosed, edgy, with my back to the wall.  Really well done.', '2003-10-23 21:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(460523, 43223, 13493, '<td valign="top">conveys the challenge well, in a darker sense. very nice</td>', 'conveys the challenge well, in a darker sense. very nice', '2003-10-23 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(460524, 43042, 13493, '<td valign="top">beautiful. well done for such low lighting</td>', 'beautiful. well done for such low lighting', '2003-10-23 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(460526, 43296, 13493, '<td valign="top">i think the person in the forground takes away from the feeling of loneliness that the magician in a box conveys.</td>', 'i think the person in the forground takes away from the feeling of loneliness that the magician in a box conveys.', '2003-10-23 21:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(460527, 43231, 13493, '<td valign="top">meets the challege, but not very intriguing</td>', 'meets the challege, but not very intriguing', '2003-10-23 21:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(460528, 42375, 11800, '<td valign="top">The red is really beautiful against the black sky. Two questions. What is that red patch up at the top? Did you try it in portrait position? I really have to fight to get my eyes to look away from the patch.</td>', 'The red is really beautiful against the black sky. Two questions. What is that red patch up at the top? Did you try it in portrait position? I really have to fight to get my eyes to look away from the patch.', '2003-10-23 21:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(460529, 43271, 13493, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge but its hard to tell what it is. makes you wonder where its taken and what the photographer wants to express</td>', 'meets the challenge but its hard to tell what it is. makes you wonder where its taken and what the photographer wants to express', '2003-10-23 21:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(460530, 43270, 12674, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!...didn''t quite get flower competely in left side of frame</td>', 'Beautiful!...didn''t quite get flower competely in left side of frame', '2003-10-23 21:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(460531, 43422, 13493, '<td valign="top">what part of this expresses loneliness or being alone. I don''t see it</td>', 'what part of this expresses loneliness or being alone. I don''t see it', '2003-10-23 21:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(460533, 42945, 13493, '<td valign="top">a feeling of empty, but not alone</td>', 'a feeling of empty, but not alone', '2003-10-23 21:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
