(460760, 43297, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptional image.  Composition, lighting, color, clarity - terrific!  This has a true emotive feeling...  a most excellent capture! - I see a winner in this one.  :-)</td>', 'This is an exceptional image.  Composition, lighting, color, clarity - terrific!  This has a true emotive feeling...  a most excellent capture! - I see a winner in this one.  :-)', '2003-10-23 23:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
