(460764, 43285, 11923, '<td valign="top">Pretty clearly fits the challenge.  I like the colors, I also like the fact that the excluded candy doesn''t match any of the others shown.   Lighting looks good as does focus.  7</td>', 'Pretty clearly fits the challenge.  I like the colors, I also like the fact that the excluded candy doesn''t match any of the others shown.   Lighting looks good as does focus.  7', '2003-10-23 23:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
