(460771, 42599, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and the focus alright, seems a tad blurred.  I like the use of space, the large amount of empty blue helps the alone feeling.  I think it would look a bit better if the fish had a little more light on it - not sure if the lighting was manipulable though.  6</td>', 'Nice colors and the focus alright, seems a tad blurred.  I like the use of space, the large amount of empty blue helps the alone feeling.  I think it would look a bit better if the fish had a little more light on it - not sure if the lighting was manipulable though.  6', '2003-10-24 00:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(460772, 43053, 12896, '<td valign="top">very nice, well done. 9</td>', 'very nice, well done. 9', '2003-10-24 00:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(460774, 43199, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great detail &amp; focus, the textures are very evident.  Good lighting, and the color difference between the peanut shell and the skin thing is nice.  I think the border is a little too much, and I''m not sure, but I think I''d like the image better without the empty shells on the left.  I see it there as a backstory to help show the peanut is the last one but I think that is done well just by having the single peanut in its shell on the right.  Just my thoughts though.  Very nice image.  8</td>', 'Great detail & focus, the textures are very evident.  Good lighting, and the color difference between the peanut shell and the skin thing is nice.  I think the border is a little too much, and I''m not sure, but I think I''d like the image better without the empty shells on the left.  I see it there as a backstory to help show the peanut is the last one but I think that is done well just by having the single peanut in its shell on the right.  Just my thoughts though.  Very nice image.  8', '2003-10-24 00:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(460776, 43209, 10848, '<td valign="top">Adorable baby, the scenery is outstanding, putting the baby in with the leaves was a wonderful idea, looks great</td>', 'Adorable baby, the scenery is outstanding, putting the baby in with the leaves was a wonderful idea, looks great', '2003-10-24 00:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
