(460782, 43042, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice image!  Very simple, yet it pulls off the alone aspect of the challenge very well.  I like the way the lighting is set up, is there additional lighting from above or is it all the candle?  I wish there was a bit more focus, but overall it the photo is excellent.  8</td>', 'A nice image!  Very simple, yet it pulls off the alone aspect of the challenge very well.  I like the way the lighting is set up, is there additional lighting from above or is it all the candle?  I wish there was a bit more focus, but overall it the photo is excellent.  8', '2003-10-24 00:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
