(460896, 43282, 9441, '<td valign="top">very cool, I like how you captured the reflection in the game piece!  Great job.</td>', 'very cool, I like how you captured the reflection in the game piece!  Great job.', '2003-10-24 02:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(460902, 42610, 12537, '<td valign="top">I love this picture I  always find my self talking pictures of street lights all the time and i really have no idea why but any was great picture never forget to notice the sky!</td>', 'I love this picture I  always find my self talking pictures of street lights all the time and i really have no idea why but any was great picture never forget to notice the sky!', '2003-10-24 03:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(460904, 43299, 12537, '<td valign="top">this is an absolutly beautiful photograph where was this taken?</td>', 'this is an absolutly beautiful photograph where was this taken?', '2003-10-24 03:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(460907, 42881, 12537, '<td valign="top">very interesting idea i love the contrast</td>', 'very interesting idea i love the contrast', '2003-10-24 03:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(460908, 42873, 12537, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2003-10-24 03:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(460911, 42552, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.  The colors are great, I love silhouettes.  Excellent lighting and the composition is perfect for the feeling of solitude/all alone.   There seems to be a bit of softness near the tree - doesn''t have a completely sharp line, but perhaps that''s from resizing?  Great shot, both as a challenge submission and stand alone.  10</td>', 'Fantastic image.  The colors are great, I love silhouettes.  Excellent lighting and the composition is perfect for the feeling of solitude/all alone.   There seems to be a bit of softness near the tree - doesn''t have a completely sharp line, but perhaps that''s from resizing?  Great shot, both as a challenge submission and stand alone.  10', '2003-10-24 03:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(460913, 43335, 12537, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture it some time hard to capture the every day beauty of down town life it reminds me of the saying alone in a room full of people is that how it goes?  Any ways its just nice to see that even though theres people passing by this man seems alone in a sense with his music and at that moment noting else matters. Well cal me a mumbling Marvin nice photo. :0)</td>', 'Wonderful picture it some time hard to capture the every day beauty of down town life it reminds me of the saying alone in a room full of people is that how it goes?  Any ways its just nice to see that even though theres people passing by this man seems alone in a sense with his music and at that moment noting else matters. Well cal me a mumbling Marvin nice photo. :0)', '2003-10-24 03:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(460918, 43087, 12537, '<td valign="top">so many times ive felt like this</td>', 'so many times ive felt like this', '2003-10-24 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(460919, 42899, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like the ''everyday'' aspect of the photo.  Should appeal generally.  The lighting is good.  The focus looks as if it could be a little bit sharper on the person.  Would''ve preferred that than the sharp brickwork.  Solid work.  6</td>', 'Nice image.  I like the ''everyday'' aspect of the photo.  Should appeal generally.  The lighting is good.  The focus looks as if it could be a little bit sharper on the person.  Would''ve preferred that than the sharp brickwork.  Solid work.  6', '2003-10-24 03:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(460921, 42867, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice example!  I like the focus, the left out guy is clearly the main subject.  I do wish the standing fellow behind the net was a bit more blurred though.  Use of available light is pretty good.  I like the black &amp; white aspect of the piece, though it doesn''t look truly black &amp; white to me.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Nice example!  I like the focus, the left out guy is clearly the main subject.  I do wish the standing fellow behind the net was a bit more blurred though.  Use of available light is pretty good.  I like the black & white aspect of the piece, though it doesn''t look truly black & white to me.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-24 03:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(460924, 43402, 11923, '<td valign="top">The colors are very vivid, which I like.  Nice lighting.  The subject however I find a little unappealing.  It seems like the flower is wilted or something.  Maybe that''s the effect of the water.   Also, I think a larger expanse of blue with the flower floating in a corner or even in the middle would amplify the alone/solitary feeling more.  The close crop diminishes that feeling for me.  4</td>', 'The colors are very vivid, which I like.  Nice lighting.  The subject however I find a little unappealing.  It seems like the flower is wilted or something.  Maybe that''s the effect of the water.   Also, I think a larger expanse of blue with the flower floating in a corner or even in the middle would amplify the alone/solitary feeling more.  The close crop diminishes that feeling for me.  4', '2003-10-24 03:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(460927, 43208, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I can''t really tell what this is a picture off.  It says lone sailor but.. I''m not seeing anything sailory.  I can''t determine what that thing is in the middle, I''m sure its painfully obvious but my eyes don''t seem to be picking it up.  I do like the colors, it gives a feeling of movement.  I would give a higher score though if I could understand the image - its very much lost on me.  3</td>', 'I''m afraid I can''t really tell what this is a picture off.  It says lone sailor but.. I''m not seeing anything sailory.  I can''t determine what that thing is in the middle, I''m sure its painfully obvious but my eyes don''t seem to be picking it up.  I do like the colors, it gives a feeling of movement.  I would give a higher score though if I could understand the image - its very much lost on me.  3', '2003-10-24 03:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(460928, 43365, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  Captures the challenge essence very well.  I love the black&amp;white aspect of it.  The lighting is great the subject is perfect.  I think the soft focus helps to enhance the lost feeling.  I really like how this photo draws me in and immediately has an emotional impact.  Very nicely done.  10</td>', 'Wonderful image.  Captures the challenge essence very well.  I love the black&white aspect of it.  The lighting is great the subject is perfect.  I think the soft focus helps to enhance the lost feeling.  I really like how this photo draws me in and immediately has an emotional impact.  Very nicely done.  10', '2003-10-24 03:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(460930, 42873, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic capture!   Excellent detail, the focus is marvelous.  Lighting is wonderful.  Really highlights that last wisher.  I would love to see a black &amp; white rendition of this.  The one thing that I don''t like is the border, I think its a little overbearing.  Other than that, this is a wonderful image.  9</td>', 'What a fantastic capture!   Excellent detail, the focus is marvelous.  Lighting is wonderful.  Really highlights that last wisher.  I would love to see a black & white rendition of this.  The one thing that I don''t like is the border, I think its a little overbearing.  Other than that, this is a wonderful image.  9', '2003-10-24 03:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(460932, 43260, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!  I like the silhouette aspect, the colors of the scene outside really contrast nicely.  Definitely has an alone look and solitary feeling.  I find the pose of the subject looking upwards and the perspective of the camera, tilted down a bit to give a nice subtle interest.  Crisp lines.  Very much like it as a whole.  8</td>', 'Great perspective!  I like the silhouette aspect, the colors of the scene outside really contrast nicely.  Definitely has an alone look and solitary feeling.  I find the pose of the subject looking upwards and the perspective of the camera, tilted down a bit to give a nice subtle interest.  Crisp lines.  Very much like it as a whole.  8', '2003-10-24 03:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(460934, 42407, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The human and emotional content is very high and is portrayed wonderfully.  The colors are nice and the muted light helps convey the mood.  I like the fact that the words are readable.  I do think the slight tilt is distracting, but not too a huge extent.  Nicely done.  7</td>', 'Great photo.  The human and emotional content is very high and is portrayed wonderfully.  The colors are nice and the muted light helps convey the mood.  I like the fact that the words are readable.  I do think the slight tilt is distracting, but not too a huge extent.  Nicely done.  7', '2003-10-24 03:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(460937, 42414, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous image, the color profusion is marvelous.  I like the lighting.  It seems very peaceful, however I''m not sure where the all alone (solitude/loneliness) piece comes in?  Are you talking about the vertical bush/tree?  I''m not picking it up from this photo because everything seems to fit together, meshes very well.  Lowered vote because of that - but it is a very technically and visually appealing image.  8</td>', 'This is a gorgeous image, the color profusion is marvelous.  I like the lighting.  It seems very peaceful, however I''m not sure where the all alone (solitude/loneliness) piece comes in?  Are you talking about the vertical bush/tree?  I''m not picking it up from this photo because everything seems to fit together, meshes very well.  Lowered vote because of that - but it is a very technically and visually appealing image.  8', '2003-10-24 04:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(460940, 43234, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  Gives the feeling of being left out and alone, yet has wonderful vivid colors and is fun!  Very nice composition.  Great focus, I do like the lighting but I think its a little to bright on the red piece, the glare at the bottom does detract for me.  Simply wonderful.  10</td>', 'This is a great image.  Gives the feeling of being left out and alone, yet has wonderful vivid colors and is fun!  Very nice composition.  Great focus, I do like the lighting but I think its a little to bright on the red piece, the glare at the bottom does detract for me.  Simply wonderful.  10', '2003-10-24 04:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(460941, 43161, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great composition for this challenge.  I like the unique manifestation.  Well lit, color is good.  I wish there was a little sharper focus on the pea.  I think the idea is fantastic and is achieved well.  Nice job.   7</td>', 'Great composition for this challenge.  I like the unique manifestation.  Well lit, color is good.  I wish there was a little sharper focus on the pea.  I think the idea is fantastic and is achieved well.  Nice job.   7', '2003-10-24 04:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(460943, 43363, 11923, '<td valign="top">LOL what a great image.  Definitely says attitude to me, also has that alone feeling.  What an interesting mix.  I like the color with the b&amp;w.  Excellent use of space - really enhances the alone mood.  I do love Garfield and this image captures his attitude well.  Great idea!  8</td>', 'LOL what a great image.  Definitely says attitude to me, also has that alone feeling.  What an interesting mix.  I like the color with the b&w.  Excellent use of space - really enhances the alone mood.  I do love Garfield and this image captures his attitude well.  Great idea!  8', '2003-10-24 04:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(460946, 42945, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Does look a bit lonely, but oddly - the leaves inside the nest sort of cancels out the emptiness.  Still the texture of the sticks, their brittle nature helps to give the feeling of being alone/solitary.   Excellent focus, nice perspective and great light.  Well done.  9</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Does look a bit lonely, but oddly - the leaves inside the nest sort of cancels out the emptiness.  Still the texture of the sticks, their brittle nature helps to give the feeling of being alone/solitary.   Excellent focus, nice perspective and great light.  Well done.  9', '2003-10-24 04:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(460950, 42532, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  The title is great, fits the image so very well.  Excellent colors and use of available light.  I love the contrast between the vast scrub and the looming hills.  Very nice focus and detail.  The only thing I don''t like is the dead/grey looking scrub in the immediate foreground.  Doesn''t look like it could''ve been cropped out though without losing part of the burro?.   Good job!  8</td>', 'Wonderful!  The title is great, fits the image so very well.  Excellent colors and use of available light.  I love the contrast between the vast scrub and the looming hills.  Very nice focus and detail.  The only thing I don''t like is the dead/grey looking scrub in the immediate foreground.  Doesn''t look like it could''ve been cropped out though without losing part of the burro?.   Good job!  8', '2003-10-24 04:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(460961, 42961, 12802, '<td valign="top">:-)  Looks like my dog!!</td>', ':-)  Looks like my dog!!', '2003-10-24 04:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(460970, 43301, 10739, '<td valign="top">Use a shorter exposition (the reflections on the water are too burnt) and then enhance the shadows of the sky editing the levels</td>', 'Use a shorter exposition (the reflections on the water are too burnt) and then enhance the shadows of the sky editing the levels', '2003-10-24 05:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(460973, 43388, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this would do very well in the shadows challenge! But also here my guess is that it will do well too. (8)</td>', 'Now this would do very well in the shadows challenge! But also here my guess is that it will do well too. (8)', '2003-10-24 06:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(460975, 43099, 2261, '<td valign="top">The picture is quite busy with so much stuff scattered around, and it seems a bit out of focus. 4</td>', 'The picture is quite busy with so much stuff scattered around, and it seems a bit out of focus. 4', '2003-10-24 06:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(460976, 43386, 2261, '<td valign="top">nice colours. 7</td>', 'nice colours. 7', '2003-10-24 06:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(460977, 43369, 2261, '<td valign="top">very moody. 8</td>', 'very moody. 8', '2003-10-24 06:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(460978, 42626, 2261, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, interesting shot. 8</td>', 'Like the composition, interesting shot. 8', '2003-10-24 06:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(460979, 42543, 2261, '<td valign="top">nice idea.8</td>', 'nice idea.8', '2003-10-24 06:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(460980, 43270, 6999, '<td valign="top">Tonally beautiful, though I''m not convinced by your placing of the focal plane here - and I''m always distracted by this desaturation trick, which I have a personal loathing for. To genuinely communicate a feeling of solitude or loneliness ... I think you need a wider view, more context for the flower.</td>', 'Tonally beautiful, though I''m not convinced by your placing of the focal plane here - and I''m always distracted by this desaturation trick, which I have a personal loathing for. To genuinely communicate a feeling of solitude or loneliness ... I think you need a wider view, more context for the flower.', '2003-10-24 06:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(460981, 43026, 2261, '<td valign="top">excellent. good night shot, full of atmosphere. 9</td>', 'excellent. good night shot, full of atmosphere. 9', '2003-10-24 06:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(460982, 43209, 2261, '<td valign="top">best kept in your own personal album, lovely for you, very very boring for anyone else.1</td>', 'best kept in your own personal album, lovely for you, very very boring for anyone else.1', '2003-10-24 06:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(460983, 42870, 2261, '<td valign="top">i like all the different browns here, very nice. 8</td>', 'i like all the different browns here, very nice. 8', '2003-10-24 06:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(460984, 43110, 2261, '<td valign="top">a stunning picture, captures the mood just perfectly, well done. 10</td>', 'a stunning picture, captures the mood just perfectly, well done. 10', '2003-10-24 06:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(460986, 43090, 2261, '<td valign="top">love it, great imagination, top 5 hopefully. 10</td>', 'love it, great imagination, top 5 hopefully. 10', '2003-10-24 06:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(460988, 43277, 6999, '<td valign="top">DOF seems a touch too shallow here - fromt and back of the fungus are drifting out of focus without concentrating the eye on any particular feature that jumps out to me, especially with some of the grasses being within that plane. Odd composition too - perhaps a compromise between a broad context and a very close concentration on the subject.</td>', 'DOF seems a touch too shallow here - fromt and back of the fungus are drifting out of focus without concentrating the eye on any particular feature that jumps out to me, especially with some of the grasses being within that plane. Odd composition too - perhaps a compromise between a broad context and a very close concentration on the subject.', '2003-10-24 06:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(460990, 43255, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I understand your point, I''m afraid. I quite like the blur of the figure moving across the street, especially as all the other figures are so static, but that seems incidental to the shot, which appears just to be an architectural night shot. And then the photo''s title just throws me completely. Feel free to PM me and explain, but don''t expect any icrease in score :-)</td>', 'I don''t think I understand your point, I''m afraid. I quite like the blur of the figure moving across the street, especially as all the other figures are so static, but that seems incidental to the shot, which appears just to be an architectural night shot. And then the photo''s title just throws me completely. Feel free to PM me and explain, but don''t expect any icrease in score :-)', '2003-10-24 06:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(460991, 43230, 6999, '<td valign="top">Compositionally nice - good and effective use of leading lines, and tonally interesting. It isn''t giving me an impression of loneliness, or even solitude somehow - possibly the simple awareness of the presence of a photographer :-)</td>', 'Compositionally nice - good and effective use of leading lines, and tonally interesting. It isn''t giving me an impression of loneliness, or even solitude somehow - possibly the simple awareness of the presence of a photographer :-)', '2003-10-24 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(460992, 42881, 6999, '<td valign="top">Weird. A more defined image - this is presumably a 1:1 zoom of the original, from the quality - would add impact, but this truly bizarre. Don''t really know what to make of it though... intereswsting, but kind of appalling too.</td>', 'Weird. A more defined image - this is presumably a 1:1 zoom of the original, from the quality - would add impact, but this truly bizarre. Don''t really know what to make of it though... intereswsting, but kind of appalling too.', '2003-10-24 06:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(460993, 42976, 6999, '<td valign="top">Can''t connect this with the challenge subject I''m afraid. Loneliness, solitude, ... it''s an architectural portrait, though. Reasonable work - god colours, sharpness, but odd cropping, the perspective distortion is peculiar and has the feeling of not being wanted.</td>', 'Can''t connect this with the challenge subject I''m afraid. Loneliness, solitude, ... it''s an architectural portrait, though. Reasonable work - god colours, sharpness, but odd cropping, the perspective distortion is peculiar and has the feeling of not being wanted.', '2003-10-24 06:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(461000, 43162, 12408, '<td valign="top">This picture really qualifies for the Challenge since it is clealry a man alone on a stage (with no audience) and sums up the feeling of loneliness</td>', 'This picture really qualifies for the Challenge since it is clealry a man alone on a stage (with no audience) and sums up the feeling of loneliness', '2003-10-24 07:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(461001, 43242, 1368, '<td valign="top">This must be Blurry! Abselotely wonderful! The best picture in this challenge! I love the mood in it and the lightning and the colors And everything! Congratulations!</td>', 'This must be Blurry! Abselotely wonderful! The best picture in this challenge! I love the mood in it and the lightning and the colors And everything! Congratulations!', '2003-10-24 07:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(461002, 43420, 12408, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but it surely manipulated - does it qualify for disqualification? I''m not sure</td>', 'I like this shot but it surely manipulated - does it qualify for disqualification? I''m not sure', '2003-10-24 07:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(461003, 43331, 12408, '<td valign="top">contrived but eloquent - this certainly describes the horror of being Lonely and driven to suicide. Strong stuff</td>', 'contrived but eloquent - this certainly describes the horror of being Lonely and driven to suicide. Strong stuff', '2003-10-24 07:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(461004, 42710, 12408, '<td valign="top">again, the image of would-be suicide expresses the theme of this challenge</td>', 'again, the image of would-be suicide expresses the theme of this challenge', '2003-10-24 07:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(461005, 43282, 12408, '<td valign="top">not sure what this has to do with ''alone'' but it''s a very effective shot</td>', 'not sure what this has to do with ''alone'' but it''s a very effective shot', '2003-10-24 07:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(461006, 42804, 13368, '<td valign="top">Be careful: the first impression when I look at this photo is that it i stilted: the horizon is...horizontal actually, but there is a line on the top right of the image that gives the optical impression that the whole photo is tilted. You may try to correct it.</td>', 'Be careful: the first impression when I look at this photo is that it i stilted: the horizon is...horizontal actually, but there is a line on the top right of the image that gives the optical impression that the whole photo is tilted. You may try to correct it.', '2003-10-24 07:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(461007, 42799, 13368, '<td valign="top">It''s really too much tilted for my taste.</td>', 'It''s really too much tilted for my taste.', '2003-10-24 07:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(461008, 43234, 13368, '<td valign="top">Never use a flash in such conditions.</td>', 'Never use a flash in such conditions.', '2003-10-24 07:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(461009, 43350, 13368, '<td valign="top">That black object behind the child''s face is really disturbing for my taste. As well as a white something under his mouth.</td>', 'That black object behind the child''s face is really disturbing for my taste. As well as a white something under his mouth.', '2003-10-24 08:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(461010, 43335, 11800, '<td valign="top">He must be optimisitc. Look at the size of his bucket! Like the motion and the b/w. I don''t get a feeling of aloneness or solitude with it. He is there to interact with people, and he is working hard to do that.</td>', 'He must be optimisitc. Look at the size of his bucket! Like the motion and the b/w. I don''t get a feeling of aloneness or solitude with it. He is there to interact with people, and he is working hard to do that.', '2003-10-24 08:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(461011, 42549, 13368, '<td valign="top">Pretty underexposed for my taste.</td>', 'Pretty underexposed for my taste.', '2003-10-24 08:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(461012, 43274, 13368, '<td valign="top">Nice expression, indeed, even though it doesn''t give me a feeling of solitude: he looks to be more bored than lonely... Dof is probably a little too shallow. I do not agree with the tight crop on the top of his head and with the central position of the subject. The background looks quite distarcting, too.</td>', 'Nice expression, indeed, even though it doesn''t give me a feeling of solitude: he looks to be more bored than lonely... Dof is probably a little too shallow. I do not agree with the tight crop on the top of his head and with the central position of the subject. The background looks quite distarcting, too.', '2003-10-24 08:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(461013, 43216, 13368, '<td valign="top">Too much black and negative space for my taste, though I understand the meaning of it. The main subject of the composition is not in focus.</td>', 'Too much black and negative space for my taste, though I understand the meaning of it. The main subject of the composition is not in focus.', '2003-10-24 08:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(461014, 42552, 12316, '<td valign="top">Great colors ... great picture 10</td>', 'Great colors ... great picture 10', '2003-10-24 08:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(461015, 43210, 13368, '<td valign="top">You didn''t catch the moment, for my taste: that large cloud is obscuring the tree silhouette; a couple of minutes later or earlier would have let you shoot a nicer photo.</td>', 'You didn''t catch the moment, for my taste: that large cloud is obscuring the tree silhouette; a couple of minutes later or earlier would have let you shoot a nicer photo.', '2003-10-24 08:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(461016, 42883, 12316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.10</td>', 'Beautiful.10', '2003-10-24 08:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(461018, 43307, 13368, '<td valign="top">Lens flare spoils the pic. If you wished to make a silhouette of the subject you had to expose with a shorter time.</td>', 'Lens flare spoils the pic. If you wished to make a silhouette of the subject you had to expose with a shorter time.', '2003-10-24 08:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(461020, 43312, 12316, '<td valign="top">Great work. 10</td>', 'Great work. 10', '2003-10-24 08:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
