(461474, 43310, 12611, '<td valign="top">great sharpness in this photo- and I love the sloping grass- I really think that adds to the movement created by the tire swing poised to go down-- but my one criticism is that the subject (child) appears a bit close to  the foreground to truly convey the "aloneness" that you are seeking.</td>', 'great sharpness in this photo- and I love the sloping grass- I really think that adds to the movement created by the tire swing poised to go down-- but my one criticism is that the subject (child) appears a bit close to  the foreground to truly convey the "aloneness" that you are seeking.', '2003-10-24 22:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(461475, 42803, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait, sincere, well lit, interesting and expressive. Very nice. But what the hell is with the title? are you serious? Mexican Loneliness? what''s next "canadian sleepines" or "nigerian anger"? minus two points for the name...</td>', 'This is a great portrait, sincere, well lit, interesting and expressive. Very nice. But what the hell is with the title? are you serious? Mexican Loneliness? what''s next "canadian sleepines" or "nigerian anger"? minus two points for the name...', '2003-10-24 22:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(461476, 42939, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image, nice muted color and light.  Pose looks very alone/lonely  Focus looks pretty good, with good general appeal in the composition.  As a personal preference I''d rather the powerlines weren''t there on the side, but I can see them helping to backup the roadside image.   Nice job.  7</td>', 'Great image, nice muted color and light.  Pose looks very alone/lonely  Focus looks pretty good, with good general appeal in the composition.  As a personal preference I''d rather the powerlines weren''t there on the side, but I can see them helping to backup the roadside image.   Nice job.  7', '2003-10-24 22:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(461477, 43194, 12611, '<td valign="top">spectacular not so lonely, perhaps a bit of cropping would be justified. Nice sea color on the crest- you do all digital photographer''s proud with that.</td>', 'spectacular not so lonely, perhaps a bit of cropping would be justified. Nice sea color on the crest- you do all digital photographer''s proud with that.', '2003-10-24 22:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(461479, 42838, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a different image.  I really like the colorplay.   Good lighting, and focus.  Fits the challenge well, the difference of the type of tree highlighting its lone status.  <br/>The overall compositional impact for me is a little low but its shot pretty well.  6</td>', 'What a different image.  I really like the colorplay.   Good lighting, and focus.  Fits the challenge well, the difference of the type of tree highlighting its lone status.  The overall compositional impact for me is a little low but its shot pretty well.  6', '2003-10-24 22:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(461481, 42729, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Nice light usage and composition.  Excellent focus and it has a nice mood behind it.  I think the fact that they are together negates most/all of the lonely/solitude feeling.  I can see them as a single entity being alone, but the mood though nice, doesn''t portray the ones set in the challenge details.  Very nice image.  8</td>', 'Great image.  Nice light usage and composition.  Excellent focus and it has a nice mood behind it.  I think the fact that they are together negates most/all of the lonely/solitude feeling.  I can see them as a single entity being alone, but the mood though nice, doesn''t portray the ones set in the challenge details.  Very nice image.  8', '2003-10-24 22:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(461482, 42941, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, a powerful image.  Great light usage, great focus, clarity is wonderful.  I''m not sure I get a solitary or lonely feeling from the image, more of a fear &amp; danger, high stress feeling.  There is the alone aspect however, so I think it fits the challenge very well.  Excellent job.  8</td>', 'Wow, a powerful image.  Great light usage, great focus, clarity is wonderful.  I''m not sure I get a solitary or lonely feeling from the image, more of a fear & danger, high stress feeling.  There is the alone aspect however, so I think it fits the challenge very well.  Excellent job.  8', '2003-10-24 22:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(461483, 43333, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  Colors are good, as is the light usage.  Subject does give a feeling of solitude and pensiveness.  Nice focus, has a good general appeal.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Nice photo!  Colors are good, as is the light usage.  Subject does give a feeling of solitude and pensiveness.  Nice focus, has a good general appeal.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-24 22:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(461484, 43418, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  Really show off the feeling of alone, in a nice unique way.  I like both the difference in language and in the color - all of which are very vivid.  Great focus.  Composition really brings the mood home.  Nice work.  7</td>', 'Wonderful image.  Really show off the feeling of alone, in a nice unique way.  I like both the difference in language and in the color - all of which are very vivid.  Great focus.  Composition really brings the mood home.  Nice work.  7', '2003-10-24 22:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(461485, 43101, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  I love the b&amp;w aspect.  Lines and shapes are nice and crisp.  The lighting is good, both it and the person''s general expression help set the mood.  Fits very well in the challenge.  Great job.  8</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  I love the b&w aspect.  Lines and shapes are nice and crisp.  The lighting is good, both it and the person''s general expression help set the mood.  Fits very well in the challenge.  Great job.  8', '2003-10-24 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(461487, 43357, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like the duo-tone look.  Great use of space, very alone feeling.  Child''s posture helps convey the feeling well.  With the title, I''m wondering if this would have a greater impact if a playground/schoolyard scene was in the background.  Just a thought.  7</td>', 'Nice image, I like the duo-tone look.  Great use of space, very alone feeling.  Child''s posture helps convey the feeling well.  With the title, I''m wondering if this would have a greater impact if a playground/schoolyard scene was in the background.  Just a thought.  7', '2003-10-24 22:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(461489, 42413, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great use of the light, I love the perspective.  Detail/focus is great.  The bridge/path does give a distance feeling, helping to put forth the feeling alone - particularly since the scene is empty of other people.  I wish the colors were a little richer, feels like a slight haze of light or something is dulling them out in the background just a bit.  Nothing terribly bad though.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Great use of the light, I love the perspective.  Detail/focus is great.  The bridge/path does give a distance feeling, helping to put forth the feeling alone - particularly since the scene is empty of other people.  I wish the colors were a little richer, feels like a slight haze of light or something is dulling them out in the background just a bit.  Nothing terribly bad though.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-24 22:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(461490, 42878, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I like the differences in light, and the focus is great.  Has a nice general alone feel, though I don''t get a solitude or lonely sense from it.  Colors are a bit muted but I think that helps with the overall feel of the area.  No real negative aspects, would suggest cropping that light looking bit of tree? on the right.  8</td>', 'Great image.  I like the differences in light, and the focus is great.  Has a nice general alone feel, though I don''t get a solitude or lonely sense from it.  Colors are a bit muted but I think that helps with the overall feel of the area.  No real negative aspects, would suggest cropping that light looking bit of tree? on the right.  8', '2003-10-24 22:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(461491, 43162, 6477, '<td valign="top">a very good play with light and shadow. this one says solitude to me, good work</td>', 'a very good play with light and shadow. this one says solitude to me, good work', '2003-10-24 22:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
