(461600, 42678, 7369, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite picture of the week; it is great! The use of light, the silhouettes, the scenery and the composition all add to the feeling of the ''lone wanderer''. (8)</td>', 'This is my favourite picture of the week; it is great! The use of light, the silhouettes, the scenery and the composition all add to the feeling of the ''lone wanderer''. (8)', '2003-10-25 03:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(461601, 43331, 7369, '<td valign="top">Some may not like this picture and it may not end very high in the total ranking. However I think you have taken a great photo which matches the challenge perfectly. The DOF and the cold colours (like the grey skin and the white from the bathroom) make this picture more than average. (7)</td>', 'Some may not like this picture and it may not end very high in the total ranking. However I think you have taken a great photo which matches the challenge perfectly. The DOF and the cold colours (like the grey skin and the white from the bathroom) make this picture more than average. (7)', '2003-10-25 03:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(461602, 42850, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very well done! I like the haze on the background. It makes the grass in the foreground more vivid and let you eye concentrate on the most important spot of colour. Good job! 10.</td>', 'Very well done! I like the haze on the background. It makes the grass in the foreground more vivid and let you eye concentrate on the most important spot of colour. Good job! 10.', '2003-10-25 03:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(461603, 43317, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture... The soft backlight you can see through the fur of the cat increase the beauty of the scene.  9 and Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice picture... The soft backlight you can see through the fur of the cat increase the beauty of the scene.  9 and Good luck.', '2003-10-25 03:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
