(461654, 43030, 12857, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.!!  The sky is amazing.  The silhouette I feel is what makes this shot work.  If you had captured any detail / color in the balloon the shot would have been lost.   If you have ever been up in a balloon you are truly all alone.  Coming to you from the balloon capital of the world ......( Albuquerque NM)<br/>8<br/></td>', 'I love this shot.!!  The sky is amazing.  The silhouette I feel is what makes this shot work.  If you had captured any detail / color in the balloon the shot would have been lost.   If you have ever been up in a balloon you are truly all alone.  Coming to you from the balloon capital of the world ......( Albuquerque NM)8', '2003-10-25 10:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
