(461683, 43234, 1570, '<td valign="top">usually i am not very fond of pictures of toys, but this totally different, very clear and bright and well composed... i like it a lot! 8.</td>', 'usually i am not very fond of pictures of toys, but this totally different, very clear and bright and well composed... i like it a lot! 8.', '2003-10-25 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
