(461685, 42389, 12857, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!!!    I love this one.  Ther reflection and placement is perfection.</td>', 'Great shot!!!!!    I love this one.  Ther reflection and placement is perfection.', '2003-10-25 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(461687, 43242, 12857, '<td valign="top">The model really appears alone. Her position almsost makes her appear wanting. Perhaps for a love lost.   Damn some of you people are talented; you can take simple photo like this and elevate it to perfection.  9<br/></td>', 'The model really appears alone. Her position almsost makes her appear wanting. Perhaps for a love lost.   Damn some of you people are talented; you can take simple photo like this and elevate it to perfection.  9', '2003-10-25 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(461689, 42850, 12857, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the muted tones of the background and the striking color of the grass.  The lone man is perfect fo this challenge.  Bravo!!!!</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the muted tones of the background and the striking color of the grass.  The lone man is perfect fo this challenge.  Bravo!!!!', '2003-10-25 11:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(461690, 43119, 12857, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is stunning.  Would have been a good one for the shadow challenge as well.</td>', 'I think this photo is stunning.  Would have been a good one for the shadow challenge as well.', '2003-10-25 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(461692, 43057, 12857, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect photo.  I love the lines.  I love the angle.  I love the scale.  I love the placement of the subjects.  On the merrit of those things this is a 10. I think for the challenge I would like to have seen a solitary person with the umbrella.  ( However I dont feel this photo was staged and   I know we have to snap what we can when the opportunity presents itself ).  Two people can be alone in the world, cant they?    Great capture.  9</td>', 'This is a perfect photo.  I love the lines.  I love the angle.  I love the scale.  I love the placement of the subjects.  On the merrit of those things this is a 10. I think for the challenge I would like to have seen a solitary person with the umbrella.  ( However I dont feel this photo was staged and   I know we have to snap what we can when the opportunity presents itself ).  Two people can be alone in the world, cant they?    Great capture.  9', '2003-10-25 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(461693, 42391, 12857, '<td valign="top">Perfection!!!!!!    10</td>', 'Perfection!!!!!!    10', '2003-10-25 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(461698, 43194, 3981, '<td valign="top">Don''t let anyone tell you this image does not fit the challenge.  There is nothing more alone and lonely feeling  than the sea.  You have captured a very beautiful moment in time.  I say it''s outstanding. 9</td>', 'Don''t let anyone tell you this image does not fit the challenge.  There is nothing more alone and lonely feeling  than the sea.  You have captured a very beautiful moment in time.  I say it''s outstanding. 9', '2003-10-25 12:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
