(461709, 42899, 11800, '<td valign="top">I can understand what you are going with here. And it does meet the challenge. Overall a good picture. <br/>You have a good story here but because the man''s arm, the neon signs and the sign at the top are all cut off, I have to fill in all the pieces. That takes away from my enjoyment of the picture.</td>', 'I can understand what you are going with here. And it does meet the challenge. Overall a good picture. You have a good story here but because the man''s arm, the neon signs and the sign at the top are all cut off, I have to fill in all the pieces. That takes away from my enjoyment of the picture.', '2003-10-25 12:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(461712, 42710, 11407, '<td valign="top">Sick! But otherwise a nice picture, I guess.</td>', 'Sick! But otherwise a nice picture, I guess.', '2003-10-25 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(461715, 42941, 11800, '<td valign="top">Is that a statue? How cool if it is.  Where is it? That''s a fountain beside him?<br/>If I was in that situation, I might be praying I was alone. You have the hunted and the hunter(the fountain looks like someone is shooting).  So it technically doesn''t fit the challenge.  I like it, so no points lost because of that.</td>', 'Is that a statue? How cool if it is.  Where is it? That''s a fountain beside him?If I was in that situation, I might be praying I was alone. You have the hunted and the hunter(the fountain looks like someone is shooting).  So it technically doesn''t fit the challenge.  I like it, so no points lost because of that.', '2003-10-25 12:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(461718, 43365, 11800, '<td valign="top">The softness works for this to remind me that it was a child that lost his/her fav buddy. Also like the color. Composition excellent. The only thing on the dreaded negative side is the placement of the bear. I think it would look more lonely if it wasn''t so perfectly upright and perfectly againt the wall.</td>', 'The softness works for this to remind me that it was a child that lost his/her fav buddy. Also like the color. Composition excellent. The only thing on the dreaded negative side is the placement of the bear. I think it would look more lonely if it wasn''t so perfectly upright and perfectly againt the wall.', '2003-10-25 12:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(461722, 43388, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear. The shadows work well in the composition. The perspective is great. Challenge well met.<br/>If I may comment on things that I see that might be improved. The thing on the bottom is distracting.  The alignment seems to be off.</td>', 'Nice and clear. The shadows work well in the composition. The perspective is great. Challenge well met.If I may comment on things that I see that might be improved. The thing on the bottom is distracting.  The alignment seems to be off.', '2003-10-25 13:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
