(461756, 43277, 4008, '<td valign="top">does not give the feeling of loneliness to me. Judging as a mushroom picture : Sharpness and color is fine, composition is bang in the middle. Should have cleaned the grass off the mushroom. Unattractive specimen.</td>', 'does not give the feeling of loneliness to me. Judging as a mushroom picture : Sharpness and color is fine, composition is bang in the middle. Should have cleaned the grass off the mushroom. Unattractive specimen.', '2003-10-25 14:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
