(461823, 42587, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color. I like how you have it framed. The only negative is the pole and to a leser degree, the clothespins. It''s pretty hard to avoid obstacles sometimes. Just a suggestion, but maybe if you had gotten a little closer, you might have been able to work around the post.</td>', 'Beautiful color. I like how you have it framed. The only negative is the pole and to a leser degree, the clothespins. It''s pretty hard to avoid obstacles sometimes. Just a suggestion, but maybe if you had gotten a little closer, you might have been able to work around the post.', '2003-10-25 18:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(461831, 42509, 10402, '<td valign="top">The pixelation gives a soft feel that I rather like. But there is nothing to draw attention to the model, who is too inconspicuous.</td>', 'The pixelation gives a soft feel that I rather like. But there is nothing to draw attention to the model, who is too inconspicuous.', '2003-10-25 18:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(461832, 43287, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very original idea. Very good composition. Very good colors. Like the dof. <br/>negative, it''s a personal thing so feel very free to ignore it.  I would like to see more of the flower head in focus.</td>', 'Very original idea. Very good composition. Very good colors. Like the dof. negative, it''s a personal thing so feel very free to ignore it.  I would like to see more of the flower head in focus.', '2003-10-25 18:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(461833, 42382, 10402, '<td valign="top">The boy is little, but he stands out and the lines in the photo draw the eye right to him. The rocks themselves have interesting textures and shapes, but I don''t think they compete too strongly for the center of interest, which is clearly the boy. Great photo and nice title.</td>', 'The boy is little, but he stands out and the lines in the photo draw the eye right to him. The rocks themselves have interesting textures and shapes, but I don''t think they compete too strongly for the center of interest, which is clearly the boy. Great photo and nice title.', '2003-10-25 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(461834, 43403, 10402, '<td valign="top">A poignant image that conveys loneliness very well. Good lighting and composition.</td>', 'A poignant image that conveys loneliness very well. Good lighting and composition.', '2003-10-25 19:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(461836, 43392, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space, which the frame defines very well.</td>', 'Good use of negative space, which the frame defines very well.', '2003-10-25 19:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(461837, 42869, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition and the feeling this photo conveys. The light cloud behind part of the tree is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the overall composition and the feeling this photo conveys. The light cloud behind part of the tree is a bit distracting.', '2003-10-25 19:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(461839, 42801, 10402, '<td valign="top">I''ll allow that the bridge is "all alone", but this doesn''t really give me a feeling of either loneliness or solitude.</td>', 'I''ll allow that the bridge is "all alone", but this doesn''t really give me a feeling of either loneliness or solitude.', '2003-10-25 19:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(461840, 43299, 10402, '<td valign="top">The shape of the tree makes a great silhouette and the cloudy sky make a nice background for it.</td>', 'The shape of the tree makes a great silhouette and the cloudy sky make a nice background for it.', '2003-10-25 19:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(461841, 43386, 10402, '<td valign="top">The center of interest is the tower at the end of the jetty, where the man is headed for some solitude or loneliness. Great lighting. Slightly tilted.</td>', 'The center of interest is the tower at the end of the jetty, where the man is headed for some solitude or loneliness. Great lighting. Slightly tilted.', '2003-10-25 19:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(461842, 43076, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the silvertones of this image, the shape of the mouse adds to the interest and it fits the challenge in its alone nature.  I don''t get the feeling of solitude or loneliness from it though.  I like the lighting, but I wish the focus was equal throughout since the subject is so prominent.  Nicely done.  7</td>', 'I like the silvertones of this image, the shape of the mouse adds to the interest and it fits the challenge in its alone nature.  I don''t get the feeling of solitude or loneliness from it though.  I like the lighting, but I wish the focus was equal throughout since the subject is so prominent.  Nicely done.  7', '2003-10-25 19:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(461844, 42617, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good solid image, well composed.  I like the contrast of the colors vs the black &amp; white cow.  I wish the colors were a bit more vivid however.  Lighting looks a bit off which may account for the slight dulling of the leaves.  Fits the challenge well.  Nice job!</td>', 'Good solid image, well composed.  I like the contrast of the colors vs the black & white cow.  I wish the colors were a bit more vivid however.  Lighting looks a bit off which may account for the slight dulling of the leaves.  Fits the challenge well.  Nice job!', '2003-10-25 19:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(461845, 42586, 10402, '<td valign="top">The wonderful composition and beautiful scenery with a single person convey solitude very well. The mist gives it a dreamy quality.</td>', 'The wonderful composition and beautiful scenery with a single person convey solitude very well. The mist gives it a dreamy quality.', '2003-10-25 19:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(461846, 42868, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great colors and I like the focus.  I think the lighting is good, though the slight glare off the collar is a bit distracting.  The subject is good - the title helps bring the sense of solitude to the image, fits the challenge very well.  Solid photo.  6</td>', 'Great colors and I like the focus.  I think the lighting is good, though the slight glare off the collar is a bit distracting.  The subject is good - the title helps bring the sense of solitude to the image, fits the challenge very well.  Solid photo.  6', '2003-10-25 19:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(461847, 42589, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I think this is a very emotive image.  The black &amp; white choice was perfect, helps convey the mood nicely.  I do think its a little too dark - a shade lighter would still capture the thought behind the photo but also allow more detail to be seen I think.  Very nicely done.  7</td>', 'Nice composition.  I think this is a very emotive image.  The black & white choice was perfect, helps convey the mood nicely.  I do think its a little too dark - a shade lighter would still capture the thought behind the photo but also allow more detail to be seen I think.  Very nicely done.  7', '2003-10-25 19:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(461848, 43084, 11923, '<td valign="top">The subject certainly looks alone, the perspective and long shot helps support that.  The lighting helps with the details, though I wish the woman was a bit sharper focus-wise.  Also there seems like a slight tilt to the image, I can''t tell if that was purposeful or not - but I find it a distractant instead of helping the photo.  Other than that, its a really sound capture.  Well done.  6</td>', 'The subject certainly looks alone, the perspective and long shot helps support that.  The lighting helps with the details, though I wish the woman was a bit sharper focus-wise.  Also there seems like a slight tilt to the image, I can''t tell if that was purposeful or not - but I find it a distractant instead of helping the photo.  Other than that, its a really sound capture.  Well done.  6', '2003-10-25 19:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(461850, 42541, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice use of space and perspective, but the subject gets a little lost in the vastness to me.  Perhaps being a shade closer would help.  Good use of the light, the pale colors are good too.  Would like a little sharper image.  I really enjoy the expansive feeling of the shot.  Good job.  6</td>', 'Nice use of space and perspective, but the subject gets a little lost in the vastness to me.  Perhaps being a shade closer would help.  Good use of the light, the pale colors are good too.  Would like a little sharper image.  I really enjoy the expansive feeling of the shot.  Good job.  6', '2003-10-25 19:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(461853, 42432, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation!  I love the color difference, it is afterall what makes the shot work for ''all alone''.   I think more of the green/brown trees surrounding would help enhance that feeling - not sure if a wider shot was possible.  Also, I wish the tones were a bit lighter, I think it would''ve boosted the colors just a bit.  Other than that, I like the composition and vision behind the image.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Nice interpretation!  I love the color difference, it is afterall what makes the shot work for ''all alone''.   I think more of the green/brown trees surrounding would help enhance that feeling - not sure if a wider shot was possible.  Also, I wish the tones were a bit lighter, I think it would''ve boosted the colors just a bit.  Other than that, I like the composition and vision behind the image.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-25 19:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(461856, 42866, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I love the b&amp;w choice, really gives the image more of an edge.  The posture of the subject against the gritty background is fabulous, helps tie-in and give truth to the title.  Focus is pretty good, seems a bit soft on the model and really good on the background though.  Not sure if that was purposeful or not.  I''d rather it the other way around.   Use of light is excellent.  One of my favorites this go around.  Wonderful work!  9</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I love the b&w choice, really gives the image more of an edge.  The posture of the subject against the gritty background is fabulous, helps tie-in and give truth to the title.  Focus is pretty good, seems a bit soft on the model and really good on the background though.  Not sure if that was purposeful or not.  I''d rather it the other way around.   Use of light is excellent.  One of my favorites this go around.  Wonderful work!  9', '2003-10-25 19:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(461857, 42405, 11923, '<td valign="top">The lighting, focus and overall composition of this shot is very nice.  I also like the b&amp;w aspect of it.  Unfortunately, I''m not getting the feeling of loneliness indicated by the title.  Also, the presence of two mannequins in the window really throws me off of the ''all alone'' feeling to.  I think you''ve done a great job on the technical side, but I''m not getting the emotion the challenge alludes to.  7</td>', 'The lighting, focus and overall composition of this shot is very nice.  I also like the b&w aspect of it.  Unfortunately, I''m not getting the feeling of loneliness indicated by the title.  Also, the presence of two mannequins in the window really throws me off of the ''all alone'' feeling to.  I think you''ve done a great job on the technical side, but I''m not getting the emotion the challenge alludes to.  7', '2003-10-25 19:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(461859, 43134, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice image.  I like the color vs. the pale rocks.  I also like the overall natural feel of the scenery.  Fits the challenge very well.  The lighting is a bit too harsh for my tastes, especially where it glares on the rock next to your subject, draws the eyes away from him and to the rock instead.  A sharper focus on the subject might spotlight him better so he doesn''t blend too much into his background.  Nice job!  6</td>', 'A nice image.  I like the color vs. the pale rocks.  I also like the overall natural feel of the scenery.  Fits the challenge very well.  The lighting is a bit too harsh for my tastes, especially where it glares on the rock next to your subject, draws the eyes away from him and to the rock instead.  A sharper focus on the subject might spotlight him better so he doesn''t blend too much into his background.  Nice job!  6', '2003-10-25 19:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(461862, 43081, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting portrayal.  Fits the challenge very well, with a nice use of light and space.  I do think the focus could be a little sharper though.  Excellent vision.  Well done.  8</td>', 'An interesting portrayal.  Fits the challenge very well, with a nice use of light and space.  I do think the focus could be a little sharper though.  Excellent vision.  Well done.  8', '2003-10-25 19:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
