(461917, 43357, 11410, '<td valign="top">aww.  nicely shows how much the new boy feels like he sticks out, or how much we all feel like we stick out when we''re new.</td>', 'aww.  nicely shows how much the new boy feels like he sticks out, or how much we all feel like we stick out when we''re new.', '2003-10-25 20:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(461918, 43057, 11410, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2003-10-25 20:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(461921, 43269, 208, '<td valign="top">It seems to me the picture tries too hard to be "Art" with a capital "A." I don''t mind staged shots, but this one seems *too* staged. It doesn''t seem real or honest. Sorry. I do like the composition, though. The placement of your subject heightens the feeling you''re going for.</td>', 'It seems to me the picture tries too hard to be "Art" with a capital "A." I don''t mind staged shots, but this one seems *too* staged. It doesn''t seem real or honest. Sorry. I do like the composition, though. The placement of your subject heightens the feeling you''re going for.', '2003-10-25 21:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(461923, 42589, 10402, '<td valign="top">Playing a guitar is a lot more fun when there is someone else there to hear you! This photo is well done. The model''s pose and the low key approach help convey his loneliness to the viewer. The noise helps too, although I think that is a bit overdone.</td>', 'Playing a guitar is a lot more fun when there is someone else there to hear you! This photo is well done. The model''s pose and the low key approach help convey his loneliness to the viewer. The noise helps too, although I think that is a bit overdone.', '2003-10-25 21:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(461925, 43261, 10402, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice is that most everything is blurry, including the subject. Using DOF to defocus the foreground and background helps make the subject stand out, but only if the subject itself is in focus. This would have been a nice photo if that was the case.</td>', 'The first thing I notice is that most everything is blurry, including the subject. Using DOF to defocus the foreground and background helps make the subject stand out, but only if the subject itself is in focus. This would have been a nice photo if that was the case.', '2003-10-25 21:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(461926, 42542, 12674, '<td valign="top">Posture of the bird  helps capture the theme...</td>', 'Posture of the bird  helps capture the theme...', '2003-10-25 21:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(461928, 42532, 10402, '<td valign="top">Ironic title! And a beautiful photo, although it seems a bit flat; a contrast boost might give it more depth.</td>', 'Ironic title! And a beautiful photo, although it seems a bit flat; a contrast boost might give it more depth.', '2003-10-25 21:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(461931, 42953, 10402, '<td valign="top">Well posed and composed. The lighting makes the subject seem too light in contrast with the dark background. But that''s a minor point; this photo expresses solitude very well.</td>', 'Well posed and composed. The lighting makes the subject seem too light in contrast with the dark background. But that''s a minor point; this photo expresses solitude very well.', '2003-10-25 21:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(461932, 42857, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice photo...might be improved by recropping to straighten horizon</td>', 'Nice photo...might be improved by recropping to straighten horizon', '2003-10-25 21:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(461936, 42821, 10402, '<td valign="top">Not exactly what the challenge asked for, but I like the panorama format and the composition. The border is too wide in comparison with the image; a thinner one would be less distracting.</td>', 'Not exactly what the challenge asked for, but I like the panorama format and the composition. The border is too wide in comparison with the image; a thinner one would be less distracting.', '2003-10-25 22:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(461942, 43260, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like this approach, but don''t think it was executed very well here. (Sorry to be critical.) The model appears to be looking up at the top of the window like he sees something there, which detracts from the feeling of introspection. Compositionally, I think the model would be better placed further right rather than in the center. Technically, the background needs a bit more contrast, which is difficult since the inside is so dark in comparison but a little tweaking with curves might help.</td>', 'I like this approach, but don''t think it was executed very well here. (Sorry to be critical.) The model appears to be looking up at the top of the window like he sees something there, which detracts from the feeling of introspection. Compositionally, I think the model would be better placed further right rather than in the center. Technically, the background needs a bit more contrast, which is difficult since the inside is so dark in comparison but a little tweaking with curves might help.', '2003-10-25 22:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(461943, 42892, 10402, '<td valign="top">The pose is nice, but the focus is on the background which is too distracting.</td>', 'The pose is nice, but the focus is on the background which is too distracting.', '2003-10-25 22:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(461945, 42803, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph.  Excellent use of light, the black &amp; white makes it even more powerful.  Great focus, and composition.  I don''t necessarily see loneliness, but there looks like a sadness in her eyes.  Fits the challenge well.  What a wonderful image.  8</td>', 'Beautiful photograph.  Excellent use of light, the black & white makes it even more powerful.  Great focus, and composition.  I don''t necessarily see loneliness, but there looks like a sadness in her eyes.  Fits the challenge well.  What a wonderful image.  8', '2003-10-25 22:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(461946, 43209, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  Great colors, use of natural light is good.  Fits the challenge well.  Seems to be a bit soft focused, would prefer more sharpness on the child.  Nice solid image.  6</td>', 'What a cutie!  Great colors, use of natural light is good.  Fits the challenge well.  Seems to be a bit soft focused, would prefer more sharpness on the child.  Nice solid image.  6', '2003-10-25 22:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(461948, 42636, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great coloring too - helps make the mood.  Model''s pose furthers this as well.  Lighting and focus looks good.  A nice solid image.  I''m not sure about the border though, distracts for me a little.  7</td>', 'Nice composition, great coloring too - helps make the mood.  Model''s pose furthers this as well.  Lighting and focus looks good.  A nice solid image.  I''m not sure about the border though, distracts for me a little.  7', '2003-10-25 22:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(461949, 42659, 10402, '<td valign="top">The animal does look rather lonely. Good focus and DOF. But I think the low contrast detracts from the effect in this photo.</td>', 'The animal does look rather lonely. Good focus and DOF. But I think the low contrast detracts from the effect in this photo.', '2003-10-25 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(461951, 43420, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, what dramatic clouds.  I love the play between the gigantic nature of the clouds and the small bird.   The black &amp; white aspect works nicely.  Looks almost like a painting.  7</td>', 'Wow, what dramatic clouds.  I love the play between the gigantic nature of the clouds and the small bird.   The black & white aspect works nicely.  Looks almost like a painting.  7', '2003-10-25 22:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(461952, 42696, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  I love the colors and the play on the title.  Great lighting and focus is nice.  I even like the border.   Well done.  8</td>', 'Great photo!  I love the colors and the play on the title.  Great lighting and focus is nice.  I even like the border.   Well done.  8', '2003-10-25 22:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(461954, 43413, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  The sharp lines make for an interesting background.  Fits the challenge really well.  Great focus, black &amp; white definitely adds to the image. Nice emotion displayed.   Wonderful all around.  8</td>', 'Very nice photo.  The sharp lines make for an interesting background.  Fits the challenge really well.  Great focus, black & white definitely adds to the image. Nice emotion displayed.   Wonderful all around.  8', '2003-10-25 22:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
