(461960, 42886, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is a fantastic image.  Has a wonderful solitude feeling, but in a positive light.  Different from many of the other entries.  I love the silhouette and the color and lighting are perfect.  Very nicely done.  I hope you make this available as a print.  10</td>', 'Wow!  This is a fantastic image.  Has a wonderful solitude feeling, but in a positive light.  Different from many of the other entries.  I love the silhouette and the color and lighting are perfect.  Very nicely done.  I hope you make this available as a print.  10', '2003-10-25 22:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(461961, 42376, 12611, '<td valign="top">this photo makes me feel creepy. too many elements for the b and w to handle. the subject looks dead not sleeping or resting- and that makes for one hell of a creepy photo</td>', 'this photo makes me feel creepy. too many elements for the b and w to handle. the subject looks dead not sleeping or resting- and that makes for one hell of a creepy photo', '2003-10-25 22:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
