(461967, 42909, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice emotive image.  I like the overall color tone, good lighting.  Focus is good, but I''d rather the toothbrush be completely in focus.  Fits the challenge well.  Nice solid image.  6</td>', 'Nice emotive image.  I like the overall color tone, good lighting.  Focus is good, but I''d rather the toothbrush be completely in focus.  Fits the challenge well.  Nice solid image.  6', '2003-10-25 22:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(461968, 43093, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Colors are wonderful.  Excellent silhouette.  The alone aspect is perfect.  Nicely done.  8</td>', 'Great image!  Colors are wonderful.  Excellent silhouette.  The alone aspect is perfect.  Nicely done.  8', '2003-10-25 22:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(461970, 43063, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I like all the negative space, as well as the b&amp;w use.  Very symbolic and fits the challenge well.  Great lighting, focus looks good.  Nicely done.  8</td>', 'Great image!  I like all the negative space, as well as the b&w use.  Very symbolic and fits the challenge well.  Great lighting, focus looks good.  Nicely done.  8', '2003-10-25 23:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(461971, 43327, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very evocative image.  The facial expression is wonderfully emotive and the use of b&amp;w helps bring the mood out extremely well.  Great lighting and focus.  Well done.  9</td>', 'Very evocative image.  The facial expression is wonderfully emotive and the use of b&w helps bring the mood out extremely well.  Great lighting and focus.  Well done.  9', '2003-10-25 23:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(461972, 43112, 12611, '<td valign="top">you managed to have the reflection be lighter than the subject. That''s not natural-its an awful problem with digital cameras. Also- there is more interesting stuff in the water than above the bridge in the phot. adjust the framing of the shot upward because the viewers neck hurts from looking up to find the sky. Oh yeah the tree in the foreground takes a lot away from the subject, especially because it is a washed out horrible green color. The whole  photo seems to have a green tinge, bordering on annoying. Other than that- its a great photo.</td>', 'you managed to have the reflection be lighter than the subject. That''s not natural-its an awful problem with digital cameras. Also- there is more interesting stuff in the water than above the bridge in the phot. adjust the framing of the shot upward because the viewers neck hurts from looking up to find the sky. Oh yeah the tree in the foreground takes a lot away from the subject, especially because it is a washed out horrible green color. The whole  photo seems to have a green tinge, bordering on annoying. Other than that- its a great photo.', '2003-10-25 23:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(461974, 43132, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, ok I found this to be a cute image.  Fits the challenge on a couple levels.. ;)  The lighting is pretty good, though its kind of harsh in areas.  The colors look bright but there''s something odd about them, I''m not sure what.. does this have a filter of some sort?  Interesting idea.  6</td>', 'Heh, ok I found this to be a cute image.  Fits the challenge on a couple levels.. ;)  The lighting is pretty good, though its kind of harsh in areas.  The colors look bright but there''s something odd about them, I''m not sure what.. does this have a filter of some sort?  Interesting idea.  6', '2003-10-25 23:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(461975, 43409, 12611, '<td valign="top">The clarity on this shot is atrocius. The colors are mottle and the whole shot is lossy. the composition would have much more impact if there was some clarity to the shot and background. It alsmost looks like a 1 megapixel camera was used with a photoshop "watercolor" effect. sorry- about this review- the sky is pretty- I guess you just had to be there.</td>', 'The clarity on this shot is atrocius. The colors are mottle and the whole shot is lossy. the composition would have much more impact if there was some clarity to the shot and background. It alsmost looks like a 1 megapixel camera was used with a photoshop "watercolor" effect. sorry- about this review- the sky is pretty- I guess you just had to be there.', '2003-10-25 23:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(461977, 42594, 12611, '<td valign="top">that must be french for " i should have taken photography lessons "</td>', 'that must be french for " i should have taken photography lessons "', '2003-10-25 23:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(461978, 42837, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Fits the challenge well.  The black &amp; white use is great, nice lighting and focus.  Everything together gives the feeling of solitude nicely.  One thing I don''t like though is the border, looks too busy for me.  Nothing huge though.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Great image!  Fits the challenge well.  The black & white use is great, nice lighting and focus.  Everything together gives the feeling of solitude nicely.  One thing I don''t like though is the border, looks too busy for me.  Nothing huge though.  Well done.  8', '2003-10-25 23:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(461979, 43060, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love this... a pencil? rhubarb? who knows, its great.</td>', 'I love this... a pencil? rhubarb? who knows, its great.', '2003-10-25 23:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(461980, 43393, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, nice use of black &amp; white.  Lighting looks good, pose of the model is good as well.  I wish the image was a little sharper though.  Solid photo.  6</td>', 'Fits the challenge, nice use of black & white.  Lighting looks good, pose of the model is good as well.  I wish the image was a little sharper though.  Solid photo.  6', '2003-10-25 23:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(461981, 42745, 12611, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a bit more meaningful background. I am interestred by the skyline horizon and not the birdhouse.</td>', 'I would have liked a bit more meaningful background. I am interestred by the skyline horizon and not the birdhouse.', '2003-10-25 23:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(461982, 42976, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great use of natural light, excellent focus and the color is crisp and appealing.  I don''t really see a connection to the challenge though.  Broadly there''s one church pictured, but I do not sense a feeling of solitude or loneliness.  Technically, a fabulous picture - just misses the mood the challenge detailed for me.   Still nice look.  7</td>', 'Great use of natural light, excellent focus and the color is crisp and appealing.  I don''t really see a connection to the challenge though.  Broadly there''s one church pictured, but I do not sense a feeling of solitude or loneliness.  Technically, a fabulous picture - just misses the mood the challenge detailed for me.   Still nice look.  7', '2003-10-25 23:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(461983, 42414, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot here. I love the phallic tree in the middle and the super saturation of colors. This shot is a "je ne sais quoi" away from a winner.</td>', 'Beautiful shot here. I love the phallic tree in the middle and the super saturation of colors. This shot is a "je ne sais quoi" away from a winner.', '2003-10-25 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(461985, 43335, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting image.  At first glance it seemed a little busy for me because my eyes were going to the three different focal points.  I think after looking at it longer though, the energy really helps highlight that feeling of alone for each person in the world.  Each person has a distinction either by their focus as with the keyboard guy, the blur of the woman?, or the position of the guy with the bag.  It all works really well for me and I love the b&amp;w use.  Different, and maybe won''t get good scores from others but I think this gets to the essence of all alone and solitude.  Well done.  10   ps.  sorry for the huge paragraph  ;)</td>', 'This is a very interesting image.  At first glance it seemed a little busy for me because my eyes were going to the three different focal points.  I think after looking at it longer though, the energy really helps highlight that feeling of alone for each person in the world.  Each person has a distinction either by their focus as with the keyboard guy, the blur of the woman?, or the position of the guy with the bag.  It all works really well for me and I love the b&w use.  Different, and maybe won''t get good scores from others but I think this gets to the essence of all alone and solitude.  Well done.  10   ps.  sorry for the huge paragraph  ;)', '2003-10-25 23:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(461986, 42862, 12611, '<td valign="top">Creative lighting- I like the halo reflected off the guys back.</td>', 'Creative lighting- I like the halo reflected off the guys back.', '2003-10-25 23:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(461987, 42799, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, use of natural light looks perfect.  I like the expansive feel of the man vs. ocean.  Great human interest.  Fits the challenge very well.  Focus is good, and so is composition.  I find the tilted horizon to be the only major drawback for me.  I can''t tell if it was a deliberate choice, but it does distract for me.  Well done!  7</td>', 'Excellent colors, use of natural light looks perfect.  I like the expansive feel of the man vs. ocean.  Great human interest.  Fits the challenge very well.  Focus is good, and so is composition.  I find the tilted horizon to be the only major drawback for me.  I can''t tell if it was a deliberate choice, but it does distract for me.  Well done!  7', '2003-10-25 23:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(461989, 42820, 12611, '<td valign="top">I especially like the piddle mark to the right of the dog! now you''ll be alone to you control that bladder, rover!</td>', 'I especially like the piddle mark to the right of the dog! now you''ll be alone to you control that bladder, rover!', '2003-10-25 23:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(461991, 43248, 11923, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit of a stretch for the challenge, I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness from the image.  I think its a good photo technically, though.  Nice colors, great use of natural light.  The focus seems a bit soft, but its not a huge deal.  Simply doesn''t connect for me in general interest or under the challenge.  6 due to good tech. merit.</td>', 'Seems a bit of a stretch for the challenge, I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness from the image.  I think its a good photo technically, though.  Nice colors, great use of natural light.  The focus seems a bit soft, but its not a huge deal.  Simply doesn''t connect for me in general interest or under the challenge.  6 due to good tech. merit.', '2003-10-25 23:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(461992, 42854, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this image, as evidenced by the title, but I think it needs to be lightened up just a bit because the image is practically indistinguishable.  That may be what you were looking for artistically, but I can''t determine who or what is alone in the shadows and that really affects my interest in the image.  I think with a little bit more light you could still have the shadow affect, while letting in more detail for the viewer.  3</td>', 'I like the idea behind this image, as evidenced by the title, but I think it needs to be lightened up just a bit because the image is practically indistinguishable.  That may be what you were looking for artistically, but I can''t determine who or what is alone in the shadows and that really affects my interest in the image.  I think with a little bit more light you could still have the shadow affect, while letting in more detail for the viewer.  3', '2003-10-25 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(461993, 42686, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, interesting image.  Fits alone well, though I don''t get a solitary or lonely vibe from it.  Nice lighting, great silhouette work.  I wish the floor was black or another solid color to keep the image in a stark/solid mode.  Also, the thing on the floor on the left (maybe a stand of some sort?) could easily be cropped out.  Nice photo over all.  5</td>', 'Heh, interesting image.  Fits alone well, though I don''t get a solitary or lonely vibe from it.  Nice lighting, great silhouette work.  I wish the floor was black or another solid color to keep the image in a stark/solid mode.  Also, the thing on the floor on the left (maybe a stand of some sort?) could easily be cropped out.  Nice photo over all.  5', '2003-10-25 23:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(461994, 43291, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, I like the contrast of the black &amp; white, and the design/texture coming from the static.  Great focus and nice use of light.  However, I don''t think this really fits the all alone challenge - I''m not able to see a connection at least.   Technically a good image, just didn''t connect for me on a challenge level.  7 due to good tech and interesting idea, would''ve been higher if I saw how it fit the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting image, I like the contrast of the black & white, and the design/texture coming from the static.  Great focus and nice use of light.  However, I don''t think this really fits the all alone challenge - I''m not able to see a connection at least.   Technically a good image, just didn''t connect for me on a challenge level.  7 due to good tech and interesting idea, would''ve been higher if I saw how it fit the challenge.', '2003-10-25 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(461995, 42516, 11923, '<td valign="top">Yikes.. remodelling?  Fits alone in general, though I don''t get the feeling of loneliness or solitude from the image.  Good lighting, though I think it''d be better a little brighter, colors show well.  Nice focus.  Cute title.  5</td>', 'Yikes.. remodelling?  Fits alone in general, though I don''t get the feeling of loneliness or solitude from the image.  Good lighting, though I think it''d be better a little brighter, colors show well.  Nice focus.  Cute title.  5', '2003-10-25 23:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(461996, 42936, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image, nice emotional impact.  Definitely fits the all alone description.  Use of black &amp; white is exceptional as is the lighting and focus.  Very well done.  This is such a sad image especially with the title, made an immediate connection.  10</td>', 'Great image, nice emotional impact.  Definitely fits the all alone description.  Use of black & white is exceptional as is the lighting and focus.  Very well done.  This is such a sad image especially with the title, made an immediate connection.  10', '2003-10-25 23:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(461998, 43187, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lloyd Center?  Great light image.  The zamboni man is always a lonely man.  Fits the challenge well.  Good use of space and nice focus.  6</td>', 'Lloyd Center?  Great light image.  The zamboni man is always a lonely man.  Fits the challenge well.  Good use of space and nice focus.  6', '2003-10-25 23:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(461999, 42792, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice image!  I like all the different textures shown.  The orange leaf against the dark background really makes the image pop too.  Fits alone, there is a bit of a lonely feel of it to me.  Good lighting, nice focus.  Put together a very sound image.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Nice image!  I like all the different textures shown.  The orange leaf against the dark background really makes the image pop too.  Fits alone, there is a bit of a lonely feel of it to me.  Good lighting, nice focus.  Put together a very sound image.  Well done.  8', '2003-10-25 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(462000, 42484, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very motive image.  Fits the alone and the inherent sadness brings out the lonely/solitary feelings.  Good use of the light and b&amp;w choice.  Nice focus.  Well composed.  8</td>', 'Very motive image.  Fits the alone and the inherent sadness brings out the lonely/solitary feelings.  Good use of the light and b&w choice.  Nice focus.  Well composed.  8', '2003-10-25 23:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(462002, 42752, 11923, '<td valign="top">How pretty!  Nice use of focus, really highlights its singularity.  Great natural lighting, excellent colors.  Composed very nicely, good use of space, etc.  I even like the border.  Simply lovely.  10</td>', 'How pretty!  Nice use of focus, really highlights its singularity.  Great natural lighting, excellent colors.  Composed very nicely, good use of space, etc.  I even like the border.  Simply lovely.  10', '2003-10-26 00:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(462005, 42735, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and nice focus.  Fits the challenge in general, not sure I get a lonely or solitude feeling from it.  May be the warm lighting.  The lighting is good, though it seems a little harsh on the shirt and shoes.  A lovely image all the same.  7</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and nice focus.  Fits the challenge in general, not sure I get a lonely or solitude feeling from it.  May be the warm lighting.  The lighting is good, though it seems a little harsh on the shirt and shoes.  A lovely image all the same.  7', '2003-10-26 00:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(462015, 43402, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great macro.Focus good.  I don''t know that the border adds to it but neither does it take away.  Over all like the photo.  Just not a first place excitement.</td>', 'Great macro.Focus good.  I don''t know that the border adds to it but neither does it take away.  Over all like the photo.  Just not a first place excitement.', '2003-10-26 00:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(462016, 43219, 4648, '<td valign="top">Like the colors.  Title not needed.  Good content and like the crop.  Nice 8</td>', 'Like the colors.  Title not needed.  Good content and like the crop.  Nice 8', '2003-10-26 00:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(462017, 42858, 7570, '<td valign="top">sure gets the message through, this photo! 7</td>', 'sure gets the message through, this photo! 7', '2003-10-26 00:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(462018, 42659, 4648, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see if he is alone or not.  Crop to tight.  Need to pull back and see the whole prairie dog.</td>', 'Can''t really see if he is alone or not.  Crop to tight.  Need to pull back and see the whole prairie dog.', '2003-10-26 00:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(462025, 43275, 10402, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better with the kitten in focus and the sign blurry.</td>', 'I think it would have been better with the kitten in focus and the sign blurry.', '2003-10-26 00:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(462027, 43213, 12735, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. You should consider using a better camera to get more detail and sharpness though.</td>', 'Very good shot. You should consider using a better camera to get more detail and sharpness though.', '2003-10-26 00:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(462028, 43331, 11538, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe how disturbing I found this photo.... it certainly made me stop. look. and think.... but I can''t honestly say I like it.</td>', 'I can''t believe how disturbing I found this photo.... it certainly made me stop. look. and think.... but I can''t honestly say I like it.', '2003-10-26 00:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(462031, 43423, 10402, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about loneliness or solitude, but the rock is certainly all alone. The stark contrast in tone, texture, and shape make this a striking photo. The symmetric composition works well. It''s too bad the one face of the rock is burned out; the exposure for the rest of the image is perfect. Perhaps turning it slightly would have helped.</td>', 'I don''t know about loneliness or solitude, but the rock is certainly all alone. The stark contrast in tone, texture, and shape make this a striking photo. The symmetric composition works well. It''s too bad the one face of the rock is burned out; the exposure for the rest of the image is perfect. Perhaps turning it slightly would have helped.', '2003-10-26 01:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(462040, 42543, 10402, '<td valign="top">Alone, yes. Loneliness or solitude, not really. But it''s a striking still life. It tells a story. Great use of color, good lighting and composition.</td>', 'Alone, yes. Loneliness or solitude, not really. But it''s a striking still life. It tells a story. Great use of color, good lighting and composition.', '2003-10-26 01:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(462047, 42794, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait of a candle that, to me at least, does convey a sense of solitude. Perhaps because it is a single candle viewed from an angle that a person using it for meditation would use; I don''t know. But I like it. Good composition and exposure. My only complaint is that I find the bits of old wick and the dust at the right edge rather distracting. Removing them would have made a better image.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait of a candle that, to me at least, does convey a sense of solitude. Perhaps because it is a single candle viewed from an angle that a person using it for meditation would use; I don''t know. But I like it. Good composition and exposure. My only complaint is that I find the bits of old wick and the dust at the right edge rather distracting. Removing them would have made a better image.', '2003-10-26 01:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(462048, 43269, 10402, '<td valign="top">The stark composition, low key, and the model''s pose and nudity do suggest a breakdown and the loneliness associated with it. Not a pretty photo, but a moving one.</td>', 'The stark composition, low key, and the model''s pose and nudity do suggest a breakdown and the loneliness associated with it. Not a pretty photo, but a moving one.', '2003-10-26 01:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(462050, 43338, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot with perfect focus, excellent composition, and good lighting. He may be all alone, but I just don''t get a feeling of loneliness or solitude.</td>', 'Great macro shot with perfect focus, excellent composition, and good lighting. He may be all alone, but I just don''t get a feeling of loneliness or solitude.', '2003-10-26 01:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(462051, 43199, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot with good composition and focus, although I personally think unsalted peanuts are more photogenic. But although the peanut is certainly alone, I just don''t get a feeling of loneliness or solitude. I want to eat the nut and go search for another bag.</td>', 'Good macro shot with good composition and focus, although I personally think unsalted peanuts are more photogenic. But although the peanut is certainly alone, I just don''t get a feeling of loneliness or solitude. I want to eat the nut and go search for another bag.', '2003-10-26 01:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(462052, 42761, 10402, '<td valign="top">The bird is blurry which makes him hard to see. Cropping off the piling at the right edge would have given a stronger feeling of loneliness, as would shooting from a lower angle to get more of the open ocean (assume there weren''t any boats or other birds).</td>', 'The bird is blurry which makes him hard to see. Cropping off the piling at the right edge would have given a stronger feeling of loneliness, as would shooting from a lower angle to get more of the open ocean (assume there weren''t any boats or other birds).', '2003-10-26 01:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(462053, 42863, 10402, '<td valign="top">A striking image, well executed. But sorry, I just don''t get a feeling of solitude from it.</td>', 'A striking image, well executed. But sorry, I just don''t get a feeling of solitude from it.', '2003-10-26 01:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(462054, 43194, 7778, '<td valign="top">Pure Joy!</td>', 'Pure Joy!', '2003-10-26 01:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(462057, 43207, 7778, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. Wonderful diminishing perspective. It is a delightfully joyous solitude. The fact, that the girl appears subordinated to its vast environment is especially poignant! I have nothing to add.</td>', 'Lovely capture. Wonderful diminishing perspective. It is a delightfully joyous solitude. The fact, that the girl appears subordinated to its vast environment is especially poignant! I have nothing to add.', '2003-10-26 01:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(462058, 43188, 10402, '<td valign="top">There are leaves, so I wouldn''t call it "dead", just "dormant". It''s shape contrasts well with the sky, but the effect is diluted by the low contrast of this image, which to me doesn''t do anything to help the image.</td>', 'There are leaves, so I wouldn''t call it "dead", just "dormant". It''s shape contrasts well with the sky, but the effect is diluted by the low contrast of this image, which to me doesn''t do anything to help the image.', '2003-10-26 01:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(462060, 43057, 7778, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contemporary, almost -urbane- feel due to this gloriously simple capture and, certainly, Italian in manner and composition. :-)<br/> <br/>The position of the two strollers under the umbrella is boldly unconventional but sensible in terms of the given tonal balance. One of the most exciting photos I''ve seen for a while.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderful contemporary, almost -urbane- feel due to this gloriously simple capture and, certainly, Italian in manner and composition. :-) The position of the two strollers under the umbrella is boldly unconventional but sensible in terms of the given tonal balance. One of the most exciting photos I''ve seen for a while. ', '2003-10-26 01:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(462062, 42610, 10402, '<td valign="top">A very dramatic sky (judicious application of curves could increase the contrast and make it even more dramatic), and the silhouetted streetlights add an element of interest. I like this photo. But I don''t see much relevance to the challenge.</td>', 'A very dramatic sky (judicious application of curves could increase the contrast and make it even more dramatic), and the silhouetted streetlights add an element of interest. I like this photo. But I don''t see much relevance to the challenge.', '2003-10-26 01:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(462064, 43287, 10402, '<td valign="top">A very creative approach for the challenge, perfectly executed.</td>', 'A very creative approach for the challenge, perfectly executed.', '2003-10-26 01:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(462065, 42939, 10402, '<td valign="top">The pose seems forced; perhaps if the model was walking it would seem more natural. Being on the crest of the hill, there is only the merest suggestion of a road; showing a long stretch of empty road would have conveyed more feeling of loneliness. Sorry to be critical.</td>', 'The pose seems forced; perhaps if the model was walking it would seem more natural. Being on the crest of the hill, there is only the merest suggestion of a road; showing a long stretch of empty road would have conveyed more feeling of loneliness. Sorry to be critical.', '2003-10-26 01:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(462077, 43038, 13537, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but seems a little bit out of focus?</td>', 'Not bad, but seems a little bit out of focus?', '2003-10-26 02:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(462078, 42403, 13537, '<td valign="top">Good.  I like the B/W</td>', 'Good.  I like the B/W', '2003-10-26 02:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(462079, 43413, 13537, '<td valign="top">This makes you think.  Is he thinking about jumping from the bridge.  A lot can be read into this.  Good composition.  The B/W adds to the dispare.</td>', 'This makes you think.  Is he thinking about jumping from the bridge.  A lot can be read into this.  Good composition.  The B/W adds to the dispare.', '2003-10-26 02:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(462080, 42939, 13537, '<td valign="top">Good... but I think I would like it better if they were walking.</td>', 'Good... but I think I would like it better if they were walking.', '2003-10-26 02:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(462081, 42606, 13537, '<td valign="top">Who hasn''t been there...  B/W might help too.</td>', 'Who hasn''t been there...  B/W might help too.', '2003-10-26 02:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(462082, 43385, 13537, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t do anything for me.  He needs a different expression on his face?  Not sure.</td>', 'Doesn''t do anything for me.  He needs a different expression on his face?  Not sure.', '2003-10-26 02:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(462083, 42609, 13537, '<td valign="top">Try this in b/w and a little softer focus.  Good overall.</td>', 'Try this in b/w and a little softer focus.  Good overall.', '2003-10-26 02:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(462084, 43241, 13537, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Unfortunate about the flash shadow.  A shot of the face would have been good too.</td>', 'Great idea!  Unfortunate about the flash shadow.  A shot of the face would have been good too.', '2003-10-26 02:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(462085, 43030, 13537, '<td valign="top">Good... I like the Silhouette of the balloon, but I think just a touch of detail of the balloon would be better.</td>', 'Good... I like the Silhouette of the balloon, but I think just a touch of detail of the balloon would be better.', '2003-10-26 02:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(462087, 43090, 13537, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but somehow needs more.</td>', 'Good idea, but somehow needs more.', '2003-10-26 02:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(462088, 43193, 13537, '<td valign="top">I was hoping for a shot like this.  I think I would have taken a wider view though.</td>', 'I was hoping for a shot like this.  I think I would have taken a wider view though.', '2003-10-26 02:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(462091, 43240, 13537, '<td valign="top">Would have been better in B/W.</td>', 'Would have been better in B/W.', '2003-10-26 02:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(462100, 43331, 12239, '<td valign="top">very nice! completely awesome effects you did there. would like to know details.</td>', 'very nice! completely awesome effects you did there. would like to know details.', '2003-10-26 03:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(462110, 43203, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, hardly all alone though if she''s sitting on her Dad''s (?) knee.<br/> <br/>Like the Scotland top though!!</td>', 'Nice photo, hardly all alone though if she''s sitting on her Dad''s (?) knee. Like the Scotland top though!!', '2003-10-26 04:28:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(462115, 42936, 7531, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a shame! Not sure about the composition here it is a little weak, it does say all alone but perhaps the furniture and other peripheral objects take the focus away.</td>', 'Now that''s a shame! Not sure about the composition here it is a little weak, it does say all alone but perhaps the furniture and other peripheral objects take the focus away.', '2003-10-26 04:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(462116, 42509, 7531, '<td valign="top">Shame about the pixelation here, it is a good composition, taken from a good view point (angle). What resolution is your camera and what post processing have you done?</td>', 'Shame about the pixelation here, it is a good composition, taken from a good view point (angle). What resolution is your camera and what post processing have you done?', '2003-10-26 04:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(462117, 43255, 7531, '<td valign="top">All alone?</td>', 'All alone?', '2003-10-26 04:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(462118, 42742, 7531, '<td valign="top">Over exposed at the top, if you have spot metering use it next time to get a reading from a mid tone. If you did that try playing with the curves in Photoshop or other editor if you have one.</td>', 'Over exposed at the top, if you have spot metering use it next time to get a reading from a mid tone. If you did that try playing with the curves in Photoshop or other editor if you have one.', '2003-10-26 04:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(462119, 43297, 7531, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple and clean but no impact for me, very stockish.</td>', 'Nice and simple and clean but no impact for me, very stockish.', '2003-10-26 04:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(462120, 43380, 7531, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, needs more tonal range, play with the curves a little you might improve it.</td>', 'Nice idea, needs more tonal range, play with the curves a little you might improve it.', '2003-10-26 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(462122, 42587, 7531, '<td valign="top">Way too small to have impact, a good composition none the less, I suspect it''s cropped from a larger shot??</td>', 'Way too small to have impact, a good composition none the less, I suspect it''s cropped from a larger shot??', '2003-10-26 05:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(462127, 42521, 6130, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful.', '2003-10-26 06:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(462128, 42939, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2003-10-26 06:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(462129, 42678, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice and I like it.</td>', 'Nice and I like it.', '2003-10-26 07:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(462131, 43391, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2003-10-26 07:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(462132, 43412, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2003-10-26 07:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(462134, 42799, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2003-10-26 07:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(462135, 43207, 6130, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful.', '2003-10-26 07:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(462141, 42961, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, but the road getting light in the backgrond leads my eyes away from the dog.</td>', 'Very nice idea, but the road getting light in the backgrond leads my eyes away from the dog.', '2003-10-26 08:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(462142, 42857, 10858, '<td valign="top">In my opinion you should have rotated it to get the horizont horizontal, not the bank of the sea. The skew water looks strange and unnatural in the background. The idea is very nice, but if you put him a very little more left (and a bit more of the sky), I think this could be a very good shot to present the rule of thirds. A little bit improve would make this an excellent one I think (as a beginner).</td>', 'In my opinion you should have rotated it to get the horizont horizontal, not the bank of the sea. The skew water looks strange and unnatural in the background. The idea is very nice, but if you put him a very little more left (and a bit more of the sky), I think this could be a very good shot to present the rule of thirds. A little bit improve would make this an excellent one I think (as a beginner).', '2003-10-26 08:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(462146, 42934, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the idea that the slide leads the eye from up to down. :-)</td>', 'I like the idea that the slide leads the eye from up to down. :-)', '2003-10-26 08:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(462151, 43113, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think the dog gets lost in the shadow... Maybe if the photo would be 4 times bigger (2x horizontal, 2x vertical) it wouldn''t disturb me so much. When using such a small subject, I have learned during this challenge that using the rule of thirds can make the shot much-much balanced and pleasant. Try it some other time. :-)</td>', 'I think the dog gets lost in the shadow... Maybe if the photo would be 4 times bigger (2x horizontal, 2x vertical) it wouldn''t disturb me so much. When using such a small subject, I have learned during this challenge that using the rule of thirds can make the shot much-much balanced and pleasant. Try it some other time. :-)', '2003-10-26 08:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(462152, 42850, 10858, '<td valign="top">i like the contrast between the subject being so dark and every other parts of the shot light. :-)</td>', 'i like the contrast between the subject being so dark and every other parts of the shot light. :-)', '2003-10-26 08:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(462155, 42626, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think it''s not so well focused or blurry a bit, I think. Anyway I like the frame, strange one, but a good idea. What disturbs me a lot is that looking the inside of the frame, the ceiling or what is different. You could have played a bit more with orange and yellow inside, make som tries with it. :-) And, at last, could have used a different angle, because the picture is a bit skew to the back. But the idea touched me, and I think this shot could be improved to a very good photo with some practise. :-)</td>', 'I think it''s not so well focused or blurry a bit, I think. Anyway I like the frame, strange one, but a good idea. What disturbs me a lot is that looking the inside of the frame, the ceiling or what is different. You could have played a bit more with orange and yellow inside, make som tries with it. :-) And, at last, could have used a different angle, because the picture is a bit skew to the back. But the idea touched me, and I think this shot could be improved to a very good photo with some practise. :-)', '2003-10-26 08:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(462159, 43297, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful one! Shame I havent''t seen this one in the crowd! :-) I love everything about this shot, the colours, the shades of blue, the composition, being so simple and great, and I guess the use of rules of third was also conscious. Congratulations a much, that''s a 10!</td>', 'Wonderful one! Shame I havent''t seen this one in the crowd! :-) I love everything about this shot, the colours, the shades of blue, the composition, being so simple and great, and I guess the use of rules of third was also conscious. Congratulations a much, that''s a 10!', '2003-10-26 08:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(462160, 43295, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Small photos have a hard time.  This also looks a little tilted, running downhill from L to R.  Your idea is good, just need a little bigger and straighter picture. 6</td>', 'Great idea.  Small photos have a hard time.  This also looks a little tilted, running downhill from L to R.  Your idea is good, just need a little bigger and straighter picture. 6', '2003-10-26 08:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
