(462169, 43379, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed. Good lighting and use of negative space. The pumpkin is certainly all alone, but the feeling this image gives me is more of fear than loneliness or solitude.</td>', 'Great idea and well executed. Good lighting and use of negative space. The pumpkin is certainly all alone, but the feeling this image gives me is more of fear than loneliness or solitude.', '2003-10-26 08:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(462171, 43119, 10858, '<td valign="top">Simple and great! I like the background''s softness against the sharp edges of the... whatever it is, for me it seems like an opened egg shaped object. 9 or 10? Mmm... Sun is shining, I give you 10 (but no way worst than 9).</td>', 'Simple and great! I like the background''s softness against the sharp edges of the... whatever it is, for me it seems like an opened egg shaped object. 9 or 10? Mmm... Sun is shining, I give you 10 (but no way worst than 9).', '2003-10-26 08:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
