(462479, 42909, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very nice interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice interpretation of the challenge.', '2003-10-26 18:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(462480, 43132, 12661, '<td valign="top">Cute. :-)</td>', 'Cute. :-)', '2003-10-26 18:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(462484, 42892, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I like the use of light and b&amp;w.  I think the expression and pose of the subject gives a sadness or despair to the photo which can be linked to loneliness and/or solitude, so it meets the challenge in my eyes.  The focus good, the only thing I don''t like are the things in the background.  I find them destracting.  Nice photo.  7</td>', 'Interesting image.  I like the use of light and b&w.  I think the expression and pose of the subject gives a sadness or despair to the photo which can be linked to loneliness and/or solitude, so it meets the challenge in my eyes.  The focus good, the only thing I don''t like are the things in the background.  I find them destracting.  Nice photo.  7', '2003-10-26 18:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(462485, 42599, 10145, '<td valign="top">Very cool...has an almost surrealistic effect   7</td>', 'Very cool...has an almost surrealistic effect   7', '2003-10-26 18:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(462486, 43303, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, the emptiness of the landscape helps pull in that feeling of solitude and despair.  Composition is nice, dead or denuded tree adds a bit of vulnerability to the photo.  I like the light usage and the b&amp;w.  7</td>', 'Good perspective, the emptiness of the landscape helps pull in that feeling of solitude and despair.  Composition is nice, dead or denuded tree adds a bit of vulnerability to the photo.  I like the light usage and the b&w.  7', '2003-10-26 18:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(462487, 42886, 10145, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...a bit of noise on the water...but otherwise very nice</td>', 'Very pretty...a bit of noise on the water...but otherwise very nice', '2003-10-26 18:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(462490, 43277, 11923, '<td valign="top">What an odd little mushroom!  I love the color, nice and vivid.  Fits the challenge in general, don''t really get a solitude or lonely feel from it.  I think the focus is great and the use of natural light is too.  Would prefer either a slightly skewed view or off-center instead smack dab in the middle, just for added depth and interest.  Nicely done.  6</td>', 'What an odd little mushroom!  I love the color, nice and vivid.  Fits the challenge in general, don''t really get a solitude or lonely feel from it.  I think the focus is great and the use of natural light is too.  Would prefer either a slightly skewed view or off-center instead smack dab in the middle, just for added depth and interest.  Nicely done.  6', '2003-10-26 18:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(462491, 42589, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is very dark...a little too dark to see lines and composition properly</td>', 'This is very dark...a little too dark to see lines and composition properly', '2003-10-26 18:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(462492, 42939, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot. I like the view from below on this</td>', 'This is a cool shot. I like the view from below on this', '2003-10-26 18:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(462494, 42510, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good use of the light, interesting image with the fog obscuring the single item in the distance.  Nice use of space.  I find the tree on the right side a large distractant, and the small size detracts a bit for me as well.   Seems to have focus issues but I''m not sure if that''s related to resizing or not.  Nice idea/image, but the technical aspect of it had a negative impact for me.  4</td>', 'Good use of the light, interesting image with the fog obscuring the single item in the distance.  Nice use of space.  I find the tree on the right side a large distractant, and the small size detracts a bit for me as well.   Seems to have focus issues but I''m not sure if that''s related to resizing or not.  Nice idea/image, but the technical aspect of it had a negative impact for me.  4', '2003-10-26 18:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(462500, 42897, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great color and use of natural light.  Looks like a golf course, its so crisp and green.  I like the position of the dog and the wide expanse shown.  Helps bring for and sustain the all alone aspect of the photo.  Focus looks great as does composition.  Only two things I would suggest:  One is a closer crop on the left where it looks like there is a shadow peeking out, nothing major but I did notice it and wonder what it was. Second, would be to crop down so that the sky is not in the photo - instead have it straight green trees across.  The addition of sky makes me notice how much of the trees on either side are cut off at top which is a bit of a detractant, I think with the solid color my noticing would be less.  Just a thought.   Well done.  8</td>', 'Great color and use of natural light.  Looks like a golf course, its so crisp and green.  I like the position of the dog and the wide expanse shown.  Helps bring for and sustain the all alone aspect of the photo.  Focus looks great as does composition.  Only two things I would suggest:  One is a closer crop on the left where it looks like there is a shadow peeking out, nothing major but I did notice it and wonder what it was. Second, would be to crop down so that the sky is not in the photo - instead have it straight green trees across.  The addition of sky makes me notice how much of the trees on either side are cut off at top which is a bit of a detractant, I think with the solid color my noticing would be less.  Just a thought.   Well done.  8', '2003-10-26 18:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(462503, 42778, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between machine and nature, and the composition works very well.  Especially like that the car isn''t right in the middle.  Good play between the muted colors of the ground and the brightness of the clouds and sky.   I think the energy of the piece, looks as if the car is driving somewhere to me, lessens the feeling of solitude/loneliness.. but I do think it fits the ''all alone'' part.  Would prefer a little sharper focus throughout the image.  Other than that, a nice solid photo.  7</td>', 'I like the contrast between machine and nature, and the composition works very well.  Especially like that the car isn''t right in the middle.  Good play between the muted colors of the ground and the brightness of the clouds and sky.   I think the energy of the piece, looks as if the car is driving somewhere to me, lessens the feeling of solitude/loneliness.. but I do think it fits the ''all alone'' part.  Would prefer a little sharper focus throughout the image.  Other than that, a nice solid photo.  7', '2003-10-26 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(462504, 43379, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! Great choice for the challenge and nice composition....8</td>', 'This is awesome! Great choice for the challenge and nice composition....8', '2003-10-26 18:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(462508, 43312, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful</td>', 'This is very beautiful', '2003-10-26 18:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(462509, 42703, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think this one would work well for shadows too.  Nice play of the shadow on the snow, the form is well defined and easy to determine what it is.  Has a good ''story'' to it.  Not sure I feel solitude or lonely from the image though it does fit ''all alone''.  Nice use of natural light, good focus.  A fun and interesting image, well done.  7</td>', 'I think this one would work well for shadows too.  Nice play of the shadow on the snow, the form is well defined and easy to determine what it is.  Has a good ''story'' to it.  Not sure I feel solitude or lonely from the image though it does fit ''all alone''.  Nice use of natural light, good focus.  A fun and interesting image, well done.  7', '2003-10-26 18:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(462510, 42923, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice blue undertone to the photo, carries the rainyday theme well.  The lighting is good and helps give a slight sense of solitude, I like the composition with the subject off to the side instead of in the middle.  Nice focus, good colors.  A sound photo.  7</td>', 'Nice blue undertone to the photo, carries the rainyday theme well.  The lighting is good and helps give a slight sense of solitude, I like the composition with the subject off to the side instead of in the middle.  Nice focus, good colors.  A sound photo.  7', '2003-10-26 18:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(462512, 42850, 10145, '<td valign="top">Nice wide open space shot</td>', 'Nice wide open space shot', '2003-10-26 18:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(462515, 42704, 10145, '<td valign="top">If the subject was removed this would be a great shot for the challenge</td>', 'If the subject was removed this would be a great shot for the challenge', '2003-10-26 18:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(462516, 43416, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, I like the use of focus to help further alienate the single marble.  Colors come out fairly well, lighting is nice too.  I wonder how it would work with the focus point being reversed, if the same solitary feeling would be achieved.  I think the border is a little distracting, mostly because its lighter than the background of the photo and pulls my eyes away.  Nice image.  6</td>', 'Interesting image, I like the use of focus to help further alienate the single marble.  Colors come out fairly well, lighting is nice too.  I wonder how it would work with the focus point being reversed, if the same solitary feeling would be achieved.  I think the border is a little distracting, mostly because its lighter than the background of the photo and pulls my eyes away.  Nice image.  6', '2003-10-26 18:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(462517, 43384, 10145, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...makes me think of fall..can almost feel the cold</td>', 'Very pretty...makes me think of fall..can almost feel the cold', '2003-10-26 18:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(462519, 42391, 10145, '<td valign="top">WAY to dark...may have been a contender if there was a tad more light</td>', 'WAY to dark...may have been a contender if there was a tad more light', '2003-10-26 18:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(462520, 42755, 10145, '<td valign="top">dont think he is forgoTTen....</td>', 'dont think he is forgoTTen....', '2003-10-26 19:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(462521, 42403, 10145, '<td valign="top">Nice panoramic shot</td>', 'Nice panoramic shot', '2003-10-26 19:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(462522, 43380, 11923, '<td valign="top">These are hands that look like they could tell a number of stories.  Nice positioning of them, gives me a sense of worry or upset.  I like the b&amp;w choice, makes the shadows and light really stand out.  Excellent use of light as well.  Great focus, I like the textures shown.   Great image.  9</td>', 'These are hands that look like they could tell a number of stories.  Nice positioning of them, gives me a sense of worry or upset.  I like the b&w choice, makes the shadows and light really stand out.  Excellent use of light as well.  Great focus, I like the textures shown.   Great image.  9', '2003-10-26 19:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(462524, 43297, 10145, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2003-10-26 19:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(462526, 43058, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the vision behind this image.  The lines are wonderful, I like the lighting as well.  I wish the focus was a little sharper though.  Also, the crop of it makes me feel like only part of the story has been told.  I wish more of the couch was shown - I think it would help increase the alone feel if a larger expanse of empty couch was visible.  Nice job.  6</td>', 'I like the vision behind this image.  The lines are wonderful, I like the lighting as well.  I wish the focus was a little sharper though.  Also, the crop of it makes me feel like only part of the story has been told.  I wish more of the couch was shown - I think it would help increase the alone feel if a larger expanse of empty couch was visible.  Nice job.  6', '2003-10-26 19:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(462528, 43420, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is a very majestic shot...this is almost surreal...the bird is dwarfed by the clouds..great photo!   8</td>', 'This is a very majestic shot...this is almost surreal...the bird is dwarfed by the clouds..great photo!   8', '2003-10-26 19:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(462529, 42812, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well, I like the difference in warm and cool tones mixing.  Really helps the man stand out from the background.   The colors are good, use of natural light is good as well. Would like a little more sharpness to the edges. A solid photo.  6</td>', 'Fits the challenge well, I like the difference in warm and cool tones mixing.  Really helps the man stand out from the background.   The colors are good, use of natural light is good as well. Would like a little more sharpness to the edges. A solid photo.  6', '2003-10-26 19:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(462531, 42978, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice image, the model''s expression seems a little distant and/or unhappy.  Could be construed as lonely, so I think it fits the challenge well.  The colors in the background look washed out and the harsh light blown out.  Also, I''d prefer the model to be completely in focus, it seems a bit soft to me.   I like the way the natural lighting brings out the glow in the skin, and the pose is very nice.  5</td>', 'A nice image, the model''s expression seems a little distant and/or unhappy.  Could be construed as lonely, so I think it fits the challenge well.  The colors in the background look washed out and the harsh light blown out.  Also, I''d prefer the model to be completely in focus, it seems a bit soft to me.   I like the way the natural lighting brings out the glow in the skin, and the pose is very nice.  5', '2003-10-26 19:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(462532, 42761, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I like the lighting on both the water and the pillars, gives a good contrast of warm and cool tones.  Fits the challenge fairly well in the ''all alone'' aspect, not sure I feel loneliness or solitude though.  I think if the other pillar were cropped out it would give it a boost in that direct.  I wish the seagull was more in focus/sharper.  Nice composition and a good photo.  Well done.  6</td>', 'Nice capture.  I like the lighting on both the water and the pillars, gives a good contrast of warm and cool tones.  Fits the challenge fairly well in the ''all alone'' aspect, not sure I feel loneliness or solitude though.  I think if the other pillar were cropped out it would give it a boost in that direct.  I wish the seagull was more in focus/sharper.  Nice composition and a good photo.  Well done.  6', '2003-10-26 19:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(462533, 43331, 10145, '<td valign="top">The last drop from the finger seems to be symbolic....the last drop of life or something like it. This is a great photo..</td>', 'The last drop from the finger seems to be symbolic....the last drop of life or something like it. This is a great photo..', '2003-10-26 19:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(462538, 43364, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is funny!  I like the shot.....shoe looks a little worn as well!</td>', 'This is funny!  I like the shot.....shoe looks a little worn as well!', '2003-10-26 19:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(462539, 42745, 11923, '<td valign="top">Looks quite empty and lonely indeed!  I''m guessing flash was used - it lit everything up just right.  Focus is good, colors are well indicated.  I would prefer to not have the branch up in the corner or the pale bit of sky in the background.  Possibly centering the shot a bit lower, so you''d be able to crop out the top and leave in the bottom that''s currently missing is a suggestion.  Also waiting until it is completely nighttime, so that you''d have a nice inky black background would keep the distracting lighter colored corner a non-issue.  Just suggestions of course.  A good image overall.  6</td>', 'Looks quite empty and lonely indeed!  I''m guessing flash was used - it lit everything up just right.  Focus is good, colors are well indicated.  I would prefer to not have the branch up in the corner or the pale bit of sky in the background.  Possibly centering the shot a bit lower, so you''d be able to crop out the top and leave in the bottom that''s currently missing is a suggestion.  Also waiting until it is completely nighttime, so that you''d have a nice inky black background would keep the distracting lighter colored corner a non-issue.  Just suggestions of course.  A good image overall.  6', '2003-10-26 19:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(462540, 43119, 10145, '<td valign="top">I like this shot...very intriguing to me....nice contrast...8</td>', 'I like this shot...very intriguing to me....nice contrast...8', '2003-10-26 19:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(462542, 43303, 10145, '<td valign="top">You know what?   I would get more of a feeling of despair if the tree had no leaves at all on it and the branches were a bit more sparse...</td>', 'You know what?   I would get more of a feeling of despair if the tree had no leaves at all on it and the branches were a bit more sparse...', '2003-10-26 19:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
