(462546, 43365, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot...the composition appears to be almost perfect. It makes one feel like a little girl or boy is out there without their teddybear....8</td>', 'This is a great shot...the composition appears to be almost perfect. It makes one feel like a little girl or boy is out there without their teddybear....8', '2003-10-26 19:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
