(462694, 43297, 7304, '<td valign="top">Fits the alone very well. Excellent composition. Light is right on. I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Fits the alone very well. Excellent composition. Light is right on. I gave it an 8.', '2003-10-26 20:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
