(462699, 43093, 7304, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot. Great idea and it is well executed. Nice color and composition. Works well with the challenge. I gave it an 8.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot. Great idea and it is well executed. Nice color and composition. Works well with the challenge. I gave it an 8.', '2003-10-26 20:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
