(462704, 43086, 7304, '<td valign="top">Unsure about the black background even though it pops the yellow off the page. Great idea.</td>', 'Unsure about the black background even though it pops the yellow off the page. Great idea.', '2003-10-26 20:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(462705, 43379, 7304, '<td valign="top">Great seasonal shot. The expression on the pumpkin is great. Excellent use og light. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Great seasonal shot. The expression on the pumpkin is great. Excellent use og light. I gave it a 7.', '2003-10-26 20:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(462708, 42706, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great focus and use of light.  The colors stand out very nicely against the sky background.  Fits the challenge well.  I like the simplicity of the image.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Great focus and use of light.  The colors stand out very nicely against the sky background.  Fits the challenge well.  I like the simplicity of the image.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-26 21:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(462709, 43323, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image - I like the busy-ness of it.  The different valves and what not make for a nice b&amp;w.  Focus is good, I like the use of light.  I don''t really see a connection with the challenge though, beyond the title.  I don''t know motors so taking the image alone (without the title) nothing says solitude, loneliness or abandoned to me.  Still a good photo.  6</td>', 'An interesting image - I like the busy-ness of it.  The different valves and what not make for a nice b&w.  Focus is good, I like the use of light.  I don''t really see a connection with the challenge though, beyond the title.  I don''t know motors so taking the image alone (without the title) nothing says solitude, loneliness or abandoned to me.  Still a good photo.  6', '2003-10-26 21:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(462712, 42910, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Love the use of space and perspective.  Nice dark mood to it, helps give the feeling of being lost in a vast unknown.  Subject itself gets a bit lost in the background though, wish there was a way to make him/her a little more visible without losing the nice darkness.  Focus is fantastic.   Well done.  7</td>', 'Great image.  Love the use of space and perspective.  Nice dark mood to it, helps give the feeling of being lost in a vast unknown.  Subject itself gets a bit lost in the background though, wish there was a way to make him/her a little more visible without losing the nice darkness.  Focus is fantastic.   Well done.  7', '2003-10-26 21:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(462713, 43087, 11923, '<td valign="top">Girl is certainly alone, but I don''t get a feeling of solitude nor loneliness.  The mood is actually kind of light to me, possibly because the lighting is bright and warm and the posing and action of the subject doesn''t lend itself to a more negative or sad mood.  Colors show well, and its a nice photo, but I don''t connect to it very well.  4</td>', 'Girl is certainly alone, but I don''t get a feeling of solitude nor loneliness.  The mood is actually kind of light to me, possibly because the lighting is bright and warm and the posing and action of the subject doesn''t lend itself to a more negative or sad mood.  Colors show well, and its a nice photo, but I don''t connect to it very well.  4', '2003-10-26 21:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(462716, 42821, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the length of the image, different from many.  The darker lighting helps make the photo moodier and the perspective is good.  I like the composition, but being that its supposed to be all alone, the addition of the second bird throws that off for me.  I understand the sentiment behind the image, I just dont think it works for the essence of this particular challenge.  That said, the first view of the photo is of a bird alone, so you do get that impact in the beginning.  Focus is good on the top bird.  Interesting portrayal, falls short on the challenge for me, but has a very nice unique factor.  6</td>', 'I like the length of the image, different from many.  The darker lighting helps make the photo moodier and the perspective is good.  I like the composition, but being that its supposed to be all alone, the addition of the second bird throws that off for me.  I understand the sentiment behind the image, I just dont think it works for the essence of this particular challenge.  That said, the first view of the photo is of a bird alone, so you do get that impact in the beginning.  Focus is good on the top bird.  Interesting portrayal, falls short on the challenge for me, but has a very nice unique factor.  6', '2003-10-26 21:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(462718, 43108, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of this image.  Excellent focus.  Lighting is good, highlights the subject well.  I think its a unique idea to portray all alone.  I don''t get the feelings of loneliness or solitude mentioned in the challenge details, but I think it still fits the challenge generally.  Well done.  7</td>', 'I love the crispness of this image.  Excellent focus.  Lighting is good, highlights the subject well.  I think its a unique idea to portray all alone.  I don''t get the feelings of loneliness or solitude mentioned in the challenge details, but I think it still fits the challenge generally.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-26 21:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(462722, 42533, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light and b&amp;w.  Gives a good darker mood to the image.  Though the subject isn''t alone, I do get a feeling of solitude.  Focus helps remove the girl from the background, which enhances that feeling.  Very well done.  7</td>', 'Nice use of light and b&w.  Gives a good darker mood to the image.  Though the subject isn''t alone, I do get a feeling of solitude.  Focus helps remove the girl from the background, which enhances that feeling.  Very well done.  7', '2003-10-26 21:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(462727, 42961, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good use of the lighting, focus is good overall.  I like the concept, fits the challenge, but compositionally I think I would''ve preferred to see the dog further along the road.   Taken so close, the feeling of being lost is reduced for me.  I really like the distance shown.  Very nice.  7</td>', 'Good use of the lighting, focus is good overall.  I like the concept, fits the challenge, but compositionally I think I would''ve preferred to see the dog further along the road.   Taken so close, the feeling of being lost is reduced for me.  I really like the distance shown.  Very nice.  7', '2003-10-26 21:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(462729, 43270, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, I love the duotone.  Would like a less tight crop so there''s some breathing room on the left.  Focus is marvelous, I like the lighting as well.  I''m finding only a tenuous connection to a feeling of solitude or loneliness as outlined by the challenge, but it does meet generally.   Lovely work.  7</td>', 'Beautiful image, I love the duotone.  Would like a less tight crop so there''s some breathing room on the left.  Focus is marvelous, I like the lighting as well.  I''m finding only a tenuous connection to a feeling of solitude or loneliness as outlined by the challenge, but it does meet generally.   Lovely work.  7', '2003-10-26 21:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(462733, 43279, 11923, '<td valign="top">Focus is good, lighting works well.  Its an interesting set up in general but I think the image in the mirror looks too busy.  Also the subject loses impact because of the flash and general composition - looks a little thrown together.   I really like the idea though, and think in a different circumstance using that method would work very well (without a big flash light)  ;)  5</td>', 'Focus is good, lighting works well.  Its an interesting set up in general but I think the image in the mirror looks too busy.  Also the subject loses impact because of the flash and general composition - looks a little thrown together.   I really like the idea though, and think in a different circumstance using that method would work very well (without a big flash light)  ;)  5', '2003-10-26 22:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(462738, 43158, 11923, '<td valign="top">Love the use of black &amp; white, posing of the figure is good, helps convey a lonely feeling to me.  Lighting looks great, but I''m seeing a strange aura affect, that I''m not sure if it was from resizing, some kind of filter, or what.  I don''t think it detracts from the image any, it just looks odd to me.  Very nicely done.  8</td>', 'Love the use of black & white, posing of the figure is good, helps convey a lonely feeling to me.  Lighting looks great, but I''m seeing a strange aura affect, that I''m not sure if it was from resizing, some kind of filter, or what.  I don''t think it detracts from the image any, it just looks odd to me.  Very nicely done.  8', '2003-10-26 22:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(462739, 42869, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, good mood set with the lighting and sepia look.  Fits the challenge well.  Has a nice use of space.  Wish the focus was a little sharper, but it looks good overall.  7</td>', 'Nice clarity, good mood set with the lighting and sepia look.  Fits the challenge well.  Has a nice use of space.  Wish the focus was a little sharper, but it looks good overall.  7', '2003-10-26 22:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(462740, 42857, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette.  Nice subject, the colors are wonderful.  Use of natural light is excellent, focus is nice too.   Wonderful interest generated by the subject, works well under the challenge.  7</td>', 'Great silhouette.  Nice subject, the colors are wonderful.  Use of natural light is excellent, focus is nice too.   Wonderful interest generated by the subject, works well under the challenge.  7', '2003-10-26 22:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(462742, 42874, 10402, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few non-human subject that really expresses loneliness well. The composition and exposure are great. The lighting isn''t, but I doubt you had any control over it and you''ve done very well under the conditions.</td>', 'This is one of the few non-human subject that really expresses loneliness well. The composition and exposure are great. The lighting isn''t, but I doubt you had any control over it and you''ve done very well under the conditions.', '2003-10-26 22:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(462743, 43051, 11923, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo!  Great focus, fits the challenge rather well.  Love the contrasting colors.  I wish the image was a little brighter, or if not overall, have the background dark as it currently is, and a shaft of light on the flower.  Very nice capture.  7</td>', 'Pretty photo!  Great focus, fits the challenge rather well.  Love the contrasting colors.  I wish the image was a little brighter, or if not overall, have the background dark as it currently is, and a shaft of light on the flower.  Very nice capture.  7', '2003-10-26 22:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(462744, 43248, 10402, '<td valign="top">This image is elegant in its simplicity. The trees give the hill a great texture. Certainly the hill top is all alone, but I really don''t get a feeling of loneliness or solitude from it.</td>', 'This image is elegant in its simplicity. The trees give the hill a great texture. Certainly the hill top is all alone, but I really don''t get a feeling of loneliness or solitude from it.', '2003-10-26 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(462745, 43136, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great use of space and distance.  B&amp;W color and perspective definitely create the mood and highlight the aloneness.  I like the use of natural light as well.  8</td>', 'Great use of space and distance.  B&W color and perspective definitely create the mood and highlight the aloneness.  I like the use of natural light as well.  8', '2003-10-26 22:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(462747, 43372, 11923, '<td valign="top">Cute image, interesting use of duotone as well.  Not getting a feeling of solitude or loneliness due to the happy tone to the image though.  Fits the challenge generally.  Focus is pretty good, lighting is okay, but a little dark to me.  Also would prefer that white stand thing wasn''t there, definitely distracts.  A fine photo.  5</td>', 'Cute image, interesting use of duotone as well.  Not getting a feeling of solitude or loneliness due to the happy tone to the image though.  Fits the challenge generally.  Focus is pretty good, lighting is okay, but a little dark to me.  Also would prefer that white stand thing wasn''t there, definitely distracts.  A fine photo.  5', '2003-10-26 22:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(462751, 43369, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I like the use of b&amp;w here.  Lighting helps give a nice peaceful, contemplative mood.  Fits the challenge perfectly, and I like the general appeal.  Good use of a natural ''everyday'' space.  The scene looks very pretty as well, I''d love to be sitting there!  Well done.  8</td>', 'Very nice image.  I like the use of b&w here.  Lighting helps give a nice peaceful, contemplative mood.  Fits the challenge perfectly, and I like the general appeal.  Good use of a natural ''everyday'' space.  The scene looks very pretty as well, I''d love to be sitting there!  Well done.  8', '2003-10-26 22:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(462753, 43193, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and nice use of space.  Helps support the all alone feeling of the image.  Nice color, subject stands out nicely.  Lighting is used well and focus is good - would like a bit sharper detail near the subject though.  Overall a very solid image.  7</td>', 'Good perspective and nice use of space.  Helps support the all alone feeling of the image.  Nice color, subject stands out nicely.  Lighting is used well and focus is good - would like a bit sharper detail near the subject though.  Overall a very solid image.  7', '2003-10-26 22:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(462755, 42594, 11923, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand the title, since I only speak &amp; read english so I''m not sure of its significance.   Fits the challenge generally, not really getting a feeling of solitude or loneliness from the image, lighting is pretty good (the flash is a bit distracting), good focus and I like that the subject isn''t completely centered in the photo.  A nice snapshot.  5</td>', 'Don''t understand the title, since I only speak & read english so I''m not sure of its significance.   Fits the challenge generally, not really getting a feeling of solitude or loneliness from the image, lighting is pretty good (the flash is a bit distracting), good focus and I like that the subject isn''t completely centered in the photo.  A nice snapshot.  5', '2003-10-26 23:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(462756, 42862, 10402, '<td valign="top">The low key treatment of the subject is well done and works with the model''s pose and express to express loneliness. The hidden bright light adds interest and mystery.</td>', 'The low key treatment of the subject is well done and works with the model''s pose and express to express loneliness. The hidden bright light adds interest and mystery.', '2003-10-26 23:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(462759, 43078, 11923, '<td valign="top">The blue in this photo is absolutely gorgeous.  Is this augmented or straight from the camera?  Nice perspective, colors are fantastic and I like the focus.  I wish the light wasn''t quite so glaring off the woman''s shirt and skin.  I don''t get a sense of solitude or loneliness from the image, I think the rich warm colors lessen those possible feelings.  Does fit all alone in general to me though.  Very nice photo.  7</td>', 'The blue in this photo is absolutely gorgeous.  Is this augmented or straight from the camera?  Nice perspective, colors are fantastic and I like the focus.  I wish the light wasn''t quite so glaring off the woman''s shirt and skin.  I don''t get a sense of solitude or loneliness from the image, I think the rich warm colors lessen those possible feelings.  Does fit all alone in general to me though.  Very nice photo.  7', '2003-10-26 23:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(462762, 43194, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, the colors are crisp and clear.  Focus is great, I love the feel of the image, a nice energy but still rather peaceful.   I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness though, so it only fits the challenge generally for me.  Still its a gorgeous image.  8</td>', 'Beautiful photo, the colors are crisp and clear.  Focus is great, I love the feel of the image, a nice energy but still rather peaceful.   I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness though, so it only fits the challenge generally for me.  Still its a gorgeous image.  8', '2003-10-26 23:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(462763, 42783, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice evocative photo.  Black &amp; white really draws the emotion out with its starkness.  Use of natural light is great, love the focus, nice and clear.  Only real distracting thing I find is the horizon is tilted so the patch of light sky pulls my eyes away a bit.  Very nice over all though!  7</td>', 'Nice evocative photo.  Black & white really draws the emotion out with its starkness.  Use of natural light is great, love the focus, nice and clear.  Only real distracting thing I find is the horizon is tilted so the patch of light sky pulls my eyes away a bit.  Very nice over all though!  7', '2003-10-26 23:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(462764, 43099, 10402, '<td valign="top">He does seem bored, which is a cousin to loneliness. Nice pose, but cluttered composition and noisy.</td>', 'He does seem bored, which is a cousin to loneliness. Nice pose, but cluttered composition and noisy.', '2003-10-26 23:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(462765, 43117, 2830, '<td valign="top">What about cropping the image on the  top and bottom? It will be different and more interesting, IMO.</td>', 'What about cropping the image on the  top and bottom? It will be different and more interesting, IMO.', '2003-10-26 23:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(462766, 42817, 11923, '<td valign="top">Man, this bird has an evil eye on it.  The colors are nice, at first I thought that was ocean but now it looks like clouds.  Very nice.  The focus on the bird and rock are great, the pale lighting dulls the photo a little bit, but not negatively.  Good job.  7</td>', 'Man, this bird has an evil eye on it.  The colors are nice, at first I thought that was ocean but now it looks like clouds.  Very nice.  The focus on the bird and rock are great, the pale lighting dulls the photo a little bit, but not negatively.  Good job.  7', '2003-10-26 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(462767, 43369, 10402, '<td valign="top">A great location for solitude, although as a viewer I don''t care so much what''s behind the woman as what she might be contemplating.</td>', 'A great location for solitude, although as a viewer I don''t care so much what''s behind the woman as what she might be contemplating.', '2003-10-26 23:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(462769, 43242, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Has a sadness yet is very peaceful as well.  Lighting is harsh in back but I think it works for this image, model has a nice soft glow to her.  I like the composition, would prefer the white thing in the right side to be cropped out - not sure if I like the clothes in the window either, adds some interest but also draws my attention away from the subject.  Excellent focus.  Simply wonderful.  10</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Has a sadness yet is very peaceful as well.  Lighting is harsh in back but I think it works for this image, model has a nice soft glow to her.  I like the composition, would prefer the white thing in the right side to be cropped out - not sure if I like the clothes in the window either, adds some interest but also draws my attention away from the subject.  Excellent focus.  Simply wonderful.  10', '2003-10-26 23:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(462770, 43409, 10402, '<td valign="top">This photo is a good expression of being alone. The composition is OK and the bluish color cast helps create the right mood. But the overall quality is poor; there are lots of artifacts and everything is blurry.</td>', 'This photo is a good expression of being alone. The composition is OK and the bluish color cast helps create the right mood. But the overall quality is poor; there are lots of artifacts and everything is blurry.', '2003-10-26 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(462771, 43275, 11923, '<td valign="top">Aww poor little guy.  Very cute image, he has sad eyes.  Love the black &amp; white, lighting is good.  Would prefer the focus to be on the kitten with the words having the soft blur rather than as is.  Over all an great photo.  8</td>', 'Aww poor little guy.  Very cute image, he has sad eyes.  Love the black & white, lighting is good.  Would prefer the focus to be on the kitten with the words having the soft blur rather than as is.  Over all an great photo.  8', '2003-10-26 23:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(462774, 42956, 10402, '<td valign="top">The chipmunk is cute but being near the edge of the photo, the twig in the central part of the frame competes with it for being the center of interest.</td>', 'The chipmunk is cute but being near the edge of the photo, the twig in the central part of the frame competes with it for being the center of interest.', '2003-10-26 23:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(462777, 43270, 10402, '<td valign="top">The flower is well past its prime, yet still visually interesting, and the interest is enhanced by desaturating the other colors in the image. Great composition, focus, and lighting. But I don''t really get a feeling of loneliness or solitude.</td>', 'The flower is well past its prime, yet still visually interesting, and the interest is enhanced by desaturating the other colors in the image. Great composition, focus, and lighting. But I don''t really get a feeling of loneliness or solitude.', '2003-10-26 23:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(462778, 42501, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, I like the juxtoposition of this image.  Very unexpected.  Shame on whoever put it there too, unless it was set out for the shot.  ;)  Great color differences, I like the lighting.  Nice photo.  7</td>', 'Heh, I like the juxtoposition of this image.  Very unexpected.  Shame on whoever put it there too, unless it was set out for the shot.  ;)  Great color differences, I like the lighting.  Nice photo.  7', '2003-10-26 23:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(462779, 42375, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and using a horizontal format lets the negative space define the shape of the lighthouse and emphasize its lonely position.<br/> <br/>Is that a meteor to the left?</td>', 'Great lighting and using a horizontal format lets the negative space define the shape of the lighthouse and emphasize its lonely position. Is that a meteor to the left?', '2003-10-26 23:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(462782, 42389, 2830, '<td valign="top">very smart idea, I like it.</td>', 'very smart idea, I like it.', '2003-10-26 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(462788, 42873, 11295, '<td valign="top">This has got it for sure. Beautiful shot. Congrats... I love it.</td>', 'This has got it for sure. Beautiful shot. Congrats... I love it.', '2003-10-26 23:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(462789, 42838, 11295, '<td valign="top">Niiiiice colour.</td>', 'Niiiiice colour.', '2003-10-26 23:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(462791, 42910, 11295, '<td valign="top">While lots of empty space conveys solitude well, I feel like the subject could have been a little closer for better effect. Otherwise, I really like the locale you''ve chosen.</td>', 'While lots of empty space conveys solitude well, I feel like the subject could have been a little closer for better effect. Otherwise, I really like the locale you''ve chosen.', '2003-10-26 23:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(462792, 43063, 11295, '<td valign="top">Top marks for conveying powerful emotion in a highly unusual way. Nice tones.. this is one of my favs.</td>', 'Top marks for conveying powerful emotion in a highly unusual way. Nice tones.. this is one of my favs.', '2003-10-26 23:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(462793, 43310, 2830, '<td valign="top">beautiful girl, beautiful picture.</td>', 'beautiful girl, beautiful picture.', '2003-10-26 23:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(462795, 43194, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and clarity.  Nice wave action captured!</td>', 'Beautiful color and clarity.  Nice wave action captured!', '2003-10-26 23:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(462796, 43242, 11295, '<td valign="top">Indeed. :)<br/>You got some really nice, crisp focus on this, and the tones are beautiful. Well done!</td>', 'Indeed. :)You got some really nice, crisp focus on this, and the tones are beautiful. Well done!', '2003-10-26 23:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(462797, 42870, 2830, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture.</td>', 'beautiful picture.', '2003-10-26 23:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(462799, 42965, 9441, '<td valign="top">very clear and sharp photo.  Good DOF and nice angle.</td>', 'very clear and sharp photo.  Good DOF and nice angle.', '2003-10-26 23:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(462804, 42608, 11295, '<td valign="top">This is very serene... nice use of tone.</td>', 'This is very serene... nice use of tone.', '2003-10-27 00:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(462814, 43030, 9441, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color, wonderful silhouette! a 10.</td>', 'Fantastic color, wonderful silhouette! a 10.', '2003-10-27 00:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(462815, 43210, 11295, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! Congrats on such a good capture... the colour and shadows are stunning!</td>', 'Spectacular! Congrats on such a good capture... the colour and shadows are stunning!', '2003-10-27 00:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(462817, 42588, 9441, '<td valign="top">terrific detail!  Wonderful clarity, and lighting...great macro.</td>', 'terrific detail!  Wonderful clarity, and lighting...great macro.', '2003-10-27 00:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(462853, 42521, 9441, '<td valign="top">beautiful!!  I can almost hear the water dropping in this shot!  Great color and clarity...a for sure 10!</td>', 'beautiful!!  I can almost hear the water dropping in this shot!  Great color and clarity...a for sure 10!', '2003-10-27 00:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(462866, 43242, 4767, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this is gorgeous!  If this is not a model, then it is PHENOMENAL!  A very enjoyable image!</td>', 'Oh my, this is gorgeous!  If this is not a model, then it is PHENOMENAL!  A very enjoyable image!', '2003-10-27 00:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(462869, 42497, 4767, '<td valign="top">Looks very cold - your model has turned BLUE!</td>', 'Looks very cold - your model has turned BLUE!', '2003-10-27 01:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(462871, 42703, 4767, '<td valign="top">Awesome color interpretation!  That snow is WHITE!</td>', 'Awesome color interpretation!  That snow is WHITE!', '2003-10-27 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(462873, 42792, 4767, '<td valign="top">NICE composition!</td>', 'NICE composition!', '2003-10-27 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(462911, 42886, 12902, '<td valign="top">No doubts, it is one of the best. Excellent picture. The ribbon awaits for you! 10</td>', 'No doubts, it is one of the best. Excellent picture. The ribbon awaits for you! 10', '2003-10-27 03:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(462912, 42608, 12902, '<td valign="top">Is hard to decide with so many beauties around, but sure this is one of the best. 10</td>', 'Is hard to decide with so many beauties around, but sure this is one of the best. 10', '2003-10-27 03:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(462913, 42737, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very funny and well composed image. I like the centered subject and the reflections. I am sure will do excellent! 10</td>', 'Very funny and well composed image. I like the centered subject and the reflections. I am sure will do excellent! 10', '2003-10-27 03:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(462915, 42953, 12902, '<td valign="top">I love the image. Top 10 I would say.</td>', 'I love the image. Top 10 I would say.', '2003-10-27 03:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(462917, 43333, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture. Congratulations!</td>', 'Excellent picture. Congratulations!', '2003-10-27 03:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(462919, 43053, 2830, '<td valign="top">beautiful color, good composition. I like this.</td>', 'beautiful color, good composition. I like this.', '2003-10-27 03:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(462923, 43327, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, maestro! 10</td>', 'Excellent picture, maestro! 10', '2003-10-27 04:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(462924, 42391, 12902, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best. Very high in my favourites. I like the B\W choice. Without it, the picture wouldn''t have been the same.  A good photo is always easy to recognize and certainly this is one of them. 10, well deserved.</td>', 'This is one of the best. Very high in my favourites. I like the B\W choice. Without it, the picture wouldn''t have been the same.  A good photo is always easy to recognize and certainly this is one of them. 10, well deserved.', '2003-10-27 04:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(462925, 42881, 12902, '<td valign="top">This one is the funniest one in the competition. I will remember it!</td>', 'This one is the funniest one in the competition. I will remember it!', '2003-10-27 04:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(462926, 43423, 12902, '<td valign="top">Awsome picture, great idea. Perfectly meets the challenge. ;) 10</td>', 'Awsome picture, great idea. Perfectly meets the challenge. ;) 10', '2003-10-27 04:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(462927, 43297, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Good use of rule of thirds. Do I have to tell you all I like in the comments? And why so? Obviously you don''t need no comments. You know a lot better. You took the picture, and from the look of it, you knew what you was doing! That''s it!  10!</td>', 'Wonderful image. Good use of rule of thirds. Do I have to tell you all I like in the comments? And why so? Obviously you don''t need no comments. You know a lot better. You took the picture, and from the look of it, you knew what you was doing! That''s it!  10!', '2003-10-27 04:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(462929, 43169, 4648, '<td valign="top">Much too dark for my taste.  3 from me.</td>', 'Much too dark for my taste.  3 from me.', '2003-10-27 04:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(462930, 42706, 4648, '<td valign="top">I know your dof brings out this solitary leaf but I can see there are other leaves on the tree.  IMO this should be shot where there are no leaves to show up in the photo.  Otherwise I like it.  Just doesn''t fit the challenge for me.  4</td>', 'I know your dof brings out this solitary leaf but I can see there are other leaves on the tree.  IMO this should be shot where there are no leaves to show up in the photo.  Otherwise I like it.  Just doesn''t fit the challenge for me.  4', '2003-10-27 04:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(462931, 43223, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The title doesn''t fit the challenge IMO but the photo does.  Great focus and cropping.  solid 7</td>', 'Nice shot.  The title doesn''t fit the challenge IMO but the photo does.  Great focus and cropping.  solid 7', '2003-10-27 04:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(462932, 43237, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great shot, color, focus, overall good photo.  1/3rd do this photo great.  Love the 2/3rds of it.  I''ll take your word that he is an Icelander and give you a 9.</td>', 'Great shot, color, focus, overall good photo.  1/3rd do this photo great.  Love the 2/3rds of it.  I''ll take your word that he is an Icelander and give you a 9.', '2003-10-27 04:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(462933, 42939, 4648, '<td valign="top">This if in my opinion one of those one in a million - the air around him looks cold and gives the reason for the upturned collar and the hugging of himself stature.  Wonderful color and focus.  This is not one of those exciting shots but says so much it deserves a 10.</td>', 'This if in my opinion one of those one in a million - the air around him looks cold and gives the reason for the upturned collar and the hugging of himself stature.  Wonderful color and focus.  This is not one of those exciting shots but says so much it deserves a 10.', '2003-10-27 04:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(462934, 42704, 4648, '<td valign="top">Personnaly would like it to be a tad lighter, but then the darkness of the photo adds to the darkness of his mood.  Good focus and cropping.  A tad lighter would be a 10 for me, as is I must give it a 9.</td>', 'Personnaly would like it to be a tad lighter, but then the darkness of the photo adds to the darkness of his mood.  Good focus and cropping.  A tad lighter would be a 10 for me, as is I must give it a 9.', '2003-10-27 04:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(462936, 43110, 4648, '<td valign="top">HER thoughts?  Sure fooled me.  I thought it was a man.</td>', 'HER thoughts?  Sure fooled me.  I thought it was a man.', '2003-10-27 04:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(462937, 43279, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love how neat your room is.  Can''t make up my mind if I would have liked it better cropped to just the mirror.  The way it is kind of tilts the photo to one side.  But then the mess on the other side could have justed added to the mess in the bottom of the mirror.  6 for now.</td>', 'Love how neat your room is.  Can''t make up my mind if I would have liked it better cropped to just the mirror.  The way it is kind of tilts the photo to one side.  But then the mess on the other side could have justed added to the mess in the bottom of the mirror.  6 for now.', '2003-10-27 04:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(462938, 43119, 4648, '<td valign="top">I really like the background.  Very nicely done the way the texture fades away to appear to be slick at the top.  Nice use of the shadow.  The lighting adds 2 more points to it.  Great job - nice 9</td>', 'I really like the background.  Very nicely done the way the texture fades away to appear to be slick at the top.  Nice use of the shadow.  The lighting adds 2 more points to it.  Great job - nice 9', '2003-10-27 04:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(462939, 42837, 4648, '<td valign="top">Weird framing - draws your eyes away from the photo even if the fram does look like the tree.  Nice B&amp;W.</td>', 'Weird framing - draws your eyes away from the photo even if the fram does look like the tree.  Nice B&W.', '2003-10-27 04:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(462941, 42735, 4648, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2003-10-27 04:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(462942, 43239, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Mountain appears to be sliding down.  Couple more slides and there go the buildings.  I like this but can''t really tell you why, because I don''t know why.  It just grabs me.</td>', 'Nice.  Mountain appears to be sliding down.  Couple more slides and there go the buildings.  I like this but can''t really tell you why, because I don''t know why.  It just grabs me.', '2003-10-27 04:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(462944, 43205, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  You can see the wind blowing and feel the crispness is it.  Good 9</td>', 'Great shot.  You can see the wind blowing and feel the crispness is it.  Good 9', '2003-10-27 04:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(462945, 42870, 4648, '<td valign="top">much too over sharpened for me.</td>', 'much too over sharpened for me.', '2003-10-27 04:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(462946, 43375, 4648, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what kind of bird this is - and he really ain''t going to get a worm here, unless it is a drowned one.  Need light on the bird.</td>', 'Can''t tell what kind of bird this is - and he really ain''t going to get a worm here, unless it is a drowned one.  Need light on the bird.', '2003-10-27 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(462947, 43134, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is this "where is Aaron" such as "where''s waldo?"  Would be much better if I could see Aaron because the rest of the photo is rather nice.</td>', 'Is this "where is Aaron" such as "where''s waldo?"  Would be much better if I could see Aaron because the rest of the photo is rather nice.', '2003-10-27 04:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(462948, 42763, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love legos.</td>', 'Love legos.', '2003-10-27 04:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(462950, 43296, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great title.  I just wish the "above" was in focus.  The building behind the "Below appears to be leaning and slanting.  I do like the "Below" which is 2/3rds so you get a 6.6 which is a 7</td>', 'Great title.  I just wish the "above" was in focus.  The building behind the "Below appears to be leaning and slanting.  I do like the "Below" which is 2/3rds so you get a 6.6 which is a 7', '2003-10-27 04:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(462951, 42696, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2003-10-27 05:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(462953, 42868, 4648, '<td valign="top">The background should either be more out of focus or completely in focus, but this is just my opinion based on my likes.  I do like the cat.</td>', 'The background should either be more out of focus or completely in focus, but this is just my opinion based on my likes.  I do like the cat.', '2003-10-27 05:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(462954, 43385, 4648, '<td valign="top">Where''s the focus?</td>', 'Where''s the focus?', '2003-10-27 05:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
