(462956, 43115, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not sure exactly what I''m suppose to see here.  It appears some of the shells are empty and some have cooked eggs in them, and one is not cracked open.  Doesn''t say much to me but the focus is nice and I like the B&amp;W.  If I understood it I might give more than a 5.</td>', 'Not sure exactly what I''m suppose to see here.  It appears some of the shells are empty and some have cooked eggs in them, and one is not cracked open.  Doesn''t say much to me but the focus is nice and I like the B&W.  If I understood it I might give more than a 5.', '2003-10-27 05:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(462957, 42899, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know what is $1.00.  Is he?  Nice shot.  Not exciting but nice.</td>', 'I''d like to know what is $1.00.  Is he?  Nice shot.  Not exciting but nice.', '2003-10-27 05:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
