(463349, 42802, 13381, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2003-10-27 12:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(463351, 43270, 13381, '<td valign="top">beautiful color treatment.</td>', 'beautiful color treatment.', '2003-10-27 12:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(463352, 42382, 13381, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the subject more central to the picture.</td>', 'I''d like to see the subject more central to the picture.', '2003-10-27 12:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(463353, 43232, 208, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of lines, textures, and shadows here.</td>', 'Beautiful use of lines, textures, and shadows here.', '2003-10-27 12:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(463354, 42389, 13381, '<td valign="top">I like how you have to see the reflection to actually see the statue.</td>', 'I like how you have to see the reflection to actually see the statue.', '2003-10-27 12:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(463355, 43360, 13381, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.</td>', 'Very dramatic.', '2003-10-27 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(463356, 42953, 13381, '<td valign="top">beautiful color treatment.</td>', 'beautiful color treatment.', '2003-10-27 12:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(463357, 43268, 13381, '<td valign="top">lovely texture.</td>', 'lovely texture.', '2003-10-27 12:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(463359, 43410, 13381, '<td valign="top">beautiful sunset.</td>', 'beautiful sunset.', '2003-10-27 12:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(463360, 43380, 13381, '<td valign="top">very striking composition.</td>', 'very striking composition.', '2003-10-27 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(463362, 43378, 13381, '<td valign="top">The foreground seems so washed out, but otherwise, the composition is beautiful.</td>', 'The foreground seems so washed out, but otherwise, the composition is beautiful.', '2003-10-27 12:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(463369, 42965, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the symbolism in this shot - I can see it easily being played by a lonely or bored person.  The lighting is good as is the focus.  Fits the challenge well, but overall my interest isn''t kept by the image.  Works on most levels though.  6</td>', 'I like the symbolism in this shot - I can see it easily being played by a lonely or bored person.  The lighting is good as is the focus.  Fits the challenge well, but overall my interest isn''t kept by the image.  Works on most levels though.  6', '2003-10-27 12:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(463371, 43030, 13381, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors and silhouette.</td>', 'Stunning colors and silhouette.', '2003-10-27 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(463374, 43287, 13381, '<td valign="top">I love the short depth of field in this shot.</td>', 'I love the short depth of field in this shot.', '2003-10-27 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(463379, 42845, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape.  Good focus, nice composition - I do wish the car was further along the road, I think the more distance between the car and the photographer would help enhance the alone feeling.  The colors are nice, especially the sky.  I wish it wasn''t quite so cloudy so some of the ground color could get through, but its darkness is a nice foil for the blue.   Good solid image.  7</td>', 'Lovely landscape.  Good focus, nice composition - I do wish the car was further along the road, I think the more distance between the car and the photographer would help enhance the alone feeling.  The colors are nice, especially the sky.  I wish it wasn''t quite so cloudy so some of the ground color could get through, but its darkness is a nice foil for the blue.   Good solid image.  7', '2003-10-27 12:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(463380, 43302, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast with the sun and shade.  I like the perspective, but I wish the shot was zoomed out more, to give a better feeling of space and alone-ness.  I like the lighting, helps add interest to the shot, gives a pseudo-silhouette appeal as well.  I wish the focus was a little sharper on the walker.  Nice image overall.  6</td>', 'Nice contrast with the sun and shade.  I like the perspective, but I wish the shot was zoomed out more, to give a better feeling of space and alone-ness.  I like the lighting, helps add interest to the shot, gives a pseudo-silhouette appeal as well.  I wish the focus was a little sharper on the walker.  Nice image overall.  6', '2003-10-27 12:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(463386, 43166, 11923, '<td valign="top">Cute title, nice fresh image.  Contrast is excellent, as is focus.  Lighting is good in general but it takes away from the solitude/loneliness aspect for me - I''m not getting either of those feelings from the photo.  Composition is good, not sure if a different pose might help convey the ''all alone''-ness even deeper or not.  I do find that bit of string a distractant since everything else is pristine - really stands out.  7</td>', 'Cute title, nice fresh image.  Contrast is excellent, as is focus.  Lighting is good in general but it takes away from the solitude/loneliness aspect for me - I''m not getting either of those feelings from the photo.  Composition is good, not sure if a different pose might help convey the ''all alone''-ness even deeper or not.  I do find that bit of string a distractant since everything else is pristine - really stands out.  7', '2003-10-27 12:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(463390, 43104, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, has good focus and the low lighting is ok but the image is flat for me, doesn''t generate much interest.   I think a different use of space, having the fly in one of the bottom corners with a large expanse of drapery or cloth might add some depth to the photo.  5</td>', 'Fits the challenge, has good focus and the low lighting is ok but the image is flat for me, doesn''t generate much interest.   I think a different use of space, having the fly in one of the bottom corners with a large expanse of drapery or cloth might add some depth to the photo.  5', '2003-10-27 12:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(463403, 43207, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!  The natural light is nice, has a softness too it that extends to the water and beach.  The rather neutral colors help enhance the subject, she stands out very well.  There''s a feeling of ''all alone'' but not solitude or loneliness to me - this is a rather joyful image.  I like it.  Good use of space.  6</td>', 'Great perspective!  The natural light is nice, has a softness too it that extends to the water and beach.  The rather neutral colors help enhance the subject, she stands out very well.  There''s a feeling of ''all alone'' but not solitude or loneliness to me - this is a rather joyful image.  I like it.  Good use of space.  6', '2003-10-27 12:49:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(463405, 43296, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I like the different angles vs the organic shapes of the girl.  I also like the double ''alone'' whammy with the person or figure in the cage.   The natural lighting is nice, focus is pretty good.  The building in the back has a strange oblong nature to it, looks stretched oddly.    6</td>', 'Interesting image.  I like the different angles vs the organic shapes of the girl.  I also like the double ''alone'' whammy with the person or figure in the cage.   The natural lighting is nice, focus is pretty good.  The building in the back has a strange oblong nature to it, looks stretched oddly.    6', '2003-10-27 12:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(463416, 42802, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black &amp; white, lighting is excellent too.  I like the focus - there''s a nice feeling of depth with the composition as well.   Fits the challenge.   Nice solid image.  7</td>', 'Nice use of black & white, lighting is excellent too.  I like the focus - there''s a nice feeling of depth with the composition as well.   Fits the challenge.   Nice solid image.  7', '2003-10-27 13:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(463419, 42695, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, cute title.   I like the contrast of color against grey.  Focus is good in general, but I wish the plant was sharper, rather than the gravel/sand beneath it.  The low lighting sets off the image well.   I think the border is too bright, pulls my eyes away from the photo.   6</td>', 'Heh, cute title.   I like the contrast of color against grey.  Focus is good in general, but I wish the plant was sharper, rather than the gravel/sand beneath it.  The low lighting sets off the image well.   I think the border is too bright, pulls my eyes away from the photo.   6', '2003-10-27 13:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(463421, 43289, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I love the rich colors in the foreground.  Excellent focus on the sheep and grass, I even like the country vs ''city'' contrast with its natural light on the sheep and the hazy, pseudo-smog air over the town.  (not sure if that was purposeful or not, but there it is all the same)   Fits the challenge very well in my eyes.  I''m not exactly sure what aspect has engaged me so much with this image, but I really like it.  10</td>', 'Great image!  I love the rich colors in the foreground.  Excellent focus on the sheep and grass, I even like the country vs ''city'' contrast with its natural light on the sheep and the hazy, pseudo-smog air over the town.  (not sure if that was purposeful or not, but there it is all the same)   Fits the challenge very well in my eyes.  I''m not exactly sure what aspect has engaged me so much with this image, but I really like it.  10', '2003-10-27 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(463430, 42497, 11923, '<td valign="top">The cold blue tone really helps convey a feeling of loneliness, despair and maybe even fear.  Model looks very vulnerable.  Focus is great, lighting is good though the stark white is a little brighter than I''d like.  Very emotive piece.  Well done.  8</td>', 'The cold blue tone really helps convey a feeling of loneliness, despair and maybe even fear.  Model looks very vulnerable.  Focus is great, lighting is good though the stark white is a little brighter than I''d like.  Very emotive piece.  Well done.  8', '2003-10-27 13:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(463433, 43206, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the color of the owl.. its a lovely purply grey.  Excellent shot.  Focus is good, I love the range of textures in the photo.  Fits alone in general - the underlying solitude or loneliness feeling detailed in the challenge is missing for me.  Lighting is good, though the bright spot in the lower right corner does detract.  I think a tighter crop along the top, to get the break in the stone wall out would keep the photo together, also create a little more intimate atmosphere.   That said this is a fantastic shot.  Very well done.  8</td>', 'Wow, I love the color of the owl.. its a lovely purply grey.  Excellent shot.  Focus is good, I love the range of textures in the photo.  Fits alone in general - the underlying solitude or loneliness feeling detailed in the challenge is missing for me.  Lighting is good, though the bright spot in the lower right corner does detract.  I think a tighter crop along the top, to get the break in the stone wall out would keep the photo together, also create a little more intimate atmosphere.   That said this is a fantastic shot.  Very well done.  8', '2003-10-27 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(463438, 43317, 6536, '<td valign="top">It has nice bright colors. Good composition. Nice lighting and shadows. You might want to sharpen in photoshop it looks a little out of focus. 6.</td>', 'It has nice bright colors. Good composition. Nice lighting and shadows. You might want to sharpen in photoshop it looks a little out of focus. 6.', '2003-10-27 13:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(463443, 42883, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous silhouette.  I love the colors, spectacular.  Focus is excellent, use of light is obviously wonderful.  The simplicity of the cactus shape and its starkness against the color really help promote the alone and solitude feelings.  Excellent image.  10</td>', 'Gorgeous silhouette.  I love the colors, spectacular.  Focus is excellent, use of light is obviously wonderful.  The simplicity of the cactus shape and its starkness against the color really help promote the alone and solitude feelings.  Excellent image.  10', '2003-10-27 13:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(463444, 42403, 6536, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea for challege. Good black &amp; white shot. Nice composition and lighting. Good DOF. I like the background. 8.</td>', 'Interesting idea for challege. Good black & white shot. Nice composition and lighting. Good DOF. I like the background. 8.', '2003-10-27 13:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(463447, 42821, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great composition and cropping. Nice angle. Very creative. Good DOF. I like how you blurred out that tree branch behind the antenna. 7.</td>', 'Great composition and cropping. Nice angle. Very creative. Good DOF. I like how you blurred out that tree branch behind the antenna. 7.', '2003-10-27 13:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(463452, 42436, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Good nightscape. I like the lighting and how the little lights in the background looks like stars.  Nice composition and DOF. 9.</td>', 'Great idea. Good nightscape. I like the lighting and how the little lights in the background looks like stars.  Nice composition and DOF. 9.', '2003-10-27 13:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(463454, 43213, 6536, '<td valign="top">6.</td>', '6.', '2003-10-27 13:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(463457, 42873, 6536, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and lighting. Great depth of field and focus. Perfect positioning of subject. 10.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and lighting. Great depth of field and focus. Perfect positioning of subject. 10.', '2003-10-27 13:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(463458, 43330, 11923, '<td valign="top">A very sweet and peaceful image.  I like the muted light, fits the challenge fairly well, get a vague sense of solitude.  The colors are nice, especially the shirt vs. the green grass.  The street in the upper left kind of detracts for me.  Would rather a full expanse of grass.   Very photogenic child, wonderful expressive face.  Nice job!  7</td>', 'A very sweet and peaceful image.  I like the muted light, fits the challenge fairly well, get a vague sense of solitude.  The colors are nice, especially the shirt vs. the green grass.  The street in the upper left kind of detracts for me.  Would rather a full expanse of grass.   Very photogenic child, wonderful expressive face.  Nice job!  7', '2003-10-27 13:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(463459, 43084, 5913, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...such a long hallway with no one around.</td>', 'Nice shot...such a long hallway with no one around.', '2003-10-27 13:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(463461, 43257, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good focus, use of natural light is good - just a shade too harsh on the white, but doesn''t detract really.  Nice detail with the feathers, I wish the bird wasn''t smack dab in the center of the photo though.  The murky look of the water is an excellent foil for the pristine white of the feathers.  Would''ve cropped a little bit more on ther ight so there wasn''t that other bird or rock edging in.  I''m not really getting a feeling of solitude or loneliness from the image, though it does fit the challenge generally.  A nice image.  6</td>', 'Good focus, use of natural light is good - just a shade too harsh on the white, but doesn''t detract really.  Nice detail with the feathers, I wish the bird wasn''t smack dab in the center of the photo though.  The murky look of the water is an excellent foil for the pristine white of the feathers.  Would''ve cropped a little bit more on ther ight so there wasn''t that other bird or rock edging in.  I''m not really getting a feeling of solitude or loneliness from the image, though it does fit the challenge generally.  A nice image.  6', '2003-10-27 13:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(463463, 42588, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail on the subject.  Very crisp and clear.  The background color is nice, though the green thing is a distraction (even though its blurred out).  Fits the challenge in general, and I get an abstract feeling of solitude - mainly because I know many don''t like snakes so that would lead to its exclusion.   Lighting is great.  A solid image.  7</td>', 'Excellent detail on the subject.  Very crisp and clear.  The background color is nice, though the green thing is a distraction (even though its blurred out).  Fits the challenge in general, and I get an abstract feeling of solitude - mainly because I know many don''t like snakes so that would lead to its exclusion.   Lighting is great.  A solid image.  7', '2003-10-27 13:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(463464, 42549, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, what a cute image.  Looks like one of the buildings has fallen down which I find distracting.  Focus is pretty good, the low lighting works, but I wish the image was brighter - I think a fair amount of detail is lost.  I like the perspective, the expanse of castle behind the lego man helps give the impression of alone and solitude.  Fun interpretation.  6</td>', 'Heh, what a cute image.  Looks like one of the buildings has fallen down which I find distracting.  Focus is pretty good, the low lighting works, but I wish the image was brighter - I think a fair amount of detail is lost.  I like the perspective, the expanse of castle behind the lego man helps give the impression of alone and solitude.  Fun interpretation.  6', '2003-10-27 13:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(463465, 43282, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice image, I like the distinction not only in size, but generally in shape and color - frosted vs. not.   I think that would hold true better if the very right piece wasn''t a pawn.  So that this forward one would be completely different in every way.   I like the reflection of the other pieces in the clear pawn - its almost as if it is seeing the others grouped and realizing its alone.  I wish there was a way to lighten the whole image up though.  The low lighting gives a nice effect for the frosted pieces but I''d like the overall darkness to lighten up just a bit.  Nice image.  6</td>', 'A nice image, I like the distinction not only in size, but generally in shape and color - frosted vs. not.   I think that would hold true better if the very right piece wasn''t a pawn.  So that this forward one would be completely different in every way.   I like the reflection of the other pieces in the clear pawn - its almost as if it is seeing the others grouped and realizing its alone.  I wish there was a way to lighten the whole image up though.  The low lighting gives a nice effect for the frosted pieces but I''d like the overall darkness to lighten up just a bit.  Nice image.  6', '2003-10-27 13:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(463468, 42708, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!  I love the detail and focus.  Lighting is great.  Use of b&amp;w is perfect.  Has a definite feeling of solitude and loneliness.  I even like how the bird in the forefront looks to be different from the ones in the background - gives it that extra bit of separation.  A very well done image.  10</td>', 'Wonderful image!  I love the detail and focus.  Lighting is great.  Use of b&w is perfect.  Has a definite feeling of solitude and loneliness.  I even like how the bird in the forefront looks to be different from the ones in the background - gives it that extra bit of separation.  A very well done image.  10', '2003-10-27 13:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(463469, 42710, 5913, '<td valign="top">Disturbing</td>', 'Disturbing', '2003-10-27 13:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(463473, 42608, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice silhouette!  I like the use of light, and the single pole fits the challenge well.  The vastness of the ocean helps extend the feeling of solitude.  I do wish there were richer colors.  Over all a very solid image.  Well done.  6</td>', 'A nice silhouette!  I like the use of light, and the single pole fits the challenge well.  The vastness of the ocean helps extend the feeling of solitude.  I do wish there were richer colors.  Over all a very solid image.  Well done.  6', '2003-10-27 14:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(463477, 43241, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good emotional impact, subject helps with that.  Lighting is pretty good, would like the focus to be a bit sharper.   Definite loneliness feeling to the image (not sure if that is solely from the image itself though - I think the title has an impact on that too).  A nice sound photo.  6</td>', 'Good emotional impact, subject helps with that.  Lighting is pretty good, would like the focus to be a bit sharper.   Definite loneliness feeling to the image (not sure if that is solely from the image itself though - I think the title has an impact on that too).  A nice sound photo.  6', '2003-10-27 14:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(463479, 43331, 2, '<td valign="top">Absolutely frightening.  I can''t remember being stirred so much by a photograph in a long time.  The clinical colors you chose are perfect.  Ten -- no question.</td>', 'Absolutely frightening.  I can''t remember being stirred so much by a photograph in a long time.  The clinical colors you chose are perfect.  Ten -- no question.', '2003-10-27 14:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(463481, 42824, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the image, it has a nice story to it.  Love the clarity and focus, lighting is good.  Nice use of black and white.   I''m not sure that I get a feeling of solitude or loneliness - though I do think it fits the challenge in general.  A very nice image.  7</td>', 'I like the image, it has a nice story to it.  Love the clarity and focus, lighting is good.  Nice use of black and white.   I''m not sure that I get a feeling of solitude or loneliness - though I do think it fits the challenge in general.  A very nice image.  7', '2003-10-27 14:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(463482, 42761, 4008, '<td valign="top">focus is not on the bird</td>', 'focus is not on the bird', '2003-10-27 14:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(463485, 42850, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, don''t envy him that job.  Great use of space, the deep landscape really gives a feeling of solitude.  The perspective is great because it makes the subject look even smaller.  Nice rich green, wish the background colors weren''t quite so washed out though.   Still a great image.  7</td>', 'Wow, don''t envy him that job.  Great use of space, the deep landscape really gives a feeling of solitude.  The perspective is great because it makes the subject look even smaller.  Nice rich green, wish the background colors weren''t quite so washed out though.   Still a great image.  7', '2003-10-27 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(463486, 42509, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a dramatic backdrop.  I love the clouds and the mountains rising up gently.  The deep landscape really brings for the feeling of alone and solitude, though the child is a bit soft focused - would rather the focus was much sharper on him/her.  Nice use of sepia, though I''m wondering if it would be better as a b&amp;w.  Use of natural light is good as well.  Nice job.  7</td>', 'Wow, what a dramatic backdrop.  I love the clouds and the mountains rising up gently.  The deep landscape really brings for the feeling of alone and solitude, though the child is a bit soft focused - would rather the focus was much sharper on him/her.  Nice use of sepia, though I''m wondering if it would be better as a b&w.  Use of natural light is good as well.  Nice job.  7', '2003-10-27 14:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(463489, 43232, 4008, '<td valign="top">very strong graphic image. I like the use of DOF and silhouette. You could try cropping out the sand.</td>', 'very strong graphic image. I like the use of DOF and silhouette. You could try cropping out the sand.', '2003-10-27 14:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(463490, 43288, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Took me a few moments to see the cigarette butt.  I like the composition, the textures are great.  Lighting looks good and the focus is decent, though I''d rather it was mostly on the cigarette so it didn''t get lost in the photo.  The overall image looks a bit gritty like it was oversharpened.  6</td>', 'Interesting image.  Took me a few moments to see the cigarette butt.  I like the composition, the textures are great.  Lighting looks good and the focus is decent, though I''d rather it was mostly on the cigarette so it didn''t get lost in the photo.  The overall image looks a bit gritty like it was oversharpened.  6', '2003-10-27 14:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(463501, 42854, 2158, '<td valign="top">I generally like dark pictures, but I still find this one a bit too dark.</td>', 'I generally like dark pictures, but I still find this one a bit too dark.', '2003-10-27 14:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(463534, 42678, 6349, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  That model really knows how to pose.</td>', 'Stunning.  That model really knows how to pose.', '2003-10-27 15:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(463561, 43287, 208, '<td valign="top">The ring keeps distracting me, actually. Seems like there''s too much stuff in the background. I''d rather look at the wonderful detail on the flower and enjoy your color choices.</td>', 'The ring keeps distracting me, actually. Seems like there''s too much stuff in the background. I''d rather look at the wonderful detail on the flower and enjoy your color choices.', '2003-10-27 15:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(463568, 43081, 208, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I''m not sure I like the lighting, though - perhaps eliminate the shadows. I like the contrast of the round marbles with the diagonals. Is that matzah?!</td>', 'Interesting idea. I''m not sure I like the lighting, though - perhaps eliminate the shadows. I like the contrast of the round marbles with the diagonals. Is that matzah?!', '2003-10-27 16:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(463576, 43310, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful stop-action.</td>', 'Beautiful stop-action.', '2003-10-27 16:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(463577, 43423, 11923, '<td valign="top">Oh this is a lovely image.  I really like all the contrasts.  The lighting is perfect, really enhances the alone aspect.  The marbles give an added interest with the way the light reflects off of them.  Its quite beautiful.  I do wish that the ones in the bottom right corner didn''t show their green nature so much, and instead were dark like the others - the different color draws the eyes away from the main subject.  I think its a great photo.  8</td>', 'Oh this is a lovely image.  I really like all the contrasts.  The lighting is perfect, really enhances the alone aspect.  The marbles give an added interest with the way the light reflects off of them.  Its quite beautiful.  I do wish that the ones in the bottom right corner didn''t show their green nature so much, and instead were dark like the others - the different color draws the eyes away from the main subject.  I think its a great photo.  8', '2003-10-27 16:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(463579, 42803, 13381, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait in black and white.  I''d love to see it in color, as well.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait in black and white.  I''d love to see it in color, as well.', '2003-10-27 16:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(463581, 42768, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts in this image.  I do think the white is a bit harsh - I''d like it better if it was a little toned down.  That said, it really sets off the subject, both her skin tone and the black burqua?.  I like the long look of the photo, but would prefer it cropped a little, I think it would still hold its length well.  Good composition, the girl looks alone and has a sadness to her that I can easily equate with isolation and solitude.  Nice job.  7</td>', 'Nice contrasts in this image.  I do think the white is a bit harsh - I''d like it better if it was a little toned down.  That said, it really sets off the subject, both her skin tone and the black burqua?.  I like the long look of the photo, but would prefer it cropped a little, I think it would still hold its length well.  Good composition, the girl looks alone and has a sadness to her that I can easily equate with isolation and solitude.  Nice job.  7', '2003-10-27 16:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(463585, 42521, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  Fits the challenge generally (I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness) but I think its wonderful.  The colors are glorious, I love the detailing and excellent focus.  The lighting is perfect, the leaf looks translucent, how was that achieved?  A leaf frozen in ice?  Regardless its a great image.  Well done.  9</td>', 'I love this image.  Fits the challenge generally (I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness) but I think its wonderful.  The colors are glorious, I love the detailing and excellent focus.  The lighting is perfect, the leaf looks translucent, how was that achieved?  A leaf frozen in ice?  Regardless its a great image.  Well done.  9', '2003-10-27 16:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(463589, 43290, 11923, '<td valign="top">A different image.  The color of the sky is nice and contrasts with the color of the figure.  I''m not sure that it emotes a loneliness or solitude for me though it is all alone.  The lighting looks good.  Its a solid photo technically, but I am not drawn in, it has little interest for me the viewer.  Also, might want to crop or clone out the items at the bottom (post challenge of course).  5</td>', 'A different image.  The color of the sky is nice and contrasts with the color of the figure.  I''m not sure that it emotes a loneliness or solitude for me though it is all alone.  The lighting looks good.  Its a solid photo technically, but I am not drawn in, it has little interest for me the viewer.  Also, might want to crop or clone out the items at the bottom (post challenge of course).  5', '2003-10-27 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(463591, 43093, 13381, '<td valign="top">I love the color difference and the reflection.</td>', 'I love the color difference and the reflection.', '2003-10-27 16:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(463592, 42415, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color in the leaves, it really draws the eye.  I also like the contrast between it and the not so healthy looking pot in front.  Focus is good but the lighting is very distracting with the large glare and lens flares.  Other than the color of the leaves, the photo is a bit flat to me, doesn''t draw me in very well.  A good snapshot.  5</td>', 'Beautiful color in the leaves, it really draws the eye.  I also like the contrast between it and the not so healthy looking pot in front.  Focus is good but the lighting is very distracting with the large glare and lens flares.  Other than the color of the leaves, the photo is a bit flat to me, doesn''t draw me in very well.  A good snapshot.  5', '2003-10-27 16:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(463599, 42939, 13141, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the 1 third -2 third ratio.  Great backdrop.</td>', 'Nice use of the 1 third -2 third ratio.  Great backdrop.', '2003-10-27 16:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(463604, 43113, 13141, '<td valign="top">This is bad</td>', 'This is bad', '2003-10-27 16:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(463605, 43194, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, texture, and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful color, texture, and composition.', '2003-10-27 16:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(463606, 42752, 13381, '<td valign="top">I love the low depth of field in this picture.</td>', 'I love the low depth of field in this picture.', '2003-10-27 16:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(463609, 43272, 13141, '<td valign="top">Am I missing something, or is there too much sky.  A little cropping could have gone a long way.</td>', 'Am I missing something, or is there too much sky.  A little cropping could have gone a long way.', '2003-10-27 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(463613, 43391, 3102, '<td valign="top">A very cool shot that could easily be wearing a ribbon soon!</td>', 'A very cool shot that could easily be wearing a ribbon soon!', '2003-10-27 16:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(463621, 43188, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the imagery of this photo.  The tree doesn''t look quite dead, but dying certainly.  This to me brings to mind the loneliness of dying and solitude so it fits the challenge well in my opinion.  I like the lighting, my main negative is the focus, I''m not sure if it is purposefully soft but that aspect detracts for me, I wish it was sharper focused because the stark lines of the tree and the black &amp; white aspect of the image seems to call for it to me.  Other than that its a sound photo.  6</td>', 'I like the imagery of this photo.  The tree doesn''t look quite dead, but dying certainly.  This to me brings to mind the loneliness of dying and solitude so it fits the challenge well in my opinion.  I like the lighting, my main negative is the focus, I''m not sure if it is purposefully soft but that aspect detracts for me, I wish it was sharper focused because the stark lines of the tree and the black & white aspect of the image seems to call for it to me.  Other than that its a sound photo.  6', '2003-10-27 16:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(463632, 43276, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice image, I like the perspective used.  There''s a nice darkness to it, though I wish it had a sharper focus, the focus is good - just seems it should be sharper.  Fits the challenge.  Normally I''d like the black &amp; white use.. but when I look at the image my mind rejects the lack of color.  I''d love to see what this looks like in color.  Well done over all.  7</td>', 'A nice image, I like the perspective used.  There''s a nice darkness to it, though I wish it had a sharper focus, the focus is good - just seems it should be sharper.  Fits the challenge.  Normally I''d like the black & white use.. but when I look at the image my mind rejects the lack of color.  I''d love to see what this looks like in color.  Well done over all.  7', '2003-10-27 16:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(463634, 43419, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea.  I like the perspective, especially that the subject is in focus instead of the hands.  I don''t necessarily get a solitude or lonely feeling from the image, but I like the originality of it.  Colors are vivid, nice use of natural light.  7</td>', 'An interesting idea.  I like the perspective, especially that the subject is in focus instead of the hands.  I don''t necessarily get a solitude or lonely feeling from the image, but I like the originality of it.  Colors are vivid, nice use of natural light.  7', '2003-10-27 16:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(463641, 43269, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great emotive photo.  Use of light and black &amp; white is wonderful.  Focus is good, I like the composition of the piece.  There does seem to be some odd color wave affect on the walls, possibly from resizing.   Great image.  8</td>', 'Great emotive photo.  Use of light and black & white is wonderful.  Focus is good, I like the composition of the piece.  There does seem to be some odd color wave affect on the walls, possibly from resizing.   Great image.  8', '2003-10-27 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(463645, 43331, 13381, '<td valign="top">Incredibly disturbing, but visually stunning.</td>', 'Incredibly disturbing, but visually stunning.', '2003-10-27 17:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(463659, 43297, 10888, '<td valign="top">Great Photo. Nice Detail in the leaf. Nice blue water and great composition! You have captured all alone perfectly. This is by far the best photo I''ve seen NICE WORK!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Great Photo. Nice Detail in the leaf. Nice blue water and great composition! You have captured all alone perfectly. This is by far the best photo I''ve seen NICE WORK!!!!!!!!!!', '2003-10-27 17:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(463672, 42704, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good, and the scenery has interest to it.  Pose of the subject projects the all alone and solitary feeling.  Good focus.  I do wish the overall tone of the image was a bit brighter, so the colors were more vivid.  Very nice.  7</td>', 'Lighting is good, and the scenery has interest to it.  Pose of the subject projects the all alone and solitary feeling.  Good focus.  I do wish the overall tone of the image was a bit brighter, so the colors were more vivid.  Very nice.  7', '2003-10-27 17:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(463674, 43368, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very moody image.  I like the starkness of the piece.  Nice lonely overtone.  Lighting does much to enhance that feeling.  Focus looks pretty good too.  6</td>', 'Very moody image.  I like the starkness of the piece.  Nice lonely overtone.  Lighting does much to enhance that feeling.  Focus looks pretty good too.  6', '2003-10-27 17:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(463677, 43412, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!  I love the colors, wonderfully vivid.  The focus is great, and I like the lighting.  I''m not getting a very solitude or loneliness feeling from the image, I think the lighting is too warm and bright for that to come through.  Fits generally under the all alone portion though.   Nicely done.  6</td>', 'Very pretty!  I love the colors, wonderfully vivid.  The focus is great, and I like the lighting.  I''m not getting a very solitude or loneliness feeling from the image, I think the lighting is too warm and bright for that to come through.  Fits generally under the all alone portion though.   Nicely done.  6', '2003-10-27 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(463726, 42817, 11677, '<td valign="top">Great composition and detail in this shot.</td>', 'Great composition and detail in this shot.', '2003-10-27 18:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(463727, 42521, 9504, '<td valign="top">Absolutely GORGEOUS!!!!!!!!!  Pricelessly good. 10</td>', 'Absolutely GORGEOUS!!!!!!!!!  Pricelessly good. 10', '2003-10-27 18:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(463728, 42905, 11677, '<td valign="top">You hit this one on the subject of alone.  nice capture!</td>', 'You hit this one on the subject of alone.  nice capture!', '2003-10-27 18:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(463729, 43213, 9504, '<td valign="top">I love the way the water line is approaching on an angle.  It adds great interest to the photo.  Stunning caputre -- just slightly over-exposed.</td>', 'I love the way the water line is approaching on an angle.  It adds great interest to the photo.  Stunning caputre -- just slightly over-exposed.', '2003-10-27 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(463730, 42718, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, the color is vivid, I like the way it contrasts with the background.  Focus looks pretty good.  I don''t connect to the photo completely, it doesn''t give me a feeling of solitude or loneliness really - the title is the only connection to that feeling, not the image.  That said, it does in general fit the ''all alone'' challenge, just doesn''t connect well for me.  5</td>', 'A nice photo, the color is vivid, I like the way it contrasts with the background.  Focus looks pretty good.  I don''t connect to the photo completely, it doesn''t give me a feeling of solitude or loneliness really - the title is the only connection to that feeling, not the image.  That said, it does in general fit the ''all alone'' challenge, just doesn''t connect well for me.  5', '2003-10-27 18:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(463731, 42710, 9504, '<td valign="top">Too scary....excellent portrayal.</td>', 'Too scary....excellent portrayal.', '2003-10-27 18:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(463733, 42497, 9504, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe it is common for people to sit around in depair naked.  Maybe the insane do...but not the average desperate person.  Desperation tends to make people cover themselves...to hide...to try to get away even in their subconscious.</td>', 'I don''t believe it is common for people to sit around in depair naked.  Maybe the insane do...but not the average desperate person.  Desperation tends to make people cover themselves...to hide...to try to get away even in their subconscious.', '2003-10-27 18:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(463734, 43194, 9504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...</td>', 'Beautiful...', '2003-10-27 18:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(463736, 43384, 9504, '<td valign="top">This looks over-exposed to me...The sky is too washed out towards the horizon.  If you have a point and shoot, it is out of your control...</td>', 'This looks over-exposed to me...The sky is too washed out towards the horizon.  If you have a point and shoot, it is out of your control...', '2003-10-27 18:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(463738, 43206, 9504, '<td valign="top">I find the background to the owl a bit distracting.  I also wish his eyes were open....  I would also potentially crop off a bigger portion of the tree on the right...and some of the top of the picture to bring the owl into the picture more.  Beautiful creature though...</td>', 'I find the background to the owl a bit distracting.  I also wish his eyes were open....  I would also potentially crop off a bigger portion of the tree on the right...and some of the top of the picture to bring the owl into the picture more.  Beautiful creature though...', '2003-10-27 18:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(463739, 43301, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the look of the light on the water and the silhouette aspect.  The colors are good, focus is nice.  I definitely get the feeling of loneliness or solitude.  I think cropping the top down a little is worth a try, I don''t think it would affect the depth of the photo.  Well done.  7</td>', 'I love the look of the light on the water and the silhouette aspect.  The colors are good, focus is nice.  I definitely get the feeling of loneliness or solitude.  I think cropping the top down a little is worth a try, I don''t think it would affect the depth of the photo.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-27 18:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(463748, 42586, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image conveying a the solitude of an early morning in October. Good composition and framing. Low contrast works well here. One of the best images of this challenge.</td>', 'Exceptional image conveying a the solitude of an early morning in October. Good composition and framing. Low contrast works well here. One of the best images of this challenge.', '2003-10-27 18:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(463752, 43093, 5792, '<td valign="top">With the addition of one person you have turned an ordinary sunset image into an exceptional All Alone Image. One of the best of the challenge<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-29 09:26:53.</i></td>', 'With the addition of one person you have turned an ordinary sunset image into an exceptional All Alone Image. One of the best of the challenge', '2003-10-27 18:52:28.000000', '2003-10-29 09:26:53.000000', 1),
(463754, 42794, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid color, the focus is a bit soft but it works for the image.  Its a good image, but I don''t connect with it much.  Fits the challenge generally, but I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness  5.</td>', 'Nice vivid color, the focus is a bit soft but it works for the image.  Its a good image, but I don''t connect with it much.  Fits the challenge generally, but I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness  5.', '2003-10-27 18:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(463757, 42532, 5792, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking backgound mountains. Colors brought out exceptionally well.  The donkey or burro sets this image apart from others.</td>', 'Breathtaking backgound mountains. Colors brought out exceptionally well.  The donkey or burro sets this image apart from others.', '2003-10-27 18:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(463758, 42543, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid colors, I like the contrasts that this image has.  Lighting is good, as is composition.  The focus is decent, I would personally prefer the cheerio to be completely in focus &amp; sharp since it is the main focal point.  Good job.  6</td>', 'Nice vivid colors, I like the contrasts that this image has.  Lighting is good, as is composition.  The focus is decent, I would personally prefer the cheerio to be completely in focus & sharp since it is the main focal point.  Good job.  6', '2003-10-27 18:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(463759, 42886, 5792, '<td valign="top">An outstanding image. The sailboat is perfectly placed. Overexposing the sky works with this image.</td>', 'An outstanding image. The sailboat is perfectly placed. Overexposing the sky works with this image.', '2003-10-27 18:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(463761, 43239, 5792, '<td valign="top">Coveys quiet solitude perfectly. Great colors.</td>', 'Coveys quiet solitude perfectly. Great colors.', '2003-10-27 18:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(463762, 42853, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well framed and beautiful image.</td>', 'Exceptionally well framed and beautiful image.', '2003-10-27 18:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(463763, 43242, 5792, '<td valign="top">You have managed to capture solitude on a street nicely. The background compliments your subject and her pose. Well done.</td>', 'You have managed to capture solitude on a street nicely. The background compliments your subject and her pose. Well done.', '2003-10-27 18:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(463764, 43099, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think the use of natural light was good and the composition is alright - a little busy though.  Subject definitely shows alone and some loneliness.  Would prefer a sharper image though, the focus seems pretty soft in general, sharpest part loks to be on the folding chair, not the focal point of the piece.   5</td>', 'I think the use of natural light was good and the composition is alright - a little busy though.  Subject definitely shows alone and some loneliness.  Would prefer a sharper image though, the focus seems pretty soft in general, sharpest part loks to be on the folding chair, not the focal point of the piece.   5', '2003-10-27 18:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(463765, 42507, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well done.</td>', 'Exceptionally well done.', '2003-10-27 18:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(463766, 42588, 5792, '<td valign="top">DOF works well. Framing is outstanding.</td>', 'DOF works well. Framing is outstanding.', '2003-10-27 19:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(463767, 43030, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I really like the range of colors, quite vivid.  Like the silhouette aspect as well.  Nothing I would really change, has a nice tranquil feel.  8</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I really like the range of colors, quite vivid.  Like the silhouette aspect as well.  Nothing I would really change, has a nice tranquil feel.  8', '2003-10-27 19:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(463768, 42869, 5792, '<td valign="top">Sepia is a nice selection for this image.</td>', 'Sepia is a nice selection for this image.', '2003-10-27 19:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(463769, 42728, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional technical quality in this image. Jet black background is great.</td>', 'Exceptional technical quality in this image. Jet black background is great.', '2003-10-27 19:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(463772, 42934, 11923, '<td valign="top">Cute image.  I like the black &amp; white, gives it a nice sharpness.  Focus is great.  Though it does fill the ''all alone'' part of the challenge, I don''t get a solitude or loneliness feeling from it.  Lighting is great, I love her hair.  Is this taken as she goes down the slide or was her hair set to look like that?  Well done.  7</td>', 'Cute image.  I like the black & white, gives it a nice sharpness.  Focus is great.  Though it does fill the ''all alone'' part of the challenge, I don''t get a solitude or loneliness feeling from it.  Lighting is great, I love her hair.  Is this taken as she goes down the slide or was her hair set to look like that?  Well done.  7', '2003-10-27 19:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(463773, 42521, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great color, quality and framing.</td>', 'Great color, quality and framing.', '2003-10-27 19:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
