(463850, 43212, 11508, '<td valign="top">really nice photo!,  I espescially like the lighting, how you can just barely see the top of the stairs.  The angle of the photo adds alot to the guy, and its an interesting message, because the guy looks like your typical outgoing, happy college student type, I like the cord of the phone in the edge of the photo, but wish it didnt go out of the photo and back in again, did you crop it this way? I like this alot, 9.</td>', 'really nice photo!,  I espescially like the lighting, how you can just barely see the top of the stairs.  The angle of the photo adds alot to the guy, and its an interesting message, because the guy looks like your typical outgoing, happy college student type, I like the cord of the phone in the edge of the photo, but wish it didnt go out of the photo and back in again, did you crop it this way? I like this alot, 9.', '2003-10-27 19:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
