(463858, 42532, 9504, '<td valign="top">What an exceptional photo.   You can kind of feel the donkey thinking...all alone...pondering where or what to do next.  I love it.  Where on earth is this?  Stunning!</td>', 'What an exceptional photo.   You can kind of feel the donkey thinking...all alone...pondering where or what to do next.  I love it.  Where on earth is this?  Stunning!', '2003-10-27 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(463859, 43158, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a well done image. The lighting is especially good. I have never understood the frequent use of wooden characters like this one at this site, but see them all the time.</td>', 'This is a well done image. The lighting is especially good. I have never understood the frequent use of wooden characters like this one at this site, but see them all the time.', '2003-10-27 19:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(463861, 43109, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very good night shot.</td>', 'Very good night shot.', '2003-10-27 19:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(463863, 43269, 9504, '<td valign="top">This is the second naked breakdown person I have seen in this challenge. The funny part is when people get down and out, I don''t think they get naked -- do they?  Naturally when we are down and alone, we want to cover up and go away.  We cover up to escape, to not be seen IMO.  If he was clothed, I would have liked it better.  You convey the breakdown feeling well.</td>', 'This is the second naked breakdown person I have seen in this challenge. The funny part is when people get down and out, I don''t think they get naked -- do they?  Naturally when we are down and alone, we want to cover up and go away.  We cover up to escape, to not be seen IMO.  If he was clothed, I would have liked it better.  You convey the breakdown feeling well.', '2003-10-27 19:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(463864, 43416, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good framing, composition and DOF.</td>', 'Good framing, composition and DOF.', '2003-10-27 19:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
