(463874, 43335, 11508, '<td valign="top">I love the man standing in the window with the bags in his hand, however I think it might add alot to crop the photo at the edge of the piano (get rid of the blured walker) Although you get a full black and white in photo, I feel like there could be more contrast, particualy around the piano players face. Good choice to black and white, but if the piano players shirt is a bright color, it might be fun to selectivly bring back that color. Great job, 8.</td>', 'I love the man standing in the window with the bags in his hand, however I think it might add alot to crop the photo at the edge of the piano (get rid of the blured walker) Although you get a full black and white in photo, I feel like there could be more contrast, particualy around the piano players face. Good choice to black and white, but if the piano players shirt is a bright color, it might be fun to selectivly bring back that color. Great job, 8.', '2003-10-27 19:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(463875, 43113, 9504, '<td valign="top">I wish the photo was bigger.  I also wish you were much, much closer to the dog.  The grass has no value in this photo.  The dog looks lovely from the little I can see...</td>', 'I wish the photo was bigger.  I also wish you were much, much closer to the dog.  The grass has no value in this photo.  The dog looks lovely from the little I can see...', '2003-10-27 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
