(463898, 42936, 5792, '<td valign="top">This B&amp;W captures the feeling of being alone exceptionally well.</td>', 'This B&W captures the feeling of being alone exceptionally well.', '2003-10-27 19:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(463901, 43223, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good angle. Nice duotone.</td>', 'Good angle. Nice duotone.', '2003-10-27 20:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(463902, 42970, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, color. Captures the challenge topic well.</td>', 'Nice framing, color. Captures the challenge topic well.', '2003-10-27 20:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(463904, 42889, 5792, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, but the image fails to measure up to it. You need to be closer to the raindrops and they should be absolutely clear. A softer focus on the background would make the water drops stand out even more and give a better sense of a rainy day.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-29 11:51:32.</i></td>', 'The idea is good, but the image fails to measure up to it. You need to be closer to the raindrops and they should be absolutely clear. A softer focus on the background would make the water drops stand out even more and give a better sense of a rainy day.', '2003-10-27 20:05:09.000000', '2003-10-29 11:51:32.000000', 1),
(463906, 43375, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image uses the rule of thirds well, but bad focus really hurts it. Otherwise it would be an excellant image.</td>', 'This image uses the rule of thirds well, but bad focus really hurts it. Otherwise it would be an excellant image.', '2003-10-27 20:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(463907, 42941, 1379, '<td valign="top">Oh, is this that WWII memorial in Virginia?  Nice shot of the splash.  Such a touching but frightening momument, no?</td>', 'Oh, is this that WWII memorial in Virginia?  Nice shot of the splash.  Such a touching but frightening momument, no?', '2003-10-27 20:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(463908, 42502, 1379, '<td valign="top">Yes!</td>', 'Yes!', '2003-10-27 20:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(463910, 42804, 9504, '<td valign="top">Oh if his head were in focus...this is a stunning shot of a beautiful bird!</td>', 'Oh if his head were in focus...this is a stunning shot of a beautiful bird!', '2003-10-27 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(463912, 43085, 5792, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this looks more like a poorly focused snapshot than anything. If you took an extreme closeup of your subject in sharp focus with a low f/number to decrease your depth of field you could turn this into a good image. Strong side lighting would help to.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this looks more like a poorly focused snapshot than anything. If you took an extreme closeup of your subject in sharp focus with a low f/number to decrease your depth of field you could turn this into a good image. Strong side lighting would help to.', '2003-10-27 20:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(463913, 42870, 9504, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was post-sharpened a little too much.  I may be mistaken... It is too busy for my tastes...but I like the off-center focus on the subject -- very nice.</td>', 'This looks like it was post-sharpened a little too much.  I may be mistaken... It is too busy for my tastes...but I like the off-center focus on the subject -- very nice.', '2003-10-27 20:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(463916, 42413, 9504, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I am wondering where this is at ....  Excellent image!</td>', 'Great shot.  I am wondering where this is at ....  Excellent image!', '2003-10-27 20:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(463917, 42510, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image could be composed much better. It looks like the tall tree in the center of the frame is you main subject. Maybe you could have walked intio the field or zoomed in on that tree so that it and the fog were the only things in the frame and that the tree was placed according to the rule of thirds and and is nearly as tall a the frame. I think that would have worked well. Low contrast and soft focus like you have would work well then.</td>', 'This image could be composed much better. It looks like the tall tree in the center of the frame is you main subject. Maybe you could have walked intio the field or zoomed in on that tree so that it and the fog were the only things in the frame and that the tree was placed according to the rule of thirds and and is nearly as tall a the frame. I think that would have worked well. Low contrast and soft focus like you have would work well then.', '2003-10-27 20:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(463921, 42509, 5792, '<td valign="top">Sepia is a good choice here, but the image correction resulting blotchy patches of focused and unfocused areas did not work for me. In my opinion it would have been better if that had not been done.</td>', 'Sepia is a good choice here, but the image correction resulting blotchy patches of focused and unfocused areas did not work for me. In my opinion it would have been better if that had not been done.', '2003-10-27 20:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(463923, 42549, 5792, '<td valign="top">With the addition of a couple of lights this would have been much, much better.</td>', 'With the addition of a couple of lights this would have been much, much better.', '2003-10-27 20:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(463928, 43176, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image had great potential, but the overall poor quality of the image completely overwhelms the fact you framed your subject well and that you got a great pose. Technical image quality is the first step toward a great picture.</td>', 'This image had great potential, but the overall poor quality of the image completely overwhelms the fact you framed your subject well and that you got a great pose. Technical image quality is the first step toward a great picture.', '2003-10-27 20:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(463934, 43113, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image could be improved considerably if the dog were placed in the sun and that if you took a closeup of the dog in sharp focus but with a shallow depth of field to achieve a nice soft focus on the background trees.</td>', 'This image could be improved considerably if the dog were placed in the sun and that if you took a closeup of the dog in sharp focus but with a shallow depth of field to achieve a nice soft focus on the background trees.', '2003-10-27 20:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(463937, 42761, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image would be much. much better if the seagul were in focus. Shallow focus would be even better.</td>', 'This image would be much. much better if the seagul were in focus. Shallow focus would be even better.', '2003-10-27 20:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(463942, 43271, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed image, but I wish the bird were larger in the frame.</td>', 'Nicely composed image, but I wish the bird were larger in the frame.', '2003-10-27 20:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(463946, 42883, 12922, '<td valign="top">Wow, great color in this shot!  It looks like the color picker in photoshop =)</td>', 'Wow, great color in this shot!  It looks like the color picker in photoshop =)', '2003-10-27 20:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(463948, 43237, 5792, '<td valign="top">This would work better if the set in a a different place in the town where the streetlight is not so prominent and background mountains are. There is another image in this challenge that has a remarkably similar setting that works much better. It is at:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=43239</td>', 'This would work better if the set in a a different place in the town where the streetlight is not so prominent and background mountains are. There is another image in this challenge that has a remarkably similar setting that works much better. It is at://www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=43239', '2003-10-27 20:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(463950, 42549, 12922, '<td valign="top">Good shot, a little dark with muddled shadows.  I think it would look great with some longer, darker shadows and brighter light source.  Oh, and a lego Knight, not a lego space guy! =)</td>', 'Good shot, a little dark with muddled shadows.  I think it would look great with some longer, darker shadows and brighter light source.  Oh, and a lego Knight, not a lego space guy! =)', '2003-10-27 20:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(463952, 43025, 7733, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting!</td>', 'Excellent lighting!', '2003-10-27 20:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(463954, 43391, 11284, '<td valign="top">It is a totally different picture in B/W.<br/>Ech ...</td>', 'It is a totally different picture in B/W.Ech ...', '2003-10-27 20:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(463958, 43302, 12922, '<td valign="top">Looks a little odd with a featureless face/body and a bright white hat.  I''d like to see what it would''ve looked like with the whole shadow, too.  I like the well defined light/dark regions and how she crosses the line between them.</td>', 'Looks a little odd with a featureless face/body and a bright white hat.  I''d like to see what it would''ve looked like with the whole shadow, too.  I like the well defined light/dark regions and how she crosses the line between them.', '2003-10-27 20:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(464002, 42857, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and nice long shadows. Slanted horizon.</td>', 'Interesting textures and nice long shadows. Slanted horizon.', '2003-10-27 21:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(464003, 43333, 12922, '<td valign="top">One of the few "lonely person" shots that doesn''t look really, really posed--good work!  I think a little narrower DOF to make the fence blurry would be nice, but great shot.</td>', 'One of the few "lonely person" shots that doesn''t look really, really posed--good work!  I think a little narrower DOF to make the fence blurry would be nice, but great shot.', '2003-10-27 21:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(464007, 43207, 10402, '<td valign="top">She looks like she''s having fun and the vast expanse of empty beach suggests she''s alone. That says solitude to me! Good lighting; the long thing shadow is intriguing. But I especially like the unusual point of view, from over the water. Very creative.</td>', 'She looks like she''s having fun and the vast expanse of empty beach suggests she''s alone. That says solitude to me! Good lighting; the long thing shadow is intriguing. But I especially like the unusual point of view, from over the water. Very creative.', '2003-10-27 21:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(464009, 42501, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, with two trees "growing out of" the ends of the sofa and trees at either side to provide a natural frame. The tall format helps emphasize the insignificance of the sofa, although it is clearly the center of initerest here with its contrasting colors.</td>', 'I like the composition, with two trees "growing out of" the ends of the sofa and trees at either side to provide a natural frame. The tall format helps emphasize the insignificance of the sofa, although it is clearly the center of initerest here with its contrasting colors.', '2003-10-27 21:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(464010, 42580, 10402, '<td valign="top">I think it conveys sadness more than loneliness,  but you''ve captured a great pose in a creative arrangement.</td>', 'I think it conveys sadness more than loneliness,  but you''ve captured a great pose in a creative arrangement.', '2003-10-27 22:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(464014, 42873, 8637, '<td valign="top">Superb capture...especially like the rough textured background.</td>', 'Superb capture...especially like the rough textured background.', '2003-10-27 22:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(464021, 43285, 10402, '<td valign="top">Everything in pairs except one. Creative. Nice colors and I like the arrangement.</td>', 'Everything in pairs except one. Creative. Nice colors and I like the arrangement.', '2003-10-27 22:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(464027, 42886, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great color and a very striking image. Sailors are often alone and the expanse of empty ocean emphasizes this. The bright, beautiful sky definitely makes this photo convey solitude and the title reinforces this.</td>', 'Great color and a very striking image. Sailors are often alone and the expanse of empty ocean emphasizes this. The bright, beautiful sky definitely makes this photo convey solitude and the title reinforces this.', '2003-10-27 22:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(464029, 43078, 12902, '<td valign="top">Great fall colours, enchanting model. You had some fun taking the picture.</td>', 'Great fall colours, enchanting model. You had some fun taking the picture.', '2003-10-27 22:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(464033, 42935, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great colors and textures. The couple stands out nicely and although a centered subject is not conventional composition, it works well here to emphasize they are alone. But a couple alone doesn''t really suggest loneliness or solitude; indeed this photo give me the impression they are just waiting for you to put the camera away! I don''t usually like borders, but this one works very well for this image.</td>', 'Great colors and textures. The couple stands out nicely and although a centered subject is not conventional composition, it works well here to emphasize they are alone. But a couple alone doesn''t really suggest loneliness or solitude; indeed this photo give me the impression they are just waiting for you to put the camera away! I don''t usually like borders, but this one works very well for this image.', '2003-10-27 22:33:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(464034, 42897, 4338, '<td valign="top">i feel if the dog was a little further away fro the camera it would have implied "alone" a bit more. other than that i like the image</td>', 'i feel if the dog was a little further away fro the camera it would have implied "alone" a bit more. other than that i like the image', '2003-10-27 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(464044, 42803, 13435, '<td valign="top">I think if she wasnt looking at the picture, then she would have looked VERY lonely. I dont think this photograph suggests loneliness.</td>', 'I think if she wasnt looking at the picture, then she would have looked VERY lonely. I dont think this photograph suggests loneliness.', '2003-10-27 23:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(464046, 42710, 13435, '<td valign="top">Very Nice Idea ... Thumbs up. <br/>A lot of ppl ended up shooting themselves because of loneliness ...!</td>', 'Very Nice Idea ... Thumbs up. A lot of ppl ended up shooting themselves because of loneliness ...!', '2003-10-27 23:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(464047, 43331, 13435, '<td valign="top">Wow ... Not Suitable For Children. Very Nice Picture :)</td>', 'Wow ... Not Suitable For Children. Very Nice Picture :)', '2003-10-27 23:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(464052, 42586, 13435, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition</td>', 'Very nice composition', '2003-10-27 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(464056, 43242, 13435, '<td valign="top">Very Nice</td>', 'Very Nice', '2003-10-27 23:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(464059, 43208, 13435, '<td valign="top">:S what is it :S</td>', ':S what is it :S', '2003-10-27 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(464066, 42858, 13561, '<td valign="top">I like this one for the contrast in colors and it grabbed my attention.  I get the sense of loneliness from this image.</td>', 'I like this one for the contrast in colors and it grabbed my attention.  I get the sense of loneliness from this image.', '2003-10-27 23:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(464072, 43364, 7226, '<td valign="top">i had to... 10</td>', 'i had to... 10', '2003-10-27 23:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(464074, 42802, 7226, '<td valign="top">damn that boy is fine, oh yeah, nice shot</td>', 'damn that boy is fine, oh yeah, nice shot', '2003-10-27 23:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(464103, 42883, 6888, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot, great colors, silhouette really stands out</td>', 'fantastic shot, great colors, silhouette really stands out', '2003-10-28 00:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(464104, 43030, 6888, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot, colors are really nice, silhouette stands out nicely</td>', 'fantastic shot, colors are really nice, silhouette stands out nicely', '2003-10-28 00:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(464106, 43232, 6888, '<td valign="top">nice composition, silhouette stands out nicely, i like the way the water fades away to nothing</td>', 'nice composition, silhouette stands out nicely, i like the way the water fades away to nothing', '2003-10-28 00:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(464109, 42690, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the effect the lighting has on the image.  There''s actually a serene feeling to it rather than solitude or loneliness - fits the challenge though.  Good focus and the composition is nice.  Solid photo.  7</td>', 'I love the effect the lighting has on the image.  There''s actually a serene feeling to it rather than solitude or loneliness - fits the challenge though.  Good focus and the composition is nice.  Solid photo.  7', '2003-10-28 00:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(464110, 43203, 6888, '<td valign="top">i just can''t seem to make the connection with the challenge, she doesn''t really seem to be alone or lonely...</td>', 'i just can''t seem to make the connection with the challenge, she doesn''t really seem to be alone or lonely...', '2003-10-28 00:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(464111, 43378, 6888, '<td valign="top">this is a nice photo, however i find it difficult to make the connection to the challenge</td>', 'this is a nice photo, however i find it difficult to make the connection to the challenge', '2003-10-28 00:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(464112, 43118, 6888, '<td valign="top">he is definitely all alone, but the effect you have applied to the photo is very distracting</td>', 'he is definitely all alone, but the effect you have applied to the photo is very distracting', '2003-10-28 00:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(464113, 43291, 6888, '<td valign="top">i find it difficult to make the connection to the challenge, this just doesn;t seem to convey alone or lonliness to me</td>', 'i find it difficult to make the connection to the challenge, this just doesn;t seem to convey alone or lonliness to me', '2003-10-28 00:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(464114, 42889, 6888, '<td valign="top">unfortunately i cannot connect this photo to the challenge...it just doesn;t say lonliness or alone to me</td>', 'unfortunately i cannot connect this photo to the challenge...it just doesn;t say lonliness or alone to me', '2003-10-28 00:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(464115, 42854, 6888, '<td valign="top">much too dark, almost a "Black Bear at Midnight" shot</td>', 'much too dark, almost a "Black Bear at Midnight" shot', '2003-10-28 00:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(464117, 43187, 6888, '<td valign="top">although he is aone, the overall shot doesn''t seem to convey the feeling to me</td>', 'although he is aone, the overall shot doesn''t seem to convey the feeling to me', '2003-10-28 00:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(464118, 43211, 6888, '<td valign="top">unfortunately this doen;t convey the feeling of alone or lonliness to me</td>', 'unfortunately this doen;t convey the feeling of alone or lonliness to me', '2003-10-28 00:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(464119, 43290, 6888, '<td valign="top">unfortunately this just doesn''t convey the feeling of being alone or lonliness to me</td>', 'unfortunately this just doesn''t convey the feeling of being alone or lonliness to me', '2003-10-28 01:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(464120, 42520, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great scene.  Good feeling of solitude but with a positive spin.  The colors are good but I wish they were a little more vivid.   Good lighting - a little harsh in the top right corner but good over all.    I think the focus should be a little sharper on the fisherperson.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Great scene.  Good feeling of solitude but with a positive spin.  The colors are good but I wish they were a little more vivid.   Good lighting - a little harsh in the top right corner but good over all.    I think the focus should be a little sharper on the fisherperson.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-28 01:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(464122, 43279, 6888, '<td valign="top">unfortunately this just doesn''t convey the feeling of being alone or lonliness to me, also the flash is very distracting, looks to be a hasily put together shot just to have something entered in the challenge...with more preparation the effect of you reflected in the mirror could become a very interesting photo</td>', 'unfortunately this just doesn''t convey the feeling of being alone or lonliness to me, also the flash is very distracting, looks to be a hasily put together shot just to have something entered in the challenge...with more preparation the effect of you reflected in the mirror could become a very interesting photo', '2003-10-28 01:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(464123, 42752, 9027, '<td valign="top">WOW! love this shot. beautiful colors and great dof. love the blur effect. nicely captured moment. :o)</td>', 'WOW! love this shot. beautiful colors and great dof. love the blur effect. nicely captured moment. :o)', '2003-10-28 01:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(464124, 43199, 9027, '<td valign="top">great detail and focus. don''t feel the red border adds to the shot, though i assume you are using it to emphasie the red in the image. perhaps a thinner border. slightly overcropped on the bottom.</td>', 'great detail and focus. don''t feel the red border adds to the shot, though i assume you are using it to emphasie the red in the image. perhaps a thinner border. slightly overcropped on the bottom.', '2003-10-28 01:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(464125, 43099, 9027, '<td valign="top">cute idea. i suppose it was a candid moment, but wish it was less cluttered. the red of the truck esp. takes attention away from the subject. perhaps selective desaturation may have helped. also, could  use more contrast/sharpness. feels a little hazy, then again, maybe it''s just my screen. :o)</td>', 'cute idea. i suppose it was a candid moment, but wish it was less cluttered. the red of the truck esp. takes attention away from the subject. perhaps selective desaturation may have helped. also, could  use more contrast/sharpness. feels a little hazy, then again, maybe it''s just my screen. :o)', '2003-10-28 01:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(464126, 42587, 9027, '<td valign="top">great composition. love the colors. this is one of the rare cases where the size doesn''t detract too much from the overall effect. still would love it see it larger though!!</td>', 'great composition. love the colors. this is one of the rare cases where the size doesn''t detract too much from the overall effect. still would love it see it larger though!!', '2003-10-28 01:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(464128, 43086, 9027, '<td valign="top">for some reason i like the starkness. nice texture and patterns in the leaf.</td>', 'for some reason i like the starkness. nice texture and patterns in the leaf.', '2003-10-28 01:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(464131, 42891, 11923, '<td valign="top">The colors have come out really well, focus is good too.  The sunlight is a bit harsh but not so much it detracts too much for me.  A good photo.  6</td>', 'The colors have come out really well, focus is good too.  The sunlight is a bit harsh but not so much it detracts too much for me.  A good photo.  6', '2003-10-28 01:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(464132, 42821, 9027, '<td valign="top">i love the vertical crop on this. has a scroll-like feel. the thick border is a bit much though. it fights with all the predominately black shapes in the image. perhaps if you took out the white border.</td>', 'i love the vertical crop on this. has a scroll-like feel. the thick border is a bit much though. it fights with all the predominately black shapes in the image. perhaps if you took out the white border.', '2003-10-28 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(464134, 42813, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the color difference, that plus the difference in food items helps give it an all alone feel.  The lighting is good as is the focus (seems a bit overcontrasted though), my main issue is the image doesn''t have any appeal on an interest level for me.  Well done on the technical side, just not as strong interest wise.  5</td>', 'I like the color difference, that plus the difference in food items helps give it an all alone feel.  The lighting is good as is the focus (seems a bit overcontrasted though), my main issue is the image doesn''t have any appeal on an interest level for me.  Well done on the technical side, just not as strong interest wise.  5', '2003-10-28 01:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(464135, 42376, 9027, '<td valign="top">great b/w image. the rock mound kinda makes me think of an elephant. love the framing provided by the tree.</td>', 'great b/w image. the rock mound kinda makes me think of an elephant. love the framing provided by the tree.', '2003-10-28 01:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(464137, 42497, 9027, '<td valign="top">interesting blue cast. great composition.</td>', 'interesting blue cast. great composition.', '2003-10-28 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(464138, 42589, 9027, '<td valign="top">really like the idea here. maybe it is my screen, but the image is very dark and grainy.</td>', 'really like the idea here. maybe it is my screen, but the image is very dark and grainy.', '2003-10-28 01:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(464141, 43416, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice composition. good dof use and colors.</td>', 'nice composition. good dof use and colors.', '2003-10-28 01:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(464142, 43317, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow that is one fluffy cat.  Does fit the challenge.  The lighting is okay, a little harsh and blownout in the right-hand corner.  I''m not sure why, but the image looks a little pixelated, maybe over contrasted?    I like the fact that the subject isn''t directly in the middle of the image.  A nice shot.  5</td>', 'Wow that is one fluffy cat.  Does fit the challenge.  The lighting is okay, a little harsh and blownout in the right-hand corner.  I''m not sure why, but the image looks a little pixelated, maybe over contrasted?    I like the fact that the subject isn''t directly in the middle of the image.  A nice shot.  5', '2003-10-28 01:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(464143, 42502, 9027, '<td valign="top">when i read the title, i was thinking calves as in the ones on our feet. haha. i like the landscape, but feels very grey, could use some saturation to bring out all the beautiful fall colors.</td>', 'when i read the title, i was thinking calves as in the ones on our feet. haha. i like the landscape, but feels very grey, could use some saturation to bring out all the beautiful fall colors.', '2003-10-28 01:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(464144, 43380, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice soft lighting. i like the different approach you took. :o)</td>', 'nice soft lighting. i like the different approach you took. :o)', '2003-10-28 01:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(464148, 43100, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white image.  Focus is good and I like the lighting, but it does seem a little bit harsh in some areas.  Composition is great, subject brings a lot of interest to the photo.  I would''ve probably cropped out that window or frame on the wall as it draws the eye away from the main subject.  Great photo.  8</td>', 'Nice black and white image.  Focus is good and I like the lighting, but it does seem a little bit harsh in some areas.  Composition is great, subject brings a lot of interest to the photo.  I would''ve probably cropped out that window or frame on the wall as it draws the eye away from the main subject.  Great photo.  8', '2003-10-28 01:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(464151, 43134, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice perspective. love the inclusion of the rocks in the foreground and how the person is semi concealed.</td>', 'nice perspective. love the inclusion of the rocks in the foreground and how the person is semi concealed.', '2003-10-28 01:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(464152, 42502, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.  Fits all alone well.  The focus is good and I like the lighting, but I wish the photo was a little brighter over all.  Also, the colors look like the could be a bit more vivid, the green is nice and rich, but the orangey-yellow looks a little washed out.  A wonderful photo, well done.  7</td>', 'Lovely scene.  Fits all alone well.  The focus is good and I like the lighting, but I wish the photo was a little brighter over all.  Also, the colors look like the could be a bit more vivid, the green is nice and rich, but the orangey-yellow looks a little washed out.  A wonderful photo, well done.  7', '2003-10-28 01:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(464153, 42516, 9027, '<td valign="top">cool wall tiles! think this would have been stronger if the colors had been brightened through a little saturation or adjustments in contrast.</td>', 'cool wall tiles! think this would have been stronger if the colors had been brightened through a little saturation or adjustments in contrast.', '2003-10-28 01:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(464154, 42872, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice! i really love this. great use of landscape and positioning of the subject. evocative.</td>', 'nice! i really love this. great use of landscape and positioning of the subject. evocative.', '2003-10-28 01:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(464156, 43060, 9027, '<td valign="top">great low angled shot. good dof and  use of complimentary colors very effective.</td>', 'great low angled shot. good dof and  use of complimentary colors very effective.', '2003-10-28 01:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(464158, 43205, 11923, '<td valign="top">Aww the poor thing.  Its so cute.  I love the richness of color.  The focus is excellent.  I think it fits alone very well.  If another opportunity arose, I would shift the view, so that island or whatever it is in the water wasn''t there.  I think an unbroken expanse of sea would enhance the depth and thus the alone feeling.  Nicely done.  7</td>', 'Aww the poor thing.  Its so cute.  I love the richness of color.  The focus is excellent.  I think it fits alone very well.  If another opportunity arose, I would shift the view, so that island or whatever it is in the water wasn''t there.  I think an unbroken expanse of sea would enhance the depth and thus the alone feeling.  Nicely done.  7', '2003-10-28 01:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(464159, 43193, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice use of repetitious objects. love the colors. think this would have also worked if you cropped out more of the background and had your subject sitting closer to the camera, filling the frame with all the chairs.</td>', 'nice use of repetitious objects. love the colors. think this would have also worked if you cropped out more of the background and had your subject sitting closer to the camera, filling the frame with all the chairs.', '2003-10-28 01:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(464160, 43372, 9027, '<td valign="top">the crops a bit close and the pillar (probably reason for crop?) distracts from the image.</td>', 'the crops a bit close and the pillar (probably reason for crop?) distracts from the image.', '2003-10-28 01:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(464162, 42560, 11923, '<td valign="top">Marvelous color, excellent use of distance and space.  I get a nice feeling of solitude from this image.  I even like the fact that the subject is not in focus, it helps make him/her feel that much further away.  A nicely captured image.  7</td>', 'Marvelous color, excellent use of distance and space.  I get a nice feeling of solitude from this image.  I even like the fact that the subject is not in focus, it helps make him/her feel that much further away.  A nicely captured image.  7', '2003-10-28 01:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(464163, 43274, 9027, '<td valign="top">lovely shot. nice soft tones. what is she eating? or are those just the chubby cheeks she was born with? hehe.</td>', 'lovely shot. nice soft tones. what is she eating? or are those just the chubby cheeks she was born with? hehe.', '2003-10-28 01:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(464165, 43223, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  Would work well in the infinity challenge I''d think.  I like the endless feel, and the perspective gives me a feeling that the person is all alone.  I like the coloring used for the image, the cool tone enhances the crisp lines.  Very nice.  8</td>', 'Great photo!  Would work well in the infinity challenge I''d think.  I like the endless feel, and the perspective gives me a feeling that the person is all alone.  I like the coloring used for the image, the cool tone enhances the crisp lines.  Very nice.  8', '2003-10-28 01:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(464166, 43162, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice! love the dramatics with the spotlight/long shadow. well composed.</td>', 'nice! love the dramatics with the spotlight/long shadow. well composed.', '2003-10-28 01:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(464167, 42520, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice composition. i like how the boardwalk leads you into the picture, as well as the zigzag patterns created the objects. don''t think you need the border though. doesn''t add to the image.</td>', 'nice composition. i like how the boardwalk leads you into the picture, as well as the zigzag patterns created the objects. don''t think you need the border though. doesn''t add to the image.', '2003-10-28 01:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(464168, 42626, 9027, '<td valign="top">cool retro colors. glad the camera is not reflected in the mirror! :o)</td>', 'cool retro colors. glad the camera is not reflected in the mirror! :o)', '2003-10-28 01:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(464171, 43215, 11923, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully simple image.  Definitely has a solitary feel to it, the lighting is perfect.  Great focus, there isn''t really anything I would suggest changing.  Simplicity at its finest.  10</td>', 'A wonderfully simple image.  Definitely has a solitary feel to it, the lighting is perfect.  Great focus, there isn''t really anything I would suggest changing.  Simplicity at its finest.  10', '2003-10-28 01:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(464173, 43303, 9027, '<td valign="top">beautiful b/w. love the tree. another crop option would have been to cut off more of the grass and inclue more sky.</td>', 'beautiful b/w. love the tree. another crop option would have been to cut off more of the grass and inclue more sky.', '2003-10-28 01:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(464174, 43240, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, the lighting helps enhance the feeling of decay.  Focus is pretty good.  I don''t really get a feeling of solitude or loneliness though, especially with those cows in the background.  A nice solid photo.  6</td>', 'An interesting image, the lighting helps enhance the feeling of decay.  Focus is pretty good.  I don''t really get a feeling of solitude or loneliness though, especially with those cows in the background.  A nice solid photo.  6', '2003-10-28 01:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(464175, 42521, 9027, '<td valign="top">love the colors. well captured drop. would have liked to see this a little less centered. or something. (something bugs me about this, but don''t know what)</td>', 'love the colors. well captured drop. would have liked to see this a little less centered. or something. (something bugs me about this, but don''t know what)', '2003-10-28 01:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(464176, 43379, 9027, '<td valign="top">hahaha! this is great. made me laugh. nicely composed. love how the guy fades into the b/w. happy halloween!</td>', 'hahaha! this is great. made me laugh. nicely composed. love how the guy fades into the b/w. happy halloween!', '2003-10-28 01:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(464178, 43333, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice job! well composed shot.</td>', 'nice job! well composed shot.', '2003-10-28 01:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(464179, 43057, 9027, '<td valign="top">love this! fabulous shapes. nice crop. love how the two people are off to the side.</td>', 'love this! fabulous shapes. nice crop. love how the two people are off to the side.', '2003-10-28 01:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(464180, 43392, 11923, '<td valign="top">A very crisp image.  I like the use of space, does give a feeling of solitude.  The figurine is very nice itself, so it creates interest.  I like the border, really ties the piece together.  Nice work.  7</td>', 'A very crisp image.  I like the use of space, does give a feeling of solitude.  The figurine is very nice itself, so it creates interest.  I like the border, really ties the piece together.  Nice work.  7', '2003-10-28 01:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(464183, 43325, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Its simple, but something easy to relate to.  I like the composition and lighting - a little lighter would be more to my preference but really its great as is.  8</td>', 'Nice image.  Its simple, but something easy to relate to.  I like the composition and lighting - a little lighter would be more to my preference but really its great as is.  8', '2003-10-28 02:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(464184, 42763, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very fun image.  I like the use of black &amp; white, the use of space is good - increases the alone/solitude feeling.  Great composition anf focus.   Nothing I''d really suggest changing.  9</td>', 'Very fun image.  I like the use of black & white, the use of space is good - increases the alone/solitude feeling.  Great composition anf focus.   Nothing I''d really suggest changing.  9', '2003-10-28 02:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(464186, 43090, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh what a cute little guy.  Nice clean presentation.  Pose of the subject gives a good feeling of solitude and alone but still an upbeat tone.  Color is great.  I like the use of space as well.    A great image.  10</td>', 'Heh what a cute little guy.  Nice clean presentation.  Pose of the subject gives a good feeling of solitude and alone but still an upbeat tone.  Color is great.  I like the use of space as well.    A great image.  10', '2003-10-28 02:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(464187, 42870, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge very well, the lighting is good.  I like the composition and the sepia-like tone.  Only thing odd is it seems over contrasted or over sharpened.   Would rather the leaves looked softer.  Still a great photo.  Good job.  8</td>', 'Fits the challenge very well, the lighting is good.  I like the composition and the sepia-like tone.  Only thing odd is it seems over contrasted or over sharpened.   Would rather the leaves looked softer.  Still a great photo.  Good job.  8', '2003-10-28 02:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(464188, 43295, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good image, fits alone well.  I like the colors but I think the light is making it a little washed out.  Also, I wish the crop wasn''t so close, a wider expanse of empty sea would help promote the alone feeling even more.  Good shot.  6</td>', 'Good image, fits alone well.  I like the colors but I think the light is making it a little washed out.  Also, I wish the crop wasn''t so close, a wider expanse of empty sea would help promote the alone feeling even more.  Good shot.  6', '2003-10-28 02:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(464189, 43211, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gosh.. its an interesting image, but I think its too busy for me.  I like the different colors and patterns but all together it makes the image look jumbled - which in turn doesn''t make me think of solitude or loneliness.. just chaos.  The lighting is good and the focus is excellent though.  I don''t understand the title - I had to look Torsion up.  A bold image, just doesn''t work for me.  5</td>', 'Gosh.. its an interesting image, but I think its too busy for me.  I like the different colors and patterns but all together it makes the image look jumbled - which in turn doesn''t make me think of solitude or loneliness.. just chaos.  The lighting is good and the focus is excellent though.  I don''t understand the title - I had to look Torsion up.  A bold image, just doesn''t work for me.  5', '2003-10-28 02:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(464191, 42542, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well, I love the sadness of the piece.  Even the poor bird looks unhappy.  Colors and lighting are good, very emotive image.  Nice focus.  The one thing that distracts for me is the border though.  It being so bright of a contrast to the image draws my eyes away.  Great shot.  8</td>', 'Fits the challenge well, I love the sadness of the piece.  Even the poor bird looks unhappy.  Colors and lighting are good, very emotive image.  Nice focus.  The one thing that distracts for me is the border though.  It being so bright of a contrast to the image draws my eyes away.  Great shot.  8', '2003-10-28 02:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(464192, 43086, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful vivid color.  I like the composition - use of space is great.  Focus looks to be good.  Fits the challenge, though I don''t get a sense of solitude or loneliness from it.  Simple, but very well done.  8</td>', 'Wonderful vivid color.  I like the composition - use of space is great.  Focus looks to be good.  Fits the challenge, though I don''t get a sense of solitude or loneliness from it.  Simple, but very well done.  8', '2003-10-28 02:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(464193, 43261, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice image!  Use of natural light is great, color is fantastic.  I love the composition - the use of space really enhances the alone aspect of the photo.  Would prefer the whole image to be in focus, just as a personal preference.  Also the bright white border draws my eyes out of the photo.  Other than that, I think its a great image.  7</td>', 'Nice image!  Use of natural light is great, color is fantastic.  I love the composition - the use of space really enhances the alone aspect of the photo.  Would prefer the whole image to be in focus, just as a personal preference.  Also the bright white border draws my eyes out of the photo.  Other than that, I think its a great image.  7', '2003-10-28 02:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(464194, 43384, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Those are some dramatic colors.  Looks a bit oversaturated with the yellows kind of - is that natural or fiddled with?  Lighting is good, I like the focus.  The subject works well, great especially around this time of year.  I have to admit I wish the photo in general were a little brighter so you could pick out just a bit more detail.  Still a great shot.  7</td>', 'Wow.  Those are some dramatic colors.  Looks a bit oversaturated with the yellows kind of - is that natural or fiddled with?  Lighting is good, I like the focus.  The subject works well, great especially around this time of year.  I have to admit I wish the photo in general were a little brighter so you could pick out just a bit more detail.  Still a great shot.  7', '2003-10-28 02:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(464195, 42881, 11923, '<td valign="top">Goodness, very unexpected.  I really like the contrast of the colors which are nice and vivid, as well as the unexpected nature of the background.  Really adds interest to the shot.  Great focus, nice lighting.  I''ll be honest and say I don''t get a feeling of alone for this image, simply because the frog appears to be on someone''s head - thus having two things.  A perception issue I''d say.  Still I love this shot.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Goodness, very unexpected.  I really like the contrast of the colors which are nice and vivid, as well as the unexpected nature of the background.  Really adds interest to the shot.  Great focus, nice lighting.  I''ll be honest and say I don''t get a feeling of alone for this image, simply because the frog appears to be on someone''s head - thus having two things.  A perception issue I''d say.  Still I love this shot.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-28 02:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(464196, 43386, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of distance.  Colors are rich and spectacular.  Focus is good as is the use of natural light.   Fits the challenge well, a solid photo.  8</td>', 'Excellent use of distance.  Colors are rich and spectacular.  Focus is good as is the use of natural light.   Fits the challenge well, a solid photo.  8', '2003-10-28 02:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(464197, 43052, 11923, '<td valign="top">An emotive image, especially since the grave seems to be overrun.  Fits the challenge well.  Use of natural light is good as is the focus.  Nice work.  7</td>', 'An emotive image, especially since the grave seems to be overrun.  Fits the challenge well.  Use of natural light is good as is the focus.  Nice work.  7', '2003-10-28 02:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(464198, 43379, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, an interesting image.  I like the use of space, and the pumpkin''s expression is great.  I''m getting more a feeling of fear than solitude or loneliness though.  Still I think its a fun photo.  6</td>', 'Heh, an interesting image.  I like the use of space, and the pumpkin''s expression is great.  I''m getting more a feeling of fear than solitude or loneliness though.  Still I think its a fun photo.  6', '2003-10-28 02:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(464199, 42436, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow I love that sky.  From the title I expected to see a figure in the photo but I can''t make one out, so my next thought is this is what you see when you are alone.  Its a great image, the sky brings to mind desolation, but then the city lights change it to simple solitude for me.  The night aspect helps give the loneliness as well.  Focus looks good as is composition.  Very nice.  7</td>', 'Wow I love that sky.  From the title I expected to see a figure in the photo but I can''t make one out, so my next thought is this is what you see when you are alone.  Its a great image, the sky brings to mind desolation, but then the city lights change it to simple solitude for me.  The night aspect helps give the loneliness as well.  Focus looks good as is composition.  Very nice.  7', '2003-10-28 02:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(464201, 43422, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, I like the angles and lines.  Use of black &amp; white is good, though I wish there were a higher contrast.  Good focus, lighting is nice.  A technically sound image.  I don''t see how it goes with the challenge though, and I only briefly connect with it on an interest basis as mentioned previously about the angles.  I''m afraid I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness.  But, it is a great shot, very nicely done on the technical side.  6</td>', 'A nice shot, I like the angles and lines.  Use of black & white is good, though I wish there were a higher contrast.  Good focus, lighting is nice.  A technically sound image.  I don''t see how it goes with the challenge though, and I only briefly connect with it on an interest basis as mentioned previously about the angles.  I''m afraid I don''t get a feeling of solitude or loneliness.  But, it is a great shot, very nicely done on the technical side.  6', '2003-10-28 02:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(464204, 42956, 11923, '<td valign="top">Cute little critter!  I like the image, the lighting is good and colors are vivid but though I do like that in a photo, in this case they really over power the shot.  Not sure if the saturation or the brightness was played with in post-editing but if possible I''d tone the color down because it really detracts for me.  Great focus on the chipmunk, details are very clear.  I like the expanse of natural setting in the background, helps give a deeper feeling of alone.  Nice work.  5</td>', 'Cute little critter!  I like the image, the lighting is good and colors are vivid but though I do like that in a photo, in this case they really over power the shot.  Not sure if the saturation or the brightness was played with in post-editing but if possible I''d tone the color down because it really detracts for me.  Great focus on the chipmunk, details are very clear.  I like the expanse of natural setting in the background, helps give a deeper feeling of alone.  Nice work.  5', '2003-10-28 02:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(464205, 42626, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color, has great lines and a wonderful crispness.  I wish the focus (which looks very good) also extended to the subject in the mirror - would really give the image that extra edge.  Also, I wish the crop wasn''t so tight.  The walls are a very nice rich color, would look good with more of it framing the mirror.  Other than that, its a very sound image.  Nice lighting, great composition.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Nice use of color, has great lines and a wonderful crispness.  I wish the focus (which looks very good) also extended to the subject in the mirror - would really give the image that extra edge.  Also, I wish the crop wasn''t so tight.  The walls are a very nice rich color, would look good with more of it framing the mirror.  Other than that, its a very sound image.  Nice lighting, great composition.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-28 02:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(464206, 42375, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great photo.  I love the contrast and color.  Very much like the star action.  Good use of light.  The perspective is great.  Lighthouses in general have a lonely feel to them but this one possibly because of the coloring seems very strong and stable - not so much a lonely feel.  Vaguely solitary though, fits the challenge all the same.  Nice photo with a good impact.  8</td>', 'Wow!  Great photo.  I love the contrast and color.  Very much like the star action.  Good use of light.  The perspective is great.  Lighthouses in general have a lonely feel to them but this one possibly because of the coloring seems very strong and stable - not so much a lonely feel.  Vaguely solitary though, fits the challenge all the same.  Nice photo with a good impact.  8', '2003-10-28 02:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(464207, 43212, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  The perspective is good, as is the lighting.  Pose of the subject really hints at an inner pain.  Can easily infer loneliness from his posture - I like the addition of the phone, adds a bit of depth to the image, as if he learned something horrible from a call or is waiting on someone to call who never will.  Gets the imagination going.  Great image.  7</td>', 'Interesting photo.  The perspective is good, as is the lighting.  Pose of the subject really hints at an inner pain.  Can easily infer loneliness from his posture - I like the addition of the phone, adds a bit of depth to the image, as if he learned something horrible from a call or is waiting on someone to call who never will.  Gets the imagination going.  Great image.  7', '2003-10-28 02:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(464208, 43203, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very cute child, nice lighting to capture the tonal ranges in her skin.  Focus on her expressive face is good.  A nice snapshot of a child, but.. I don''t see the connection to the challenge unfortunately.  She doesn''t seem alone as evidenced by all the people around so that takes away a lonely or solitude element as well.  I think this would''ve done well in a different challenge, as it is an appealing photo, I just don''t see how it fits.  5</td>', 'Very cute child, nice lighting to capture the tonal ranges in her skin.  Focus on her expressive face is good.  A nice snapshot of a child, but.. I don''t see the connection to the challenge unfortunately.  She doesn''t seem alone as evidenced by all the people around so that takes away a lonely or solitude element as well.  I think this would''ve done well in a different challenge, as it is an appealing photo, I just don''t see how it fits.  5', '2003-10-28 02:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(464210, 43210, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow.. I wouldn''t mind lonely nights that begin like this.  The image is spectacular.  The colors are wonderful, the silhouette is perfect.  Focus is great, everything is so crisp.  There''s nothing I do not like about this image.  Very well done - I''m envious!  10</td>', 'Wow.. I wouldn''t mind lonely nights that begin like this.  The image is spectacular.  The colors are wonderful, the silhouette is perfect.  Focus is great, everything is so crisp.  There''s nothing I do not like about this image.  Very well done - I''m envious!  10', '2003-10-28 03:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(464211, 43403, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very emotive image.  Definite sadness and I can infer a loneliness from missing the friend.  Good use of light and black &amp; white.  Focus is excellent.  A very nice tribute to someone lost.  7</td>', 'Very emotive image.  Definite sadness and I can infer a loneliness from missing the friend.  Good use of light and black & white.  Focus is excellent.  A very nice tribute to someone lost.  7', '2003-10-28 03:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(464214, 43240, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but I would have liked it more were the car off center.</td>', 'I like this photo, but I would have liked it more were the car off center.', '2003-10-28 03:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(464215, 42799, 12252, '<td valign="top">The horizon isn''t horizontal.</td>', 'The horizon isn''t horizontal.', '2003-10-28 03:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(464217, 42837, 12252, '<td valign="top">The sky behind the tree looks too light. Otherwise, nice image.</td>', 'The sky behind the tree looks too light. Otherwise, nice image.', '2003-10-28 03:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(464244, 43109, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I''d have corrrected the slight tilt, but otherwise it''s fine. Like the pull of subject to and from the bright lightss and the lonely figure. One of few shots so far that nails this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot. I''d have corrrected the slight tilt, but otherwise it''s fine. Like the pull of subject to and from the bright lightss and the lonely figure. One of few shots so far that nails this challenge.', '2003-10-28 05:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(464247, 42610, 13263, '<td valign="top">I like the angles in this</td>', 'I like the angles in this', '2003-10-28 05:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(464249, 43112, 13263, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, not sure about lonely though</td>', 'I like the photo, not sure about lonely though', '2003-10-28 05:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(464250, 42552, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I usually try to ignore the more imposing borders, but this one, for me, distracts hugely from the image: and it IS part of your submission. I think the use of a colour from the image weakens the impact of those colours IN the image enormously.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I usually try to ignore the more imposing borders, but this one, for me, distracts hugely from the image: and it IS part of your submission. I think the use of a colour from the image weakens the impact of those colours IN the image enormously.', '2003-10-28 05:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(464251, 42885, 13263, '<td valign="top">well constructed</td>', 'well constructed', '2003-10-28 05:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(464252, 42599, 6999, '<td valign="top">Top image: might have used something like Neatimage to clean up the noise in the blue, shouldn''t have been hard. Wonderfully odd portrait though.</td>', 'Top image: might have used something like Neatimage to clean up the noise in the blue, shouldn''t have been hard. Wonderfully odd portrait though.', '2003-10-28 05:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(464253, 42510, 6999, '<td valign="top">Could have been wonderful. The small image doesn''t help, and I''m certain that losing the tree from the right of frame would help. This kind of shot, in general, works well if composed against the ''rule of thirds'' - I think I''d have tried to take it from the other side of that tree, to make the line of the fence perpendicular to the poplar. Slight blur in the foreground details - was this hot from a moving vehicle?</td>', 'Could have been wonderful. The small image doesn''t help, and I''m certain that losing the tree from the right of frame would help. This kind of shot, in general, works well if composed against the ''rule of thirds'' - I think I''d have tried to take it from the other side of that tree, to make the line of the fence perpendicular to the poplar. Slight blur in the foreground details - was this hot from a moving vehicle?', '2003-10-28 05:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(464254, 42909, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice effort. Not sure about the focus on the pot rather than the brush, and the lighting is a touch harsh. Looking at the focal depth you have here, I''d guess it would have been possible to get both the brush AND the pot cleanly focussed: after all, it''s the combination of the two that tells the story. Imaginitive work though, and makes a great change from some of the more obvious shots.</td>', 'Nice effort. Not sure about the focus on the pot rather than the brush, and the lighting is a touch harsh. Looking at the focal depth you have here, I''d guess it would have been possible to get both the brush AND the pot cleanly focussed: after all, it''s the combination of the two that tells the story. Imaginitive work though, and makes a great change from some of the more obvious shots.', '2003-10-28 05:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(464257, 43282, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the way you can see the other pieces through the top of the pawn</td>', 'Very nice, I like the way you can see the other pieces through the top of the pawn', '2003-10-28 05:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(464258, 43303, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I think the horizon could do with being levelled up tho</td>', 'Nice shot, I think the horizon could do with being levelled up tho', '2003-10-28 05:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(464259, 43377, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of negative space</td>', 'Very nice use of negative space', '2003-10-28 05:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(464260, 43274, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice use of soft focus</td>', 'Nice use of soft focus', '2003-10-28 05:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(464261, 43215, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great detail in a nicely simple photo. 10</td>', 'Great detail in a nicely simple photo. 10', '2003-10-28 05:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(464262, 42817, 2780, '<td valign="top">Some brightness/contrast adjustments would make this photo "pop out" more, but nice capture.</td>', 'Some brightness/contrast adjustments would make this photo "pop out" more, but nice capture.', '2003-10-28 05:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(464263, 43239, 6999, '<td valign="top">Is this one of the Icelanders? The blackness of those rocks... Wonderful landscape work, though I''d have been tempted to crop out the slightly over-exposed sky - just contrat the buildings with the rock face, which would give you a bit more dynamic range to bring out the texture of that rock even more ... but it''s a great light that you''ve found here.</td>', 'Is this one of the Icelanders? The blackness of those rocks... Wonderful landscape work, though I''d have been tempted to crop out the slightly over-exposed sky - just contrat the buildings with the rock face, which would give you a bit more dynamic range to bring out the texture of that rock even more ... but it''s a great light that you''ve found here.', '2003-10-28 05:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(464264, 43158, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Great lighting, 10</td>', 'I really like this. Great lighting, 10', '2003-10-28 05:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(464265, 43117, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think you should level the horizon, and maybe make the colours richer. But its a good idea, nice and simple.</td>', 'I think you should level the horizon, and maybe make the colours richer. But its a good idea, nice and simple.', '2003-10-28 05:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(464266, 43288, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has to be JJ, no? Think I''ve seen those buildings the right way up in other shots of yours.</td>', 'Has to be JJ, no? Think I''ve seen those buildings the right way up in other shots of yours.', '2003-10-28 05:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(464267, 43188, 2780, '<td valign="top">Seems washed out, I think you should adjust the brightness/contrast. Also a not so centered composition might look good.</td>', 'Seems washed out, I think you should adjust the brightness/contrast. Also a not so centered composition might look good.', '2003-10-28 05:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(464268, 43296, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, 9</td>', 'Great shot, 9', '2003-10-28 05:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(464269, 42710, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, great lighting. 9</td>', 'Very good shot, great lighting. 9', '2003-10-28 05:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(464270, 42695, 6999, '<td valign="top">Peculiar title :-) I''m not sure you''ve got enough of the surroundings of this shoot to give a great feeling of solitude - the impression is of clever framing rrather than a real one-off plant in a wilderness. Technically perfectly fine - and I like the progression of focus against the grain of the soil/sand whatever.</td>', 'Peculiar title :-) I''m not sure you''ve got enough of the surroundings of this shoot to give a great feeling of solitude - the impression is of clever framing rrather than a real one-off plant in a wilderness. Technically perfectly fine - and I like the progression of focus against the grain of the soil/sand whatever.', '2003-10-28 05:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(464271, 42501, 2780, '<td valign="top">A simple unsharp-mask would make this image sharper and more appealing, but nice shot nontheless.</td>', 'A simple unsharp-mask would make this image sharper and more appealing, but nice shot nontheless.', '2003-10-28 05:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(464272, 42608, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice atmospheric shot</td>', 'Very nice atmospheric shot', '2003-10-28 05:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(464273, 43301, 2780, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatly seems a bit overexposed, but theres not much you could do about that without underexposing the sky. A tough situation... 6</td>', 'Unfortunatly seems a bit overexposed, but theres not much you could do about that without underexposing the sky. A tough situation... 6', '2003-10-28 05:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(464274, 43205, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but I think a less centred composition and a level horizon would improve it.</td>', 'Nice photo but I think a less centred composition and a level horizon would improve it.', '2003-10-28 05:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(464275, 42862, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great lighting to set the mood.</td>', 'Great lighting to set the mood.', '2003-10-28 05:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(464276, 43269, 6999, '<td valign="top">Too posed - or at any rate, too posed-looking - to be truly affecting. Quite like the way the subject isn''t lit, if you see what I mean. But it feels too obvious. Looks like someone with a hangover, more than someone deperate.</td>', 'Too posed - or at any rate, too posed-looking - to be truly affecting. Quite like the way the subject isn''t lit, if you see what I mean. But it feels too obvious. Looks like someone with a hangover, more than someone deperate.', '2003-10-28 05:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(464277, 43269, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space in this composition</td>', 'I like the use of negative space in this composition', '2003-10-28 05:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(464278, 42956, 2780, '<td valign="top">hehe, cute. I didn''t spot him at first :)</td>', 'hehe, cute. I didn''t spot him at first :)', '2003-10-28 05:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(464280, 42678, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, 9</td>', 'Nice silhouette, 9', '2003-10-28 05:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(464281, 43057, 6999, '<td valign="top">Just fabulous. Do you know a photo by Andre Kertesz called The Balcony, Martinique? It uses the same construction, though in a more abstract manner than this (but then if this were THAT good, you''d BE Andrre Kertesz, wouldn''t you?). Great composition, textures, shapes. The ultimate leading line, perhaps.</td>', 'Just fabulous. Do you know a photo by Andre Kertesz called The Balcony, Martinique? It uses the same construction, though in a more abstract manner than this (but then if this were THAT good, you''d BE Andrre Kertesz, wouldn''t you?). Great composition, textures, shapes. The ultimate leading line, perhaps.', '2003-10-28 05:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(464282, 43266, 6999, '<td valign="top">Sharpening artefacts here are quite intrusive, and the processing (I''m not saying it isn''t in camera, but they''re still present) has lost you a lot of detail.</td>', 'Sharpening artefacts here are quite intrusive, and the processing (I''m not saying it isn''t in camera, but they''re still present) has lost you a lot of detail.', '2003-10-28 05:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
