(464462, 43350, 7190, '<td valign="top">You caught a nice mood to the shot. the elements on the top left are a bit distracting above the child''s head, I might have cropped them out and it might add a bit more drama to the shot. THe little piece of white by his chin is a bit jarring too but that is a simple fix. Was thinking if you used a reflector you might get more eye detail without throwing off the modd of the shot . nice</td>', 'You caught a nice mood to the shot. the elements on the top left are a bit distracting above the child''s head, I might have cropped them out and it might add a bit more drama to the shot. THe little piece of white by his chin is a bit jarring too but that is a simple fix. Was thinking if you used a reflector you might get more eye detail without throwing off the modd of the shot . nice', '2003-10-28 12:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
