(464472, 43188, 7190, '<td valign="top">You have the potential of a really good shot but it is too muddy or flat in tone. I have the habit of going a bit too high contrast when shooting black and white and am always told to bracket your shots. Bracketing is a good habit to get into but I forget to practice it myself.  I''d like to see tne tree black and it would make the photo, pop and give it more depth and drama.</td>', 'You have the potential of a really good shot but it is too muddy or flat in tone. I have the habit of going a bit too high contrast when shooting black and white and am always told to bracket your shots. Bracketing is a good habit to get into but I forget to practice it myself.  I''d like to see tne tree black and it would make the photo, pop and give it more depth and drama.', '2003-10-28 12:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
