(464479, 43078, 7190, '<td valign="top">love the colors surrounding your model but she is too over exposed.She comes acroos too jarring against the rich background.  This week is the first in a long time given to writing comments and it is all been bracketing your shots a practice thatI foregt to do myself.</td>', 'love the colors surrounding your model but she is too over exposed.She comes acroos too jarring against the rich background.  This week is the first in a long time given to writing comments and it is all been bracketing your shots a practice thatI foregt to do myself.', '2003-10-28 12:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(464480, 42763, 13547, '<td valign="top">Ah takes me back that does... I''d like to see a colour version of this actually, to compare them, but hey, great shot!  Simple but effective!</td>', 'Ah takes me back that does... I''d like to see a colour version of this actually, to compare them, but hey, great shot!  Simple but effective!', '2003-10-28 12:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(464481, 43285, 13547, '<td valign="top">Yummy!</td>', 'Yummy!', '2003-10-28 12:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(464482, 43203, 13547, '<td valign="top">Awww can I take her home? lol she looks like my lil sister!  Lovely picture!</td>', 'Awww can I take her home? lol she looks like my lil sister!  Lovely picture!', '2003-10-28 12:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(464493, 43415, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice warm tones.  I like the composition - the empty chair helps support the lone diner theme.  The low lighting boosts the mood as well.  Good focus, though part of the napkin seems a bit soft - would rather that was completely sharp.  A great image.  7</td>', 'Nice warm tones.  I like the composition - the empty chair helps support the lone diner theme.  The low lighting boosts the mood as well.  Good focus, though part of the napkin seems a bit soft - would rather that was completely sharp.  A great image.  7', '2003-10-28 13:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(464496, 43375, 11923, '<td valign="top">Love the blue, gives a nice brightness to the image.  Use of natural light is good - throws the duck into a semi-silhouette.  I would rather the duck had more sharpness to it though, seems a bit blurred.  Good composition - use of distance &amp; space is excellent, supports the all alone feel. 7</td>', 'Love the blue, gives a nice brightness to the image.  Use of natural light is good - throws the duck into a semi-silhouette.  I would rather the duck had more sharpness to it though, seems a bit blurred.  Good composition - use of distance & space is excellent, supports the all alone feel. 7', '2003-10-28 13:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(464498, 43331, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image.  Focus is excellent, image has a lot to see and all of it culminates in a feeling of desperation, loneliness, sadness and pain.  Title really sets the piece up.  Color is good, I like the sort of washed out look (was this desaturated?)  makes the arm look dead.   A gutsy image to make - I really like the ''blood'' drop.  A disturbing but fantastic image.  10</td>', 'Very powerful image.  Focus is excellent, image has a lot to see and all of it culminates in a feeling of desperation, loneliness, sadness and pain.  Title really sets the piece up.  Color is good, I like the sort of washed out look (was this desaturated?)  makes the arm look dead.   A gutsy image to make - I really like the ''blood'' drop.  A disturbing but fantastic image.  10', '2003-10-28 13:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(464500, 43370, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black &amp; white - great open feel to the image.  I like the perspective.  I wish the lines were a bit sharper.  The distance before the child makes for good use of space, definitely feels alone.  Not sure I get an underlying solitude or loneliness feeling though.   A very solid photo.  8</td>', 'Nice use of black & white - great open feel to the image.  I like the perspective.  I wish the lines were a bit sharper.  The distance before the child makes for good use of space, definitely feels alone.  Not sure I get an underlying solitude or loneliness feeling though.   A very solid photo.  8', '2003-10-28 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(464501, 43071, 11923, '<td valign="top">A great shot.  Lighting is good, focus is excellent.  Its unfortunate those people are in the background, they really detract for me.  The best thing I like about this is it gives me a subtle feeling of solitude because of the horse''s blinders shutting out the rest of the world.  I''m not sure if that''s what you were going for, but its what I see in the image - very powerful but shown so simply and subtley.  Very nice.  8</td>', 'A great shot.  Lighting is good, focus is excellent.  Its unfortunate those people are in the background, they really detract for me.  The best thing I like about this is it gives me a subtle feeling of solitude because of the horse''s blinders shutting out the rest of the world.  I''m not sure if that''s what you were going for, but its what I see in the image - very powerful but shown so simply and subtley.  Very nice.  8', '2003-10-28 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(464505, 43050, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, lighting is good - the low tones help to enhance a lonely feel.  Focus is good but seems to be directed more at the ground than the chair.  Technically sound over all but the interest factor is missing for me.  Maybe if the image was black &amp; white it would have an added starkness which would boost the interest level.  6</td>', 'Fits the challenge, lighting is good - the low tones help to enhance a lonely feel.  Focus is good but seems to be directed more at the ground than the chair.  Technically sound over all but the interest factor is missing for me.  Maybe if the image was black & white it would have an added starkness which would boost the interest level.  6', '2003-10-28 13:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(464510, 42620, 11923, '<td valign="top">A good image.  Normally I''d say it doesn''t really fit all alone, but the focusing does make the man with the ax stand out and look separated.  The focus is good, I like the low lighting as well, unfortunately the color seems a little washed out - not sure if that is because of the light or not.  Good emotional impact.  Nicely done.  7</td>', 'A good image.  Normally I''d say it doesn''t really fit all alone, but the focusing does make the man with the ax stand out and look separated.  The focus is good, I like the low lighting as well, unfortunately the color seems a little washed out - not sure if that is because of the light or not.  Good emotional impact.  Nicely done.  7', '2003-10-28 13:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(464513, 42862, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice image!  I like the silhouette with b&amp;w look very much.  Fits the challenge extremely well, nice mood presented.  Lighting is great and the focus is ncie too.  8</td>', 'Very nice image!  I like the silhouette with b&w look very much.  Fits the challenge extremely well, nice mood presented.  Lighting is great and the focus is ncie too.  8', '2003-10-28 13:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(464517, 42944, 11923, '<td valign="top">The scenery does seem rather bleak.  I like the black &amp; white tones, very good contrast.  I''m not sure if the title is indicating that this is an anniversary of the day, this is where the person was, or just a representation of how the photographer felt.  The use of natural light is great, my only negatives are I wish the entire tree was visible and sharper, and the white border draws my eyes away.  Nice work!  6</td>', 'The scenery does seem rather bleak.  I like the black & white tones, very good contrast.  I''m not sure if the title is indicating that this is an anniversary of the day, this is where the person was, or just a representation of how the photographer felt.  The use of natural light is great, my only negatives are I wish the entire tree was visible and sharper, and the white border draws my eyes away.  Nice work!  6', '2003-10-28 13:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(464518, 43053, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow what a great contrast.  I love the vivid yellow of the image, the starkness of the single tree and then the grey clouds is wonderful.   Nice dramatic use of distance and space - supports the alone, solitude feel.  Great detailing.  An exceptional image.  9</td>', 'Wow what a great contrast.  I love the vivid yellow of the image, the starkness of the single tree and then the grey clouds is wonderful.   Nice dramatic use of distance and space - supports the alone, solitude feel.  Great detailing.  An exceptional image.  9', '2003-10-28 13:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(464522, 43127, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the black &amp; white choice, gives the contrasts a boost and adds a starkness.  Focus is good, I wish the whole leaf were in focus though.  Nice perspective.  An interesting image.  7</td>', 'I like the black & white choice, gives the contrasts a boost and adds a starkness.  Focus is good, I wish the whole leaf were in focus though.  Nice perspective.  An interesting image.  7', '2003-10-28 13:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(464523, 42889, 11923, '<td valign="top">A different shot.  I like the raindrops, wish more of them were in focus though.  It looks like a thoroughly dismal day.  Can easily infer loneliness or solitude.  To be honest though, the scene beyond the raindrops isn''t very interesting, doesn''t capture my attention very well.  5</td>', 'A different shot.  I like the raindrops, wish more of them were in focus though.  It looks like a thoroughly dismal day.  Can easily infer loneliness or solitude.  To be honest though, the scene beyond the raindrops isn''t very interesting, doesn''t capture my attention very well.  5', '2003-10-28 13:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(464524, 42943, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I love the use of distance.  Good focus on the ball, the lighting works well too.  A nice creative shot.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Great image!  I love the use of distance.  Good focus on the ball, the lighting works well too.  A nice creative shot.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-28 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(464525, 42593, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image.  I do think it fits all alone well - the wording around her gives the imagination a number of ways to interprete the scene.  I like the differences in size and shape, the color is good too though a little less vivid that I''d expect.   Nice work.  7</td>', 'An interesting image.  I do think it fits all alone well - the wording around her gives the imagination a number of ways to interprete the scene.  I like the differences in size and shape, the color is good too though a little less vivid that I''d expect.   Nice work.  7', '2003-10-28 13:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(464526, 43378, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  The framing of the moon is great.  The color contrasts work really well, though I think the lighting is a little too harsh.  I do like the texture shown.  Good focus, and a very nice composition.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Nice capture!  The framing of the moon is great.  The color contrasts work really well, though I think the lighting is a little too harsh.  I do like the texture shown.  Good focus, and a very nice composition.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-28 13:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(464528, 43310, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  The lighting is perfect, the sun is just right.  Nice use of black and white - good high contrasts throughout the image.  Adorable model shown with great scenery as a background.  I think this shows all alone (though not solitude or loneliness) very well.  Has a great happy feel to it.  Focus looks great to me.  Excellent image. 9</td>', 'Great photo!  The lighting is perfect, the sun is just right.  Nice use of black and white - good high contrasts throughout the image.  Adorable model shown with great scenery as a background.  I think this shows all alone (though not solitude or loneliness) very well.  Has a great happy feel to it.  Focus looks great to me.  Excellent image. 9', '2003-10-28 13:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(464530, 43287, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting image!  Title really pulls it all together.  I love the color contrasts, the focus is great, but as a personal preference I''d rather the ring was more defined.  I like the composition - leaving the pulled petals in really gives depth and background to the photo.  A great idea and well executed.  8</td>', 'Interesting image!  Title really pulls it all together.  I love the color contrasts, the focus is great, but as a personal preference I''d rather the ring was more defined.  I like the composition - leaving the pulled petals in really gives depth and background to the photo.  A great idea and well executed.  8', '2003-10-28 13:54:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(464532, 43232, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  Very stark, high contrast.  The perspective is excellent, lighting gives a very nice gritty mood to the photo.  Perfect silhouette.  This is only a minor issue, but I wish the whole wall or whatever is being stood on was in focus.  Very nice.  9</td>', 'I love this image.  Very stark, high contrast.  The perspective is excellent, lighting gives a very nice gritty mood to the photo.  Perfect silhouette.  This is only a minor issue, but I wish the whole wall or whatever is being stood on was in focus.  Very nice.  9', '2003-10-28 13:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(464534, 42742, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent image!  High contrast, beautiful focus.  I like the title, as it gives the image that push into a sadder mood than I might have seen on its own.  Fits the challenge well.  Lighting really works here.  I don''t think there''s anything I''d change.  10</td>', 'Excellent image!  High contrast, beautiful focus.  I like the title, as it gives the image that push into a sadder mood than I might have seen on its own.  Fits the challenge well.  Lighting really works here.  I don''t think there''s anything I''d change.  10', '2003-10-28 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(464538, 43391, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail.  Nice use of space, gives an alone feel.  I can''t decide if the blue and green in the back is distracting in a good or bad way.  An over all good image.  6</td>', 'Great focus and detail.  Nice use of space, gives an alone feel.  I can''t decide if the blue and green in the back is distracting in a good or bad way.  An over all good image.  6', '2003-10-28 14:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(464571, 42857, 2634, '<td valign="top">You need to straighten the horizon and it would be more effective if the subject was not centered but off to one side.</td>', 'You need to straighten the horizon and it would be more effective if the subject was not centered but off to one side.', '2003-10-28 15:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(464573, 42799, 2634, '<td valign="top">it would be helpful to the photo to straighten the horizon.</td>', 'it would be helpful to the photo to straighten the horizon.', '2003-10-28 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(464577, 42664, 9602, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this too, great job</td>', 'I thought about doing this too, great job', '2003-10-28 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(464578, 43386, 2634, '<td valign="top">a slight rotation to straighten the horizon would strengthen this.</td>', 'a slight rotation to straighten the horizon would strengthen this.', '2003-10-28 15:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(464585, 43193, 10402, '<td valign="top">Maybe if she had set her clock back after Daylight Savings Time she wouldn''t have been an hour early.  :-)<br/> <br/>I like the composition. The model is closer to the corner than the "rule of thirds" would dictate, but it works perfectly here.</td>', 'Maybe if she had set her clock back after Daylight Savings Time she wouldn''t have been an hour early.  :-) I like the composition. The model is closer to the corner than the "rule of thirds" would dictate, but it works perfectly here.', '2003-10-28 15:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(464633, 43275, 2130, '<td valign="top">I''ll take you home...</td>', 'I''ll take you home...', '2003-10-28 16:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(464648, 43368, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nasty case of oversharpening.</td>', 'Very nasty case of oversharpening.', '2003-10-28 17:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(464651, 42761, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame it''s out of focus. The subject is too centred in the composition for my taste. The beak ideally needs to contrast with the background... here half of it is lost against a wooden post. The arrangement of the posts in the frame seems haphazard and not balanced. I do like the sunset colours on the side of the two foreground posts though. 4</td>', 'Shame it''s out of focus. The subject is too centred in the composition for my taste. The beak ideally needs to contrast with the background... here half of it is lost against a wooden post. The arrangement of the posts in the frame seems haphazard and not balanced. I do like the sunset colours on the side of the two foreground posts though. 4', '2003-10-28 17:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(464656, 42803, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but her expression doesn\''t give the shot much of an atmosphere of loneliness. The exposure is pretty good (apart from the odd burnt highlight),  considering the range of tones you\''ve tried to capture. 6</td>', 'Lovely shot, but her expression doesn\''t give the shot much of an atmosphere of loneliness. The exposure is pretty good (apart from the odd burnt highlight),  considering the range of tones you\''ve tried to capture. 6', '2003-10-28 17:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(464665, 43266, 8522, '<td valign="top">Way too oversharpened, and the border is completely inappropriate by being far too overbearing for the photo. I prefer bird shots where the bird is facing the photographer, or side-on. I like the composition of the branches though. 4</td>', 'Way too oversharpened, and the border is completely inappropriate by being far too overbearing for the photo. I prefer bird shots where the bird is facing the photographer, or side-on. I like the composition of the branches though. 4', '2003-10-28 17:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(464667, 42586, 11895, '<td valign="top">fits the challenge well</td>', 'fits the challenge well', '2003-10-28 17:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(464668, 42939, 8522, '<td valign="top">Far too oversharpened.</td>', 'Far too oversharpened.', '2003-10-28 17:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(464671, 42886, 11895, '<td valign="top">for me, this really fits the challenge and conveys sentiment, well done<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-29 00:09:41.</i></td>', 'for me, this really fits the challenge and conveys sentiment, well done', '2003-10-28 17:35:13.000000', '2003-10-29 00:09:41.000000', 1),
(464674, 42941, 11895, '<td valign="top">fits the challenge in a dramatic way, well done</td>', 'fits the challenge in a dramatic way, well done', '2003-10-28 17:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(464676, 42413, 11895, '<td valign="top">scores high on meeting the challenge</td>', 'scores high on meeting the challenge', '2003-10-28 17:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(464680, 43275, 11895, '<td valign="top">fits the challenge well, wish the kitten''s face was in as sharp focus as the lettering</td>', 'fits the challenge well, wish the kitten''s face was in as sharp focus as the lettering', '2003-10-28 17:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(464711, 43057, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, classy, simple, elegant. Great composition and use of leading lines. Wonderful soft-focus. I like the use of sillhouette. Black and white works nicely here. My favourite this challenge. 10</td>', 'Beautiful, classy, simple, elegant. Great composition and use of leading lines. Wonderful soft-focus. I like the use of sillhouette. Black and white works nicely here. My favourite this challenge. 10', '2003-10-28 18:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(464714, 42710, 8522, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge. My only criticism is that it''s a shame about the burnt out highlights on the shoulder and upper arm. Superb composition, powerful implementation of a creative idea. 10</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge. My only criticism is that it''s a shame about the burnt out highlights on the shoulder and upper arm. Superb composition, powerful implementation of a creative idea. 10', '2003-10-28 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(464716, 43275, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I just wish the kitten was in focus. 9</td>', 'Great shot, I just wish the kitten was in focus. 9', '2003-10-28 18:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(464731, 43360, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic clouds in the sky, makes for a nice contrast with the lighter yellow in the horizon.  I like the silhouette effect, though I wish there was more distance in the shot.  The tree looks very close up.  Fits the challenge well.  Nicely done.  6</td>', 'Great dramatic clouds in the sky, makes for a nice contrast with the lighter yellow in the horizon.  I like the silhouette effect, though I wish there was more distance in the shot.  The tree looks very close up.  Fits the challenge well.  Nicely done.  6', '2003-10-28 18:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(464733, 42587, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very vivid colors, I like all the angles too.  Definitely fits the challenge.  I wish the picture itself was larger though.  Also, the bush on the right hand side is a little distracting - it detracts from the angular feel of the image.  Overall a good shot.  6</td>', 'Very vivid colors, I like all the angles too.  Definitely fits the challenge.  I wish the picture itself was larger though.  Also, the bush on the right hand side is a little distracting - it detracts from the angular feel of the image.  Overall a good shot.  6', '2003-10-28 18:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(464737, 43410, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, though they seem a bit dulled, possibly by the low lighting.  I love the silhouette effect.  I do get an alone or solitude sense, fits the challenge well.  Excellent job.  6</td>', 'Lovely colors, though they seem a bit dulled, possibly by the low lighting.  I love the silhouette effect.  I do get an alone or solitude sense, fits the challenge well.  Excellent job.  6', '2003-10-28 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(464743, 43271, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great use of space, really supports the alone/solitude feel of the image.  Good contrast with the b&amp;w, definitely adds interest.  The focus looks pretty good and the light usage is nice.    Well done.  7</td>', 'Great use of space, really supports the alone/solitude feel of the image.  Good contrast with the b&w, definitely adds interest.  The focus looks pretty good and the light usage is nice.    Well done.  7', '2003-10-28 18:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(464746, 43388, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, I love all the long shadows (would''ve been perfect for shadows II).  The sense of distance really brings out the alone aspect, I like the tones.  Focus is pretty good, wish the girl was a little sharper though.  I think the perspective is what really draws my interest.  Very nice  7</td>', 'Great perspective, I love all the long shadows (would''ve been perfect for shadows II).  The sense of distance really brings out the alone aspect, I like the tones.  Focus is pretty good, wish the girl was a little sharper though.  I think the perspective is what really draws my interest.  Very nice  7', '2003-10-28 18:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(464748, 42979, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely child!  The lighting looks good, the shadows give a faint feeling of loneliness to her face.  Nice focus, the shadows portion of her face seems to have a softer focus though - would prefer even focus on the whole face - this could just be because of the shadows.  A nice image.  6</td>', 'Lovely child!  The lighting looks good, the shadows give a faint feeling of loneliness to her face.  Nice focus, the shadows portion of her face seems to have a softer focus though - would prefer even focus on the whole face - this could just be because of the shadows.  A nice image.  6', '2003-10-28 18:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(464750, 42858, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge perfectly.  The title helps bring in some solitude or loneliness to the image (knowing its the last).  I love the color, both in its brightness and the contrasts.  Good perspective.  The lighting is a little overbright for me on the pear, but not so much it makes a huge negative impact.   A well taken photo.  7</td>', 'Fits the challenge perfectly.  The title helps bring in some solitude or loneliness to the image (knowing its the last).  I love the color, both in its brightness and the contrasts.  Good perspective.  The lighting is a little overbright for me on the pear, but not so much it makes a huge negative impact.   A well taken photo.  7', '2003-10-28 18:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(464751, 42866, 12114, '<td valign="top">Definetely a lonely picture. Maybe it wold have been even better taken from a little lower position and by framing the feet in there too! 7 from me!</td>', 'Definetely a lonely picture. Maybe it wold have been even better taken from a little lower position and by framing the feet in there too! 7 from me!', '2003-10-28 18:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(464752, 43312, 12114, '<td valign="top">Very cool... Did you spraypaint the leaves?</td>', 'Very cool... Did you spraypaint the leaves?', '2003-10-28 18:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(464761, 43226, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a great image.  I love the black &amp; white, there are some excellent lines in the photo that really stand out.  Lighting is good, focus is great.  I wish the crop was a little tighter on the left side - that sign or graffiti is a bit distracting.  I think this fits the challenge in general, because the woman draws the eyes and she is essentially alone, but all the birds do add another element so I can''t exclude them from the image.  Still its a great shot.  Very nice.  9</td>', 'What a great image.  I love the black & white, there are some excellent lines in the photo that really stand out.  Lighting is good, focus is great.  I wish the crop was a little tighter on the left side - that sign or graffiti is a bit distracting.  I think this fits the challenge in general, because the woman draws the eyes and she is essentially alone, but all the birds do add another element so I can''t exclude them from the image.  Still its a great shot.  Very nice.  9', '2003-10-28 18:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(464763, 43112, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  I love the reflection, the colors and the focus are all excellent.  The natural light is great, but a bit harsh on the rock pillar.  I like the composition but I''m flipflopping on whether the tree on the left distracts too much or not.  On one hand it helps add depth to the image, but on the other its so prominent in the foreground that it draws the eyes away and out of the image.  Its a toss up.  I think this is a very strong photo, well done.  7</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  I love the reflection, the colors and the focus are all excellent.  The natural light is great, but a bit harsh on the rock pillar.  I like the composition but I''m flipflopping on whether the tree on the left distracts too much or not.  On one hand it helps add depth to the image, but on the other its so prominent in the foreground that it draws the eyes away and out of the image.  Its a toss up.  I think this is a very strong photo, well done.  7', '2003-10-28 18:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(464766, 43331, 12114, '<td valign="top">Shocking... Makes you think! The picture is good but it is hard to look at!</td>', 'Shocking... Makes you think! The picture is good but it is hard to look at!', '2003-10-28 18:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(464768, 42692, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh!  What a fun image.  This little guy looks lost!  Great capture.  Nice use of space and the lighting is good.  I think this image really works because my perceptions are that a penguin should be by snow - this beach like scene really makes him stand out as in the wrong place.  Very nice.  8</td>', 'Heh!  What a fun image.  This little guy looks lost!  Great capture.  Nice use of space and the lighting is good.  I think this image really works because my perceptions are that a penguin should be by snow - this beach like scene really makes him stand out as in the wrong place.  Very nice.  8', '2003-10-28 18:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(464770, 42873, 13602, '<td valign="top">Beautiful -&gt; 10</td>', 'Beautiful -> 10', '2003-10-28 18:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(464772, 42804, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous blue.  It really offsets the stark colors of the bird.   The spread wings give a sense of drama and the perspective gives a nice height to the image.  I can really feel a solitude here.  Focus is pretty good, wish the bird was a little sharper though.  The natural light brightens everything up, but it does seem too harsh in the sky and a bit on the white feathers.   A good photo overall though.  6</td>', 'Gorgeous blue.  It really offsets the stark colors of the bird.   The spread wings give a sense of drama and the perspective gives a nice height to the image.  I can really feel a solitude here.  Focus is pretty good, wish the bird was a little sharper though.  The natural light brightens everything up, but it does seem too harsh in the sky and a bit on the white feathers.   A good photo overall though.  6', '2003-10-28 18:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(464775, 43025, 12114, '<td valign="top">A good picture but it does not say "All alone" to me at all. 5</td>', 'A good picture but it does not say "All alone" to me at all. 5', '2003-10-28 18:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(464779, 43118, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice setting, the posture of the subject gives a semi-loneliness to the image - looks rather relaxed to me.  Definitely fits the all alone portion of the challenge, I like the lighting and the focus is good.  The negative art choice is an interesting one, does add a little oomph to the image - I''m not sure if the neon-like colors aren''t too distracting though.  Also I have to ask.. is the tie stained?  I like the different direction.  Nice work.  7</td>', 'Nice setting, the posture of the subject gives a semi-loneliness to the image - looks rather relaxed to me.  Definitely fits the all alone portion of the challenge, I like the lighting and the focus is good.  The negative art choice is an interesting one, does add a little oomph to the image - I''m not sure if the neon-like colors aren''t too distracting though.  Also I have to ask.. is the tie stained?  I like the different direction.  Nice work.  7', '2003-10-28 19:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(464786, 42862, 13390, '<td valign="top">Excellent Lighting!</td>', 'Excellent Lighting!', '2003-10-28 19:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(464787, 43193, 13390, '<td valign="top">Neat Idea!</td>', 'Neat Idea!', '2003-10-28 19:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(464789, 42610, 11923, '<td valign="top">Ah I like this image.  Very simple, but fun.  Nice contrast against that gorgeous sky.  Perspective is good - gives an excellent feeling of height.  I''m don''t think it really fits the challenge specifically though - there are two poles after all.  5</td>', 'Ah I like this image.  Very simple, but fun.  Nice contrast against that gorgeous sky.  Perspective is good - gives an excellent feeling of height.  I''m don''t think it really fits the challenge specifically though - there are two poles after all.  5', '2003-10-28 19:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(464791, 42549, 13390, '<td valign="top">Feels a little underxposed, not as bright and vibrant as it could be, the current lighting doesn''t do it justice. Nice angle and composition though.</td>', 'Feels a little underxposed, not as bright and vibrant as it could be, the current lighting doesn''t do it justice. Nice angle and composition though.', '2003-10-28 19:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(464792, 43312, 13390, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2003-10-28 19:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(464793, 43089, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like this!  Good contrast between the grass and the ticket.  Focus is pretty good too.  The sunlight (I''m assuming) has everything well covered, the colors are vibrant.  Well done.  6</td>', 'I like this!  Good contrast between the grass and the ticket.  Focus is pretty good too.  The sunlight (I''m assuming) has everything well covered, the colors are vibrant.  Well done.  6', '2003-10-28 19:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
