(464795, 42745, 13390, '<td valign="top">Snapshot?</td>', 'Snapshot?', '2003-10-28 19:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(464800, 42407, 13390, '<td valign="top">The angle feels a little too straight on for me. This shot has a lot of potential; I would suggest trying different angles and playing with the DOF and lighting. Nice job.</td>', 'The angle feels a little too straight on for me. This shot has a lot of potential; I would suggest trying different angles and playing with the DOF and lighting. Nice job.', '2003-10-28 19:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(464801, 43278, 13390, '<td valign="top">I would really like to see its eyes more fully, but a nice close up though. I paarticulary like the lighting though.</td>', 'I would really like to see its eyes more fully, but a nice close up though. I paarticulary like the lighting though.', '2003-10-28 19:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(464803, 42910, 13390, '<td valign="top">Good Question......</td>', 'Good Question......', '2003-10-28 19:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(464805, 43400, 11923, '<td valign="top">Cute title.  A very nice image.  Focus is great, the color of the bird is marvelous.  Fits the challenge well - a lot of general interest.  I would recommend cropping out the sunlight part - I find it a distractant.  Also, that blue thing in the tree to the right - is that an ornament?  Looks kind of metallic blue so it draws the eye.  A good sound image.  6</td>', 'Cute title.  A very nice image.  Focus is great, the color of the bird is marvelous.  Fits the challenge well - a lot of general interest.  I would recommend cropping out the sunlight part - I find it a distractant.  Also, that blue thing in the tree to the right - is that an ornament?  Looks kind of metallic blue so it draws the eye.  A good sound image.  6', '2003-10-28 19:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(464811, 43409, 806, '<td valign="top">the quality of this photograph is suffering from compression maybe? The set up is good... compositionally, and the colors look like they would make the photo.</td>', 'the quality of this photograph is suffering from compression maybe? The set up is good... compositionally, and the colors look like they would make the photo.', '2003-10-28 19:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(464815, 43164, 11923, '<td valign="top">What an arresting face.  Lighting is great, and the focus is perfect.  I love the texture of the fur - really shows up well.  Good color, nice presentation.  I wish there were more of a grassy background to help enhance an ''all alone'' feeling though.   Good image.  6</td>', 'What an arresting face.  Lighting is great, and the focus is perfect.  I love the texture of the fur - really shows up well.  Good color, nice presentation.  I wish there were more of a grassy background to help enhance an ''all alone'' feeling though.   Good image.  6', '2003-10-28 19:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(464819, 42533, 10402, '<td valign="top">She certainly looks alone and lonely; the other kids are just part of the background. The black and white adds to the feeling, but I think the conversion made the image a little flat and blends the subject''s into the background.</td>', 'She certainly looks alone and lonely; the other kids are just part of the background. The black and white adds to the feeling, but I think the conversion made the image a little flat and blends the subject''s into the background.', '2003-10-28 19:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(464826, 42783, 806, '<td valign="top">This needed to be cropped to remove the edge of the horizon, or levelled. Nice light and tones. good emotion.</td>', 'This needed to be cropped to remove the edge of the horizon, or levelled. Nice light and tones. good emotion.', '2003-10-28 19:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(464828, 42752, 806, '<td valign="top">poetic image. congrats!</td>', 'poetic image. congrats!', '2003-10-28 19:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(464831, 42970, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors!  That''s the first thing that strikes me about the image.  Simply wonderful.  I love the silhouette - especially the fact that the lines of the person are nice and sharp.  Lighting is great, so is composition.  Definitely fits the challenge on all levels.  Excellent capture - nothing I would change.  10</td>', 'Fantastic colors!  That''s the first thing that strikes me about the image.  Simply wonderful.  I love the silhouette - especially the fact that the lines of the person are nice and sharp.  Lighting is great, so is composition.  Definitely fits the challenge on all levels.  Excellent capture - nothing I would change.  10', '2003-10-28 19:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(464835, 42552, 806, '<td valign="top">lovely image. gives a feeling of distance, longing, awaiting, timelessness....</td>', 'lovely image. gives a feeling of distance, longing, awaiting, timelessness....', '2003-10-28 19:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
