(464844, 42783, 9441, '<td valign="top">clean, clear and crisp photo.  I like the B&amp;W for this shot...nicely done.</td>', 'clean, clear and crisp photo.  I like the B&W for this shot...nicely done.', '2003-10-28 19:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(464845, 43239, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image.  I love the contrast between the sheer, dark mountainous cliffs and the small but colorful barn.  The lighting is good, focus is excellent. Subject is very interesting.  My only wish was that the sky was a more uniform and deeper blue.  Still this is a very awe-inspiring photo.  Well done.  9</td>', 'Fantastic image.  I love the contrast between the sheer, dark mountainous cliffs and the small but colorful barn.  The lighting is good, focus is excellent. Subject is very interesting.  My only wish was that the sky was a more uniform and deeper blue.  Still this is a very awe-inspiring photo.  Well done.  9', '2003-10-28 19:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(464852, 43038, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a sweety.  I like the lighting, the curled pose of the kitten does make me think of all alone - it against the big wide world!  Good focus, nice composition.  Well done.  7</td>', 'What a sweety.  I like the lighting, the curled pose of the kitten does make me think of all alone - it against the big wide world!  Good focus, nice composition.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-28 19:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
