(464984, 43081, 10634, '<td valign="top">I know I''m being too picky, but I would have liked it more if the white marbles were either all white or turned so they had the same color stripe showing... would have made them more united and the black one more the odd ball out. Otherwise, I love this shot.</td>', 'I know I''m being too picky, but I would have liked it more if the white marbles were either all white or turned so they had the same color stripe showing... would have made them more united and the black one more the odd ball out. Otherwise, I love this shot.', '2003-10-28 21:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
