(464997, 42850, 4321, '<td valign="top">Love the color and it fits the topic perfectly</td>', 'Love the color and it fits the topic perfectly', '2003-10-28 21:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(465013, 43166, 10402, '<td valign="top">Not really lonely, but certainly all alone and the title is a nice pun. I like the lighting and the white background. The thread or whatever it is should probably add character, but to me it is just distracting.</td>', 'Not really lonely, but certainly all alone and the title is a nice pun. I like the lighting and the white background. The thread or whatever it is should probably add character, but to me it is just distracting.', '2003-10-28 22:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(465014, 43104, 10402, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t really give me a feeling of loneliness or solitude, but the fly is certainly all alone. I like the background. Good focus and composition.</td>', 'It doesn''t really give me a feeling of loneliness or solitude, but the fly is certainly all alone. I like the background. Good focus and composition.', '2003-10-28 22:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(465015, 43409, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I love the distance of it and the colors are great, though a little dulled - possibly because of the lowish light.  Nice composition, really covers the challenge well.  I do wish the main subject (man on bench) was a bit more in focus, also I''d recommend cropping the left side just a hair more so that black box/sign thingie wasn''t showing.  The border seems a bit too much for the image - draws me away instead of keeping me in.  A good, interesting image, well done.  6</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I love the distance of it and the colors are great, though a little dulled - possibly because of the lowish light.  Nice composition, really covers the challenge well.  I do wish the main subject (man on bench) was a bit more in focus, also I''d recommend cropping the left side just a hair more so that black box/sign thingie wasn''t showing.  The border seems a bit too much for the image - draws me away instead of keeping me in.  A good, interesting image, well done.  6', '2003-10-28 22:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(465021, 43057, 10402, '<td valign="top">Seeing a couple doesn''t make feel loneliness or solitude, but it''s true that the couple is all alone. This is emphasized by their placement near the edge of the frame, where the viewer''s eye is led by the strong lines.</td>', 'Seeing a couple doesn''t make feel loneliness or solitude, but it''s true that the couple is all alone. This is emphasized by their placement near the edge of the frame, where the viewer''s eye is led by the strong lines.', '2003-10-28 22:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(465027, 42389, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like that the full status is only visable in the shadow.</td>', 'I like that the full status is only visable in the shadow.', '2003-10-28 22:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(465028, 43197, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo!  I love the distance, the colors, the space.  Well composed, high interest.  The title is great, really hits the ''all alone'' subject on the head.  Good focus, everything looks great.  Well done.  10</td>', 'Fantastic photo!  I love the distance, the colors, the space.  Well composed, high interest.  The title is great, really hits the ''all alone'' subject on the head.  Good focus, everything looks great.  Well done.  10', '2003-10-28 22:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(465031, 43266, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great rich colored sky, nice stark lines.  Focus is good, as is the lighting.  I think the border is a little too much.  A simple medium thickness black border wouldn''t draw the eyes away as much in my opinion.   Great composition.  Good work!  7</td>', 'Great rich colored sky, nice stark lines.  Focus is good, as is the lighting.  I think the border is a little too much.  A simple medium thickness black border wouldn''t draw the eyes away as much in my opinion.   Great composition.  Good work!  7', '2003-10-28 22:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(465033, 42389, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great image!  I love the differing angles and textures and the use of the reflection pool is perfect.  Very high interest image.  I don''t see anything I''d change or suggest different options on.  A very well composed photograph.  10</td>', 'Great image!  I love the differing angles and textures and the use of the reflection pool is perfect.  Very high interest image.  I don''t see anything I''d change or suggest different options on.  A very well composed photograph.  10', '2003-10-28 22:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(465037, 42863, 11923, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, I think alone it wouldn''t have been that great, but the vivid colors and the use of duotone gives a nice abstract look.  The lighting is great, composition is nice.  Focus is pretty good but I wish it were sharper on the hydrant.  My main detractant is that though the hydrant is by itself, the fact that there is a corresponding yellow on the leaves gives a feeling of togetherness or community, kind of dampens the alone feeling for me.  I like the originality of the image.  Very nice.  7</td>', 'An interesting image, I think alone it wouldn''t have been that great, but the vivid colors and the use of duotone gives a nice abstract look.  The lighting is great, composition is nice.  Focus is pretty good but I wish it were sharper on the hydrant.  My main detractant is that though the hydrant is by itself, the fact that there is a corresponding yellow on the leaves gives a feeling of togetherness or community, kind of dampens the alone feeling for me.  I like the originality of the image.  Very nice.  7', '2003-10-28 22:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(465043, 42965, 10402, '<td valign="top">Solitaire and solitude do have the same root, so I suppose this could meet the challenge. I don''t really feel solitude when viewing this image, but that''s probably just me. I like the way you''ve cropped this.</td>', 'Solitaire and solitude do have the same root, so I suppose this could meet the challenge. I don''t really feel solitude when viewing this image, but that''s probably just me. I like the way you''ve cropped this.', '2003-10-28 22:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(465046, 43274, 11923, '<td valign="top">What a sweet face.  Great use of black &amp; white, the lighting is great.  The child does look rather pensive, though I''m not sure I get a solitude or loneliness vibe.   That said, it certainly fits the general feel of ''all alone''. The focus is good, though it sems to be centered on the hair just off the temple to the right - would rather it was on her face.  Other than that, I have no complaints.  A beautiful photo.  8</td>', 'What a sweet face.  Great use of black & white, the lighting is great.  The child does look rather pensive, though I''m not sure I get a solitude or loneliness vibe.   That said, it certainly fits the general feel of ''all alone''. The focus is good, though it sems to be centered on the hair just off the temple to the right - would rather it was on her face.  Other than that, I have no complaints.  A beautiful photo.  8', '2003-10-28 22:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(465049, 43183, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great vivid colors, nice focus too.  I like the distant vista, gives a good feeling of being away from everything.   The natural light makes for great tones.  Fits the challenge well.  A good solid photo.  7</td>', 'Great vivid colors, nice focus too.  I like the distant vista, gives a good feeling of being away from everything.   The natural light makes for great tones.  Fits the challenge well.  A good solid photo.  7', '2003-10-28 22:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(465052, 43299, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and wonderful silhouette.  I like the perspective and the composition is great.  I think the sharpness could be touched up just a bit - not a huge thing though.  Simply a great photo.  8</td>', 'Beautiful sky and wonderful silhouette.  I like the perspective and the composition is great.  I think the sharpness could be touched up just a bit - not a huge thing though.  Simply a great photo.  8', '2003-10-28 22:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
