(465096, 43405, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great focus, I love its sharpness.  Lighting is good and the composition works nicely.  Fits the challenge well, almost feel sorry for the leaf, its so battered and bruised!  Very nice solid image.  7</td>', 'Great focus, I love its sharpness.  Lighting is good and the composition works nicely.  Fits the challenge well, almost feel sorry for the leaf, its so battered and bruised!  Very nice solid image.  7', '2003-10-28 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
