(465101, 42935, 11923, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, the leaves are fantastic.  Nice distance feeling, helps give a solitude tone.  I''m wishy washy on whether the couple would count as a single subject, I find it hard to view it in an ''all alone'' light.  Focus is good, composition is nice, though I''d have preferred the couple to be somewhere other than central.  Also, I''m not sure why the red coat is so much more bright than the leaves on the trees, but it does seem a little too vibrant.   Don''t get me wrong, these are rather small things, I think this is a fantastic image.  Nicely executed.  9</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, the leaves are fantastic.  Nice distance feeling, helps give a solitude tone.  I''m wishy washy on whether the couple would count as a single subject, I find it hard to view it in an ''all alone'' light.  Focus is good, composition is nice, though I''d have preferred the couple to be somewhere other than central.  Also, I''m not sure why the red coat is so much more bright than the leaves on the trees, but it does seem a little too vibrant.   Don''t get me wrong, these are rather small things, I think this is a fantastic image.  Nicely executed.  9', '2003-10-28 23:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
