(465306, 43093, 9913, '<td valign="top">congratulations on your blue ribbon<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-20 04:04:45.</i></td>', 'congratulations on your blue ribbon', '2003-10-29 01:52:17.000000', '2005-09-20 05:04:45.000000', 0),
(465307, 43242, 9027, '<td valign="top">nicely done. love the misty quality of the backdrop.</td>', 'nicely done. love the misty quality of the backdrop.', '2003-10-29 01:52:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(465308, 43297, 9027, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful. love the blue.</td>', 'simply beautiful. love the blue.', '2003-10-29 01:54:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(465309, 43119, 9073, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. You''ve used the lighting so well that I''m simply overcome with wonder. This certainly goes into my favourites!<br/></td>', 'This is a great shot. You''ve used the lighting so well that I''m simply overcome with wonder. This certainly goes into my favourites!', '2003-10-29 01:56:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(465311, 43081, 10858, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this one Csoka! I thought it would get higher results, though. The different coloured white marbles didn''t disturb me, it said for me that the whites accept de differences among them, but not the black. Being pushed out, I think the black is alone enough. Good work!</td>', 'Congrats on this one Csoka! I thought it would get higher results, though. The different coloured white marbles didn''t disturb me, it said for me that the whites accept de differences among them, but not the black. Being pushed out, I think the black is alone enough. Good work!', '2003-10-29 02:03:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(465318, 42886, 9906, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the first of hopefully many ribbons!  This was an awesome shot that I picked in the top 2 or 3.  It is also now my desktop of the moment!<br/>TC</td>', 'Congratulations on the first of hopefully many ribbons!  This was an awesome shot that I picked in the top 2 or 3.  It is also now my desktop of the moment!TC', '2003-10-29 02:12:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(465320, 43093, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wooohooo Heida, finally you got your well deserved bluey, yassir! Congratulations to you. What wonderful colors.....that''s it, I''m packing up and moving to Iceland!</td>', 'Wooohooo Heida, finally you got your well deserved bluey, yassir! Congratulations to you. What wonderful colors.....that''s it, I''m packing up and moving to Iceland!', '2003-10-29 02:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(465321, 43363, 10084, '<td valign="top">Since I couldn''t enter one of these :<br/> <br/><a href="//images.snapfish.com/3389%3B35523232%7Ffp47%3Dot%3E2323%3D544%3D%3C35%3D3232544%3B44%3C%3A6nu0mrj" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">B&amp;W Version.</a> <br/> <br/><a href="//images.snapfish.com/3389%3B35523232%7Ffp47%3Dot%3E2323%3D544%3D%3C33%3D3232544%3B4239%3Cnu0mrj" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Color version.</a> <br/> <br/>taken about 2 weeks ago. The weather didn''t cooperate to retake the shots. So I decided to have some fun on this one.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-29 02:16:34.</i></td>', 'Since I couldn''t enter one of these : B&W Version.  Color version.  taken about 2 weeks ago. The weather didn''t cooperate to retake the shots. So I decided to have some fun on this one. Thanks for all the comments.', '2003-10-29 02:14:55.000000', '2003-10-29 02:16:34.000000', 0),
(465325, 42886, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congrats to you on your ribbon, beautiful pic. Blue and red ribbons both go to Iceland wow!</td>', 'Congrats to you on your ribbon, beautiful pic. Blue and red ribbons both go to Iceland wow!', '2003-10-29 02:18:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(465327, 43030, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, congrats on 3rd place.</td>', 'Beautiful capture, congrats on 3rd place.', '2003-10-29 02:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(465332, 43287, 6458, '<td valign="top">I win this time young Smith!  <br/> <br/>Good shot Rob, I had this as a 7.</td>', 'I win this time young Smith!   Good shot Rob, I had this as a 7.', '2003-10-29 02:28:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(465335, 42886, 13440, '<td valign="top">Congratulation! I thought you''re gonna be the winner!?  :D</td>', 'Congratulation! I thought you''re gonna be the winner!?  :D', '2003-10-29 02:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(465337, 43289, 6458, '<td valign="top">Kavey,<br/>  Why would the sheep have to feel or be alone. All the picture should do is create a feeling of aloneness (or solitude) in the viewer.<br/>Thanks for the comment tho!</td>', 'Kavey,  Why would the sheep have to feel or be alone. All the picture should do is create a feeling of aloneness (or solitude) in the viewer.Thanks for the comment tho!', '2003-10-29 02:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(465338, 42885, 5728, '<td valign="top">Man 45th place sux, this photo should have easily been in the top 5 photos. Not only does it depict "all alone" wonderfully, it is technically a spot on pic. Congrats to you Yanik, for me this should have been way up there, sheeesh!</td>', 'Man 45th place sux, this photo should have easily been in the top 5 photos. Not only does it depict "all alone" wonderfully, it is technically a spot on pic. Congrats to you Yanik, for me this should have been way up there, sheeesh!', '2003-10-29 02:32:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(465341, 42606, 10858, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your helpful comments, this challenge taught me a lot. <br/> <br/>Some reflections on your comments: It was really hard to catch him paying no attention, he started waving and smiling when he saw the camera. Next time I will pay attention to spaces and not-too-much-centered compositions. Of course, I needed PS, in order to get rid of some colours. The B&amp;W idea came from the environment which was almost absolutely grey. Anyway, I am not sure about it now. Maybe the kid being coloured against all greys would be also an expression of being alone-coloured in this colourless world.</td>', 'Thank you all for your helpful comments, this challenge taught me a lot.  Some reflections on your comments: It was really hard to catch him paying no attention, he started waving and smiling when he saw the camera. Next time I will pay attention to spaces and not-too-much-centered compositions. Of course, I needed PS, in order to get rid of some colours. The B&W idea came from the environment which was almost absolutely grey. Anyway, I am not sure about it now. Maybe the kid being coloured against all greys would be also an expression of being alone-coloured in this colourless world.', '2003-10-29 02:37:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(465349, 42710, 5728, '<td valign="top">I see this was an either "love it" or "hate it" pic, looking from the distributions of scores. 20 X 1''s and 18 X 10''s.</td>', 'I see this was an either "love it" or "hate it" pic, looking from the distributions of scores. 20 X 1''s and 18 X 10''s.', '2003-10-29 02:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(465357, 43093, 9913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i>Wooohooo Heida, finally you got your well deserved bluey, yassir! Congratulations to you. What wonderful colors.....that''s it, I''m packing up and moving to Iceland!</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Be sure to bring lots of warm clothes;)</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwiness:Wooohooo Heida, finally you got your well deserved bluey, yassir! Congratulations to you. What wonderful colors.....that''s it, I''m packing up and moving to Iceland!  Be sure to bring lots of warm clothes;)', '2003-10-29 02:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(465368, 43057, 9972, '<td valign="top">I like this! Im surprised it didnt score better. Well Done.</td>', 'I like this! Im surprised it didnt score better. Well Done.', '2003-10-29 03:03:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(465376, 43289, 7086, '<td valign="top">Looks like I owe you a beer Matt.</td>', 'Looks like I owe you a beer Matt.', '2003-10-29 03:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(465421, 42824, 5728, '<td valign="top">Robbery!</td>', 'Robbery!', '2003-10-29 04:04:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(465425, 43057, 9669, '<td valign="top">This is the best shot in the challenge, and one of the best I have seen on DPChallenge.  The shades, and the silhouette are great, but the shapes are what really makes it (without having been there, the walkway and the sea look like two complementing triangles).  11.  This belongs on a wall (on my wall)</td>', 'This is the best shot in the challenge, and one of the best I have seen on DPChallenge.  The shades, and the silhouette are great, but the shapes are what really makes it (without having been there, the walkway and the sea look like two complementing triangles).  11.  This belongs on a wall (on my wall)', '2003-10-29 04:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
