(465490, 42886, 9972, '<td valign="top">As much as I think my photo shouldve won (no bias) I couldnt accept first place with this shot up against mine. Not only is this a brilliant photo is fits the challenge perfectly. To me that counts for a lot. Taking a good photo is a lot easier than taking a great photo that is supposed to convey a message (in this case "All Alone"), and to have that message clearly shown without having to use a title or description to explain it.<br/>Long story short you shouldve won.......then me second.<br/>Keep it up mate!<br/></td>', 'As much as I think my photo shouldve won (no bias) I couldnt accept first place with this shot up against mine. Not only is this a brilliant photo is fits the challenge perfectly. To me that counts for a lot. Taking a good photo is a lot easier than taking a great photo that is supposed to convey a message (in this case "All Alone"), and to have that message clearly shown without having to use a title or description to explain it.Long story short you shouldve won.......then me second.Keep it up mate!', '2003-10-29 06:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(465493, 43255, 12674, '<td valign="top">OK, I definitely used a too obscure title. I thought more people might recognize the Plaza Hotel in NYC and be familiar with the popular kids'' "Home Alone 2" movie starring McCaulie Caulkin as Kevin. Kevin''s mom screams his name when she realizes he''s been left behind and he spends the whole movie at this hotel being pursued by bad guys. My first submittal....I''m learning. Thanks for your helpful comments.<br/> <br/>Steve</td>', 'OK, I definitely used a too obscure title. I thought more people might recognize the Plaza Hotel in NYC and be familiar with the popular kids'' "Home Alone 2" movie starring McCaulie Caulkin as Kevin. Kevin''s mom screams his name when she realizes he''s been left behind and he spends the whole movie at this hotel being pursued by bad guys. My first submittal....I''m learning. Thanks for your helpful comments. Steve', '2003-10-29 06:13:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(465495, 42873, 9972, '<td valign="top">The only thing I dont like about this shot is that it beat mine by one of dem there (pistils?)<br/>In a jealous rage Ill say it doesnt fit the challenge properly and the border is too much.<br/>The reality is you used a closeup to convey all alone (there were debates on that issue) which is pretty clever and the photo is an interesting take on the subject.<br/>Love your work.</td>', 'The only thing I dont like about this shot is that it beat mine by one of dem there (pistils?)In a jealous rage Ill say it doesnt fit the challenge properly and the border is too much.The reality is you used a closeup to convey all alone (there were debates on that issue) which is pretty clever and the photo is an interesting take on the subject.Love your work.', '2003-10-29 06:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
