(465624, 42752, 806, '<td valign="top">Even though you have rec''d a number of comments on the distraction of the background, I think the shallow dof of the background actually adds to the image. It gives it an ethereal feeling.. much like how we humans perceive a butterflies life or a fairy world to be. I think you have done a marvelous job!</td>', 'Even though you have rec''d a number of comments on the distraction of the background, I think the shallow dof of the background actually adds to the image. It gives it an ethereal feeling.. much like how we humans perceive a butterflies life or a fairy world to be. I think you have done a marvelous job!', '2003-10-29 09:12:17.000000', NULL, 0),
