(465875, 43208, 3018, '<td valign="top">It really is surprising how some photographs are underapreciated.  I like this photo a lot, I don''t know how people do not recognize what it is.  But really, you don''t have to know, to apreciate it.  Colors and movement are great.  Keep up your good work, and don''t get sad about these scores and comments.</td>', 'It really is surprising how some photographs are underapreciated.  I like this photo a lot, I don''t know how people do not recognize what it is.  But really, you don''t have to know, to apreciate it.  Colors and movement are great.  Keep up your good work, and don''t get sad about these scores and comments.', '2003-10-29 12:01:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(465881, 43403, 6624, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your placement with this image.  I was touched by the skateboard and when I read what you had to say about it I learned why.  It is terrible to lose a friend in any way but this must have been a particularly difficult loss and you have expressed it well.  I think your friend would have liked the image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your placement with this image.  I was touched by the skateboard and when I read what you had to say about it I learned why.  It is terrible to lose a friend in any way but this must have been a particularly difficult loss and you have expressed it well.  I think your friend would have liked the image.', '2003-10-29 12:02:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(465943, 43420, 8637, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe this did not ribbon!  I agree that folks must not have seen the bird.  Got a 10 from me and I don''t do that often.  I hope you put this up for sale.</td>', 'Can''t believe this did not ribbon!  I agree that folks must not have seen the bird.  Got a 10 from me and I don''t do that often.  I hope you put this up for sale.', '2003-10-29 12:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
