(466819, 43269, 10084, '<td valign="top">I gave you a "7" and possible more if you took the shot from further back. It would isolated you "the subject" more and give an even more feeling of "alone". Cropping close to the frame makes it feel confining.</td>', 'I gave you a "7" and possible more if you took the shot from further back. It would isolated you "the subject" more and give an even more feeling of "alone". Cropping close to the frame makes it feel confining.', '2003-10-30 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(466829, 43331, 259, '<td valign="top">too bad you were screwed by all the people who voted you a 1 just because it was graphic and shows violence.  you should have done so much better.  if you don''t take a picture of something warm and fuzzy you pay the price (like my shot this week is paying).<br/> <br/>i wouldn''t be discouraged by your finish.  you got a whole lot of 8-10s.</td>', 'too bad you were screwed by all the people who voted you a 1 just because it was graphic and shows violence.  you should have done so much better.  if you don''t take a picture of something warm and fuzzy you pay the price (like my shot this week is paying). i wouldn''t be discouraged by your finish.  you got a whole lot of 8-10s.', '2003-10-30 01:18:24.000000', NULL, 0),
