(467973, 43213, 10342, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eswik:</b></div><hr/><i>Very good shot. You should consider using a better camera to get more detail and sharpness though.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The camera is not the problem... its 4 megapixels... its the software that causes a very sharp picture to be less sharp</td>', 'Originally posted by eswik:Very good shot. You should consider using a better camera to get more detail and sharpness though.  The camera is not the problem... its 4 megapixels... its the software that causes a very sharp picture to be less sharp', '2003-10-31 08:26:05.000000', NULL, 0),
