(468429, 42710, 8816, '<td valign="top">This is an extremely powerful photo G4D''s!  The use of sharp contrast, a slight blue hue and negative space really allows this photo to display the incredible emotion behind the photo.<br/> <br/>I''m truly disgusted by the scores you got on this, I know a large amount of people on this site are so close-minded that anything slightly original and artistic scares them and they vote it low, but this is beyond ridiculous.  20 1''s?  Give me a break!  This is what photography is all about folks, enhancing our perception of the world, and stimulating our emotions, through technically superb and compositionally pleasing photo''s.  Some people should seriously get there head out of there asses, grow up, and come out into the real world.<br/> <br/>I applaud you G4D, this photo is remarkable, despite the ignorance and immaturity of many members of this site.<br/> <br/>Lee</td>', 'This is an extremely powerful photo G4D''s!  The use of sharp contrast, a slight blue hue and negative space really allows this photo to display the incredible emotion behind the photo. I''m truly disgusted by the scores you got on this, I know a large amount of people on this site are so close-minded that anything slightly original and artistic scares them and they vote it low, but this is beyond ridiculous.  20 1''s?  Give me a break!  This is what photography is all about folks, enhancing our perception of the world, and stimulating our emotions, through technically superb and compositionally pleasing photo''s.  Some people should seriously get there head out of there asses, grow up, and come out into the real world. I applaud you G4D, this photo is remarkable, despite the ignorance and immaturity of many members of this site. Lee', '2003-10-31 18:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
