(491630, 43208, 8987, '<td valign="top">I like the ''ocean of color'' effect too! It would have been better without the ''red tail'' imho, but hey, you can''t influence everything ;o)</td>', 'I like the ''ocean of color'' effect too! It would have been better without the ''red tail'' imho, but hey, you can''t influence everything ;o)', '2003-11-21 05:43:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(491631, 43208, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love this one!  The colors are beautiful, the composition works well, and I think it fits the challenge.  It has a very "abstract" feel (which I think is very nice!), and has such a "soft focus" feel to it , and generally speaking, those don''t go over very well at dpc.  But, I don''t think that you should worry much about the voters - this is very nice work -I would be proud of it!</td>', 'I love this one!  The colors are beautiful, the composition works well, and I think it fits the challenge.  It has a very "abstract" feel (which I think is very nice!), and has such a "soft focus" feel to it , and generally speaking, those don''t go over very well at dpc.  But, I don''t think that you should worry much about the voters - this is very nice work -I would be proud of it!', '2003-11-21 06:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(499341, 42886, 8860, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by amateurboi:</b></div><hr/><i>2 and 3 for this?? They must be kidding!</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oh yeah - that''s one sick sense of humour (get used to it though). This is stunning.</td>', 'Originally posted by amateurboi:2 and 3 for this?? They must be kidding! Oh yeah - that''s one sick sense of humour (get used to it though). This is stunning.', '2003-11-30 18:53:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(499436, 43327, 11184, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job.  You were able to capture the real essence and mood of feeling alone.  The blackness...only lighting the facial features which communicate emotion...good stuff.</td>', 'Wonderful job.  You were able to capture the real essence and mood of feeling alone.  The blackness...only lighting the facial features which communicate emotion...good stuff.', '2003-11-30 21:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(499439, 43365, 11184, '<td valign="top">Ooo...very nice.  I can see why they call you moodville.  Definitely can create a mood.  I love the shade of the ground you got.</td>', 'Ooo...very nice.  I can see why they call you moodville.  Definitely can create a mood.  I love the shade of the ground you got.', '2003-11-30 21:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
