(512272, 43057, 326, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shot! Just beautiful!</td>', 'What a wonderful shot! Just beautiful!', '2003-12-13 17:23:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(512942, 43057, 7778, '<td valign="top">Well, it fared well (11/323 is not bad at all), which surprised me considering its quite an artsy shot. Beauty is so rare a thing.</td>', 'Well, it fared well (11/323 is not bad at all), which surprised me considering its quite an artsy shot. Beauty is so rare a thing.', '2003-12-14 20:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(514075, 42935, 14836, '<td valign="top">Cropping this picture was a great way of composing this centered shot. The panoramic feel helps isolate the subject in this beautiful autumn day.</td>', 'Cropping this picture was a great way of composing this centered shot. The panoramic feel helps isolate the subject in this beautiful autumn day.', '2003-12-15 21:44:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(515492, 43057, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot--and you''re right.  It didn''t deserve the low scores (though it did really well overall anyway.<br/> <br/>One technical comment: the horizon is not straight and really should be.  Unfortunately, that will also reduce the angle on the lovely angled walkway.</td>', 'Very nice shot--and you''re right.  It didn''t deserve the low scores (though it did really well overall anyway. One technical comment: the horizon is not straight and really should be.  Unfortunately, that will also reduce the angle on the lovely angled walkway.', '2003-12-17 10:07:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(518253, 42415, 13195, '<td valign="top">thanks guys.  your comments encourages me to shoot more pictures and try harder.  I´ll promise to comment about other photos, thing I didn´t do before.</td>', 'thanks guys.  your comments encourages me to shoot more pictures and try harder.  I´ll promise to comment about other photos, thing I didn´t do before.', '2003-12-20 07:06:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(523805, 43207, 12733, '<td valign="top">Sorry I missed this the first time around. It really does convey the feeling of joy one can have even when all alone - or maybe especially when all alone. By including so much of the shoreline, you convey that feeling of aloneness and the sense of freedom that goes with it.</td>', 'Sorry I missed this the first time around. It really does convey the feeling of joy one can have even when all alone - or maybe especially when all alone. By including so much of the shoreline, you convey that feeling of aloneness and the sense of freedom that goes with it.', '2003-12-27 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
