(923583, 42866, 16862, '<td valign="top">Góð</td>', 'Góð', '2004-09-23 15:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(967284, 42710, 24925, '<td valign="top">This is idiotic.  I would love to hear why somebody would give this a 1...If you can''t deal with an image, don''t vote on it.<br/> <br/>...drgsoell had an incredibly mature response to this, in my opinion.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-20 16:43:43.</i></td>', 'This is idiotic.  I would love to hear why somebody would give this a 1...If you can''t deal with an image, don''t vote on it. ...drgsoell had an incredibly mature response to this, in my opinion.', '2004-10-20 17:41:28.000000', '2004-10-20 17:43:43.000000', 0),
(968302, 42710, 18897, '<td valign="top">Every now and then one randomly stumbles across great images here. This is clearly one. Before "my time" but you would have gotten 8+ from me for it. I rarely vote 1-2 or 9-10.<br/> <br/>So there are two things with this one that bothers me. The impact of the subject and the people who has the stomach to vote this as a 1 just from being upset about said impact.<br/> <br/>It''s an image. It''s art! And good one at that. <br/> <br/>And yet they - all 20+12 of them - live around here, happily, understanding nothing, contaminating the very foundation that this site rests upon.<br/> <br/>You deserved better.</td>', 'Every now and then one randomly stumbles across great images here. This is clearly one. Before "my time" but you would have gotten 8+ from me for it. I rarely vote 1-2 or 9-10. So there are two things with this one that bothers me. The impact of the subject and the people who has the stomach to vote this as a 1 just from being upset about said impact. It''s an image. It''s art! And good one at that.  And yet they - all 20+12 of them - live around here, happily, understanding nothing, contaminating the very foundation that this site rests upon. You deserved better.', '2004-10-21 11:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(977167, 43053, 28618, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!! a harmonious balance populated yet at peace something humans should take note of "How we learn from nature"<br/> <br/>Great shot!!</td>', 'Very Nice!! a harmonious balance populated yet at peace something humans should take note of "How we learn from nature" Great shot!!', '2004-10-27 23:11:32.000000', NULL, 0),
