(3563683, 42857, 73305, '<td valign="top">I loooooooooove it! :)  I remember the day you came back from the beach with these photos - I loved them so much! :)  I miss our photo trips.<br/> <br/>Anyway, update this thing, woman!  Now!  You have so many awesome super-de-duper photos you can put on here.<br/> <br/>&lt;3.</td>', 'I loooooooooove it! :)  I remember the day you came back from the beach with these photos - I loved them so much! :)  I miss our photo trips. Anyway, update this thing, woman!  Now!  You have so many awesome super-de-duper photos you can put on here. <3.', '2007-04-19 17:20:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4140679, 42886, 43463, '<td valign="top">What makes the shot so stunningly beautiful is that warm amber/orange glow emanating out of the cloud cover. Those nice warm golden/orange tones are appealing for they compliment the idea of a nice, warm day at the beach. The silhouette of sailboat and the gleams of light playing upon the ocean surface are the two wonderful finishing touches that greatly increases the appeal of this photo composition. Beautifully composed and a lovely capture.</td>', 'What makes the shot so stunningly beautiful is that warm amber/orange glow emanating out of the cloud cover. Those nice warm golden/orange tones are appealing for they compliment the idea of a nice, warm day at the beach. The silhouette of sailboat and the gleams of light playing upon the ocean surface are the two wonderful finishing touches that greatly increases the appeal of this photo composition. Beautifully composed and a lovely capture.', '2007-10-04 10:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4823283, 43409, 96322, '<td valign="top">The title made me really sad because he looks lonely. I just want to sit with him.<br/> <br/>But the clarity is terrible. This shot would be much more moving if it was more clear.</td>', 'The title made me really sad because he looks lonely. I just want to sit with him. But the clarity is terrible. This shot would be much more moving if it was more clear.', '2008-07-14 03:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
